\par }{\fs20\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof {\shp{\*\shpinst\shpleft1440\shptop2070\shpright10512\shpbottom2070\shpfhdr1\shpbxpage\shpbxignore\shpbypage\shpbyignore\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt0\shpz2\shplockanchor\shplid2049{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn fFlipH}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFlipV}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn shapePath}{\sv 4}}{\sp{\sn fFillOK}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFilled}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fArrowheadsOK}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn posrelh}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn posrelv}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}}{\shprslt{\*\do\dobxpage\dobypage\dodhgt8194\dpline\dpptx0\dppty0\dpptx9920\dppty0\dpx1190\dpy2070\dpxsize9920\dpysize0\dplinew15\dplinecor0\dplinecog0\dplinecob0}}}}{\f0\fs16  \par }}{\footerf \pard\plain \s22\ql \b\f354\fs18  Page {\field{\*\fldinst PAGE}{\fldrslt 1}}{     }\'a9 2025 \uc2 Factiva, Inc.  All rights reserved.\par }{\footer \pard\plain \s22\ql \b\f354\fs18  Page {\field{\*\fldinst PAGE}{\fldrslt 1}} of {\field{\*\fldinst NUMPAGES}{\fldrslt 1}}{     }\'a9 2025 \uc2 Factiva, Inc.  All rights reserved.\par }\pard\plain \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\fs20 {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/19: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,625 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 July 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Altcoins charts flash \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signals after Bitcoin's surprise move above $66,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvNDljN2U4MDYtNDgxZS00YTMxLWEzZTktZTZmYTE5NTFhMjQ0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/19: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned up on July 19 after a mild pullback for the past two days. Farside Investors data shows that United States-based spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) continued to witness inflows on July 17 and 18, signaling that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-bitcoin-etf-investors-plummeting-bitcoin-outlook"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 market participants had turned cautious but not \b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Onchain analytics firm Santiment said in a post on X that the number of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) wallet addresses holding a non-zero balance had plummeted by 672,510 over the past month. According to the firm, such {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-holding-addresses-fall-good-sign-rebound-santiment"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 mass liquidations are generally followed by a rebound}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/835ee31d-fc32-4f97-9e2f-0d8831e91e68.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/19: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Trading firm QCP Capital also sounded positive in its latest bulletin, speculating that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s resilience in the wake of equity market weakness and the likely \uc2 Mt. Gox\uc2  supply suggests that the market {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bulls-toward-66k-btc-price-new-1-month-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 may have shaken off most of its worries}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin continue its recovery and reach $70,000, pushing altcoins higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s sharp recovery stalled at $66,128 on July 17, but the bears could not sink the price below the 50-day simple moving average ($63,806). This suggests that the bulls are buying on every minor dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/fa677784-d386-4485-8e69-5dc7660d9570.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/19: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day SMA ($60,380) has started to turn up, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) has jumped into the positive zone, signaling that the bulls are at an advantage. If the price sustains above $66,128, it will clear the path for a rally to the psychological level of $70,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below the 50-day SMA (63,762), it will indicate that the bulls are losing their grip. The BTC/USDT pair could plummet to the 20-day SMA, where the bulls will try to arrest the decline.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has risen above the 50-day SMA ($3,441) on July 19, indicating that the bulls are trying to extend the recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/7768857d-2fa8-482e-b8fa-81ab625a91b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/19: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers retain the price above the 50-day SMA, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to $3,730. This level is likely to attract selling by the bears, but if the bulls prevail, the pair will attempt a move to $4,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks below $3,346, the pair may reach the 20-day SMA ($3,235). This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if they fail in their endeavor, the pair may retest the solid support at $2,850.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) soared above the 50-day SMA (586) on July 19, indicating that the bulls remain in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/965fbbf8-e4b2-47f4-b95b-fcbed75f381c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/19: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains above the 50-day SMA, the BNB/USDT pair could reach $635. The bears are expected to defend this level with all their might because the failure to do that could result in a rally to $722.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down sharply and breaks below the 20-day SMA ($545), it will suggest that the bears are selling on rallies. The pair may then remain range-bound between $460 and $635 for a while.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line of the descending triangle pattern, indicating solid demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/310ba607-b7b9-4f63-be10-97719884dfc2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/19: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day SMA ($145) has started to turn up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive territory, indicating that the bulls have the edge. A break and close above the downtrend line will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could climb to $180 and eventually to the stiff overhead resistance of $210.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated in the near term if the price turns down and plunges below the moving averages. The pair could then spend some more time inside the triangle.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply from $0.64 on July 18, indicating that the bears are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/d10c0ef8-e2dd-447c-bc6e-d9b0673de113.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/19: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair dropped back below the breakout level of $0.57, but the long tail on the July 19 candlestick shows aggressive buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are completing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive territory, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the price maintains above $0.57, the bulls will again try to overcome the barri