ased spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) continued to witness inflows on July 17 and 18, signaling that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-bitcoin-etf-investors-plummeting-bitcoin-outlook"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 market participants had turned cautious but not \b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Onchain analytics firm Santiment said in a post on X that the number of Bitcoin wallet addresses holding a non-zero balance had plummeted by 672,510 over the past month. According to the firm, such {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-holding-addresses-fall-good-sign-rebound-santiment"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 mass liquidations are generally followed by a rebound}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/835ee31d-fc32-4f97-9e2f-0d8831e91e68.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/19: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Trading firm QCP Capital also sounded positive in its latest bulletin, speculating that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s resilience in the wake of equity market weakness and the likely \uc2 Mt. Gox\uc2  supply suggests that the market {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bulls-toward-66k-btc-price-new-1-month-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 may have shaken off most of its worries}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin continue its recovery and reach $70,000, pushing altcoins higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s sharp recovery stalled at $66,128 on July 17, but the bears could not sink the price below the 50-day simple moving average ($63,806). This suggests that the bulls are