oving averages for the past few days, indicating a tussle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/8eabb98d-7532-482a-8228-5434b0702069.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/19: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day SMA ($26.75) and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. That suggests a possible range-bound action between $29 and $24 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above $29. Such a move will signal solid demand at lower levels. The AVAX/USDT pair could start a relief rally to $34 and subsequently to $37.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the breakdown level of $0.000020 on July 17 and reached the 20-day SMA ($0.000017) on July 18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/9da9c221-35c6-427c-bf37-57fa5e856344.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/19: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day SMA, the bulls will make another attempt to overcome the barrier at $0.000020. If they succeed, it will indicate the start of a stronger recovery. The SHIB/USDT pair could then start a rally to $0.000026.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price skids below the 20-day SMA, it will suggest that the pair may swing between $0.000020 and $0.000012 for some time. The flattish 20-day SMA and the RSI at the midpoint also point to a consolidation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvNDljN2U4MDYtNDgxZS00YTMxLWEzZTktZTZmYTE5NTFhMjQ0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240719ek7j000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 EU\par \b \uc2 EU releases crypto-asset classification tools to help firms comply with MiCA\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Savannah Fortis \par \uc2 469 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 July 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The EU has released new guidelines for classifying crypto-assets under MiCA, aiming to standardize and clarify the regulatory framework.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvZjU5NzJkYTUtOTUzYy00MGU3LTgyOTEtMmIzZTBjYzg3YzViLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EU releases crypto-asset classification tools to help firms comply with MiCA}}}\par \par \uc2 Regulators in the \uc2 European Union\uc2  have issued new guidelines allowing relevant market participants to classify cryptocurrencies and digital assets under the Markets in Crypto-Assets (MiCA) \b \highlight22\uc2 Regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 On July 12, three European Supervisory Authorities \u8212\'20\'14 the \uc2 European Banking Authority\uc2 , the \uc2 European Insurance and Occupational Pensions Authority\uc2  and the \uc2 European Securities and Markets Authority\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.esma.europa.eu/press-news/esma-news/esas-consult-guidelines-under-markets-crypto-assets-regulation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 released}}}\uc2  a consultation paper intended to standardize and clarify the classification of digital assets across the region.\par \par \uc2 Crypto classification under MiCA\par \par \uc2 The newly released guidelines provide a structured approach to classifying various types of crypto assets.\par \par \uc2 This includes determining whether a token falls under MiCA through question-based prompts, such as who the issuer is, whether it is based on the blockchain, or whether it is a type of financial instrument.\par \par \uc2 It also helps determine whether the token in question qualifies as a standard crypto asset under MiCA or if it could be classified as another type of asset, such as an electronic money token (EMT) or an asset-referenced token (ART).\par \par \uc2 Issuers of ARTs must include a legal opinion in their white papers, clearly explaining the classification of these tokens. The opinion should confirm that the tokens are neither EMTs nor any other type of crypto asset excluded from the scope of MiCA.\par \par \uc2 For crypto assets that do not fall under the categories of ARTs or EMTs, the white papers must include an explanation outlining their classification.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/okx-malta-mica-hub-eu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 OKX selects Malta as MiCA hub for EU crypto compliance}}}\par \par \uc2 EU MiCA compliance\par \par \uc2 The guidelines are inviting market stakeholders to submit any comments related to the consultation paper by mid-October, with a virtual hearing to be held on Sept. 23.\par \par \uc2 Patrick Hansen, senior director of EU strategy and policy at Circle, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/paddi_hansen/status/1814248046617591972"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 posted}}}\uc2  on X, calling the guidelines \u8220\'20\'1Cvery helpful\u8221\'20\'1D and said that he has already seen \u8220\'20\'1Cmany people getting token classifications wrong under MiCA.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Circle was one of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/circle-first-licensed-stablecoin-issuer-mica"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the first stablecoin issuers}}}\uc2  to comply with MiCA, meaning that its USD Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/usdc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDC}}}\uc2  ) and EURC are now regulatory compliant under the new rules.\par \par \uc2 This follows {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/mica-laws-crypto-europe-impact"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the first set of regulations under MiCA}}}\uc2 , which came into force on June 30 and targeted stablecoins and stablecoin issuers. The next set of MiCA regulations to come into effect are anticipated by December 2024.\par \par \uc2 The Cardano Foundation, which oversees its \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) cryptocurrency, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-mica-compliance-sustainability-indicators"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 released sustainability indicators}}}\uc2  in compliance with the forthcoming MiCA six months prior to them coming into effect.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/sec-drops-ether-probe-but-still-seeks-billions-in-penalties-from-ripple-hodlers-digest-june-16-22/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC drops Ether probe but still seeks billions in penalties from Ripple: Hodler\u8217\'20\'19s Digest, June 16\u8211\'20\'1322}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvZjU5NzJkYTUtOTUzYy00MGU3LTgyOTEtMmIzZTBjYzg3YzViLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240719ek7j0008k\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 EU\par \b \uc2 EU releases crypto-asset classification tools to help firms comply with MiCA\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Savannah Fortis \par \uc2 479 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 July 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The EU has released new guidelines for classifying crypto-assets under MiCA, aiming to standardize and clarify the regulatory framework.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvZjU5NzJkYTUtOTUzYy00MGU3LTgyOTEtMmIzZTBjYzg3YzViLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EU releases crypto-asset classification tools to help firms comply with MiCA}}}\par \par \uc2 Regulators in the \uc2 European Union\uc2  (EU) have issued new guidelines allowing relevant market participants to classify cryptocurrencies and digital assets under the Markets in Crypto-Assets \b \highlight22\uc2 Regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MiCA).\par \par \uc2 On July 12, three European Supervisory Authorities (ESAs) \u8212\'20\'14 the \uc2 European Banking Authority (EBA)\uc2 , the \uc2 European Insurance and Occupational Pensions Authority\uc2  (\uc2 EIOPA\uc2 ), and the \uc2 European Securities and Markets Authority\uc2  (\uc2 ESMA\uc2 ) \u8212\'20\'14 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.esma.europa.eu/press-news/esma-news/esas-consult-guidelines-under-markets-crypto-assets-regulation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 released}}}\uc2  a consultation paper intending to standardize and clarify the classification of said assets across the region.\par \par \uc2 Crypto classification under MiCA\par \par \uc2 The newly released guidelines provide a structured approach to classifying various types of crypto-assets.\par \par \uc2 This includes determining whether a token falls under MiCA through question-based prompts, such as who the issuer is, whether it is based on the blockchain or whether it is a type of financial instrument.\par \par \uc2 It also helps determine whether the token in question qualifies as a standard crypto-asset under MiCA or if it could be classified as another type of asset, such as an e-money token (EMT) or an asset-referenced token (ART).\par \par \uc2 Issuers of ARTs must include a legal opinion in their white papers, clearly explaining the classification of these tokens. The opinion should confirm that the tokens are neither Electronic Money Tokens (EMTs) nor any other type of crypto-asset excluded from the scope of MiCA.\par \par \uc2 For crypto-assets that do not fall under the categories of ARTs or EMTs, the white papers must include an explanation outlining their classification.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/okx-malta-mica-hub-eu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 OKX selects Malta as MiCA hub for EU crypto compliance}}}\par \par \uc2 EU MiCA compliance\par \par \uc2 The guidelines are inviting market stakeholders to submit any comments related to the consultation paper by mid-October, with a virtual hearing to be held on Sept. 23.\par \par \uc2 Patrick Hansen, the senior director of EU strategy and policy at Circle, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/paddi_hansen/status/1814248046617591972"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 posted}}}\uc2  on X called the guidelines \u8220\'20\'1Cvery helpful\u8221\'20\'1D and said that he has already seen \u8220\'20\'1Cmany people getting token classifications wrong under MiCA.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Circle was one of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/circle-first-licensed-stablecoin-issuer-mica"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the first stablecoin issuers}}}\uc2  to comply with MiCA, meaning that its ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/usdc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDC}}}\uc2  ) and EURC are now regulatory compliant under the new rules.\par \par \uc2 This follows {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/mica-laws-crypto-europe-impact"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the first set of regulations under MiCA}}}\uc2  coming into force on June 30, which targeted stablecoins and stablecoin issuers. The next set of MiCA regulations to come into effect are anticipated by December 2024.\par \par \uc2 The Cardano Foundation, which oversees the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) cryptocurrency, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-mica-compliance-sustainability-indicators"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 released sustainability indicators}}}\uc2  in compliance with the forthcoming Markets in Crypto-Assets (MiCA) six months prior to them coming into effect.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/sec-drops-ether-probe-but-still-seeks-billions-in-penalties-from-ripple-hodlers-digest-june-16-22/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC drops Ether probe but still seeks billions in penalties from Ripple: Hodler\u8217\'20\'19s Digest, June 16\u8211\'20\'1322}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvZjU5NzJkYTUtOTUzYy00MGU3LTgyOTEtMmIzZTBjYzg3YzViLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240719ek7j0005m\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,763 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 July 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Altcoins look ready to break out as Bitcoin's move above $65,000 confirms that the bull market is back on track.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvZGRiMDIzOTctMzE2OC00MTIxLWFjZGYtOWU1MTg2MjlhNjYwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been conquering overhead resistance levels one by one, signaling that the bulls are gaining confidence. Farside Investors data shows {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-66k-bitcoin-bulls-beat-100m-asks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $422 million in inflows}}}\uc2  into the United States-based spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) on July 16.\par \par \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 iShares Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (IBIT) once again crossed $20 billion in assets under management after its latest purchase of 4,004 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) . The fund had earlier surpassed $20 billion in AUM in late May. Looking at the massive inflows, ETF Store president Nate Geraci said in a post on X that it is not only the retail investors; even {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrocks-spot-bitcoin-etf-sees-260-millon-flow-day"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 advisers and institutional investors have been buying}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/5718ed01-b994-40c7-913a-2e261b7db348.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recent rise has improved sentiment, and analysts are speculating how soon {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-forecast-splendid-bullish-price-action-now-that-btc-is-above-65k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a new all-time high could be achieved}}}\uc2 . While anything is possible in the markets, the current up move is expected to face solid selling between $70,000 and the all-time high near $74,000. Expect markets to remain volatile in the near term as some of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-accumulating-mt-gox-distribution"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 creditors of the defunct Mt. Gox exchange sell}}}\uc2  their repayments.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s strength trigger further buying in altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin climbed above the 50-day simple moving average ($63,926) on July 15, indicating that the bulls are on a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/4174917e-5a84-4efc-a10d-37dcb38b5eea.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price back below the 50-day SMA on July 16, but the long tail on the candlestick shows solid buying at lower levels. If the price sustains above the 50-day SMA, a rally to $70,000 is possible.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and breaks below the 50-day SMA, it will signal that demand dries up at higher levels. The bears will then try to sink the BTC/USDT pair to the 20-day SMA ($59,952).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rallied to the 50-day SMA ($3,454) on July 15, indicating that the sideways movement between $2,850 and $4,094 remains intact.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/ef9d4ac1-a788-4484-b62f-47c1ef3c4e30.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to strengthen their position further by pushing the price to $3,730 and later attempt a rally to the overhead resistance of $4,094. Sellers are expected to fiercely defend the zone between $4,000 and $4,094.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down from the current level and plummets below the 20-day SMA ($3,228). The ETH/USDT pair may then retest the crucial support at $2,850. A break below this support will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears are protecting the 50-day SMA ($586) in BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ), but they are struggling to pull the price below the 20-day SMA ($544). The long tail on the July 16 candlestick shows that the bulls are buying on minor dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/f8bd19f1-152b-46b6-a2fd-74affd975d2a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the 50-day SMA will open the doors for a rally to the overhead resistance of $635. This level may pose a strong challenge to the bulls, but if the buyers do not give up much ground, the BNB/USDT pair may start its climb toward $722.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to swiftly drag the price below the 20-day SMA. If they do that, it will indicate selling at higher levels. The pair may then drop to the $495 to $460 support zone.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a descending triangle pattern for several days. The bulls have pushed the price to the downtrend line, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/20db9b92-0afd-4dcd-b89a-ce498ce93f53.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from the downtrend line but bounces off the 20-day SMA ($143), it will suggest a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. That will increase the likelihood of a break above the downtrend line. If that happens, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to $189 and subsequently to $210.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day SMA, it will signal that the pair may remain inside the triangle for a while. A break below $116 will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern, starting a move to $100.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has made a strong comeback in the past few days, putting the bulls back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/8a23c152-8f34-4ea6-bc5e-f17cd3915ffe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to stall the rally at $0.57, but the buyers bulldozed their way above the resistance on July 16. The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the overbought zone, indicating that bulls are in charge.\par \par \uc2 However, a short-term pullback could not be ruled out. The first support on the downside is at $0.57. If bulls flip the level into support, the XRP/USDT pair could surge to $0.67 and subsequently to $0.74. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum will weaken if the price breaks and maintains below $0.57.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) back above the breakdown level of $0.12 on July 15, signaling that the markets rejected the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/25eec2d4-0337-46c4-b1dc-196b59352a0c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to halt the up move at the 50-day SMA ($0.13). If the price turns down but finds support at the 20-day SMA ($0.11), it will suggest that the bulls are buying the dips. That will improve the prospects of a break above the 50-day SMA. The DOGE/USDT pair could then climb toward $0.15 and later $0.18.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day SMA, it will indicate that the bears are active at higher levels. The pair may then slump to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day SMA ($7.43) on July 15 but turned down from the $7.72 overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/e7b149e5-ef42-45df-bcf2-e6915cbb337a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price remains below the 50-day SMA ($7.32), the bears will try to pull the TON/USDT pair to $6.77. This is an essential level for the bulls to defend because if they fail to do that, the pair will complete a double top pattern. That may start a downward move to $6 and later to $5.50.\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day SMA and the RSI just below the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. The bulls will have to drive the pair above $7.72 to start a rally to the overhead resistance of $8.29.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-xrp-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is XRP price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been maintaining above the moving averages for the past few days, indicating a lack of aggressive selling by the traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/892e0473-998c-4308-8f51-2f0f336500e0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day SMA ($0.40) has started to turn up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive zone, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the upside. Buyers will try to push the price to the overhead resistance of $0.51.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair turns down and breaks below the moving averages, it will indicate that the bears have not given up. That could result in a range-bound action between $0.32 and $0.45 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has reached the overhead resistance of $29, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/c17ad7a7-ec1a-4695-af6a-f9ce3b66bb34.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day SMA ($26.84) has flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  has risen into positive territory, indicating a balance between supply and demand. The advantage will tilt in favor of the bulls if they push and sustain the price above $29. If that happens, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could jump to $34 and later to $37.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day SMA, it will suggest that the pair may remain stuck between $21.80 and $29 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) reached the breakdown level of $0.000020 on July 16, where the bears are trying to halt the rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/fd6d95a5-0a3f-4f38-9be3-ddfe39115235.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A positive sign in favor of the bulls is that they have not ceded ground to the bears. This suggests that the bulls are holding on to their positions as they anticipate another leg higher. If the price rises above $0.000020, the SHIB/USDT pair could reach $0.000026.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down sharply from $0.000020, the pair could drop to the 20-day SMA ($0.000017). Such a move could indicate the possibility of a range-bound action between $0.000020 and $0.000012 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvZGRiMDIzOTctMzE2OC00MTIxLWFjZGYtOWU1MTg2MjlhNjYwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240718ek7h0000d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
