\par\par \b \uc2 Next Bull Run Is Different From 2021: Market Focus Shifts From Metaverse, NFT and P2E to AI, RWA and DePin\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 1,472 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 July 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 GameGPT (DUEL)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Landshare (LAND)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Arweave (AR)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 End Note}}}\par \par \uc2 Among a few important discussions, one matter that people across the crypto market are discussing is \u8216\'20\'18the next crypto market bull run.\u8217\'20\'19 Although no one is certain for when the event could occur, it is anticipated that this time it is going to be massive. Other than being the biggest, this bull run is different from the previous ones in terms of the sectors that will lead the rally.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  phases are common phenomena due to the crypto market\u8217\'20\'19s cyclical nature while moving forward. Historically Bitcoin (BTC) price movements have ignited and sustained the bull runs but gradually the dependency shifted to other altcoins, sectors and narratives.\par \par \uc2 A glance in the past cycles shows BTC price first saw a massive jump in 2011 when it rose from $0.8 to $36 due to new traders entering the market and pouring money. Later in 2013, Bitcoin sustained $50 price levels and later hit the $1,000 mark for the first time.\par \par \uc2 Fast forward to 2017, Bitcoin price surged from $1,000 to $6,500 and made the highest peak at $19,666. Eruption of initial coin offerings and performance of Ethereum (ETH), and newly launched Filecoin (FIL), Tezos (XTZ), Polkadot (DOT), Cosmos (ATOM) and few others pumped the market to unprecedented levels.\par \par \uc2 After a long \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  phase, the crypto market rebounded in 2021 where the Bitcoin price rose to insane levels of $69,000. Global crypto market hit $3 Trillion for the first time and every other asset rallied to their highest trading prices: ETH at $4,000, \uc2 SOL\uc2  hit $260, \uc2 BNB\uc2  reached a high of $650, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  at $3 and so many others.\par \par \uc2 The highlighted sectors of this bull run were frenzy around non-fungible tokens (NFTs), metaverse, gameFi due to play-to-earn (P2E) among others. However, almost none of these trends are relevant today since much more mature narratives make it to space and spread all over.\par \par \uc2 The major advancements in the crypto and blockchain space in terms of functionality and scalability is attracting institutional interest as well as acceptance as it can be seen from increased investments. The clarity on regulations also boosts optimism in the burgeoning asset class.\par \par \uc2 These trending narratives including artificial intelligence (AI), real world assets (RWA), and decentralized physical infrastructure networks (DePIN) are gaining significant traction from investors and crypto enthusiasts alike. So much so that these are likely to drive the upcoming crypto bull run along with Bitcoin and major altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Clearly the AI, RWA, and DePIN are going to carry out the next bull run and the native tokens have proved it. The price performance of few tokens belonging to these sectors drew the attention of investors and they are among top gainers of this year. The number of projects in these sectors are growing at a rapid pace that end up increasing confusion when it comes to picking a potential project.\par \par \uc2 Based on the analysis, here are leading tokens belonging to each of these sectors that we found, are going to lead their native sectors.GameGPT (DUEL), Landshare (LAND), and Arweave (AR) are the leading AI, RWA and DePIN sectors respectively and likely to drive the growth in the coming bull run.\par \par \uc2 GameGPT (DUEL)\par \par \uc2 AI-driven cryptocurrencies are currently in the spotlight, with GameGPT ($DUEL) emerging as a standout during the altcoin season of 2024. By merging artificial intelligence with blockchain technology, $DUEL aims to revolutionize the gaming sector through AI-enhanced game development.\par \par \uc2 Within the vibrant field of AI cryptocurrencies, GameGPT sets itself apart with its innovative approaches and distinctive features. Founded in 2020, this AI-based game development protocol is designed to transform the gaming industry by incorporating AI into the game development process. The $DUEL token plays an essential role in over 10,000 games, improving programming and economic structures, facilitating community votes, in-game features, and transactions within the GameGPT ecosystem.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.gamegpt.gg/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 GameGPT}}}\uc2  leverages AI strategies to accelerate game development and make creation more accessible, establishing itself as a leader in blockchain gaming innovations.\par \par \uc2 Recently, GameGPT formed a strategic alliance with Hydro Protocol on the Injective network, strengthening its position at the intersection of blockchain and advanced gaming technologies. To celebrate this partnership, GameGPT initiated a special $DUEL token airdrop for the Hydro Protocol community, incorporating partnership-themed quests to enhance user engagement.\par \par \uc2 Support from renowned companies like \uc2 Animoca Brands\uc2 , CoinFund, and Polygon, as well as partnerships with top gaming titles, have reinforced GameGPT's robust foundation. The impressive performance of the $DUEL token rally has notably boosted my investment portfolio, affirming my position in the growing AI cryptocurrency market.\par \par \uc2 The recent market downturn affected the AI sector and DUEL token received the same treatment. Still the token broke the downside streak and saw 6% increase in the weekly timeframe, sustaining at $0.0044 at present. As the AI narrative continues to grow the market share, DUEL is in the position to get going matching the pace.\par \par \uc2 Landshare (LAND)\par \par \uc2 Real world assets (RWAs) are taking the front of the cryptocurrency market. Tokenization of assets is becoming popular and many projects are emerging within the space providing ultimate values and unique propositions. In the tokenization real estate industry Landshare has played a significant role.\par \par \uc2 The innovative approach of offering fractional ownership of real estate assets through blockchain technology has drawn investors eager to tap into the profitable real estate sector. The RWA sector is swiftly growing in the fast-paced cryptocurrency market, driven by a broader trend towards asset tokenization across multiple sectors.\par \par \uc2 LAND, the primary native token of a leading tokenized real estate platform, has grown substantially in this dynamic environment. This growth has proven highly advantageous for investors. Landshare has been at the forefront of blending blockchain technology with real estate, enabling property investments starting at only $1. This model provides investors with fractional ownership of real estate properties, thus transforming the real estate investment scene.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.landshare.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Landshare}}}\uc2  has successfully employed the LAND token in transactions, as evidenced by the successful sale of four tokenized properties on the Binance Smart Chain (BSC). This demonstrates Landshare's robust operational strengths and readiness for wider market integration.\par \par \uc2 This momentum and ongoing enhancements at Landshare have strengthened the platform's distinct role in addressing the inefficiencies of the traditional real estate market and affirmed my investment decision, offering significant growth and passive income possibilities in the crypto market.\par \par \uc2 LAND token was no exception to experience a dip recently when the broader crypto market took a plunge. The token price slid from the yearly high of $7 to $1.8 within a few months. However, it possesses the potential to benefit from the market conditions getting better. It is trading at $2.1 jumping 15% within a week showing the token was among the leading tokens to chase the market optimism.\par \par \uc2 Arweave (AR)\par \par \uc2 Arweave represents a pioneering approach to decentralized data storage, positioning itself within the sector as a leader in permanent, sustainable data storage\u8212\'20\'14a concept it terms decentralized physical infrastructure network (DePIN). Unlike traditional data storage solutions that rent space, Arweave allows users to pay a one-time endowment, ensuring data is stored forever without recurring fees.\par \par \uc2 This model is particularly valuable for archiving important data such as academic research, historical records, and digital artwork, thus preventing loss over time. The solid fundamentals of Arweave are underpinned by its innovative blockweave technology, enhancing scalability and data retrieval efficiency.\par \par \uc2 Arweave's native token AR performance reflects its leading role in the DePIN sector, attracting investors interested in long-term data preservation and indicating strong market trust in its utility and future relevance.\par \par \uc2 AR token is trading at $27.8 following an impressive growth of nearly 25% in the last week. It is expected to continue the uptrend given the DePIN narrative spreading its reach among the investors.\par \par \uc2 End Note\par \par \uc2 The tokens mentioned here: DUEL, LAND and AR are based on their past performances and belong to the latest trends. Crypto market is prone to \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the recent dip is another example of it. Investors should take these as insights of the current market scenario, tokens that could shine during the bull and potential reasons for it.\par \par \uc2 It is advised to always do your own research before stepping into the crypto market. Always prefer to follow the experts and read the market pattern and trends. The hassle of research and gathering information before investing not only saves investors their hard earned money but also provides good returns.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240718ek7h0000g\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,763 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 July 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Altcoins look ready to break out as Bitcoin's move above $65,000 confirms that the bull market is back on track.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvZGRiMDIzOTctMzE2OC00MTIxLWFjZGYtOWU1MTg2MjlhNjYwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been conquering overhead resistance levels one by one, signaling that the bulls are gaining confidence. Farside Investors data shows {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-66k-bitcoin-bulls-beat-100m-asks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $422 million in inflows}}}\uc2  into the United States-based spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) on July 16.\par \par \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 iShares Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (IBIT) once again crossed $20 billion in assets under management after its latest purchase of 4,004 Bitcoin. The fund had earlier surpassed $20 billion in AUM in late May. Looking at the massive inflows, ETF Store president Nate Geraci said in a post on X that it is not only the retail investors; even {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrocks-spot-bitcoin-etf-sees-260-millon-flow-day"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 advisers and institutional investors have been buying}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/5718ed01-b994-40c7-913a-2e261b7db348.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recent rise has improved sentiment, and analysts are speculating how soon {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-forecast-splendid-bullish-price-action-now-that-btc-is-above-65k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a new all-time high could be achieved}}}\uc2 . While anything is possible in the markets, the current up move is expected to face solid selling between $70,000 and the all-time high near $74,000. Expect markets to remain volatile in the near term as some of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-accumulating-mt-gox-distribution"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 creditors of the defunct Mt. Gox exchange sell}}}\uc2  their repayments.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s strength trigger further buying in altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin climbed above the 50-day simple moving average ($63,926) on July 15, indicating that the bulls are on a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/4174917e-5a84-4efc-a10d-37dcb38b5eea.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price back below the 50-day SMA on July 16, but the long tail on the candlestick shows solid buying at lower levels. If the price sustains above the 50-day SMA, a rally to $70,000 is possible.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and breaks below the 50-day SMA, it will signal that demand dries up at higher levels. The bears will then try to sink the BTC/USDT pair to the 20-day SMA ($59,952).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rallied to the 50-day SMA ($3,454) on July 15, indicating that the sideways movement between $2,850 and $4,094 remains intact.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/ef9d4ac1-a788-4484-b62f-47c1ef3c4e30.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to strengthen their position further by pushing the price to $3,730 and later attempt a rally to the overhead resistance of $4,094. Sellers are expected to fiercely defend the zone between $4,000 and $4,094.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down from the current level and plummets below the 20-day SMA ($3,228). The ETH/USDT pair may then retest the crucial support at $2,850. A break below this support will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears are protecting the 50-day SMA ($586) in BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ), but they are struggling to pull the price below the 20-day SMA ($544). The long tail on the July 16 candlestick shows that the bulls are buying on minor dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/f8bd19f1-152b-46b6-a2fd-74affd975d2a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the 50-day SMA will open the doors for a rally to the overhead resistance of $635. This level may pose a strong challenge to the bulls, but if the buyers do not give up much ground, the BNB/USDT pair may start its climb toward $722.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to swiftly drag the price below the 20-day SMA. If they do that, it will indicate selling at higher levels. The pair may then drop to the $495 to $460 support zone.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a descending triangle pattern for several days. The bulls have pushed the price to the downtrend line, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/20db9b92-0afd-4dcd-b89a-ce498ce93f53.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from the downtrend line but bounces off the 20-day SMA ($143), it will suggest a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. That will increase the likelihood of a break above the downtrend line. If that happens, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to $189 and subsequently to $210.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day SMA, it will signal that the pair may remain inside the triangle for a while. A break below $116 will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern, starting a move to $100.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has made a strong comeback in the past few days, putting the bulls back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/8a23c152-8f34-4ea6-bc5e-f17cd3915ffe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to stall the rally at $0.57, but the buyers bulldozed their way above the resistance on July 16. The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the overbought zone, indicating that bulls are in charge.\par \par \uc2 However, a short-term pullback could not be ruled out. The first support on the downside is at $0.57. If bulls flip the level into support, the XRP/USDT pair could surge to $0.67 and subsequently to $0.74. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum will weaken if the price breaks and maintains below $0.57.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) back above the breakdown level of $0.12 on July 15, signaling that the markets rejected the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/25eec2d4-0337-46c4-b1dc-196b59352a0c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to halt the up move at the 50-day SMA ($0.13). If the price turns down but finds support at the 20-day SMA ($0.11), it will suggest that the bulls are buying the dips. That will improve the prospects of a break above the 50-day SMA. The DOGE/USDT pair could then climb toward $0.15 and later $0.18.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day SMA, it will indicate that the bears are active at higher levels. The pair may then slump to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day SMA ($7.43) on July 15 but turned down from the $7.72 overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/e7b149e5-ef42-45df-bcf2-e6915cbb337a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price remains below the 50-day SMA ($7.32), the bears will try to pull the TON/USDT pair to $6.77. This is an essential level for the bulls to defend because if they fail to do that, the pair will complete a double top pattern. That may start a downward move to $6 and later to $5.50.\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day SMA and the RSI just below the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. The bulls will have to drive the pair above $7.72 to start a rally to the overhead resistance of $8.29.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-xrp-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is XRP price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been maintaining above the moving averages for the past few days, indicating a lack of aggressive selling by the traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/892e0473-998c-4308-8f51-2f0f336500e0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day SMA ($0.40) has started to turn up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive zone, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the upside. Buyers will try to push the price to the overhead resistance of $0.51.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair turns down and breaks below the moving averages, it will indicate that the bears have not given up. That could result in a range-bound action between $0.32 and $0.45 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has reached the overhead resistance of $29, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/c17ad7a7-ec1a-4695-af6a-f9ce3b66bb34.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day SMA ($26.84) has flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  has risen into positive territory, indicating a balance between supply and demand. The advantage will tilt in favor of the bulls if they push and sustain the price above $29. If that happens, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could jump to $34 and later to $37.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day SMA, it will suggest that the pair may remain stuck between $21.80 and $29 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) reached the breakdown level of $0.000020 on July 16, where the bears are trying to halt the rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/fd6d95a5-0a3f-4f38-9be3-ddfe39115235.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A positive sign in favor of the bulls is that they have not ceded ground to the bears. This suggests that the bulls are holding on to their positions as they anticipate another leg higher. If the price rises above $0.000020, the SHIB/USDT pair could reach $0.000026.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down sharply from $0.000020, the pair could drop to the 20-day SMA ($0.000017). Such a move could indicate the possibility of a range-bound action between $0.000020 and $0.000012 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvZGRiMDIzOTctMzE2OC00MTIxLWFjZGYtOWU1MTg2MjlhNjYwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240717ek7h000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
