\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 7-16 BTC, ETH, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , UNI, ATOM\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 1,844 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 July 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Major Cryptocurrencies Record Significant Inflows}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Avalanche (AVAX) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cosmos (ATOM) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) has surged past $64,000, having been incredibly \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  as buyers return to the market. BTC\u8217\'20\'19s recent surge indicates strong demand at lower levels, with the cryptocurrency recording weekly inflows of over $1.3 billion, according to data from \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 BTC and other major altcoins could register significant upward movement should the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment continue, potentially even reaching new all-time highs.\par \par \uc2 Major Cryptocurrencies Record Significant Inflows\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) has rocketed over 12% during the past seven days as bulls returned to the market, driving the prices of major cryptocurrencies higher. The world\u8217\'20\'19s largest cryptocurrency recorded the fifth largest weekly inflows at $1.35 billion. At the same time, Ethereum (ETH) saw weekly inflows worth $72 million as anticipation around the launch of a spot Ethereum ETF in the US builds. According to crypto analytics firm Santiment, smaller BTC traders dumped their holdings when prices dipped. On the other hand, BTC whales bought the dip, accumulating the asset in a big way. Data from IntoTheBlock showed that BTC whales purchased over 71,000 BTC during the recent \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Every trader has two questions: How long will the BTC rally continue, and will it be able to set a new all-time high? Traders may be tempted to take profits near the overhead resistance, and we could see this happen this time as well. This is why BTC may find it difficult to set a new all-time high and will likely encounter significant resistance around $65,000 and $70,000 should it climb any higher.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/crypto-price-analysis-7-15-btc-eth-sol-ton-xrp-matic-dot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  has been quite \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  since the weekend, surging past the $60,000 mark. However, its \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is showing signs of waning as bears push back, with considerable selling pressure prevalent at higher levels. This is evident in the price chart, which shows BTC in the red during the ongoing session as sellers push back. After a mixed week, BTC rose by 0.99% to $57,972 in a session marred by high \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Buyers were able to continue controlling the market over the weekend as well, with BTC registering an increase of 1.71% on Saturday and 3.06% on Sunday to end the weekend above $60,000. Sunday\u8217\'20\'19s increase also saw BTC push above the 200 and 20-day SMAs to settle at $60,750.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/rMPcc8zv/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current week began with an impressive surge of 6.63% for BTC. This saw the price surge past $64,000 and settle at $64,776. However, bears were expected to defend the $65,000 level, and with the expectation that some profit booking would occur, BTC fell into the red during the ongoing session as bulls lost steam. Currently, BTC is down by almost 2% as sellers are looking to push the price down to $60,000. If BTC is able to recover and push back above $64,000, we could see the price test the resistance at $65,000. A break above this level could see a rally towards the $70,000 mark.\par \par \uc2 However, if bears can push the price down further, it would indicate selling on rallies. As such, BTC could drop to $60,000.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) saw a significant uptick in demand near a crucial support level, leading to a notable rebound. However, bulls may have to wait a little longer to push above $3,500, with ETH currently down by 1.76%. Looking at the price chart, we can see that ETH has surged after a prolonged \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend, which saw the price dip to a low of $2,824. However, the price has since rebounded, reclaiming the $3,000 level. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified in recent days, with anticipation growing around the launch of spot Ethereum ETFs.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/yPh5QKCe/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 As we can see in the price chart, after experiencing significant \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday, ETH was able to push above the 200-day SMA on Friday, rising by 1.12% to $3,136. The weekend saw bulls continue to control the market, with ETH rising by 1.34% on Saturday and 2.17% on Sunday to settle at $3,247. Sunday also saw ETH push above the 20-day SMA, a crucial level. ETH began the current week with a 7.37% surge as bulls eyed the $3,500 level and a move above the 50-day SMA. However, with intense selling pressure at $3,500, bulls began losing momentum, and ETH settled at $3,486. The current session sees ETH down by 1.55% as buyers look to push ETH back towards the 20-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 If bulls are able to regain control, we could see ETH push above $3,500, a level not seen since May. However, should sellers continue to push ETH lower, we could see a drop to $3,000 or $2,850.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (SOL) surged past the $150 mark on the back of growing optimism and market strength. The cryptocurrency is currently trading above the 20,50, and 200-day SMAs but is down by just over 2% during the current session. However, it has seen a noticeable jump over the weekend, which has fueled its ascent to above $150. SOL registered a jump of 2.78%, which saw it move above the 200-day SMA to $139.60. Saturday saw another increase, which pushed SOL above the 20-day SMA to $142.04, while a 4.05% increase on Sunday saw SOL settle at $147.79, just below the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/6M7ujUM9/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL surged past the 50-day SMA and $150 on Monday, registering an increase of 7.93% to $159. However, it faced significant resistance at $160 and, as a result, has seen a drop during the ongoing session. Currently, SOL is down by 3.30% and is trading at $154. If the price remains above $150 and consolidates, we may see SOL test of $160 again. A break past this level could start a rally to $170 and above. The \uc2 RSI\uc2  is currently sitting at 56, indicating neither overbought nor oversold conditions, giving SOL room for upward price movements.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has spent the previous week steadily climbing towards $0.45. The cryptocurrency broke above the 20-day SMA on Wednesday when it rose to $0.38. By Friday, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  had pushed above $0.40 after an increase of 6%, settling at $0.41, just below the 50-day SMA. It was able to move above the 50-day SMA on Saturday when it registered an increase of 6% to move to $0.44. However, with strong resistance at $0.45, sellers were able to push \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  down to $0.43 on Sunday, a drop of 2.26%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/KEKqpUlx/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current week began with buyers attempting to push \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  above $0.45. However, they were unable to do so, and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  settled at $0.44 once again. The current session sees \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  down by 2.39% with sellers in control. If \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is able to break out and consolidate above $0.45, we could see a rally toward $0.50. However, if sellers retain control of the markets, we could see a drop to $0.40.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche (AVAX) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche (\uc2 AVAX\uc2 ) has witnessed considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the past week as it attempted to move above the 20-day SMA, acting as a dynamic resistance level. \uc2 AVAX\uc2  was able to stay above $25, trading in a narrow range during the previous week. \uc2 AVAX\uc2  registered an increase of just above 3% on Friday, rising to $25.99. However, it was back in the red on Saturday, falling marginally before rising by 1.87% on Sunday to end the weekend above $26.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/Jh94eERz/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current week began with bulls pushing AVAX above the 20-day SMA, as the price broke above this level and moved to $27.84 after an increase of 5.61%. However, bulls lost momentum as the price got closer to $30, with \uc2 AVAX\uc2  back in the red during the ongoing session. \uc2 AVAX\uc2  is currently down by 3.36% and trading at $26.89. Looking at the price chart, we can see that \uc2 AVAX\uc2  is experiencing considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as indicated by the Bollinger Bands. If sellers push AVAX lower, it could slip below the 20-day SMA and move down to $25.\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) has registered a sharp drop, down by almost 7% during the ongoing session. UNI was quite \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the weekend, registering considerable gains as the crypto markets turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The cryptocurrency pushed above $8 on Friday after an increase of 3.28%, settling at $8.09. The weekend saw UNI continue to be \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , rising by 0.99% on Saturday and 2.80% on Sunday to $8.60, settling just below the 20-day SMA. UNI broke above the 20-day SMA on Monday, rising to $8.60.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/OkPhPfq8/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, UNI was unable to push higher, and \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment returned during the ongoing session as the price faced strong resistance at higher levels. Currently, UNI is trading at $8.05, down by over 6%. If sellers continue to control the session, UNI could be pushed below $8. UNI faces several critical resistance levels that it must overcome for a sustained push upwards. These levels are $8.60, $9, and $9.50.\par \par \uc2 Cosmos (ATOM) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Cosmos (ATOM) has recovered well after dropping to a low of $5.09 on July 5. Over the past week, the cryptocurrency has registered an increase of over 8%, although the current session has seen the escalation of selling pressure. ATOM reclaimed $6 on Friday after a 3.59% increase, which saw the price move to $6.15. The weekend saw only marginal increases of 0.92% on Saturday and 0.24% on Sunday, leaving the price at $6.23, just below the 20-day SMA. ATOM surged past the 20-day SMA on Monday, rising by 4.41% and reaching a crucial level at $6.50.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/RnfH1fGw/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, it faced considerable selling pressure at this level and, as a result, fell back into the red during the current session. The current session sees ATOM down by just over 3%, with the price at $6.29. If ATOM continues to be \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , we could see a move back to $6. If it is able to consolidate above $6, it indicates demand at lower levels. To alleviate the selling pressure, ATOM must consolidate above the 20-day SMA and push above $7 and the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240717ek7g00007\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, TON, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,754 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 July 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin continues to view aggressive buying at lower levels, but will traders\u8217\'20\'19 demand dry up near $70,000?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvNGYwNjljNmYtNzIzNy00MmM1LWI5ZDYtYjBhN2Q1OTUxODI5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rose 8.8% last week to conquer the psychological barrier of $60,000, indicating solid buying at lower levels. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  data shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/digital-asset-investment-inflows-record-17-8-b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin witnessed inflows of $1.35 billion}}}\uc2 , the fifth largest weekly inflows on record.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) was not alone as even Ethereum products saw inflows of $72 million in anticipation of the launch of the first spot Ethereum exchange-traded fund (ETF) in the US.\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency analytics firm Santiment said in a post on X that smaller traders dumped their holdings in the fall while {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-scoop-up-71000-btc-during-price-dip"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin whales and sharks accumulated}}}\uc2 . According to market intelligence platform IntoTheBlock Bitcoin, Bitcoin whales purchased 71,000 Bitcoin during \u8220\'20\'1Cthe recent price decrease.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/dca9ea1d-b132-423d-99cd-29157417539c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The next question in every trader's mind is whether the rally will continue and Bitcoin hit a new all-time high. In a range, traders generally tend to take profits near the overhead resistance, and that is likely to happen again. The bulls may not find it easy to drive the price to a new all-time high as the bears are expected to pose significant resistance above $70,000.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin continue its recovery and climb above the $64,500 resistance, triggering buying in altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index remains in a solid uptrend. The bulls extended the rally on July 15, hitting a lifetime high of 5,666.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/881c7130-4d2f-4cd5-9aae-b991c8558c5c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) remains in the overbought zone, signaling that bulls are in command. The bears will try to start a correction from 5,600, but if the bulls prevail, the index could start its journey toward 6,000.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the 20-day simple moving average (5,519). That will indicate profit-booking by short-term traders. The index may then slump to the 50-day SMA (5,375).\par \par \uc2 US Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push the US dollar index (DXY) above the 50-day SMA (105) on July 9, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/58f6a4fa-6a17-45d3-9de3-d079ce3615c7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price turned down on July 10 and has reached the crucial support at 104. Buyers are expected to defend this level. If the price rebounds off 104 with strength, the index could reach the moving averages. If the price turns down sharply from the moving averages, the likelihood of a break below 104 increases. The index may drop to 103.17 and later to 102.63.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above the moving averages will open the doors for a rally to 106, where the bears are likely to sell aggressively.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin jumped above the 20-day SMA ($59,522) on July 14, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/87b38335-ce4e-41fd-b381-b978b55fec37.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to strengthen their position by pushing the price above the $64,602 overhead resistance. If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair is likely to pick up momentum and reach the $72,000 to $73,777 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from $64,602, it will suggest that the bears are selling on rallies. The pair could then pullback to the 20-day SMA. If the price turns up from the 20-day SMA, it will signal a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. That will improve the prospects of a break above $64,602.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between $2,850 and $4,094 for the past several months. In a range, traders buy near the support and sell close to the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/b5662a33-6187-4f62-9191-fe8ffdf92150.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears\u8217\'20\'19 failure to sink and maintain the price below $2,850 has started a move toward the resistance at $4,094. The bears may try to stall the recovery at the 50-day SMA ($3,469), but if the bulls do not give up much ground, the possibility of the up move continuing remains high.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to make a comeback, they will have to swiftly tug the price back below the 20-day SMA. If they do that, the ETH/USDT pair could slide toward $2,850.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day SMA ($543) on July 15, indicating that the selling pressure is reducing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/cd8b0490-54f5-4a89-bfd3-f4d2a971be9c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to continue the up move by pushing the price above the 50-day SMA ($587). If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could reach the overhead resistance of $635, where the sellers will attempt to stall the rally.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from $635, it is likely to find support at the 20-day SMA. A bounce off the 20-day SMA will enhance the prospects of a break above $635.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the 50-day SMA and breaks below the 20-day SMA, it will signal that the pair remains stuck inside the $495 to $635 range.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) recovery has risen above the 50-day SMA ($148), indicating that the bears are losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/ff343626-7be0-415d-80c5-20108b90114e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 There is a minor resistance at $155, but if that is scaled, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could reach the downtrend line. The bears are expected to protect this level, as a break above it will invalidate the developing descending triangle pattern. The failure of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern is a positive sign. That may start a rally to $169 and subsequently to $210.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to quickly pull the price back below the 20-day SMA ($141). That may keep the price within the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day SMA ($0.46) on July 12 and followed that up with a sharp up move to $0.57 on July 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/e3327a3d-7882-4ce9-b715-490d689356f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are defending the $0.57 level, but a positive sign is that the bulls have not allowed the price to dip below the psychological level of $0.50. If the price rebounds off $0.50, the likelihood of a rally above $0.57 increases. The XRP/USDT pair could then rise to $0.62 and eventually to $0.67.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and breaks below $0.50, it will signal that the pair may drop to the solid support at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) has been swinging between $6.77 and $8.29 for the past few days, indicating buying on dips and selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/b6321a0b-f1ee-4996-aad9-4e50b2b64679.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day SMA ($7.46) has flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. If buyers drive the price above $7.72, the TON/USDT pair could rally to $8.29.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down sharply from $7.72, it will signal that the bears are selling on rallies. The pair could then slide toward the support of the range at $6.77. The next trending move is likely to begin on a break above $8.29 or below $6.77.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) pullback has reached the breakdown level of $0.12, indicating that the bulls are attempting a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/e2ac7696-7fd2-4613-9aa7-2cf137e89b2c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from $0.12, it will suggest that the bears are attempting to flip the level into resistance. The DOGE/USDT pair could drop to $0.10 and then retest the July 5 low of $0.09. Buyers are expected to fiercely defend the $0.09 to $0.10 support zone.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above $0.12 will be the first indication of a potential trend change. The pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.13), where the bears may mount a strong defense, but if the bulls prevail, the rally could reach $0.15.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke above the descending channel on July 12 and followed it up with a break above the 50-day SMA ($0.41) on July 13. This suggests that the downtrend could be over.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/a662c41e-8fb9-4e85-aced-ec653f4e5cf9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day SMA ($0.39) has started to turn up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  has jumped into the positive territory, indicating that the bulls have the upper hand. If the price stays above the moving averages, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could climb to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down sharply and plummets below the 20-day SMA. If that happens, it will signal that the current breakout may have been a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvNGYwNjljNmYtNzIzNy00MmM1LWI5ZDYtYjBhN2Q1OTUxODI5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240716ek7f0000c\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, TON, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,754 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 July 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin continues to view aggressive buying at lower levels, but will traders\u8217\'20\'19 demand dry up near $70,000?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvNGYwNjljNmYtNzIzNy00MmM1LWI5ZDYtYjBhN2Q1OTUxODI5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rose 8.8% last week to conquer the psychological barrier of $60,000, indicating solid buying at lower levels. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  data shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/digital-asset-investment-inflows-record-17-8-b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin witnessed inflows of $1.35 billion}}}\uc2 , the fifth largest weekly inflows on record.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin was not alone a even Ethereum products saw inflows of $72 million in anticipation of the launch of the first spot Ethereum exchange-traded fund (ETF) in the US.\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency analytics firm Santiment said in a post on X that smaller traders dumped their holdings in the fall while {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-scoop-up-71000-btc-during-price-dip"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin whales and sharks accumulated}}}\uc2 . According to market intelligence platform IntoTheBlock Bitcoin, Bitcoin whales purchased 71,000 Bitcoin during \u8220\'20\'1Cthe recent price decrease.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/dca9ea1d-b132-423d-99cd-29157417539c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The next question in every trader's mind is whether the rally will continue and Bitcoin hit a new all-time high. In a range, traders generally tend to take profits near the overhead resistance, and that is likely to happen again. The bulls may not find it easy to drive the price to a new all-time high as the bears are expected to pose significant resistance above $70,000.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin continue its recovery and climb above the $64,500 resistance, triggering buying in altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index remains in a solid uptrend. The bulls extended the rally on July 15, hitting a lifetime high of 5,666.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/881c7130-4d2f-4cd5-9aae-b991c8558c5c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) remains in the overbought zone, signaling that bulls are in command. The bears will try to start a correction from 5,600, but if the bulls prevail, the index could start its journey toward 6,000.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the 20-day simple moving average (5,519). That will indicate profit-booking by short-term traders. The index may then slump to the 50-day SMA (5,375).\par \par \uc2 US Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push the US dollar index (DXY) above the 50-day SMA (105) on July 9, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/58f6a4fa-6a17-45d3-9de3-d079ce3615c7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price turned down on July 10 and has reached the crucial support at 104. Buyers are expected to defend this level. If the price rebounds off 104 with strength, the index could reach the moving averages. If the price turns down sharply from the moving averages, the likelihood of a break below 104 increases. The index may drop to 103.17 and later to 102.63.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above the moving averages will open the doors for a rally to 106, where the bears are likely to sell aggressively.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin jumped above the 20-day SMA ($59,522) on July 14, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/87b38335-ce4e-41fd-b381-b978b55fec37.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to strengthen their position by pushing the price above the $64,602 overhead resistance. If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair is likely to pick up momentum and reach the $72,000 to $73,777 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from $64,602, it will suggest that the bears are selling on rallies. The pair could then pullback to the 20-day SMA. If the price turns up from the 20-day SMA, it will signal a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. That will improve the prospects of a break above $64,602.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between $2,850 and $4,094 for the past several months. In a range, traders buy near the support and sell close to the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/b5662a33-6187-4f62-9191-fe8ffdf92150.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears' failure to sink and maintain the price below $2,850 has started a move toward the resistance at $4,094. The bears may try to stall the recovery at the 50-day SMA ($3,469), but if the bulls do not give up much ground, the possibility of the up move continuing remains high.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to make a comeback, they will have to swiftly tug the price back below the 20-day SMA. If they do that, the ETH/USDT pair could slide toward $2,850.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day SMA ($543) on July 15, indicating that the selling pressure is reducing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/cd8b0490-54f5-4a89-bfd3-f4d2a971be9c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to continue the up move by pushing the price above the 50-day SMA ($587). If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could reach the overhead resistance of $635, where the sellers will attempt to stall the rally.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from $635, it is likely to find support at the 20-day SMA. A bounce off the 20-day SMA will enhance the prospects of a break above $635.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the 50-day SMA and breaks below the 20-day SMA, it will signal that the pair remains stuck inside the $495 to $635 range.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) recovery has risen above the 50-day SMA ($148), indicating that the bears are losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/ff343626-7be0-415d-80c5-20108b90114e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 There is a minor resistance at $155, but if that is scaled, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could reach the downtrend line. The bears are expected to protect this level, as a break above it will invalidate the developing descending triangle pattern. The failure of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern is a positive sign. That may start a rally to $169 and subsequently to $210.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to quickly pull the price back below the 20-day SMA ($141). That may keep the price within the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day SMA ($0.46) on July 12 and followed that up with a sharp up move to $0.57 on July 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/e3327a3d-7882-4ce9-b715-490d689356f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are defending the $0.57 level, but a positive sign is that the bulls have not allowed the price to dip below the psychological level of $0.50. If the price rebounds off $0.50, the likelihood of a rally above $0.57 increases. The XRP/USDT pair could then rise to $0.62 and eventually to $0.67.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and breaks below $0.50, it will signal that the pair may drop to the solid support at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) has been swinging between $6.77 and $8.29 for the past few days, indicating buying on dips and selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/b6321a0b-f1ee-4996-aad9-4e50b2b64679.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day SMA ($7.46) has flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. If buyers drive the price above $7.72, the TON/USDT pair could rally to $8.29.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down sharply from $7.72, it will signal that the bears are selling on rallies. The pair could then slide toward the support of the range at $6.77. The next trending move is likely to begin on a break above $8.29 or below $6.77.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) pullback has reached the breakdown level of $0.12, indicating that the bulls are attempting a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/e2ac7696-7fd2-4613-9aa7-2cf137e89b2c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from $0.12, it will suggest that the bears are attempting to flip the level into resistance. The DOGE/USDT pair could drop to $0.10 and then retest the July 5 low of $0.09. Buyers are expected to fiercely defend the $0.09 to $0.10 support zone.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above $0.12 will be the first indication of a potential trend change. The pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.13), where the bears may mount a strong defense, but if the bulls prevail, the rally could reach $0.15.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke above the descending channel on July 12 and followed it up with a break above the 50-day SMA ($0.41) on July 13. This suggests that the downtrend could be over.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/a662c41e-8fb9-4e85-aced-ec653f4e5cf9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day SMA ($0.39) has started to turn up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  has jumped into the positive territory, indicating that the bulls have the upper hand. If the price stays above the moving averages, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could climb to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down sharply and plummets below the 20-day SMA. If that happens, it will signal that the current breakout may have been a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvNGYwNjljNmYtNzIzNy00MmM1LWI5ZDYtYjBhN2Q1OTUxODI5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240715ek7f000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,731 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 July 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls have been fiercely defending the $53,485 to $56,500 zone, signaling solid demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvZDQwMmE2ZmUtNWE2Yy00ZTNkLWE1MjYtMjAwNjUyODhjZDgyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bounced off the $56,500 support on July 12, indicating demand at lower levels. Institutional investors are viewing the dips in Bitcoin as a buying opportunity. According to the onchain analytics platform CryptoQuant, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/buying-the-dip-bitcoin-institutional-investors-add-100k-btc-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 institutional investors have acquired 100,000 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  in new purchases in a week.\par \par \uc2 A positive sign for the bulls is that much of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/german-government-bitcoin-sales-3200-btc-transferred"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 German government\u8217\'20\'19s Bitcoin selling is over}}}\uc2 . Traders will next {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-cpi-gains-last-1-hour-mt-gox-sell-off-fears"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 keenly watch the selling by the creditors}}}\uc2  of the \uc2 Mt. Gox\uc2  exchange after they receive their repayments. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) may start a recovery if the selling is subdued, but if the creditors dump their holdings, the price may remain under pressure for some more time.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/0162edfd-3db5-4ac0-a751-bb42f9513033.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s failure to start a strong relief rally has halted the recovery in several altcoins, but the bulls have not ceded much ground to the bears. This suggests that the buyers are holding on to their positions as they anticipate the upmove to continue.\par \par \uc2 Will the selling pressure in Bitcoin and altcoins reduce? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push Bitcoin above the 20-day simple moving average ($59,650) on July 11, but the bears held their ground. This shows that the sentiment remains negative, and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/f879d4a4-b700-4c89-904d-ef1acc9c981b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The onus is on the bulls to guard the zone between $56,552 and $53,485. If the price turns up sharply from the support zone, it will signal solid buying on dips. The bulls will have to overcome the barrier at the 20-day SMA to reduce the selling pressure. The BTC/USDT pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA ($64,532).\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be invalidated in the near term if the price continues lower and breaks below $53,485. If that happens, it will signal the start of a downtrend. The pair could plummet to $50,000, where the bulls will try to arrest the decline.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) July 11 candlestick shows that the bears are selling the rallies to the 20-day SMA ($3,239).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/8fb92a51-0bb4-4a71-87c8-23236082f7f1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price to $2,850, which is an important level to watch out for. Buyers are expected to defend the level with vigor. If the price rebounds off $2,850, the bulls will make another attempt to clear the hurdle at the 20-day SMA. If they succeed, it will suggest the start of a sustained recovery to the 50-day SMA ($3,499).\par \par \uc2 If bears want to strengthen their position, they will have to yank the price below $2,850, which might be a difficult task. If this level cracks, the selling could intensify and the ETH/USDT pair may plunge to $2,200.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day SMA ($547) on July 11, indicating that the bears are aggressively defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/866bc71b-4dd2-44b8-a4c9-2a244f840ca6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the BNB/USDT pair to $495, which is an important level to keep an eye on. If the price rebounds off $495 will suggest that the bulls are trying to put in a higher low. That will improve the prospects of a break above the 20-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks below $495, it will suggest that the bears are maintaining their pressure. The pair could then drop to $460, which is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are finding it difficult to push Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day SMA ($150), indicating that the bears are unwilling to give up.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/2011a1d1-9e00-4c86-aa34-179c9b2199bd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could remain stuck between $116 and the 50-day SMA for some time. If the price skids below $116, it will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. That may start a downward move to $100 and later to $80.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up and breaks above the 50-day SMA, it will signal the start of a relief rally to the downtrend line. The bears will try to stall the recovery at the downtrend line, but if the buyers bulldoze their way through, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) pullback reached the 50-day SMA ($0.49) on July 12, where the bears sold aggressively, as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/044edd96-8b2c-4ff4-8511-51cc1444da13.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $0.46, it will suggest a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. That will enhance the prospects of a break above the 50-day SMA. The XRP/USDT pair could then attempt a move to $0.53.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price slips and maintains below $0.46, it will signal that the bears remain active at higher levels. The pair may then gradually decline toward the crucial support at $0.41. The bulls are expected to aggressively defend the $0.46 to $0.41 zone.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is consolidating in a downtrend. The price is stuck between the breakdown level of $0.12 and the psychological support at $0.10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/04f00429-7237-46f5-b54f-5c419d903667.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory indicate advantage to bears. A break and close below $0.10 will embolden the bears who will try to sink the DOGE/USDT pair to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 The $0.12 resistance is the crucial level to watch out for on the upside. If this level is scaled, it will suggest the start of a strong recovery. The 50-day SMA ($0.14) may act as a hurdle, but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the 20-day SMA ($7.48), indicating that the bulls are maintaining their buying pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/da5ec8c6-3d90-41b1-8027-7cb41b7be81a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls propel the price above the 20-day SMA, the TON/USDT pair could rise to $7.72 and thereafter attempt a rally to $8.29. This level is expected to attract strong selling by the bears who will try to keep the price inside the $6.77 to $8.29 range.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the 20-day SMA, it will signal that the bears are fiercely defending the level. A break and close below $6.77 will complete a double top pattern, opening the gates for a drop to $6 and then to $5.50.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/key-btc-price-levels-bitcoin-58k-sticky-us-ppi"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Key BTC price levels emerge as Bitcoin hits $58K on 'sticky' US PPI}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has reached the resistance line of the descending channel, indicating that the bulls are attempting a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/a2b460f3-a1a1-4103-aa32-7006b061c99a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day SMA ($0.39) is flattening out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just above the midpoint, signaling that the selling pressure is reducing. If buyers push the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.41), it will signal a short-term trend change. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then attempt a rally to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be negated if the price turns down sharply from the resistance line and breaks below the 20-day SMA. That could pull the price down toward the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $27.50 and $24.50 for the past few days, but this tight range trading is unlikely to continue for long.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/b1ee4bfa-a379-401c-89c6-d829e0b04147.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers kick and sustain the price above the 20-day SMA, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($30.39). This level may offer resistance, but if the bulls prevail, the pair could surge to $34 and subsequently to $37.20.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below $24, it will signal that the bears are in command. The pair may retest the July 5 low of $21.80. If this level cracks, the pair could plummet to $19.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears have not allowed Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) to rise above the 20-day SMA ($0.000017), indicating selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/fc933984-fc92-4fb3-9f20-fbe01117c11d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory suggest that the bears have the edge. A break below $0.000015 will open the doors for a possible drop to $0.000012 and eventually to $0.000010.\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to have other plans. They will try to drive the price above the 20-day SMA and start a rally to the breakdown level of $0.000020. This level may again witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvZDQwMmE2ZmUtNWE2Yy00ZTNkLWE1MjYtMjAwNjUyODhjZDgyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \u