\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 7-12 BTC, ETH, \uc2 SOL\uc2 ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , RNDR, SEI\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 1,893 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 July 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Smart Money Is Betting On BTC}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Avalanche (AVAX) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Render (RNDR) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEI Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) has dropped over the past couple of days after failing to push above the $60,000 mark. After reaching a high of $59,683, BTC fell into the red and settled at $57,386, with sellers active at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 Despite BTC\u8217\'20\'19s difficulty in recent days, one analyst has predicted that it could hit a staggering $330,000 this bull cycle.\par \par \uc2 Smart Money Is Betting On BTC\par \par \uc2 The staggering prediction was made by independent analyst Arsen, who, unfazed by BTC\u8217\'20\'19s recent dip, predicted a staggering rebound during the current bull cycle. Arsen has stated that institutional investors, financial professionals, and market experts have been accumulating BTC during its recent correction, indicating long-term bullishness. The analyst noted that the recent dip was nothing new and pointed at previous bull cycles, which had experienced substantial price increases.\par \par \uc2 BTC\u8217\'20\'19s first bull cycle in 2012 lasted for 800 days and saw the price of the asset increase by a staggering 9,000%. Subsequent bull cycles in 2016 and 2020 also went on for about 800 days and saw BTC\u8217\'20\'19s value increase by 3000% and 1200%, respectively. Arsen\u8217\'20\'19s prediction comes in the middle of an ongoing correction that has seen BTC down almost 24% from its all-time high of $74,000. Currently, the asset is trading just above the $57,000 mark, with bears looking to push the price lower.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Germany has been liquidating its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/crypto-price-analysis-7-11-btc-eth-sol-xrp-ton-dot-atom"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  holdings, which has had a significant impact on the price of the asset. The government offloaded an additional $376 million worth of BTC on Thursday and now has around 9,000 BTC left to sell. So far, the German authorities have liquidated 82% of their holdings. With the selling seemingly at an end, BTC has remained steady around the $57,000 mark, which could bring some cheer to market watchers. So, is the bottom already in? After dropping to a low of $53,591 on July 5, BTC has done well in recovering and climbing to its current levels. Spot Bitcoin ETFs have registered strong inflows, which have nullified the selling pressure to an extent.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/nOoxWlkC/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC started the current week on a positive note as bulls attempted to push the asset towards $60,000. However, BTC is facing considerable selling pressure at higher levels, and as a result, it dropped and settled at $56,762. Tuesday saw buyers continue to control the market, with BTC rising to $58,081. Buyers made a renewed push towards $60,000 on Wednesday as BTC went above the 200-day SMA, but with sellers defending this level strongly, BTC dropped to $57,826, a marginal drop of 0.44%. Thursday saw another push towards $60,000, but selling at higher levels again pushed BTC back down, as it fell even further, registering a drop of 0.76% to $57,386. The current session sees BTC marginally down, with sellers in control. BTC faces strong levels of resistance at $59,000 and $60,000, which is where the 200 and 20-day SMAs are presently placed. If sellers manage to breach BTC\u8217\'20\'19s support levels, we could see a slide towards $50,000.\par \par \uc2 According to analysts, BTC is at a crucial point despite its recent rebound. A report by CryptoQuant has shown that the profit and loss (P&L) index is hovering around the 365-day moving average. If this metric slips below the moving average, BTC could see a major correction. CryptoQuant also stated that the bull-bear market cycle is approaching a crucial level and could switch to \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  if BTC declines further.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) has encountered stubborn resistance at the $3,100 level, which has prevented the bulls from pushing ETH higher. ETH began the week facing considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  as both bulls and bears sought to exert control over the market. Sellers pushed ETH to a low of $2,827, but Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s support was able to withstand the selling pressure. On the other hand, buyers pushed ETH to a day high of $3,096 as they attempted to push the price above $3,100 and the 200-day SMA. However, both levels held and ETH eventually settled at $3,020, an increase of 3.02%. Buyers remained in control on Tuesday, as ETH rose by 1.57% to $3,067 and then pushed to $3,103 on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/6xOliE2O/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Thursday saw high \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  once again as buyers and sellers battled for control. Buyers attempted to push ETH towards the 20-day SMA as it rose to $3,125. However, sellers pushed ETH back below the 200-day SMA, with ETH registering a marginal drop to settle at $3,101. The current session sees sellers in control, with ETH trading just below $3,100. While ETH has stayed above $3,000, it has been unable to move above $3,100. If it is able to push above the resistance level, we could see a move towards $3,300, the next crucial resistance level. However, if the bears are able to push ETH below $3,000 once again, we could see the $2,800 support level tested again.\par \par \uc2 One analyst pointed out that ETH could witness a stunning rally that could take it to $8,000 in this market cycle.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) has registered a drop of 3.40% over the past 24 hours, with selling pressure taking the asset below $140. While \uc2 SOL\uc2  has formed a strong level of support at $120, it is currently stuck under a key resistance level that the bulls have failed to overcome. While \uc2 SOL\uc2  has stabilized to a certain extent, failure to push above $150 could lead to another selloff. \uc2 SOL\uc2  registered a significant increase of 6.23% on Monday, pushing above the 20 and 200-day SMAs and settling at $139.88. Marginal increases on Tuesday and Wednesday saw \uc2 SOL\uc2  move to $142 by Wednesday. Buyers attempted to push towards $150 but could not do so.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/bsWZOUuI/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2  fell into the red on Thursday, dropping by 4.42% to $135.83. It also dropped below the 20 and 200-day SMAs once again. The current session sees \uc2 SOL\uc2  marginally up and trading at $136.66. Technical indicators for \uc2 SOL\uc2  remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , meaning we could see the price recover. For now, \uc2 SOL\uc2  must reclaim the $140 level and then push towards $150. If it can push above $140, it could be an indication that \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment is returning to the market. The \uc2 RSI\uc2  also indicates bullishness, giving \uc2 SOL\uc2  considerable room to appreciate.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is currently trading at $0.40 and is retesting its descending trendline, a factor that has been in play since March. The cryptocurrency has been quite \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  this week and has registered an increase of over 20% during the past seven days. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is also reflected in the \uc2 RSI\uc2  and the MACD. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence in the first week of July, often a precursor to a reversal or short-term rally. The positive sentiment is primarily driven by a surge in whale inflows, with data from IntoTheBlock pointing to a staggering increase of over 1,000% in such inflows.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/jY5c2ZQP/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This is why \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has shown incredible resilience at a time of market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , spending all of the current week in the green. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  registered an increase of over 6% on Monday, rising to $0.36. An increase of 1.90% on Tuesday and 3.46% on Wednesday took \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  above a crucial resistance level of $0.38. The current session sees \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  at $0.39, as it looks to push above $0.40 and towards the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche (AVAX) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche (\uc2 AVAX\uc2 ) has significantly declined over the past few days after failing to push above the 20-day SMA, acting as a dynamic resistance level. The cryptocurrency has also been experiencing considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and could face considerable selling pressure in the coming weeks. \uc2 AVAX\uc2  climbed to $26.44 on Tuesday after facing significant selling pressure over the weekend. However, it was unable to push above the 20-day SMA and fell by 2.54% on Wednesday to settle at $25.77. Thursday saw \uc2 AVAX\uc2  drop by a further 2.14% to $25.22. The current session sees AVAX marginally down, trading at $25.19.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/a0ZIerkM/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 While \uc2 AVAX\uc2  has faced significant selling pressure, its support at $25 has held firm. The level has already been tested twice, and if buyers are able to consolidate above this level, we could see \uc2 AVAX\uc2  make another attempt to move above the 20-day SMA. However, if the bulls cannot push AVAX above this level, we could see the asset trade in a narrow range. The cryptocurrency could see a slide down to $20 if its support fails to hold.\par \par \uc2 Render (RNDR) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Render (RNDR) has been on a downward trajectory since May, with \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensifying this week. The cryptocurrency has lost almost 9% during the past 24 hours, and its extended downtrend has caused investors to lose a significant chunk of capital. The larger AI space has been in the doldrums, with its bearishness impacting other tokens besides RNDR as well. The cryptocurrency\u8217\'20\'19s Chaikin Money Flow also indicates this bearishness, currently sitting below the zero line, indicating significant outflows.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/675UxmGV/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 RNDR also lost a crucial support level at the beginning of the month, slipping below $7. After managing to stay above $6, RNDR dropped by over 8% on Thursday, falling to $5.97. The current session sees RNDR down by 2.59%, with sellers in control. If sellers continue to control the market, RNDR could see a drop to $5.50 or even $5.\par \par \uc2 SEI Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 SEI has surged over 25% in the past 7 days as bulls eye a critical resistance level. Surpassing this level could lay the foundation for a reversal, leading to a significant rally at $0.50. The cryptocurrency dropped to $0.25 after a staggering fall of 10.30% on Sunday. However, its support level held, and SEI was able to rebound, surging by 10.94% to $0.28 and wiping out the previous session\u8217\'20\'19s losses. SEI continued its upward trajectory on Tuesday, registering an increase of 15.99% and rising to $0.33.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/LB7Tq3wB/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, it faced stiff resistance at this level and could only register a marginal increase on Wednesday. Thursday saw SEI register a drop of 6.54%, as it fell to $0.31. The current session sees the price at $0.32 as buyers attempt to push above the 20-day SMA. If SEI can push above this level, we can see a rally towards $0.40 and the 500-day SMA. A breakout above this level could push the price as high as $0.50.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240713ek7c0000a\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,732 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 July 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls have been fiercely defending the $53,485 to $56,500 zone, signaling solid demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvZDQwMmE2ZmUtNWE2Yy00ZTNkLWE1MjYtMjAwNjUyODhjZDgyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $56,500 support on July 12, indicating demand at lower levels. Institutional investors are viewing the dips in Bitcoin as a buying opportunity. According to the onchain analytics platform CryptoQuant, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/buying-the-dip-bitcoin-institutional-investors-add-100k-btc-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 institutional investors have acquired 100,000 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  in new purchases in a week.\par \par \uc2 A positive sign for the bulls is that much of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/german-government-bitcoin-sales-3200-btc-transferred"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 German government\u8217\'20\'19s Bitcoin selling is over}}}\uc2 . Traders will next {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-cpi-gains-last-1-hour-mt-gox-sell-off-fears"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 keenly watch the selling by the creditors}}}\uc2  of the \uc2 Mt. Gox\uc2  exchange after they receive their repayments. Bitcoin may start a recovery if the selling is subdued, but if the creditors dump their holdings, the price may remain under pressure for some more time.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/0162edfd-3db5-4ac0-a751-bb42f9513033.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s failure to start a strong relief rally has halted the recovery in several altcoins, but the bulls have not ceded much ground to the bears. This suggests that the buyers are holding on to their positions as they anticipate the up move to continue.\par \par \uc2 Will the selling pressure in Bitcoin and altcoins reduce? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push Bitcoin above the 20-day simple moving average ($59,650) on July 11, but the bears held their ground. This shows that the sentiment remains negative, and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/f879d4a4-b700-4c89-904d-ef1acc9c981b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The onus is on the bulls to guard the zone between $56,552 and $53,485. If the price turns up sharply from the support zone, it will signal solid buying on dips. The bulls will have to overcome the barrier at the 20-day SMA to reduce the selling pressure. The BTC/USDT pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA ($64,532).\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be invalidated in the near term if the price continues lower and breaks below $53,485. If that happens, it will signal the start of a downtrend. The pair could plummet to $50,000, where the bulls will try to arrest the decline.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) July 11 candlestick shows that the bears are selling the rallies to the 20-day SMA ($3,239).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/8fb92a51-0bb4-4a71-87c8-23236082f7f1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price to $2,850, which is an important level to watch out for. Buyers are expected to defend the level with vigor. If the price rebounds off $2,850, the bulls will make another attempt to clear the hurdle at the 20-day SMA. If they succeed, it will suggest the start of a sustained recovery to the 50-day SMA ($3,499).\par \par \uc2 If bears want to strengthen their position, they will have to yank the price below $2,850, which might be a difficult task. If this level cracks, the selling could intensify and the ETH/USDT pair may plunge to $2,200.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day SMA ($547) on July 11, indicating that the bears are aggressively defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/866bc71b-4dd2-44b8-a4c9-2a244f840ca6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the BNB/USDT pair to $495, which is an important level to keep an eye on. If the price rebounds off $495 will suggest that the bulls are trying to put in a higher low. That will improve the prospects of a break above the 20-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks below $495, it will suggest that the bears are maintaining their pressure. The pair could then drop to $460, which is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are finding it difficult to push Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day SMA ($150), indicating that the bears are unwilling to give up.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/2011a1d1-9e00-4c86-aa34-179c9b2199bd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could remain stuck between $116 and the 50-day SMA for some time. If the price skids below $116, it will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. That may start a downward move to $100 and later to $80.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up and breaks above the 50-day SMA, it will signal the start of a relief rally to the downtrend line. The bears will try to stall the recovery at the downtrend line, but if the buyers bulldoze their way through, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) pullback reached the 50-day SMA ($0.49) on July 12, where the bears sold aggressively, as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/044edd96-8b2c-4ff4-8511-51cc1444da13.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $0.46, it will suggest a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. That will enhance the prospects of a break above the 50-day SMA. The XRP/USDT pair could then attempt a move to $0.53.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price slips and maintains below $0.46, it will signal that the bears remain active at higher levels. The pair may then gradually decline toward the crucial support at $0.41. The bulls are expected to aggressively defend the $0.46 to $0.41 zone.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is consolidating in a downtrend. The price is stuck between the breakdown level of $0.12 and the psychological support at $0.10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/04f00429-7237-46f5-b54f-5c419d903667.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory indicate advantage to bears. A break and close below $0.10 will embolden the bears who will try to sink the DOGE/USDT pair to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 The $0.12 resistance is the crucial level to watch out for on the upside. If this level is scaled, it will suggest the start of a strong recovery. The 50-day SMA ($0.14) may act as a hurdle, but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) has been trading near the 20-day SMA ($7.48), indicating that the bulls are maintaining their buying pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/da5ec8c6-3d90-41b1-8027-7cb41b7be81a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls propel the price above the 20-day SMA, the TON/USDT pair could rise to $7.72 and thereafter attempt a rally to $8.29. This level is expected to attract strong selling by the bears who will try to keep the price inside the $6.77 to $8.29 range.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the 20-day SMA, it will signal that the bears are fiercely defending the level. A break and close below $6.77 will complete a double top pattern, opening the gates for a drop to $6 and then to $5.50.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/key-btc-price-levels-bitcoin-58k-sticky-us-ppi"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Key BTC price levels emerge as Bitcoin hits $58K on 'sticky' US PPI}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has reached the resistance line of the descending channel, indicating that the bulls are attempting a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/a2b460f3-a1a1-4103-aa32-7006b061c99a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day SMA ($0.39) is flattening out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just above the midpoint, signaling that the selling pressure is reducing. If buyers shove the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.41), it will signal a short-term trend change. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then attempt a rally to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be negated if the price turns down sharply from the resistance line and breaks below the 20-day SMA. That could pull the price down toward the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $27.50 and $24.50 for the past few days, but this tight range trading is unlikely to continue for long.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/b1ee4bfa-a379-401c-89c6-d829e0b04147.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers kick and sustain the price above the 20-day SMA, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($30.39). This level may offer resistance, but if the bulls prevail, the pair could surge to $34 and subsequently to $37.20.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below $24, it will signal that the bears are in command. The pair may retest the July 5 low of $21.80. If this level cracks, the pair could plummet to $19.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears have not allowed Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) to rise above the 20-day SMA ($0.000017), indicating selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/fc933984-fc92-4fb3-9f20-fbe01117c11d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory suggest that the bears have the edge. A break below $0.000015 will open the doors for a possible drop to $0.000012 and eventually to $0.000010.\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to have other plans. They will try to drive the price above the 20-day SMA and start a rally to the breakdown level of $0.000020. This level may again witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvZDQwMmE2ZmUtNWE2Yy00ZTNkLWE1MjYtMjAwNjUyODhjZDgyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240712ek7c000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Asia Express\par \b \uc2 Singapore \u8216\'20\'18not ready\u8217\'20\'19 for Bitcoin ETFs, sneaky crypto mining rig importer: Asia Express\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yohan Yun \par \uc2 1,303 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 July 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Singapore isn\u8217\'20\'19t in a rush to list crypto ETFs, according to SGX CEO this week as Philippines charges two over a $6M XRP hot wallet hack.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.magazine.cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Magazine-asia-Express-2504-scaled.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Singapore \u8216\'20\'18not ready\u8217\'20\'19 for Bitcoin ETFs, sneaky crypto mining rig importer: Asia Express}}}\par \par \uc2 Our weekly roundup of news from East Asia curates the industrys most important developments.\par \par \uc2 SGX boss says Singapore not ready for Bitcoin ETFs\par \par \uc2 While several nations have approved the listing of cryptocurrency-based exchange-traded funds, Singapore, a key financial hub in Asia, is apparently not ready.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.magazine.cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Singapore-Exchange-CEO.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Singapore Exchange CEO}}}\par \par \uc2 SGX CEO Chye speaks at Reuters NEXT conference. (Reuters)\par \par \uc2 Singapore Exchange\uc2  (SGX) CEO \uc2 Loh Boon Chye{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/business/finance/sgx-has-no-immediate-plans-allow-crypto-listings-ceo-says-2024-07-09/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  so in a conference hosted by Reuters on July 9, stating that SGX is currently not open to crypto listings.\par \par \uc2 The ecosystem, I feel, at this point in time, is not ready for such products in Singapore, said Loh.\par \par \uc2 Singapore is often considered a rival to Hong Kong as both cities are global financial centers that strive to offer the most favorable business environment through \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  and tax incentives.\par \par \uc2 Hong Kong has already launched Asias first spot Bitcoin and Ether ETFs, a few months after the spot Bitcoin ETFs made their debut in the United States, the worlds largest economy.\par \par \uc2 Like Hong Kong, Singapore has expressed ambitions to become a hub for crypto businesses and has handed out more permits than its rival.\par \par \uc2 As of today, Singapore has green-lighted {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://eservices.mas.gov.sg/fid/institution?term=%22digital%20payment%20token%22&sector=Payments&category=Major%20Payment%20Institution&activity=Digital%20Payment%20Token%20Service&page=3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 24 digital payment token licenses}}}\uc2 , a permit that allows businesses to provide crypto services, including trading and custody.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://servedbyadbutler.com/go2/;ID=169476;size=728x90;setID=601214;referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fcointelegraph.com%2Fmagazine%2Fwp-json%2Fwp%2Fv2%2Fposts%3F_embed%26per_page%3D100"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://servedbyadbutler.com/go2/;ID=169476;size=300x250;setID=601213;referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fcointelegraph.com%2Fmagazine%2Fwp-json%2Fwp%2Fv2%2Fposts%3F_embed%26per_page%3D100"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Philippines charges two in $6 million crypto exchange XRP theft\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Philippines Department of Justice{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.pna.gov.ph/articles/1228602"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 has filed}}}\uc2  criminal charges against two former consultants of \uc2 Coins.ph\uc2 , who allegedly hacked the crypto exchange in October last year, allowing them to steal $6 million in XRP from a hot wallet.\par \par \uc2 The pair, identified as Vladimir Evgenevich Avdeev and Sergey Yaschuck, worked as consultants for \uc2 Coins.ph\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The exchange is licensed by the \uc2 Philippines central bank\uc2  to provide crypto trading and custody services to 16 million users.\par \par \uc2 Their pair\u8217\'20\'19s tenure allowed them access to Coins.phs network infrastructure, including secure access key protocols and server systems, according to the DOJ. When their tenure ended, they managed to retain access and used them without right, the prosecutors explained.\par \par \uc2 The alleged hack was discovered when \uc2 Coins.ph\uc2  found a 12.2 million XRP hole in one of its hot wallets. The stolen assets were subsequently traced to a separate external wallet which was eventually linked to Yaschucks account.\par \par \uc2 Read also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/singer-verites-web3-music-nfts-community/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Features Singer Vrits fan-first approach to Web3, music NFTs and community building}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/crypto-regulation-sec-chair-gary-gensler-final-say/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Features Crypto \b  \highlight22regulation\b0 \highlight22 : Does SEC Chair Gary Gensler have the final say?}}}\par \par \uc2 The two former consultants face charges for violating the nations Cybercrime Prevention Act. Avdeev is facing 23 counts, and Yaschuck is charged with three.\par \par \uc2 Vladimir Evgenevich Avdeev and Sergey Yaschuck reportedly departed from the country before they were indicted.\par \par \uc2 Importer caught trying to sneak expensive rigs through Korean customs\par \par \uc2 South Koreas airport customs has reportedly busted an importer for tax evasion after trying to bring cutting-edge cryptocurrency mining equipment disguised as obsolete and second-hand models.\par \par \uc2 The importer allegedly reported the products as outdated models worth $290 (400,000 Korean won) per unit. They were, in fact, one of the latest mining rigs available in the market worth a blistering $14,000 each.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.magazine.cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Crypto-rigs-1024x768.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrency mining rigs confiscated by South Korean autorities at Incheon Airport customs.}}}\par \par \uc2 Cutting-edge cryptocurrency mining rigs disguised as used and outdated models to evade customs tax. (Incheon Airport Customs)\par \par \uc2 Incheon Airport Customs said that the unnamed 44-year-old importer has been referred to prosecution on charges of violating the Customs Act by importing almost 700 units of high-end crypto mining rigs across 45 instances from November 2022.\par \par \uc2 They alleged the imported evaded around $144,000 worth of customs duties.\par \par \uc2 During customs clearance inspection, customs officials discovered discrepancies between the declared and actual models. Upon disassembling the mining machines, they confirmed that high-performance components such as GPUs (graphics processing units) were installed.\par \par \uc2 Read also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/intro-bitcoin-change-your-life/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Features A new intro to Bitcoin: The 9-minute read that could change your life}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/money-printer-brrrrr-wall-st-bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Features As Money Printer Goes Brrrrr, Wall St Loses Its Fear of Bitcoin}}}\par \par \uc2 The accused has been referred to prosecutors for further legal proceedings but has not been detained or held in custody.\par \par \uc2 A customs official {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.yna.co.kr/view/AKR20240710053100004"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cited}}}\uc2  by local media said that the country expects an uptick in low-cost declaration cases due to the increasing domestic demand for cryptocurrency mining rigs.\par \par \uc2 Suspicious Seven Hong Kongs securities watchdog says keep away\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Hong Kong Securities and Futures Commission\uc2  (SFC){\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/news-and-announcements/news/doc?refNo=24PR117"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 listed}}}\uc2  seven businesses suspected of engaging in crypto fraud in a statement last week, naming XTCQT, CEG, BTEPRO, Bitones,org, Yomaex, Bstor and Taurusemex.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 SFC\uc2  said that clients of the trading platforms have reported encountering withdrawal issues. In several instances, the platforms claimed the accounts were linked to money laundering activities, which was the reason for suspension.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.magazine.cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/SFC-website-with-warning-banner-1024x576.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Screenshot of Hong Kong Securities Futures Commission on July 10 displays a warning to name businesses suspected of fraud}}}\par \par \uc2 SFC\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s website features a banner listing businesses suspected of fraud. (\uc2 SFC\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 This led to some paying exorbitant fees to unfreeze their accounts.\par \par \uc2 In response to these allegations, local law enforcement has started blocking access to the websites associated with the named businesses, as requested by the citys financial watchdog. However, many of these sites were already offline by the time action was taken.\par \par \uc2 Taurusemex stands accused of falsely advertising that its investors accounts were regulated by the citys financial authority, a claim the \uc2 SFC\uc2  has denounced as untrue.\par \par \uc2 Read also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/blockchain-projects-making-renewable-energy-reality/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Features The blockchain projects making renewable energy a reality}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/cryptos-critics-can-fud-ever-be-healthy/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Features Crypto critics: Can FUD ever be useful?}}}\par \par \uc2 It comes as Hong Kong has expressed its ambitions to establish itself as a hub for cryptocurrency, unveiling a licensing scheme aimed at providing regulated crypto trading access to both retail and institutional investors.\par \par \uc2 Local businesses were mandated to obtain a license or at least be deemed-to-be-licensed by the deadline of June 1, 2024.\par \par \uc2 As of July 10, 2024, only two entities, HashKey and \uc2 OSL\uc2 , are on the SFCs {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.sfc.hk/en/Welcome-to-the-Fintech-Contact-Point/Virtual-assets/Virtual-asset-trading-platforms-operators/Lists-of-virtual-asset-trading-platforms"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 roster}}}\uc2  of licensed trading platforms. Meanwhile, twelve applications have been withdrawn or rejected.\par \par \uc2 Bitget expects Japanese crypto users to continue growing\par \par \uc2 Japan had the sixth-highest number of visitors to centralized exchanges in the world from November 2023 to April 2024, according to a new report released by Bitget Research.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.magazine.cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Streets-of-Japan-1024x682.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Singapore \u8216\'20\'18not ready\u8217\'20\'19 for Bitcoin ETFs, sneaky crypto mining rig importer: Asia Express}}}\par \par \uc2 Pedestrians on the streets of Japan. (Marcellinus Jerricho/Pixabay)\par \par \uc2 The research arm expects Japans \b \highlight22\uc2 crypto adoption\b0 \highlight\uc2  to continue heating up.\par \par \uc2 Bitgets study found a distinctive trend among Japanese users. Theres been a preference for older dog-themed memecoins like Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) and Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ). In contrast, newer memecoins like Book of Meme (BOME) and Slerfsol (SLERF) did not appear in the trending searches of Japanese internet users.\par \par \uc2 The countrys investors have also maintained strong interest in early blue-chip tokens like XRP and Cardanos \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 . These two currencies were not found in the trending search list of most other countries, according to Bitget.\par \par \uc2 In 2022, Prime Minister Fumio Kishidas administration drew up its own {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.digital.go.jp/assets/contents/node/basic_page/field_ref_resources/a31d04f1-d74a-45cf-8a4d-5f76e0f1b6eb/32054b11/20230308_meeting_web3_report_01.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Web3 project team}}}\uc2  to highlight blockchain technology as a key element in achieving its vision for a sustainable and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/japan-village-nfts-help-aging-population"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 technologically advanced society}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Bitget expects Japans daily active cryptocurrency traders to increase from 350,000 in 2024 to approximately 500,000 by the end of the year.\par \par \uc2 Subscribe The most engaging reads in blockchain. Delivered once a week.\par \par \uc2 Email address\par \par \uc2 SUBSCRIBE\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.magazine.cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/reading-copy.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Subscribe to Magazine by Cointelegraph Newsletter.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.magazine.cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Magazine-asia-Express-2504-scaled.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240712ek7c00004\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price faces major \u8216\'20\'18summer of 2021\u8217\'20\'19 style correction despite BTC whale buying\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 786 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 July 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Onchain data shows Bitcoin price at an inflection point as the bear market beckons.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvY2JiYzA1NDUtZjliZi00MWEzLTkxMmItYjFhNTEzYmQ3ZTM2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price faces major \u8216\'20\'18summer of 2021\u8217\'20\'19 style correction despite BTC whale buying}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is at a \u8220\'20\'1Cpivotal point\u8221\'20\'1D as several onchain metrics signal further downside, while whales experience the fastest Bitcoin accumulation rate in more than a year, according to a new CryptoQuant report.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been in a downtrend since turning away from its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-new-73-6-k-all-time-high-etfs-eat#:~:text=Data%20from%20Cointelegraph%20Markets%20Pro,dip%20before%20abruptly%20heading%20higher."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new all-time high in March}}}\uc2 . Over the last month, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price action has been characterized by a series of lower highs and lower lows, reaching a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-falls-below-58k-first-time-two-months"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 two-month low at $53,500}}}\uc2  on July 5.\par \par \uc2 Despite rebounding back above $57,000, continued Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/german-government-354m-btc-sell-off"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 selling by the German government}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/mt-gox-repayment-crypto-market-volatility"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Mt. Gox repayments}}}\uc2  threaten further losses for BTC.\par \par \uc2 The CryptoQuant report reveals that the profit and loss (P&L) index is hovering around its 365-day moving average (MA). The onchain data provider explains that if this index drops below its 365-day, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-is-bitcoin-a-beginners-guide-to-the-worlds-first-cryptocurrency#:~:text=Bitcoin%20is%20digital%20money%2C%20also,independently%20of%20any%20central%20authority."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  could embark on a major correction as those seen in previous drawdowns.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CA crossover to the downside has been associated with major corrections (May-July 2021) or the start of a bear market (November-December 2021). See red circles.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/b636f06e-180f-4381-9ef3-742287621e06.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price faces major \u8216\'20\'18summer of 2021\u8217\'20\'19 style correction despite BTC whale buying}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin P&L index. Source: CryptoQuant\par \par \uc2 CryptoQuant\u8217\'20\'19s Bitcoin bull-bear market cycle indicator is also approaching a critical level and could \u8220\'20\'1Cswitch to bear market if prices decline further.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The chart below shows that the indicator is currently playing out in a similar way it did in March 2020, May 2021 and November 2021. A drop below the neutral line will mean that the market has switched to a bear phase, pointing to further declines.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/66397272-fa7b-4789-87a6-1fa3c70bea75.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price faces major \u8216\'20\'18summer of 2021\u8217\'20\'19 style correction despite BTC whale buying}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bull-bear market indicator. Source: CryptoQuant\par \par \uc2 According to CryptoQuant, these two metrics show that Bitcoin is at \u8220\'20\'1Ca level where a local bottom can form or a major \u8216\'20\'18summer-of-2021\u8217\'20\'19 style correction can occur.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In addition, Tether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) market cap growth has stalled, suggesting that a rally might be hard to come by as historical recoveries can be attributed to a rise in stablecoin liquidity, CryptoQuant added. Growth in the market of USDT is often considered a key driver of bull markets.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CUSDT market capitalization is still slowing down. Bitcoin price typically rallies as more liquidity enters the crypto market via USDT minting, a condition that has still not been met.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/7860c03a-063e-4648-a747-0eeb6d6e6ac4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price faces major \u8216\'20\'18summer of 2021\u8217\'20\'19 style correction despite BTC whale buying}}}\par \par \uc2 USDT market change vs. BTC price. Source: CryptoQuant\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-7-10-btc-eth-bnb-sol-xrp-doge-ton-ada-avax-shib"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/10: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Bitcoin whales have been aggressively accumulating as the recent downswing gave large holders an opportunity to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-traders-tell-pesimissts-buy-the-dip-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 buy more on the dip}}}\uc2 , boosting their stack by 6.3% over the past month, the fastest pace since April 2023.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/a1273130-0026-4f0b-9dec-685757b55aec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price faces major \u8216\'20\'18summer of 2021\u8217\'20\'19 style correction despite BTC whale buying}}}\par \par \uc2 Total Bitcoin holdings and monthly change. Source: CryptoQuant\par \par \uc2 CryptoQuant said that this indicates \u8220\'20\'1Crising demand for Bitcoin\u8221\'20\'1D at lower levels. This is corroborated by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/FarsideUK/status/1809433132812173625"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increased}}}\uc2  inflows into US-based spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs).\par \par \uc2 Data from SoSo Value shows that despite BTC\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  to four-month lows on July 5, institutional investors poured $143.1 million into spot Bitcoin ETFs that day. This was followed by $294.9 million and $216.4 million net inflows on July 8 and July 9, respectively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/be69de4d-0646-42a7-a4a5-00a453d8f65d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price faces major \u8216\'20\'18summer of 2021\u8217\'20\'19 style correction despite BTC whale buying}}}\par \par \uc2 Total spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  net flows. Source: SoSo Value\par \par \uc2 This institutional support has counterbalanced the selling pressure while simultaneously demonstrating BTC\u8217\'20\'19s acceptance within the financial mainstream.\par \par \uc2 From a technical perspective, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s short-term resistance rests at $59,000, embraced by the 200-day simple moving average, as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/intocryptoverse/status/1810885240870645969"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 observed}}}\uc2  by Benjamin Cowen, founder of the \u8220\'20\'1CInto The Cryptoverse\u8221\'20\'1D newsletter.\par \par \uc2 Note that the price has been sealed below this level since breaching it on July 4, and bulls were required to flip it back into support to avoid further losses.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis is the 200D SMA and would also correspond to a backtest of the trend line that BTC broke down from.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/29b020bd-8cee-42a2-be16-23cbdffdd79c.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price faces major \u8216\'20\'18summer of 2021\u8217\'20\'19 style correction despite BTC whale buying}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: Benjamin Cowen\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvY2JiYzA1NDUtZjliZi00MWEzLTkxMmItYjFhNTEzYmQ3ZTM2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240710ek7a000e5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price faces major \u8216\'20\'18summer of 2021\u8217\'20\'19 style correction despite BTC whale buying\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 787 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 July 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Onchain data shows Bitcoin price at an inflection point as the bear market beckons.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvY2JiYzA1NDUtZjliZi00MWEzLTkxMmItYjFhNTEzYmQ3ZTM2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price faces major \u8216\'20\'18summer of 2021\u8217\'20\'19 style correction despite BTC whale bu