\par\par \b \uc2 Cardano and Raboo Ride High On  \highlight22\uc2 Bullish \highlight\uc2  Trend As Core Announces ETP\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 759 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 July 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano rides high on \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  trend}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Core's new ETP announcement}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Raboo's impressive presale performance and growth potential}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Conclusion}}}\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market is currently in high spirits and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Raboo are riding this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend to the moon. The performance of both cryptocurrencies has been encouraging and has successfully garnered the attention of investors and analysts. Adding to the excitement, Core has announced a new Exchange-Traded product (ETP), further energizing the investment community. This development promises to broaden crypto asset access for seasoned and novice investors. Continue reading as we discuss how these trends shape the cryptocurrency landscape's future.\par \par \uc2 Cardano rides high on \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has recently experienced a significant upsurge due to critical technological updates and strategic developments. Currently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 trading at $0.4173,}}}\uc2  with a 4.59% increase in the last 24 hours, Cardano has introduced enhancements to its smart contracting language, Plutus, which allows for easier portability of smart contracts from Ethereum. This development, alongside the scheduled Chang hard fork to initiate governance capabilities, has sparked considerable interest in Cardano among investors\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B.\par \par \uc2 Cardano's significant upsurge can also be attributed to increased confidence from large-scale investors, or "whales," who are actively accumulating \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 . This whale activity and the general comeback in the cryptocurrency market have seen Cardano's Total Value Locked TVL and \b \highlight22\uc2 price rise\b0 \highlight\uc2 . This signaling indicates a viable belief in Cardano's technology and its strategic position within the crypto market, thus improving its investment appeal to new and institutional investors.\par \par \uc2 Core's new ETP announcement\par \par \uc2 Core's recent announcement of a new Exchange Traded Product (ETP) marks a significant evolution in cryptocurrency investments. This new ETP, which includes a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://bsc.news/post/core-foundation-and-valour-inc-partner-to-launch-world-s-first-yield-bearing-btc-etp#:~:text=Valour%2520Inc.%252C%2520a%2520subsidiary%2520of,offering%2520a%25205.65%2525%2520annualized%2520yield."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Yield Bearing BTC ETP}}}\uc2 , leverages the unique features of the Core Chain to offer yields directly from Bitcoin's block rewards. By integrating blockchain innovations with traditional financial mechanisms, Core's ETPs provide retail and institutional investors with novel opportunities to engage with digital assets through established investment channels. This approach not only enhances Bitcoin's utility beyond a mere investment asset, but also broadens its appeal by providing a yield-generating potential within the secure structure of an ETP\u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0B.\par \par \uc2 Core's introduction of such innovative ETPs is set to transform the liquidity and stability dynamics of cryptocurrency investments. These products could significantly enhance Core's market stability by attracting a broader range of investors, including those from traditional financial sectors who might be looking for familiar investment structures with the added benefits of blockchain technology. Moreover, the timing of this launch is strategic, aligning with a period of increasing institutional interest in cryptocurrencies, which is suitable for Core.\par \par \uc2 Raboo's impressive presale performance and growth potential\par \par \uc2 Significant milestones and enthusiastic investor support have marked Raboo's journey through its presale. Currently, in Stage 4 and priced at $0.0048, Raboo has seen a robust 60% increase in value from its initial stage. This growth reflects a strong market appetite and confidence in its potential, underscored by the over $1.6 million raised so far. The project boasts over 10,000 registered users and over 2,900 dedicated token holders, indicating a solid and growing community rallying behind Raboo's vision.\par \par \uc2 Strategically, Raboo is making decisive moves to capitalize on the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  market conditions. Including cryptocurrency in significant exchanges is a pivotal step aligning with its aggressive growth strategy. This expansion is about widening market access and cementing Raboo's position in the competitive crypto landscape. Analysts are optimistic, projecting a potential 100x return from its current valuation, a testament to its perceived value and prospects in the market.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 Remarkable changes are taking place in the cryptocurrency market, as evidenced by Cardano's technological advancements and strategic enhancements, which have created a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. Meanwhile, Raboo capitalizes on this momentum with its successful presale and strategic listings, promising investors potential exponential returns. Core's innovative ETP launch further aligns traditional financial products with blockchain's modern capabilities, enhancing accessibility for institutional and retail investors. Investors should watch Raboo's progress as it positions itself as the next big name in the memecoin world.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://rabootoken.com?&utm_source=marketing&utm_campaign=CRNF&utm_id=2505-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 You can participate in the Raboo presale here}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/RabootokenPortal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Telegram: https://t.me/RabootokenPortal}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Raboo_Official"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Twitter: https://twitter.com/Raboo_Official}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the viewsof Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240704ek7300003\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/3: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,594 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 July 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin's support at $60,000 appears soft, and altcoins crumble as traders appear hesitant to buy the current dip.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) again revisited the $60,000 support on July 3, indicating that the bears have maintained their selling pressure. It may not be easy to break the $60,000 to $56,552 support zone as the bulls are expected to defend it, keeping Bitcoin inside the large range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 The risk to Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s continued sideways action could come from the selling pressure created by the \uc2 Mt. Gox\uc2  creditors, who may {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rush to book profits after receiving their repayments}}}\uc2  in early July.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/e362f5a3-8002-45b0-ac19-e6650c35c5b4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, lower levels are likely to see buying from the United States-based spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds, which have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-drops-below-60k-mt-gox-repayment"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 amassed $14.8 billion in net inflows}}}\uc2  since their launch in January.\par \par \uc2 It is difficult to predict the amount of Bitcoin the \uc2 Mt. Gox\uc2  creditors will dump in the open market because some of it may go through over-the-counter trading desks. The uncertainty may cause \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the next few days. What are the important support and resistance levels to watch out for in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from the 20-day exponential moving average ($63,212) on July 1, indicating that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling near overhead resistance levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/faae2350-38a5-4cec-8ecb-317f24da78b1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position by pulling the price below the immediate support at $60,000. If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could tumble to the pivotal support at $56,552. Buyers are expected to guard this level with all their might because if they fail to do that, the pair may start a downtrend. The next support is at $50,000.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $56,552, the bulls will try to push the pair to the 20-day EMA. Buyers will have to overcome this barrier to signal that the pair remains inside the $56,552 to $73,777 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls failed to push and maintain Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($3,451) on July 1, indicating that the bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/acae13c7-d319-4102-b30c-8e6aa446b321.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory suggest that the bears have the edge. Sellers will try to sink the price to $3,240, which is again likely to act as a strong support. If this level breaks down, the next stop could be $3,000.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above the 50-day SMA will signal that the short-term correction may be over. The ETH/USDT pair could then start a rally to $3,730 and subsequently to $3,887.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($585) on July 1, indicating that the bears are vigorously defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/5d6bd10a-cf3c-45f3-b21e-2fb71084b5ba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sink and maintain the price below the immediate support at $551. If they manage to do that, the selling could pick up. The BNB/USDT pair may plummet to $536 and eventually to the solid support at $495.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price rebounds off $551, it will signal solid demand at lower levels. The bulls will have to kick the price above the 50-day SMA ($604) to suggest that the correction may be over. The pair may then rise to $635.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the resistance line on July 2, but the price turned down sharply from the 50-day SMA ($156) on July 3.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/5679cbf2-9a2e-493b-a2a5-c23f1b694714.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($145) has flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just below the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the SOL/USDT pair may swing between $116 and the 50-day SMA for a while.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up and breaks above the 50-day SMA, it will signal that the bulls have seized control. The pair could rally to $175 and subsequently to $189. Sellers are expected to fiercely protect the zone between $189 and $205.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are striving to push XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.48), but the bears are not willing to relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/ec7b1935-5a5c-4548-9f50-d2e4b2561410.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower from the current level, the bears will make another attempt to sink the XRP/USDT pair below $0.46. If they succeed, the pair could gradually drift toward $0.41. The bulls are expected to aggressively defend the zone between $0.41 and $0.46.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, buyers will have to clear the 20-day EMA hurdle to clear the path for a rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.50). This is a crucial resistance to watch out for because a break above it will suggest the start of a strong recovery toward $0.57.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls failed to push Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.13) in the past few days, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/97761f0d-e1c7-4c90-8236-cc004b13c4ed.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The tight consolidation near the $0.12 support increases the risk of a breakdown. If the price closes below $0.12, the DOGE/USDT pair could decline to $0.10 and later to the solid support at $0.08.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the downside, they will have to quickly shove the price above $0.13. The pair could then start a recovery to the 50-day SMA ($0.14), indicating that the range-bound action remains intact.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) rose above the $7.87 resistance on July 2, indicating that the buyers have retained their control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/5e1a7bf8-d30c-48cf-9603-73ae76b55f0f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers drive the price above $8.29, the TON/USDT pair will resume its uptrend. The pair could then attempt a rally to the psychologically crucial level of $10, which is likely to attract strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 The first support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($7.55). If this level gets taken out, the pair may slide to the 50-day SMA ($7.08). This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break below it will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-ethereum-eth-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Ethereum (ETH) price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) range-bound action between $0.40 and $0.35 resolved to the upside on July 1, indicating that the buyers overpowered the sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/0244757a-41e9-4868-81cd-84b29cd029ae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The up move is facing resistance at the 50-day SMA ($0.43), but if the bulls do not allow the price to slip below $0.40, it will signal a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. That will improve the prospects of a rally above the 50-day SMA. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then reach $0.50.\par \par \uc2 Instead, a break below $0.40 may trap the aggressive bulls, pulling the pair to the crucial support at $0.35.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) closed above the overhead resistance of $29 on June 30, but the bulls could not maintain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/0ebf7284-337c-425e-be5a-4c00dc7482e1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears again pulled the price back below $29 on July 1, suggesting that the breakout may have been a bull trap. The AVAX/USDT pair could drop to the solid support at $23.51, where buyers are expected to step in. That could keep the pair stuck inside a range for some time.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to make a comeback, they will have to push and maintain the price above $30.12. If they do that, the pair may start a relief rally to the 50-day SMA ($32.55) and later to $37.20.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have held the $0.000016 support in Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) for the past few days, but the failure to start a strong rebound could intensify selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/cad98a18-6ab7-4edb-ae79-0a5a45ba1ce8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.000018) is sloping down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the oversold territory, indicating that the bears hold the edge. If the $0.000016 support breaks down, the SHIB/USDT pair could drop to $0.000014 and thereafter to $0.000010.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bulls. If they want to make a comeback, they will have to quickly drive the price above the 20-day EMA and the breakdown level of $0.000020. If they do that, the pair may start a recovery toward $0.000025.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvZWE1NTM3MGQtZmY0Mi00ZWJlLWIxNDctMzI5OTE0NGRiZGJiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240703ek73000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
