\par\par \b \uc2 Polkadot Price Analysis: $DOT Up 8% Over the Past 7 Days\b0\par\par\uc2 Jana Serfontein \par \uc2 391 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 June 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Altcoins Up as Bitcoin Dips}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 What Is The Driving Force Behind $DOT\u8217\'20\'19s Growth?}}}\par \par \uc2 After recent market difficulties, widespread losses and Bitcoin ($BTC) dropping below crucial levels, certain altcoins, including Polkadot ($DOT), look poised for some welcomed growth.\par \par \uc2 Following a significant dip in the market, with Bitcoin dropping briefly below $60,000, indicating broader market stagnation, certain altcoins appear ready for substantial growth. Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s $DOT gained 8% in the past week and is currently trading at $6.15.\par \par \uc2 Altcoins Up as Bitcoin Dips\par \par \uc2 The crypto market took a big knock over the past few weeks, with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/is-bitcoin-btc-going-to-51000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  ($BTC) briefly dipping to a recent low of $58,500. While signals looked overwhelmingly \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the market appears to have recovered slightly, with $BTC gaining back some ground, currently trading at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $61,644}}}\uc2 . In a few days, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://alternative.me/crypto/fear-and-greed-index/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto Fear and Greed Index}}}\uc2  shifted from the mid-70s, indicating extreme greed, to as low as 30, indicating fear among participants. Market sentiment improved somewhat, and the index shows a neutral score of 47.\par \par \uc2 The improvement in market sentiment is reflected in prices, with altcoins such as Cardano and Polkadot looking poised for significant growth.\par \par \uc2 With a market cap exceeding $8.8 billion, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/polkadot-dot-tumbles-amid-wider-market-downturns"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polkadot}}}\uc2  trades at $6.15, surging nearly 8% in the past week despite this week\u8217\'20\'19s market turndown. $DOT is up 1.42% over the 24-hour charts\par \par \uc2 What Is \uc2 The Driving Force\uc2  Behind $DOT\u8217\'20\'19s Growth?\par \par \uc2 Polkadot is famous for its interoperability and its significant contributions to decentralized applications. Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s community is currently considering a proposal for a new bridge to enhance its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/potential-bridge-between-cardano-ada-and-polkadot-dot-sparks-community-interest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 interoperability}}}\uc2  with Cardano, which sent waves of excitement through both communities and is reflected in the prices of $ DOT and $ \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 While the project's feasibility is still under discussion, the aim is to address interoperability issues that remain prevalent in the crypto industry. Talks of the new bridge come just days after the activation of SnowBridge, a Polkadot-Ethereum bridge, on June 20. SnowBridge uses first-party signatures from Ethereum and Polkadot validators, resulting in a transparent, permissionless and auditable process.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240701ek6u00005\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
