\par\par \b \uc2 Was Cardano Hacked? Brett\u8217\'20\'19s Price Forecast and New Player Is Already up 60%\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 744 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 June 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano resilient against sophisticated DDOs attack, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  holds steady}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Brett sees strong rally amid market turbulence, eyes support amidst correction}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Raboo: AI-powered meme coin poised for explosive growth in 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Conclusion}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano has successfully defended itself against a sophisticated attack from numerous smart contracts. Meanwhile, BRETT has surged despite market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 A new presale token in the meme coin ecosystem, Raboo, has seen a 60% increase since its Stage 1 and has now raised almost $2 million. Analysts have tipped Raboo as one of the best cryptos to buy in 2024, citing its substantial growth potential in the crypto market.\par \par \uc2 Cardano resilient against sophisticated DDOs attack, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  holds steady\par \par \uc2 Cardano recently withstood a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodnes.bg/en/2024/06/26/cardano-preturpya-hackerska-ataka-ima-posledici/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 significant DDoS attack that aimed to disrupt its blockchain}}}\uc2  by flooding it with transactions from 194 smart contracts, each costing 0.9 \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Despite the attempt, Cardano's decentralized design prevented any major disruptions, showcasing its robustness in handling cyber threats.\par \par \uc2 The attack targeted Cardano's network in an effort to overwhelm it and potentially steal staked cryptocurrencies. However, swift action from the development team, led by Philip Disarro, neutralized the threat by removing the attacker's staking identifier. The ability of the development team to promptly thwart the attack prevented significant financial losses to Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s investors and also underscores Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s resilience, affirming it as one of the best cryptos to buy in 2024.\par \par \uc2 Brett sees strong rally amid market turbulence, eyes support amidst correction\par \par \uc2 BRETT has recently seen a notable increase, surpassing the average gain of meme coins amidst a broader market resurgence. Despite challenges faced by major cryptocurrencies like Bitcoin and Ethereum, BRETT has shown resilience. Over the month, it has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/based-brett/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 surged impressively by 118%.}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, BRETT is experiencing a correction phase after its recent surge, approaching a key support level around $0.15408. The relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) indicates a shift from overbought conditions to a more neutral state, suggesting reduced selling pressure. With its short-term momentum strong and a positive trend in moving averages, BRETT appears poised for its next market move.\par \par \uc2 BRETT\u8217\'20\'19s performance is reflective of broader trends and market sentiment, influenced by celebrity endorsements and market waves favoring such assets. Forecasts from Coincu, a crypto price analytics platform, suggests BRETT\u8217\'20\'19s price could range between $0.1580 and $0.1640 in July, while August predictions indicate potential fluctuations between $0.1610 and $0.1761, averaging approximately $0.1686.\par \par \uc2 Raboo: AI-powered meme coin poised for explosive growth in 2024\par \par \uc2 Raboo ($RABT) presale token has emerged as a leading meme coin, integrating social-fi and artificial intelligence to cultivate a dynamic community of meme enthusiasts. The absence of taxes on both buy and sell transactions underscores why Raboo has been tipped as one of the best altcoins to invest in this year given that retail and institutional investors will be able to maximize all their returns.\par \par \uc2 Analysts foresee Raboo's presale price potentially growing by 233%, with expectations of a monumental 100x increase upon its launch day. The meme coin aspires to achieve a top 20 ranking by market capitalization, supported by innovative features like the Post-to-Earn platform, allowing meme coin enthusiasts to monetize their social media content.\par \par \uc2 This presents a compelling opportunity for early adopters looking to participate in a community-driven cryptocurrency set to expand significantly. Raboo combines elements of SocialFi, MemeFi, and blockchain technology, bridging the gap between memes and the digital world. With over 8,000 registered meme coin enthusiasts, Raboo is on track to disrupt the meme coin ecosystem.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s development team was able to prevent financial losses by thwarting a sophisticated hacking attempt. Meanwhile, BRETT has surged despite prevailing market challenges, showing significant monthly and annual gains.\par \par \uc2 In the meme coin ecosystem, Raboo, a new presale token, has garnered attention for its promising growth trajectory. Currently in Stage 4 of its presale, Raboo has seen a remarkable 60% increase since Stage 1, underscoring its recommendation as one of the best altcoins to invest in this year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://rabootoken.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 You can participate in the Raboo presale here:}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/RabootokenPortal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/RabootokenPortal}}}\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Raboo_Official"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://twitter.com/Raboo_Official}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the viewsof Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240629ek6s00007\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/28: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,610 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 June 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Crypto markets remain volatile across the board, but data suggests traders are buying Bitcoin price dips.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) remains stuck in a large range, but the bulls are trying to maintain the price above $60,000. This is a positive sign as it shows the bulls are not waiting for the price to dip to $56,552 before buying. According to Farside Investors {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://farside.co.uk/?p=997"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data}}}\uc2 , the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) seem to have turned the corner as they attracted net inflows in the past three days.\par \par \uc2 However, the range-bound action of the past few months and the failure to break out to a new high above $73,777 has resulted in a drop in \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiments across major social media platforms over the past few weeks, per Santiment data. The drop in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sentiment-drop-signals-bottom"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 trader euphoria could be signaling a market bottom}}}\uc2 , added the crypto analytics firm.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/756ea067-58fa-4e3b-8faf-d122fbd40eb3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Along with Bitcoin, select analysts are turning positive on Ether. Bitwise chief investment officer \uc2 Matt Hougan\uc2  said in a post on X that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-spot-etfs-could-attract-15b-by-end-of-2025-bitwise-cio"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spot Ether ETFs could attract $15 billion}}}\uc2  in net inflows within 18 months of their launch.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin start a recovery to $64,602, or could bears yank the price to $56,552? How are the altcoins expected to behave? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers are finding it difficult to push Bitcoin above $62,500 in the near term, but a positive sign is that they have not allowed the price to dip and sustain below $60,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/886ebe89-523d-44c3-b511-ace3df7366d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers kick the price above $62,500, the BTC/USDT pair will attempt a rally to $64,602. This is a crucial resistance for the bears to defend because a break above it will clear the path for a rise to $70,000.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break and close below $60,000 will signal that the bears are in control. The pair may collapse to the pivotal support at $56,552, where buyers are expected to step in because a break below it may sink the pair to $50,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) relief rally is facing selling at the moving averages, indicating that the bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/4c29e076-6f08-459c-86a4-13f0775101cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower from the current level, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on relief rallies. The bears will try to pull the price below $3,200 and challenge the critical support at $3,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rises above the moving averages, it will suggest the start of a rally to $3,730. If the ETH/USDT pair turns down from $3,730 but finds support at the 20-day EMA, it will improve the prospects of a break above the overhead resistance.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to defend the $560 support, but BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) recovery is facing selling at the 20-day EMA ($594).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/2ae32acf-08ac-42c5-9e51-d659eec4a700.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below $560, it will signal the start of the next leg of the down move to $536. The bulls will try to arrest the decline at this level, but if the bears prevail, the BNB/USDT pair may plunge to $495.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the decline, they will have to propel the price above the moving averages. That will clear the path for a possible move to $635. A break and close above this level will put the bulls in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned up sharply above the 20-day EMA ($143) on June 27, but the higher levels are attracting solid selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/6b306156-302d-45ca-b25b-c051528eb3ef.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a balance between buyers and sellers. The advantage will tilt in favor of the bulls if they push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($156). That could open the doors for a possible rally to $175, and after that, to $189.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have the edge if they sink and maintain the price below the 20-day EMA. The SOL/USDT pair may then descend to the solid support at $116. Buyers are expected to vigorously defend the level.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears have been trying to sink XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) below the $0.46 support for the past few days, but the bulls have held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/b434a746-7a8d-4cb0-b62c-2461c18174a7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the failure to push the price above the moving averages increases the risk of a breakdown. If the $0.46 support gives way, the XRP/USDT pair is likely to slide down to the critical support at $0.41.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair will attempt a rally to the overhead resistance of the range at $0.57.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck between $0.12 and $0.13 for the past few days, indicating that the bulls have successfully defended the support but failed to start a rebound.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/bb6e5371-e913-4134-81f8-02ccd88ae76f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.13) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory indicate that the bears have the upper hand. Sellers will try to yank and sustain the price below $0.12. If they do that, the DOGE/USDT pair may drop to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA. That will signal the start of a possible recovery to the 50-day SMA ($14). The pair may then remain inside the large range between $0.12 and $0.18 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed Toncoin (TON) above the $7.67 resistance on June 27 but are struggling to sustain the breakout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/fdf11ef7-d4a8-4d24-befd-83dae505608a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns lower and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($7.39), it will suggest that the bears are selling on rallies. The TON/USDT pair may then drop to the 50-day SMA ($7). A break and close below $6.60 will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. The pair may then tumble to $6 and later to $5.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the 20-day EMA and rises above $7.87, it will suggest that the bulls remain in command. The pair could then climb to $8.29. If this level is scaled, the rally could reach $10.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between $0.40 and $0.35 for the past few days, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/c8e0c4d5-75e1-4ef0-8077-6dc00193ddb0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may extend its stay inside the range for some more time. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above $0.40. The pair may then move up to the 50-day SMA ($0.43), where the bears are again expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break and close below $0.35 will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears. The pair may then slump to $0.28.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned up from $23.51 on June 24 and reached the breakdown level of $29 on June 28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/db2abaa7-ac74-4c22-b0c6-f4d80a909fce.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($28.63) is flattening out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is rising toward the midpoint, indicating that the selling pressure is reducing. If buyers drive and maintain the price above $29, it will signal that the markets have rejected the breakdown. The AVAX/USDT pair may rally to the 50-day SMA ($33.01).\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down sharply from $29, it will suggest that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance. The pair may then retest the solid support at $23.51.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a tight range between $0.000016 and $0.000018 for the past few days, suggesting equilibrium between buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/1f95b37f-24bc-4306-81fc-a78bd0bab890.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.000019) and the RSI near the oversold territory suggest that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If the $0.000016 level cracks, the SHIB/USDT pair may sink to $0.000014 and subsequently to $0.000010.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the range resolves to the upside, the pair may reach the breakdown level of $0.000020. If bulls drive the price above this resistance, it will suggest the start of a robust recovery to the 50-day SMA ($0.000022).\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDYvZWZiYTU4YWQtMzc0ZC00YzEwLTkzN2ItM2VjMjJiMWMyNmU3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240628ek6s000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
