\par\par \b \uc2 Could Bitcoin hit $73,000 in July? AMBCrypto's June report explores possibilities\b0\par\par\uc2 Adrian Barkley \par \uc2 530 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 June 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin's struggles and market response}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum's decline and investor movements}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 7,259 memecoin investors surveyed}}}\par \par \uc2 June proved to be a turbulent month for cryptocurrencies, with Bitcoin, Ethereum, and Cardano each facing unique challenges and trends. Despite some positive signals, the overall sentiment was dampened by geopolitical tensions, regulatory uncertainties, and shifting market dynamics.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin's struggles and market response\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin experienced a notable downturn after the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 's June FOMC meeting, where the Fed Chair's skepticism about the U.S. economy's strength led to a market retreat. Bitcoin prices fell to a weekly low of $66,249, with significant long liquidations amounting to $32.92 million. Despite this, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ambcrypto.com/category/bitcoin-news/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  ETFs hold 4.33% of the total supply, with a projected annual absorption rate of 2.43%, suggesting a looming supply shock as production trails behind demand. If July doesn\u8217\'20\'19t see short-term headwinds then Bitcoin could steadily climb up to test $73,000 level. Well, this can only be possible if the BTC spot ETF netflows are healthy.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum's decline and investor movements\par \par \uc2 Ethereum also faced setbacks, with the total value locked (TVL) on its platform tumbling to $60.74 billion by mid-June. The number of whale accounts holding over $100,000 in ETH dropped significantly, reflecting a broader sell-off amid uncertainties over Ethereum ETFs. Despite these challenges, Ethereum's futures open interest indicated heightened market speculation, which could lead to increased short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, Cardano presented a mixed bag of outcomes. While its treasury balance grew by 3.5% to 1.48 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , on-chain transaction volumes plummeted, reflecting a sharp drop in profitability and market engagement. However, Cardano's decentralized exchanges like Minswap showed resilience, maintaining a robust position within the ecosystem. Meanwhile, a lot of memecoin investors were in profit during mid-June. AMBCrypto conducted a survey to find out traders\u8217\'20\'19 winning strategies.\par \par \uc2 7,259 memecoin investors surveyed\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ambcrypto.com/memecoin-trading-strategies-june-2024-report/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AMBCrypto's detailed survey}}}\uc2  of 7,259 memecoin investors reveals varied strategies and motivations within the unpredictable memecoin market. As of mid-June, memecoins such as SHIB, DOGE, and PEPE constituted 2.13% of the cryptocurrency market, attracting a growing number of investors globally.\par \par \uc2 Interestingly, 50% of those surveyed reported profits throughout most of June. The survey disclosed that more than 30% of investors are drawn to memecoins for their potential for high returns and the prospects for long-term growth of the projects. In contrast, a smaller group of about 6% engages with memecoins purely for their entertainment value.\par \par \uc2 The survey results also highlight a division in investment rationale; 43% of investors emphasize the importance of real-world use cases, while 47% predominantly value hype and community engagement, pointing to the substantial influence of social dynamics on memecoin popularity. Furthermore, a significant 8.6% disregard real-world applications entirely, concentrating only on the financial outcomes of their investments.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240701ek6r00003\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/26: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SHIB, \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,674 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 June 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls are defending the $56,552 level, but BTC will need to trade above $64,500 to signal a comeback.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating inside a large range between $56,552 and $73,777 for several months, indicating buying near its support and selling close to the resistance. Generally, when the price spends a long time in consolidation, it needs a solid trigger to push the price above or below the range.\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to sink the price below the support on the news of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/germany-btc-sell-arkham-wallet"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 German Government selling their Bitcoin holdings}}}\uc2  and the likely selling pressure to be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-exchange-balances-140k-btc-mt-gox-payout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 created by the Mt. Gox payout}}}\uc2 . However, that did not work out as lower levels attracted buyers who defended the support and are trying to start a recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/7bd79c10-e3a9-4aee-8f77-8ae6eacbe134.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Investors also seem to have used the recent weakness to start accumulating again. Data from SoSo Value shows {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etfs-reverse-outflows-31m-inflows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $31 million in net inflows}}}\uc2  into the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds after almost {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etfs-shed-1-3-billion-two-weeks-amid-market-slump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $1.3 billion in outflows}}}\uc2  over the last two weeks.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin bulls prevent a breakdown below $56,552? Will that lead to a recovery in altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls have a battle on their hands as they try to prevent the bears from pulling the price below the pivotal support at $56,552.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/b80ec9e9-f804-4dec-8f38-e87ec3ec44b8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price below $60,000 on June 24, but the long tail on the candlestick shows buying at lower levels. Expect bulls to remain active in the $60,000 to $56,552 zone for the next few days because if they fail to protect the support, the BTC/USDT pair may plunge to $50,000.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($64,883) is the key resistance level to watch out for on the upside. A break and close above this level will suggest that the bears are losing their grip. The pair may then attempt a rally to $70,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually slipping to the next significant support at $3,000. The bulls purchased the dip to $3,240 on June 24 but are struggling to push the price to the 20-day EMA ($3,506).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/07fb97b7-0354-49f4-9c7f-497f624ba498.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the bears will make one more attempt to sink the price below $3,200. If they manage to do that, the ETH/USDT pair could plummet to the psychological level of $3,000. Buyers are expected to fiercely defend the $3,000 to $2,850 zone.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA to signal that the selling pressure is reducing. That will clear the path for a possible up move to $3,730.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke below the $560 support on June 24, but the bears could not sustain the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/019095e8-32c4-4ca3-a708-9e004f1f4842.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Any recovery attempt is likely to face stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($597). If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, the bears will again try to sink the BNB/USDT pair to $536. This is an important support, but if it cracks, the pair could drop to $495.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rises and breaks above the moving averages, it will suggest that the bears are losing their grip. The pair may then rally to the overhead resistance at $635.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) recovered smartly from $122 on June 24 and re-entered the descending channel pattern on June 25.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/e7b3e437-3e0c-48d3-9794-512715ff6506.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to halt the relief rally at the 20-day EMA ($143). If the price turns down sharply from this level, the SOL/USDT pair could tumble to the crucial support at $116. The bulls are expected to defend this level with all their might because a break below it may open the doors for a fall to $100.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the selling pressure is reducing. The pair may then climb to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s resistance line. A break above the channel will tilt the advantage in favor of the bulls.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $0.46 support on June 24, but the bulls are finding it difficult to extend the recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/93fedb6e-be12-4421-bb14-028e9e08e95c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is in the negative territory, indicating that the bears are in control. Sellers will again try to yank the price below $0.46. If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair could slump toward the next major support at $0.41.\par \par \uc2 Buyers are expected to vigorously defend the $0.41 to $0.46 zone because a break below it could sink the pair to $0.35. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. The pair may then attempt a rally to $0.52.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the $0.12 support on June 24, but the bulls started a recovery and pushed the price back above the breakdown level on June 25.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/bd53767b-f021-4d34-88f7-938b20581d1e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to propel the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.13) to signal the start of a robust recovery. The DOGE/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day simple moving average ($0.15), indicating that the range-bound action between $0.12 and $0.18 may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down sharply and breaks below $0.12, it will suggest that bears are in command. That could start a downward move toward $0.10, where the bulls will again try to arrest the decline.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) has been trading between the 50-day SMA ($6.93) and the overhead resistance of $7.67 for the past few days. This suggests that the bulls are not ceding ground to the bears and have kept up the buying pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/7aba4845-b6c5-42eb-94d3-77e6e2adc0f6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are gradually sloping higher, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just above the midpoint, suggesting that the bulls have a slight edge. A break and close above $7.67 could retest the crucial resistance at $8.29. If this level is scaled, the TON/USDT pair could attempt a rally to $10.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down sharply from the current level, it will signal that the bears are fiercely defending the $7.67 level. The pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern on a break below $6.60. That could start a fall to $6 and then to $5.50.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/telegram-notcoin-100-price-rally-210m-not-token-burn"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Telegram-linked Notcoin eyes 100% price rally after 210M NOT token burn}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the breakdown level of $0.40 since June 18, but the bulls have not allowed the price to slip below $0.35. This suggests a range-bound action between $0.35 and $0.40.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/898d6599-e7bc-4334-8330-65fd35dc8e61.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.40) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory indicate that the bears have a slight edge. If the price turns down from $0.40, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may continue to oscillate inside the tight range.\par \par \uc2 If the price skids below $0.35, it will signal the resumption of the downtrend. The pair may then collapse to $0.28. On the contrary, a rally above $0.40 will suggest that the markets have rejected the breakdown. The pair may rise to the 50-day SMA ($0.43) and later to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the 78.6% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.000017 on June 24, indicating that the bears are firmly in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/23fdb2fa-2b43-4fde-87e3-0776c119f8c6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to start a recovery on June 25, but the up move lacks strength. The bears will again try to sink the price below $0.000017. If they can pull it off, the SHIB/USDT pair could drop to $0.000014 and eventually to $0.000010.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to make a comeback, they will have to quickly shove the price back above the breakdown level of $0.000020. That could clear the path for a rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.000023).\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) resumed its downtrend after breaking below the strong support at $29 on June 17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/e3cf9260-164c-4780-b31d-6c61b66008ca.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The down sloping moving averages and the RSI near the oversold zone suggest that the bears are in control. The bulls are trying to start a relief rally, which is likely to face strong selling at the 20-day EMA ($28.76). If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again attempt to sink the AVAX/USDT pair to $20.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the bulls kick the price above $29. The pair could then rise to $33, indicating that the markets have rejected the breakdown below $29.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDYvN2U5MzUwNDEtMTUwMS00ZmY5LThjYmYtNmZjYjI0N2M0YzllLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240626ek6q000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
