\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 6/25 - BTC, ETH, SOL, TON, DOGE, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SHIB, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 1,757 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 June 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC Whales Cautious}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Toncoin (TON) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Shiba Inu (SHIB) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polygon (MATIC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 The Bitcoin (BTC) price fell as low as $58,474 on Monday as it shuttled between its support and resistance levels. BTC has been gradually falling towards its support level after failing to break past resistance.\par \par \uc2 Whether sellers can push BTC below its support level and completely take control of the market remains to be seen.\par \par \uc2 BTC Whales Cautious\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin whales have become a cautious lot since the asset slipped below its support level on Friday (June 21). Data from Santiment shows that whale transactions dropped to 9,921 transactions of more than $100,000. This is a sharp drop from the 17,091 transactions just two days prior. However, long-term traders could look at the dip as a buying opportunity, with Metaplanet, a Tokyo-based investment and consulting firm, outlining plans to issue 1 billion yen worth of bonds to raise money and purchase Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/crypto-price-analysis-624-btc-eth-sol-avax-doge-ton-icp-hbar-rndr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  continued its downward trajectory over the weekend, ending the previous week with a drop of 1.70% on Sunday to settle at $63,170. The current week began with BTC firmly in the red, as sellers controlled the session on Monday, pushing the price as low as $58,474. However, buyers entered the market at this level, pushing BTC back above $60,000. Eventually, the price settled at $60,330.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/bNv2RKhH/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC has strong support at $60,000, and as a result, buyers entered the market at this level, pushing the price up by 1.04% during the current session. Currently, BTC is trading just under the $61,000 mark. So where does BTC go from here? As mentioned earlier, there is a strong level of support at $60,000, which is expected to attract buyers should BTC reach this level. Any uptick in price will face resistance at the $65,500 level, where the 20 and 50-day SMAs have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover. Should sellers regain control, the support at $60,000 could be tested, and if breached, BTC could drop toward the $57,500 mark. Looking at the indicators, we have already mentioned the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover. A look at the Choppiness Index indicates that the market is range-bound, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is also in the oversold territory, indicating that the bears are currently in the driving seat.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 The Ethereum (ETH) price has been on a downward trajectory ever since it was rejected at the $4,000 resistance level. ETH\u8217\'20\'19s latest test of this resistance level was on May 27, when it reached a high of $3,972. However, the elusive $4,000 mark remained out of reach. Over the past month, ETH has dropped over 10%, and selling pressure has intensified over the past few days. ETH dropped below the 50-day SMA on Sunday after a drop of 2.16% pushed the price to $3,420. Crucially, this drop took ETH below the $3,500 mark as well.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/BgJq8SF1/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current week began with intense selling pressure, pushing ETH as low as $3,241. However, buyers were able to push the price up, with ETH eventually dropping by just over 2% to $3,352. The current session sees ETH marginally up as buyers look to recover, but with strong \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment dominating the market, a reversal could see bears target the crucial $3,000 support zone. As we can see from the price chart, the 200-day SMA is also present at this level, further increasing the level\u8217\'20\'19s importance.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 RSI\uc2  has also dropped below 50, indicating a strengthening \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment. Should sellers breach the crucial support zone at $3,000, ETH could drop towards $2,800 and even $2500.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL), which faced considerable selling pressure all through the previous week, has made a positive start to the current week. On Monday, SOL faced considerable selling pressure as bears looked to push the price below $130, a crucial support level. This support has been tested twice in April, with SOL rebounding impressively. So, could we see a similar recovery, or will SOL be dragged lower due to the Bitcoin factor?\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/t8iE4DbN/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 On Sunday, SOL dropped as low as $128.19, but with buyers entering the market at this level, the price rebounded on Monday, but not after facing considerable selling pressure. SOL dropped to $121.97 before buyers pushed the price significantly, eventually helping SOL move past the crucial $130 level and settle at $132.33. The current session sees sellers remain in control, with SOL up 1.61% and trading at $134.46. Should SOL continue its upward trajectory, it could move past the 20-day SMA and test $150. However, if sellers can regain control and breach $130, we could see SOL drop to as low as $100.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) ended the previous week positively, registering an increase of 2.51% on Sunday to settle at $7.51. However, TON faced considerable resistance at this level, indicating that bears are vigorously defending the resistance level. As a result, TON faced significant selling pressure on Monday, dropping as low as $7.09. TON has a strong level of support at $6.60, and with the 50-day SMA acting as another prop, buyers were able to push the price back up to $7.46.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/nvAtSksG/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 TON has registered a 4% increase over the past 24 hours as buyers look to test resistance levels once again. Should TON move past this level, we could see a jump to $8. However, if sellers regain control, the $6.60 support level could be tested again. If this level is breached, it could start a decline to $6 or even lower. The \uc2 RSI\uc2  is currently at a neutral level, giving TON a fair bit of room for positive price movements.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) has shown incredible resistance, climbing above $0.12 despite facing considerable selling pressure on Monday. DOGE had been fairly \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the weekend, ending Sunday with a 1.61% drop to settle at $0.12. Monday saw bears tighten their grip as DOGE went as low as $0.11. However, the current session has seen a recovery of sorts, with DOGE up by 2.53% and back above $0.12.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/e4s7RqMw/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 $0.12 is a crucial support level for DOGE. If sellers can push the price below this level, DOGE could drop to $0.11 and go as low as $0.09. Such a scenario would indicate complete dominance by sellers. However, should \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment return and push DOGE above $0.12, we could see the price climb towards $0.15 on the back of sustained \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pressure. For such a scenario, DOGE must first go past the 200-day and 20-day SMAs.\par \par \uc2 BNB Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin (BNB) has been on a downward trajectory since it hit its all-time high of $720 on June 6. Since then, selling pressure has pushed the price below $600. On Sunday, BNB closed below the ascending trendline support, indicating a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  move. The \uc2 RSI\uc2  sitting below 50 further supports BNB\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  turn, as can be seen in the price chart below.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/Z9TKewpy/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, BNB has support at the $560 level. However, should sellers breach this level of support, BNB could see a 10% decline, which could push the price below $500 and retest its March low of $498. The current session sees buyers and sellers struggling to take control of the market. BNB had pushed up to $578 but is now trading at $571, indicating strong pushback.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has been on a downward trajectory since the beginning of the month, with the 20-day SMA acting as resistance and pushing the price lower. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has consistently been rejected at the 20-day SMA, dropping as low as $0.35 on June 18 before recovering and settling at $0.38. Since then, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been oscillating between $0.35 and $0.40. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has strong support at $0.35, a level where buyers are entering the market. However, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could plummet towards $0.30 if this support level is breached.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/xomgCwgd/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Should \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment return, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could climb and test the resistance at $0.40. If it is able to get past this level, the next target for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be $0.45.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu (SHIB) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 SHIB\u8217\'20\'19s downward trajectory has mirrored the broader correction in the crypto markets. SHIB dipped below the 200-day SMA on June 18 after registering a drop of 6.42%. Since then, DOGE has witnessed considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , with selling pressure increasing closer to $0.000019, where the 200-day SMA was acting as resistance. DOGE dropped to $0.000017 on Monday, bringing it close to a critical support level at $0.000016. The current session sees DOGE up by 1.41% as buyers enter the market.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/pluF52SX/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Analysts have predicted that DOGE could drop to $0.000016 and rebound, potentially rising to $0.000020. DOGE has also witnessed some consolidation over the past few days, as indicated by data from IntoTheBlock, which has shown a decline in whale transactions.\par \par \uc2 Polygon (MATIC) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 MATIC has experienced a considerable decline since the beginning of the month, with its price dropping from $0.72 on June 6 to the current $0.57. While it has registered an increase of nearly 4% over the past 24 hours, it has dropped over 20% over the past month, indicating that the overall sentiment around the asset remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . If Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend continues, we could see MATIC drop to $0.50, taking the price to a low not seen since October 2023.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/O9yYJ1iT/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, should buyers build on the current session and counter the selling pressure, MATIC could test the resistance at $0.60 and look to move past the 20-day SMA. The asset could make moderate gains in the next few months if market sentiment improves.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240626ek6p00003\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/24: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,653 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 June 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Traders are unsure whether a buy-the-dip opportunity has arrived, even as Bitcoin price retests the $60,000 support.\par \par \uc2 An asset stuck in a trading range oscillates between the support and the resistance. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually sinking toward its support after failing to break out of the resistance. This suggests that the bears will attempt to yank Bitcoin below the range and seize control.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin whales seem to have turned cautious after BTC slipped below its support near $64,500 on June 21. According to Santiment data, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-critical-support-level-whale-transactions-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin whales completed 9,923 transactions}}}\uc2  exceeding $100,000 during the two days on June 22 and 23. That is a sharp drop from the 17,091 transactions in the two days prior.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/a77a52b6-2d24-4f39-ae24-a0673828f995.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s weakness may have kept the short-term traders on the hook, but the long-term investors are viewing the dip as a buying opportunity. Following in the footsteps of \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 , Tokyo-based investment and consulting firm Metaplanet revealed plans to issue {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/metaplanet-billion-yen-bond-sale-buy-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 one billion yen ($6.26 million) worth of bonds}}}\uc2  to raise money to buy Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin plunge below the psychological support at $60,000, putting pressure on the altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index is in an uptrend. The bulls pushed the price above 5,500 on June 20, but higher levels witnessed profit booking.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/da056dc7-5e0f-4ae8-a9d6-29451c0612aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 During strong up moves, the corrections usually do not last more than three days. The 20-day exponential moving average (5,387) is the important level to watch out for on the downside. If the price turns up from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bulls remain in control. A break above 5,505 could propel the index to 5,600 and eventually toward 6,000.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to make a comeback, they will have to drag the price below the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the index could collapse to the 50-day simple moving average (5,237).\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) bounced off the 50-day SMA (105.19) on June 20 and rose above the 105.74 overhead resistance on June 21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/1ffb2529-1e44-4e20-b65d-3b5dee5cd303.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls are finding it difficult to sustain the breakout. The bears have pulled the price back below 105.74 on June 24. If buyers do not give up much ground from the current level, it will improve the prospects of a rise above 106. That could start a rally to 106.50 and later to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s resistance line.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated if the price continues lower and dives below the support line. The index may then descend to the strong support at 104, where buyers are likely to step in.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from the breakdown level of $64,602 on June 23, indicating that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/8e353bb1-4038-412f-8fa8-8d682daba225.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the oversold territory, signaling that the bears are firmly in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair could plunge to solid support at $60,000. This level is expected to attract strong buying by the bulls, but any relief rally is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA ($65,687). If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the possibility of a drop to $56,552 will increase.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the moving averages. If that happens, the pair could attempt a rally to $70,000 and subsequently to $72,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) uncertainty resolved to the downside with a break below the 50-day SMA ($3,475) on June 23.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/7c7fa9dc-3b11-4b79-873c-40695b59320d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($3,528) and the RSI near 35 suggest that the bears are in command. The sellers will attempt to sink the price to the psychological support at $3,000 and then to $2,850.\par \par \uc2 Buyers are expected to aggressively purchase in the $3,000 to $2,850 zone. On the upside, a break and close above the 20-day EMA will suggest that the bears are losing their grip. The ETH/USDT pair could then start an up move toward $3,730.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has continued to slide toward the immediate support at $560, indicating that the bears are maintaining their selling pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/3961a37a-7d3f-41fd-b44a-a26289fc2ada.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $560 with strength, it will signal that the bulls are trying to defend the level. The BNB/USDT pair may recover to the 20-day EMA ($602), which is likely to act as a strong hurdle. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will increase the likelihood of a break below $560. The pair may then slump toward $536.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to kick the price above the moving averages to suggest that the selling pressure is weakening. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up on a break and close above $635.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls could not push Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) back into the descending channel pattern in the past few days, indicating that the bears flipped the support line into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/cf16c0b7-9033-49d6-82f9-942092cd1755.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears increased their selling pressure on June 23 and are trying to sink the SOL/USDT pair to the critical support at $116. This level is likely to attract solid buying by the bulls, but the recovery is expected to face stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($144).\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will make another attempt to yank the price below $116. If they succeed, the pair could slump to $100. On the upside, buyers will have to drive the price above the 50-day SMA ($156) to clear the path for a rally to $189.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been oscillating between the critical support at $0.46 and the 50-day SMA ($0.51) for several days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/80974743-9b05-4411-a3d5-4274483bf753.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.49) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory suggest that the bears have the upper hand. If the $0.46 support cracks, the XRP/USDT pair could plunge to the next significant support at $0.41. Buyers are expected to aggressively defend the zone between $0.41 and $0.46.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above the 50-day SMA will be the first sign of strength. The pair may then attempt a rally to $0.57.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-low-can-the-bitcoin-price-go"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 How low can the Bitcoin price go?}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) turned down from the overhead resistance of $7.67 on June 24, indicating that the bears are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/6fb5a649-94a0-4101-94ad-591756f256f9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The $6.60 support is an important level to watch out for on the downside because a break and close below it will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. That could start a decline to $6 and subsequently to $5.50. The pattern target of the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup is $4.91.\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off the 50-day SMA, it will signal that the bulls continue to buy on dips. That could keep the TON/USDT pair stuck between the 50-day SMA and $7.67 for some time. A break and close above $7.67 will open the gates for a retest of $8.29.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to start a strong rebound off the $0.12 support in Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has encouraged the bears to increase the selling pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/dc6b5dfb-82d5-41ef-837a-4c206d0d6e2b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below $0.12, it will indicate that the bears have overpowered the bulls. That could start a slide to psychological support at $0.10. The bulls will try to arrest the decline at this level, but if the bears prevail, the next stop could be $0.08.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA ($0.13). That could start a rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.15), keeping the DOGE/USDT pair stuck inside the $0.12 to $0.18 range.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is forming a range between $0.35 and $0.40, indicating buying at lower levels and selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/d9e31c4a-77f3-424a-8d7d-5ab8c8c0a780.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.41) and the RSI near the oversold territory signal that the bears are in command. If the $0.35 level breaks down, the selling could pick up, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may plummet to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the downside, they will have to push the price above the moving averages. If they do that, it will indicate that the markets have rejected the breakdown. The pair may then climb to $0.49.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDYvNmNmZDRjYjktZGUyMi00YmVhLTliMzQtZjk4YWJmZmY1NmUwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240624ek6o000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/21: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SHIB, \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,541 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 June 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s break below the nearby support of $64,602 is expected to put additional pressure on altcoins in the short term.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is gradually moving down toward the support of the $56,552 to $73,777 range it has been stuck in for the past several months. Glassnode lead analyst James Check cautioned traders in a June 19 X post not to fall prey to a \u8220\'20\'1Ccombination of boredom, mini-pumps and mini-dumps\u8221\'20\'1D and get {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-weighted-sentiment-indicator-fud-price-sideways-crypto-analysts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shaken out of their positions}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 While the near-term Bitcoin price action remains uncertain, analysts are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  about the long-term prospects. Analysts at research and brokerage firm Bernstein expect strong flows into spot United States Bitcoin exchange-traded funds to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bernstein-analysts-expect-200k-bitcoin-price-by-2025-due-to-spot-btc-etf-flows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 boost Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price to $200,000}}}\uc2  by the end of the next year, an upward revision from their previous target of $150,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/45db4f9f-1723-4989-ad1a-57f5fc0d76c7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Some analysts expect a correction in the near term but that has not prevented \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-800-million-convertible-note-offering-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 adding more Bitcoin to its stockpile}}}\uc2 . The firm announced on June 20 that it had purchased 11,931 Bitcoin at an average price of $65,883 per Bitcoin, taking its total to 226,331 Bitcoin. The recently completed $800 million convertible note offering funded the latest purchase.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin stage a strong recovery in the next few days and pull the cryptocurrency markets higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin attempted a recovery on June 20, but the long wick on the candlestick shows strong selling by the bears near the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/d464491d-f4a3-434e-82dc-6d2d367e9f2e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price below the solid support at $64,602 on June 21, indicating the start of a deeper pullback. If bears sustain the price below $64,602, the selling could pick up, and the BTC/USDT pair may descend to the next significant support at $60,000.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up and closes above $64,602, it will signal aggressive buying at lower levels. The pair may climb to the 20-day exponential moving average ($66,736), which is likely to act as a strong resistance. Buyers will have to overcome this barrier to clear the path for a rally to $70,000 and subsequently to $72,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to push Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($3,575) on June 20, but the bears held their ground. This suggests that bears remain sellers on relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/fb161961-6642-4a57-a529-7c50a7d1a7ba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position further by pulling and maintaining the price below the 50-day simple moving average ($3,458). If they manage to do that, the selling could accelerate, and the pair may dive to $3,000.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the down move, they will have to quickly push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA. The ETH/USDT pair could then attempt a rally to $3,730 and later to $3,977.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the moving averages for the past few days, indicating that the bears are maintaining their pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/797de67c-10b4-44a5-b5b7-fe9db6552f76.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is $560. If the price rebounds off this level, it will signal that the BNB/USDT pair may remain between $560 and $635 for a while. A break above $635 will suggest that the bulls are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price breaks below $560, the correction may deepen, and the pair could plunge to $536 and eventually to $495. The bulls are expected to fiercely defend this level.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears thwarted efforts by the bulls to push Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) back inside the descending channel pattern in the past two days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/ec548de6-6dbc-4d8a-a888-e3459b0597d1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the bears have flipped the support line into resistance. A break below $128 could sink the SOL/USDT pair to the solid support at $116. Buyers are expected to defend this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA ($148). The bulls will have to push the price above the resistance line to open the doors for a rally to $176 and then $188.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the 50-day SMA ($0.51) and the vital support at $0.46 for several days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/06849f31-dcfe-4c7f-887a-483b593aa56e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A minor positive in favor of the bulls is that they are trying to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.50). If they manage to do that, the possibility of a break above the 50-day SMA increases. The XRP/USDT pair could then rally to $0.57.\par \par \uc2 The critical level to watch on the downside is $0.46. If this level gives way, the pair may tumble to the pivotal level of $0.41. The bulls are expected to buy in the zone between $0.46 and $0.41.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have held Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the crucial support of $0.12 for the past three days but they failed to start a strong rebound.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/aa8876b8-4770-4af9-8d10-ddf9006444d4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.14) and the RSI near the oversold zone suggest that the bears are in command. If the $0.12 support breaks down, the DOGE/USDT pair could start declining to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA. That will suggest the consolidation to continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) is attempting a rebound off the 50-day SMA ($6.76), signaling that the bulls are aggressively defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/46377271-6586-484f-9456-702bb41e76d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers shove the price above the 20-day EMA ($7.23), it will suggest the start of a relief rally to $7.67. This level may again attract selling by the bears, but if the bulls overcome this resistance, the TON/USDT pair may rise to $8.29.\par \par \uc2 The critical level to watch on the downside is the 50-day SMA. A break and close below this support will suggest the start of a deeper correction. The pair may slump to $6, and after that, to $5.50.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a tight range near the breakdown level of $0.40 for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/7d4db8c5-5ca9-4306-af50-91f0ee915649.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks above $0.40, it is again likely to face selling at the moving averages. However, if the bulls prevail, it will suggest the start of a robust recovery. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to $0.50, where the bears may pose a strong challenge.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $0.40 or the moving averages and breaks below $0.35, it will indicate that the bears hold the edge. The pair may then plunge to $0.28.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are protecting the $0.000017 level in Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) but have failed to start a strong rebound. This suggests a lack of aggressive buying at current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/3be62f78-e69c-446e-ba88-180b2040da3c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.000021) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the oversold zone suggest that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If the $0.000017 level cracks, the SHIB/USDT pair may plummet to $0.000014.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the downside, they will have to swiftly drive the price above the 20-day EMA. If they do that, it will suggest that the markets have rejected the breakdown. The up move may pick up pace above the 50-day SMA ($0.000023).\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting a recovery in Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ), which is facing selling at the breakdown level of $29.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/0b2aab45-5ff4-45da-bc41-e6a8f00791cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $29, it will signal that the bears have flipped the level into resistance. That will increase the possibility of a drop below $25. If that happens, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could slide to $20.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($30.95) to weaken the selling pressure. The pair may then climb to the 50-day SMA ($34.39), suggesting that the breakdown below $29 could have been a bear trap.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDYvMTI1Y2VmNDYtOGM0Mi00NTA4LThiOWQtZjhmMzM2NTI2ODdiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240621ek6l000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/19: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SHIB, \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,572 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 June 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 If Bitcoin breaks below $64,500, selling could intensify, and a drop to $60,000 is possible.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a large range between $56,552 and $73,777 for several days. It is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout with certainty, because trading inside the range can be random and volatile. Hence, it is better to wait for the price to break out before establishing large bets.\par \par \uc2 Traders are becoming {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-banana-zone-crypto-analysts-key-metrics"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cautious in the short term}}}\uc2  due to the uncertainty. According to Farside Investors data, Bitcoin exchange-traded funds have witnessed outflows for the past four days. Additionally, \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 \u8220\'20\'1CWeekly Asset Fund Flows\u8221\'20\'1D report showed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/digital-asset-funds-biggest-outflow-since-march"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 outflows of $600 million}}}\uc2  from \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products, the largest since March 22.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/d8bd704c-2fb5-468e-9fb8-942077bb468f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-are-top-bitcoin-traders-bullish-despite-dip-to-64300"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph\u8217\'20\'19s analysis of Deribit derivatives data}}}\uc2  shows that Bitcoin whales and market makers are not panicking and \u8220\'20\'1Cremained optimistic during the dip.\u8221\'20\'1D Several analysts have also maintained a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/traders-bitcoin-recovery-despite-drop-below-65k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  view during Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s drop}}}\uc2  below $65,000.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin rebound off its strong support, pulling the altcoins higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin reached the bottom of its $64,602 to $72,000 range on June 18. The failure of the bulls to start a strong rebound off the level suggests that the bears are maintaining their selling pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/87bef1f9-1008-405a-898a-a3a78fb5597d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($67,249) and the relative strength index (RSI) below 40 indicate that the bears have the edge. If the $64,602 level cracks, the BTC/USDT pair could collapse to $60,000.\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls are unlikely to give up the $64,602 level without putting up a fight. If the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will signal the start of a robust recovery. The pair may then climb to $70,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) remains stuck between the moving averages, suggesting a sharp breakout could be around the corner.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/b960959f-9638-4388-8468-70db68a3a994.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks above the 20-day EMA ($3,586), the ETH/USDT pair could rise to $3,730. This is an important level for the bears to defend because a break above it will open the doors for a potential rise to $3,977.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below the 50-day simple moving average ($3,436), it will signal that the bears are in charge. The pair could tumble to psychological support at $3,000 and eventually to $2,850.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) fell below the immediate support of $590 on June 18, but the bears could not challenge the vital support at $560. This suggests a lack of aggressive selling at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/2b7f7c93-609a-4354-bedd-9bd9a0bc0b73.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to start a recovery and push the price above the moving averages. If they manage to do that, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to $617. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a rise above it will suggest that the corrective phase may be over. The bulls will then try to push the price toward $722.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the bears will attempt to sink the pair below $560. If they do that, the next stop is likely to be $536.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) fell below the descending channel pattern on June 18, but the bulls purchased the dip, as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/70e78d49-5d49-491e-b802-b7b56fe15af8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($152) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the negative territory suggest that the bears are in command. If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to tug the SOL/USDT pair to the critical support at $116. This level is expected to attract solid buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated in the near term if the price turns up and rises above the resistance line. The pair may then climb to $176.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 50-day SMA ($0.51) on June 17 but found support at $0.46 on June 18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/19969376-84cb-4c4d-b494-c67b5b08dd48.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.50) is flattening out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just below the midpoint, suggesting a minor advantage for the bears. The bulls will have to propel the price above the 50-day SMA to tilt the advantage in their favor.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break and close below the $0.46 support will suggest that the bears have overpowered the bulls. The XRP/USDT pair could then skid to $0.41. The bulls are expected to fiercely defend the zone between $0.46 and $0.41.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) below the strong support at $0.12 but could not sustain the lower levels. This shows that the bulls are defending the $0.12 level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/bc99c8cf-4186-472d-85e5-94918d0d74b0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to start a relief rally, but it is likely to face intense selling pressure at the 20-day EMA ($0.14). If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again strive to sink the DOGE/USDT pair below $0.12. If they succeed, the pair could start the next leg of the downtrend to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, a rally above the 20-day EMA will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the $0.12 to $0.18 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls could not sustain Toncoin\u8217\'20\'19s (TON) rebound off $7.67 on June 16, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/b3166067-0764-4317-b2e3-e9758ae8d4cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears maintained their selling pressure and pulled the price below the 20-day EMA ($7.23) on June 18 and the uptrend line on June 19. The ascending triangle pattern will be negated if the price maintains below the uptrend line. That could start a decline to $6.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up sharply from the 50-day SMA ($6.67) and breaks above the uptrend line, it will signal that the breakdown may have been a bear trap. That could propel the TON/USDT pair to $7.67.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-ethereum-eth-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Ether (ETH) price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) signaled the resumption of the downtrend after the price plummeted and closed below the strong support at $0.40 on June 18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/40f33a72-0508-40a7-ad1f-fa85893dd423.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A minor positive is that the bulls purchased the dip to the $0.35 support. Buyers will attempt to start a recovery, which is expected to face strong selling at the moving averages. If the price turns down from the moving averages, the bears will try to sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair below $0.35. If they can pull it off, the pair may slump to $0.28.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if buyers thrust the price above the moving averages, it will indicate that the corrective phase may be over.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) broke below the $0.000020 support on June 17, signaling that the bears are in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/1641c705-9b38-4e61-b112-2b4ef06b6fcb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price slipped to the 78.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.000017 on June 18, where the buyers stepped in. The SHIB/USDT pair is attempting a rebound, which is likely to face aggressive selling at $0.000020. If the price turns down sharply from $0.000020, the bears will try to drag the pair to $0.000014.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns up and rises above the moving averages. Such a move will suggest solid buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) plunged and closed below the $29 support on June 17, signaling that the consolidation resolved in favor of the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/43ffc835-7ccf-4463-b0f1-d9c7d35db521.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The selling continued on June 18, and the price slipped to $25, where the buyers are trying to arrest the decline. The price could rise to the breakdown level of $29, which is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $29, it will suggest that the bears have flipped the level into resistance. That increases the likelihood of a drop to $20.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to make a comeback, they will have to drive the AVAX/USDT pair above the 20-day EMA ($31.71). If they do that, the bears may get trapped, resulting in a short squeeze.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDYvNzI5OTgxMWItNjQ0Ni00NzBjLTg3ZDAtMzJmZGM2NzA3YzRmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240619ek6j000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
