\uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Weekly fund data pulled on June 15, 2024, has revealed significant outflows of capital, primarily from Bitcoin investment vehicles.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchange-traded products and funds saw $600 million in outflows last week, marking the most significant outflows since March 22, a June 17 report revealed.\par \par \uc2 According to the latest \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1CWeekly Asset Fund Flows\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://etp.coinshares.com/de/knowledge/market-activity/fund-flows-17-06-24"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2 , the outflows were primarily from Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) investment vehicles, which experienced $621 million in weekly outflows. Conversely, short Bitcoin funds saw $1.8 million in weekly inflows.\par \par \uc2 The report pointed to a more hawkish-than-expected outlook from the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 , which means maintaining high interest rates, as the likely culprit behind the capital flight from fixed-supply assets like Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Altcoins chug along\par \par \uc2 Altcoins generally performed well last week, with $13.2 million in inflows into Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) investment vehicles, $2 million into LIDO investment products, and $1.1 million into XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) investment products.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ), \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) investment products also saw small weekly inflows.\par \par \uc2 However, the inflows into altcoins did little to stem the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-drops-etfs-lose-inflow-steak-us-inflation-fed-meeting"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tide of outflows}}}\uc2  and sell-offs that have resulted in total digital assets under management declining from $100 billion to $94 billion during the week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/da244669-7ec1-4772-9128-d1c6233a0ceb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 A breakdown of inflows/outflows by \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Source: \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  Weekly Fund Flows Report\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/majority-bitcoin-etf-flows-are-hedge-funds-says-raoul-pal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Vast majority\u8217\'20\'19 of ETF flows could be driven by arbitrage \u8212\'20\'14 Raoul Pal}}}\par \par \uc2 Institutional adoption lagging\par \par \uc2 Despite the initial interest surrounding the launch of Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) in the United States, many experts believe institutional adoption of digital assets is still in its infancy.\par \par \uc2 Marc Degen, co-founder of blockchain firm Trust Square, recently shared his belief that corporate adoption of Bitcoin was still in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/corporate-adoption-amateur-league-bitcoin-etfs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1Camateur league\u8221\'20\'1D phase}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The co-founder illustrated his point by using \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  inflows. Degen explained that Bitcoin ETFs have amassed between $60 billion and $70 billion to date, with total assets under management globally hitting $100 billion earlier in June.\par \par \uc2 Degen put this figure into greater perspective by comparing total \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  fund inflows to capital flows into \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2 . In 2023, the banking giant saw $489 billion in net new client inflows.\par \par \uc2 This one financial institution experienced more capital inflows within a year than the entire Bitcoin investment fund ecosystem has through its numerous exchange-traded funds, exchange-traded products and asset trust offerings.\par \par \uc2 Franklin Templeton\uc2  CEO \uc2 Jenny Johnson\uc2  recently voiced the same sentiment and argued that institutional adoption is still in the early phase, with robust institutional interest and capital deployment to arrive in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/franklin-templeton-ceo-bitcoin-investment"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second investment wave}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/big-questions-did-the-nsa-create-bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Big Questions: Did the NSA create Bitcoin?}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDYvZTk3MTQ5ZTEtMDkzNC00YTJkLWFlOTQtMmY0MTViZjUyZGM4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240617ek6h000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/17: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,586 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 June 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has strong support at $64,500, but a drop to $60,000 is possible if the level cracks.\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) has been trading near its all-time high, but Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has gradually given up ground in the past few days. This suggests that supply exceeds demand in Bitcoin. According to Farside Investors {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://farside.co.uk/?p=997"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data}}}\uc2 , spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds have seen outflows for four of the five days since June 10.\par \par \uc2 However, analysts point out that long-term investors have not panicked and continue buying. Market intelligence firm Santiment shows that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/66k-btc-price-critical-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 number of wallets with 10 BTC or more}}}\uc2  has hit 16.6 million, the highest level since June 2022.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/39978da0-fb9b-419f-a47b-8709915f2d71.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Although Bitcoin looks weak in the near term, it remains stuck inside a range and is likely to witness buying at the support. The longer the time spent in a range, the greater the force needed for the price to break out from it.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and select altcoins hold above their respective support levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index is in an uptrend. The up move is facing selling near 5,450, but a positive sign is that the bulls have not ceded much ground to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/0f18b31c-f0c9-4fb4-947e-1018466e7a1b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average (5,340) is sloping up, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is in the overbought zone, signaling that the bulls are in command. If buyers kick the price above 5,450, the index could reach 5,600. This level may act as a resistance, but if the bulls overcome it, the index could rally toward 6,000.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest that the bulls may be booking profits. That could sink the price to 5,265 and later to the 50-day simple moving average (5,214).\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to sustain the U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) below the support line of the ascending channel on June 12, but the bulls did not relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/b052efea-2c0c-45ca-9129-183d652ed2d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price bounced sharply from the support line on June 13 and reached the overhead resistance of 105.74 on June 14. The 20-day EMA (104.92) has started to rise and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive zone, signaling that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers shove the price above $105.74, the index could reach 106.50.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated in the near term if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the support line. That may tug the price down to the strong support at 104.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin failed to start a bounce off the 50-day SMA ($66,189), suggesting that the bears have maintained their selling pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/587be649-fc58-4c2d-aabf-f31549c9f5fe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bounces-1-month-lows-btc-price-levels-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 critical support to watch}}}\uc2  now is $64,602. If this level cracks, the BTC/USDT pair is likely to descend to $60,000. This level may act as strong support, but if the bears prevail, the pair might tumble to $56,552.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the Bitcoin bulls. If they want to make a comeback, they will have to quickly push the price above the 20-day EMA ($67,612). If they do that, the pair is likely to move up to $70,000 and subsequently to $72,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 50-day SMA ($3,421) on June 14 but is facing stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($3,604).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/a3c4bc6e-3d9d-4e8a-bbfc-7e36b31a7e8d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If ETH price plummets below the 50-day SMA, the advantage will tilt in favor of the bears. The ETH/USDT pair could drop to the psychological level at $3,000 and thereafter to the vital support at $2,850. This level is expected to attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off the 50-day SMA, it will signal that the bulls are buying the dips. That will increase the likelihood of a rally above the 20-day EMA. The pair may then jump to $3,730.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the 50-day SMA ($605).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/56e69baa-9a8f-4bab-86e7-6d170cb94d3d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($621) has started to turn down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just below the midpoint, signaling a minor advantage to the bears. If the price skids below $590, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to $560.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $635, it will suggest that the correction may be over. The bulls will then try to push the pair to the critical overhead level of $722.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line on June 14 but the bulls could not push the price to the moving averages. This suggests that the bears are selling on relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/b63088fa-e8f1-4e78-9381-303e099822a7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sink the price below the channel and start a decline to the crucial support at $116. This level has been a strong support twice before, and the bulls will again try to defend it.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns up and breaks above the channel\u8217\'20\'19s resistance line. The SOL/USDT pair could then attempt a rally to $175, where the bears may mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $0.46 support on June 14, indicating aggressive buying by the bulls. The bears tried to stall the recovery at the 20-day EMA ($0.50), but the bulls overcame the resistance on June 17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/c5652c66-b07c-4425-8ecb-ad5a9da761a3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  has jumped into positive territory, indicating that the bears are losing their grip. If buyers sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.51), the XRP/USDT pair could rally to $0.57.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the 50-day SMA and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are selling on minor rallies. The pair could then retest the essential support at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-surge-50-this-year-against-bitcoin-analysis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum poised to 50% surge this year against Bitcoin \u8212\'20\'14 Fractal analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) bounced off the $7.67 level on June 16, but the bulls could not push the price to $8.29.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/175e1fc3-3620-4833-aba3-43c967efd4ed.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pull and maintain the price below $7.67. If they do that, it could trap the aggressive bulls and sink the TON/USDT pair to the uptrend line. This is an important level to watch out for because a break below it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern. The pair may then slump to $6.\par \par \uc2 However, the rising moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory suggest that the bulls have the upper hand. A break and close above $8.29 will signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend. The pair may then climb to $10.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) continues to slide toward the crucial support at $0.12, where the bulls are likely to step in.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/781bcc79-ae2b-4306-ade8-fc407d406c98.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from $0.12, it is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA ($0.14). The bears will then again attempt to sink the price below $0.12. If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could start the next leg of the down move to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up and breaks above the moving averages, it will signal that the bulls are aggressively defending the $0.12 level. That could keep the price stuck inside the $0.12 to $0.18 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned up from $0.40 on June 14, but the bulls failed to push the price to the moving averages, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/165e3414-24ab-4db2-9647-828dab5fb8ca.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are again trying to sink the price below the essential support at $0.40. If they can pull it off, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may resume the downtrend. The next support on the downside is at $0.35.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to prevent the downside, they will have to fiercely defend the $0.40 support and push the price above the moving averages. If they do that, the pair could attempt a rally to $0.49.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDYvZjEwZWIwZWItYTliOC00ZTVjLWFhZGYtODhhNWM2YjdlNTNjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240617ek6h000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/14: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SHIB, \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,600 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 June 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins are witnessing intense selling pressure, suggesting that a near-term fall is possible.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has dropped to the support of its narrow range, suggesting that the bears are keeping up the selling pressure.\par \par \uc2 Veteran trader Peter Brandt said in a post on X that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-new-btc-price-48k-target"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin risks a fall to $60,000}}}\uc2  and eventually to $48,000. However, the Bitcoin whales do not seem worried about the short-term uncertainty and have continued their purchase. The number of whale entities holding at least 1,000 Bitcoin is nearing its all-time high.\par \par \uc2 The smaller and even the larger whales are positive about the future prospects. \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  said in a press release that it intends to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-700m-stock-sale-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 offer $700 million in convertible senior notes}}}\uc2  due in 2032, the proceeds of which will be used to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-raise-500-million-stock-buy-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 acquire more Bitcoin}}}\uc2  and for \u8220\'20\'1Cgeneral corporate purposes.\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  holds 214,400 BTC today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/ba3b4e07-78e2-4795-9be5-14da0056088a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The buying is not restricted to Bitcoin alone, as Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) witnessed one of its biggest days in long-term holder accumulation. CryptoQuant head of research Julio Moreno said in a post on X that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-long-term-holders-accumulate-eth-near-record-levels"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 accumulation addresses bought 298,000 Ether}}}\uc2  on June 12 over 24 hours, a tad shy of the 317,000 Ether record purchase on Sep. 11, 2023.\par \par \uc2 Will whale buying help start a recovery in Bitcoin toward $70,000? Could altcoins also follow to the upside? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s June 12 candlestick shows that the bears are trying to stall the relief rally at $70,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/8773ed1b-829d-4cfa-878a-1cc7b6acf0ff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($68,234) has started to turn down, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) has slipped into negative territory, indicating that the bears have an edge. If the price skids below the 50-day simple moving average ($66,047), the BTC/USDT par could start a deeper correction to $60,000.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bulls. To prevent the decline, they will have to kick and maintain the price above the 20-day EMA. The pair may then climb to $70,000 and subsequently to $72,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s recovery stalled at the 20-day EMA ($3,618) on June 12, indicating that the sentiment is turning negative, and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/e47ef6d8-3c24-4064-8cad-87084c1c66ab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls must protect the 50-day SMA ($3,400) because if they fail in their endeavor, the ETH/USDT pair could start a deeper fall toward $2,850. The bulls are expected to buy near $2,850 and keep the price inside the range.\par \par \uc2 Buyers must drive and maintain the price above the 20-day EMA if they want to make a comeback. If they do that, the buying could pick up, and the pair may start a relief rally to $3,887 and later to $3,977.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a tight range between $591 and $635 for the past few days, indicating a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/ffd44a33-f82a-49f1-b213-1849c254f743.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($627) has started to turn down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the negative zone, signaling a minor advantage to the bears. If the price breaks below $591, the BNB/USDT pair may slump to $536.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated soon if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $635. The bulls will then attempt to push the price to the overhead resistance of $722.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been falling inside the descending channel pattern for several days. The price rebounded off the support line on June 12, but the bears halted the relief rally at the 20-day EMA ($159).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/9c69ac4c-edb8-49df-a2f9-2e5ca1137abc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are again trying to sink the price below the support line. If they manage to do that, the selling could pick up, and the SOL/USDT pair may move down toward the critical support at $116. The bulls are likely to defend this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rises from the current level and breaks above the channel, it will suggest that the short-term correction may be over. The pair could move up to $176 and then to $189.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been oscillating inside the large range between $0.46 and $0.57 for the past few days. This shows buying near the support and selling close to the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/c41a20aa-78ad-4449-a951-50b7c45ad7c1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory suggest that the bears are in control. If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA ($0.50), it will increase the likelihood of a drop below $0.46. If that happens, the XRP/USDT pair could descend to the pivotal support at $0.41.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to prevent the downside, they must quickly pull the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.51). The pair may then gradually start its journey toward the overhead resistance at $0.57.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is trying to find support at $0.13, but the bulls have failed to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.15).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/8ce9fe3d-05f6-41c7-853b-ef39044d3f78.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will increase the likelihood of a drop to $0.12. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if it cracks, the DOGE/USDT pair may plummet to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above the moving averages will clear the path for a rally to $0.18. The bears are likely to mount a strong defense at this level. If the price turns down from $0.18, the range-bound action may continue for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) broke and closed above the stiff overhead resistance of $7.67 on June 13, completing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/a87228f7-282c-41e3-b8a5-214439a78e65.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above $7.87, the TON/USDT pair is likely to start the next leg of the uptrend. The pattern target of the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup is $10.62, but the bears are expected to pose a strong challenge at $10.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the breakout level of $7.67. Such a move will signal that the markets have rejected the breakout. Selling may pick up if the bears yank the price below the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) was rejected at the 20-day EMA ($0.44) on June 12, indicating that the bears are selling on every relief rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/dfeb35c8-34d9-4d26-938a-9ef9726b57e3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative zone suggest that the bears are in command. The $0.40 to $0.41 zone is likely to act as a firm support, but if the bears prevail, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could plunge to $0.35.\par \par \uc2 Bulls must quickly propel the price above the moving averages if they want to prevent the downside. If they do that, the pair could attempt a rally to the resistance line. This level may be a minor obstacle, but the next stop could be $0.57 if it's overcome.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually slipping toward the vital support at $0.000020, which is likely to witness strong buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/c1fff492-20b8-40e2-9483-cf9c35bcd550.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from $0.000020 and breaks above the moving averages, it will indicate that the range remains intact. The bulls will then attempt to push the SHIB/USDT pair to the overhead resistance at $0.000030.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that the bears are maintaining their pressure. A break and close below $0.000020 will signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend to the 78.6% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.000017.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($34) on June 12, indicating that the bears are selling the rallies to the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/e8344632-6abb-4aff-9daa-1996a3d43d64.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The AVAX/USDT pair is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears at $29. If the price rebounds off the support with strength and rises above the moving averages, it will signal that the consolidation may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks and closes below $29, it will indicate that the range has resolved in favor of the bears. That could start a downward move to $25 and subsequently to $20.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDYvMDhmNDVlMDEtODA0MC00MjI0LWJiOWQtMDI2N2NiZDJhYmYwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240614ek6e000bb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
