\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Prediction: Where Will Cardano's  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2  And Ripple's XRP Be If They Get Spot ETFs?\b0\par\par\uc2 Adrian Barkley \par \uc2 808 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 June 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETFSwap (ETFS) To Reach $20 With A 5000x \b  \highlight22Bullish\b0 \highlight22  Rally Propelled By Spot ETFs Hype}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano's \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  To Reach $38, Ripple's XRP To Reach $10 With Spot ETF Approvals As Basis For Price Prediction}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ls-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Conclusion On ETFSwap Vs Cardano's \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  And Ripple's XRP \b  \highlight22Bullish\b0 \highlight22  Crypto Price Predictions}}}\par \par \uc2 The recent \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  introduction of crypto spot ETFs into the crypto markets is notably observed to be leveraged by smart investors for high investment profitability. Top market experts make bold crypto price predictions of Cardano's \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Ripple's XRP, and ETFSwap (ETFS) in the event they get Spot ETF approvals and listing.\par \par \uc2 ETFSwap (ETFS) To Reach $20 With A 5000x \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Rally Propelled By Spot ETFs Hype\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://etfswap.io/?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=pr&utm_campaign=0613"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETFSwap (ETFS)}}}\uc2  is a highly decentralized platform that offers next-generation DeFi utilities and solutions for creating profitable traders and investors. Its DeFi platform utilities highly leveraged by smart investors and traders are garnering the attention of famous market experts who make \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crypto price predictions of the ETFS token to reach a whopping $20 amid the craze of Spot ETFs and grand token launch on leading crypto exchanges.\par \par \uc2 ETFSwap (ETFS) \uc2 DeFi\uc2  trading platform offers smart investors and traders a rare opportunity to access highly sought-after tokenized Spot ETFs and cryptocurrencies traded by institutional players in the global markets. The tokenized spot ETFs listed for trading on the DeFi platform include leveraged, commodity, market, fixed income, Bitcoin and Ethereum Spot ETFs.\par \par \uc2 Smart traders and investors leverage these spot ETF investments, which cover top traditional sectors, including healthcare, technology, energy and agriculture. Also, traders on the DeFi platform have a profitable edge trading these Spot ETFs as ETFSwap (ETFS) provides a 50x leverage to scale profits and returns on investments up to 45,000%.\par \par \uc2 ETFSwap (ETFS) is multifaceted, with its utility token serving different purposes and utilities, including swapping into desired tokenized spot ETFs and cryptocurrencies, payment of low trading fees on the platform and a governance token for holders.\par \par \uc2 Smart investors and users on the DeFi trading platform can earn a passive income and build wealth when they stake assets, provide liquidity and engage in yield farming. ETFSwap (ETFS) generously rewards all asset stakers, providing liquidity on its DeFi platform with a whopping 87% APR in staking yields.\par \par \uc2 ETFSwap (ETFS) is a highly secure and private DeFi trading platform for profitable investors and traders that prioritizes anonymity and investment security. Top global security firm CyberScope has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cyberscope.io/audits/etfswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 audited}}}\uc2  ETFSwap (ETFS) platform smart contracts and reports no vulnerabilities or security threats.\par \par \uc2 Smart investors are incentivized to engage in investment and trading activities on the DeFi platform by not having to go through unnecessary KYC registration and trader onboarding formalities.\par \par \uc2 Cardano's \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  To Reach $38, Ripple's XRP To Reach $10 With Spot ETF Approvals As Basis For Price Prediction\par \par \uc2 Cardano's \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and Ripple's XRP are two DeFi giant altcoins making the rounds in the crypto industry alongside ETFSwap (ETFS) as top market experts make \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crypto price predictions in foresight of a Spot ETF addition to their ecosystems.\par \par \uc2 Famous market analysts place a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  price {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.banklesstimes.com/news/2024/01/12/cardano-price-prediction-a-spot-ada-etf-faces-one-key-risk/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 prediction}}}\uc2  on Cardano's \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  to reach a whopping $38 in the coming months if a Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) spot ETF is approved by the Securities Exchange Commission (SEC). At press time, Cardano's \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 trades}}}\uc2  at $0.43, according to coinmarketcap data.\par \par \uc2 For Ripple's XRP, top analysts make a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  $10 price {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.binance.com/sv/square/post/9184448743834"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 prediction}}}\uc2  on the XRP token in hopes of a Spot ETF coming to its ecosystem. Ripple's XRP, which has suffered in its regulatory battles with the SEC in previous years, has gotten renewed hopes from its partial win in its court proceedings with the SEC and top analysts making \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  price predictions on the XRP native token.\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 trades}}}\uc2  at $0.48, as trading data from coinmarketcap shows.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion On ETFSwap Vs Cardano's \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  And Ripple's XRP \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Crypto Price Predictions\par \par \uc2 ETFSwap's viral ICO presale is making rounds in the crypto industry. Market experts are making a $20 price prediction for the ETFS token alongside Cardano's \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and Ripple's XRP, which have also been projected to rally massively amid rumours of a Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Ripple (XRP) Spot ETF.\par \par \uc2 ETFSwap (ETFS), which sells at an undervalued price of $0.01831 in stage 2 of its viral presale, is bought up fast by big whales and institutional players.\par \par \uc2 For more information about the ETFS presale:\par \par \uc2 Visit ETFSwap Presale\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://linktr.ee/etfswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Join The ETFSwap Community}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240614ek6d00006\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 OKX\par \b \uc2 P2P.org partners with OKX to provide institutional staking services\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Vince Quill \par \uc2 473 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 June 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 P2P.org, a staking services firm and validator, announced a partnership with OKX to introduce institutional staking services for its business clients.\par \par \uc2 Institutional staking firm and validator P2P.org has launched crypto staking services for institutional clients in partnership with the OKX exchange.\par \par \uc2 As part of P2P's staking-as-a-business model (SaaB), business clients will have access to institutional-grade staking services across a range of assets, including Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ), Kusama (KSM), Celestia (TIA), and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 Spokespeople for P2P told Cointelegraph, "Staking with OKX enables eligible users to enjoy an APR without the hassle of setting up new nodes," before listing common barriers to entry preventing institutions from participating in the crypto staking market.\par \par \uc2 A steep learning curve, time investment, and the significant cost of running a node are all impediments preventing businesses from taking advantage of the yields offered by digital assets, P2P spokespeople explained.\par \par \uc2 P2P.org expands footprint\par \par \uc2 In April, P2P.org hit {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-validator-p2p-org-7-5-billion-tvl-saab"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $7.5 billion in total value locked (TVL)}}}\uc2  and introduced its \u8220\'20\'1Cstaking-as-a-businesses\u8221\'20\'1D model, which aims to reduce barriers to entry for institutional clients.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-staking-p2p-restaking-api-eigenlayer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum validator P2P.org enables ETH restaking on EigenLayer}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 At the time, Alex Esin, CEO of P2P.org, told Cointelegraph, \u8220\'20\'1COur objective is to assist in the establishment or amplification of staked assets within institutional products, ensuring that staking contributes a minimum of 10% to total revenue, ideally reaching 20%.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Exposure without expertise\par \par \uc2 Models like P2P\u8217\'20\'19s SaaB, crypto exchange-traded products, and exchange-traded funds (ETFs) are becoming increasingly popular options for institutional investors and traditional financial institutions. These avenues allow institutional players to gain exposure to the crypto markets without having to master any of the technical expertise inherent to digital assets.\par \par \uc2 According to a recentCoinShares \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows\u8221\'20\'1D report, inflows into crypto exchange-traded funds and products hit {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-fund-inflows-2-billion-may-btc-coinshares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $2 billion in May 2024}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14bringing the year-to-date figure to more than $15 billion in capital invested.\par \par \uc2 Institutional interest in crypto was re-ignited following the approval of a spot Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) ETF in the United States, as leading asset managers like \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  began providing BTC exposure to their clients.\par \par \uc2 This interest in \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment has spilled into other sectors, where pension fund managers are diversifying their holdings by gaining exposure to Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 In a recent \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  filing, the \uc2 State of Wisconsin Investment Board\uc2  (SWIB), the manager for Wisconsin's state pension system, revealed it had roughly 2.4 million shares of \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 's \uc2 iShares Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (IBIT) and more than 1 million shares of Grayscale's \uc2 Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (GBTC), for a combined {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/wisconsin-investments-spot-bitcoin-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $164 million investment}}}\uc2  into the decentralized currency.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/cailtlyn-jenner-token-scammer-sahil-arora-celebrity-network-leaked-price-list/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Caitlyn Jenner meme coin \u8216\'20\'18mastermind\u8217\'20\'19s\u8217\'20\'19 celebrity price list leaked}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDYvYTFkMDliYzUtZmFlMS00NTljLTkyZWQtZGMwOTRmZDkxMzM1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240613ek6d000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, SHIB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,524 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 June 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins have rebounded sharply off their strong support levels, suggesting solid demand at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price rallied sharply after United States Consumer Price Index (CPI) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-shoots-up-1-5-k-us-cpi-shows-inflation-slowing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data came in lower than forecast}}}\uc2 . The CPI data was unchanged from last month, and the year-on-year figure of 3.3% showed a slowdown from the previous pace of 3.4% \u8212\'20\'14 both 0.1% lower than forecast.\par \par \uc2 The sharp recovery from the $66,000 level shows that the bulls have not given up and are buying near strong support levels. Traders can expect the next directional move above $73,777 or below $56,552. Until then, the range-bound action may continue.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/e0e85875-4586-49b2-bd31-c123e845a682.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Japanese firm Metaplanet has been using Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s sideways price action to build its treasury. The firm disclosed on June 11 that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/metaplanet-stock-soars-after-latest-bitcoin-purchase"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 it had purchased 23.25 Bitcoin}}}\uc2 , taking its total haul to 141.07 Bitcoin, acquired at an average price of $65,365.\par \par \uc2 Could buyers sustain the recovery in Bitcoin and select altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin plummeted below the 20-day exponential moving average ($68,700) on June 11 but found support at the 50-day simple moving average ($65,982).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/ec20e904-3262-4d20-905c-4ed0c53e819a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls aggressively purchased the dip to the 50-day SMA and pushed the price above the 20-day EMA. This suggests that the BTC/USDT pair may oscillate inside the tight range between $66,500 and $72,000 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to catapult the price above the $72,000 to $73,777 resistance zone to seize control. That will open the gates for a rally to $80,000 and eventually to $88,000. On the downside, a slide below the 50-day SMA could start a downward move to $60,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure to rise above $3,730 may have increased selling, pulling Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($3,655) on June 11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/8da9a1c8-8812-40ed-a4df-3b5bfd9b659a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls aggressively bought the dip near the 50-day SMA ($3,388), signaling strong demand at lower levels. Buyers will make one more attempt to overcome the obstacle at $3,730. If they do that, the ETH/USDT pair may rise to $3,887 and later to $3,977.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from $3,730, it will indicate that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance. The pair may turn down and retest the 50-day SMA. A break below this level could sink the pair toward $2,850.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) fell below the 50-day SMA ($605) on June 11, but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. This suggests buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/5b0da414-c34b-4b5e-9c83-81c7df654159.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push the price above the overhead resistance of $635. If they manage to do that, it will suggest that the correction may be over. The BNB/USDT pair may try to rise toward $722.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and breaks below $591, it will indicate that every relief rally is being sold into. There is minor support at $560, but if it cracks, the pair may drop to $536.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 50-day SMA ($157) on June 11, but the price recovered sharply from the support line of the descending channel pattern on June 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/b97631bb-92e3-4298-b22c-d3dbbd6af5ca.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will attempt to propel the price above the resistance line. If they succeed, it will suggest that the short-term corrective phase may be over. The SOL/USDT pair will try to rise to $176 and subsequently to the overhead resistance at $189.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated if the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA ($162) or the resistance line and plunges below the channel. That could clear the path for a drop to $116.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls could not build upon XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) bounce off the crucial support at $0.46 on June 7, showing a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/78358c19-3896-4cfa-a98f-7a02e56e207e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have started to turn down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the negative zone, indicating that the bears are in control. If the price turns down from the moving averages, the bears will again attempt to sink the XRP/USDT pair below $0.46.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above the moving averages will suggest that the bears are losing their grip. The pair may extend its consolidation between $0.46 and $0.57 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned up sharply from $0.13, indicating that the bulls are not waiting for a deeper correction to buy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/f46720a0-2e46-418e-855f-6084c83db7ec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are likely to act as a substantial hurdle on the way up. If the price turns down from the moving averages, the bears will make one more attempt to sink the DOGE/USDT pair to $0.12.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers kick the price above the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may continue its range-bound action between $0.12 and $0.18 for a while longer. The bulls will be back in control on a break above $0.18.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull Toncoin (TON) below the uptrend line on June 11 but the bulls held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/cf47cf5e-b860-402a-9fe0-ed96628e0e9e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($6.88) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive zone suggest that the bulls have an edge. Buyers will try to push the price above the overhead resistance of $7.67. If they can pull it off, the TON/USDT pair may surge to $10.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from $7.67, it will signal that bears are active at higher levels. That will increase the likelihood of a drop below the uptrend line. Such a move will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern setup and sink the pair to $6.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-reasons-why-pepe-another-70-jump-by-july"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3 reasons why Pepe poised for another 70% jump by July}}}\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck between $0.000020 and $0.000030 for the past few days, indicating buying on dips and selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/1de6d48e-415f-4ec9-8efc-81f970d59e31.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to vigorously defend the $0.000020 level because a break and close below it will start the next leg of the downtrend. The SHIB/USDT pair could then plunge to the 78.6% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.000017.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the moving averages, it will signal that the range-bound action may continue for some more time. The bulls will have to clear the hurdle at $0.000030 to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from the triangle\u8217\'20\'19s support line on June 10, suggesting that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/d3180b39-03c4-46bb-bb39-de12bb320309.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers purchased the dip to $0.41 and are trying to push the price back above the moving averages. If they manage to do that, it will signal that the breakdown below the triangle may have been a bear trap. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then climb to the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then try to sink the pair to $0.35.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a large range between $29 and $40 for several days, which suggests that traders are buying near the support and selling close to the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/61d6199f-bd5c-43e7-b108-c3fd0c0a6695.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price is attempting to start a relief rally from $30.59. Any recovery is likely to face selling at the moving averages. If the price turns down from the moving averages, the bears will make one more attempt to sink the AVAX/USDT pair below $29. If they succeed, the pair could drop to $20.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rises and breaks above the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDYvN2Y3NDEwMWQtNzgzMi00YTVkLTllNGMtM2JmMzA5YjA3MjE0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240612ek6c000be\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 BTC price risks $60K dive as Bitcoin bid liquidity thins on new 3% dip\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 623 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 June 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin analysis hopes for a BTC price turnaround as thin liquidity opens up the road toward $60,000.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin traded below $68,000 during the June 11 Asia trading session as analysis warned of further BTC price losses.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/ed370d92-fd8b-4247-980c-3bf5b88c5069.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 BTC price weakness meets lack of \u8220\'20\'1Cheavy\u8221\'20\'1D bid support\par \par \uc2 Data from Cointelegraph Markets Pro and \uc2 TradingView\uc2  showed a 3% dip taking Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) to lows of $67,320 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  after the daily close.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-drops-etfs-lose-inflow-steak-us-inflation-fed-meeting"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-drops-etfs-lose-inflow-steak-us-inflation-fed-meeting}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-drops-etfs-lose-inflow-steak-us-inflation-fed-meeting"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Lacking support at the key $69,000 level}}}\uc2 , Bitcoin bulls failed to stave off a downward move through thin exchange order book liquidity.\par \par \uc2 The day prior, Keith Alan, co-founder of trading resource Material Indicators, had warned that insufficient bids could be a warning sign for BTC price strength.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Sure\uc2  we have some laddered bid support in here, but not a heavy, heavy concentration of it \u8212\'20\'14 and really, it\u8217\'20\'19s not even heavy down to $60,000 if I can be completely honest,\u8221\'20\'1D he said during his {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/live/F_poBrf4UnM"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 latest YouTube update}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 An accompanying chart covered order book liquidity for the BTC/USDT pair on the largest global crypto exchange, \uc2 Binance\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/1f8c9949-31dc-4fca-99eb-0492485d6aff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT liquidity heatmap. Source: Material Indicators\par \par \uc2 In a subsequent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/MI_Algos/status/1800363318349021613"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 post}}}\uc2  on X, Material Indicators noted that with the latest move down, Bitcoin had formally rejected $69,000 as support and had also given up the 21-day moving average \u8212\'20\'14 a key short-term trendline.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSupport at the 21-Day Moving Average and the R/S Flip at $69k have both been invalidated,\u8221\'20\'1D it read.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis move isn\u8217\'20\'19t over. In fact I expect these killer whale games to continue up to and through JPow\u8217\'20\'19s comments on Wednesday and economic reports on Thursday.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/17c7858c-0624-4978-b4b2-80f43bd68564.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day chart with 21SMA. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph reported, the week\u8217\'20\'19s main {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/2nd-highest-weekly-close-ever-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 potential \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  catalyst for Bitcoin}}}\uc2  and crypto price action is United States macroeconomic data \u8212\'20\'14 the Consumer Price Index (CPI) and Producer Price Index (PPI) \u8212\'20\'14 along with the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s latest interest rate decision and accompanying press conference by Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSo far CPI/PPI has been around the highs of this range & FOMC resulting in local lows,\u8221\'20\'1D popular trader Skew {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/52kskew/status/1800326301129294328"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 continued}}}\uc2  on the topic.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CInteresting few days ahead.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/31340bfb-e932-436a-8c22-90c025e412bf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD chart. Source: Skew\par \par \uc2 Mixed opinions on Bitcoin support\par \par \uc2 In his own market analysis, meanwhile, fellow trader and commentator Credible Crypto suggested that the outcome of the down move may not be as radical as a trip to $60,000.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-6-10-spx-dxy-btc-eth-bnb-sol-xrp-ton-doge-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 6/10: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 With liquidity being added and pulled from the market at will by large-volume traders, appetite for BTC could spare bulls any lower than even $65,000.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe continue to see spot absorption on each and every move down, even on lower timeframes,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/CredibleCrypto/status/1800407698153865335/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  to X subscribers.\par \par \uc2 Credible Crypto noted that overhead resistance at $72,000 had been \u8220\'20\'1Cpulled immediately\u8221\'20\'1D once Bitcoin began reversing.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhat are the odds we front run range lows and 62-65k and just reverse from here? I think they are decent,\u8221\'20\'1D he concluded.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNo guarantees of course, but we will know soon enough with developing PA over the next 24 or so hours.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/1cfa8f7d-cfda-4a19-92bb-3cf51d0cc6cf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD chart. Source: Credible Crypto\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDYvY2YyMTk2ZDUtMjlhNS00ZWM0LTk4YjAtZDQzZjU2NGNjYjQzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240611ek6b0002t\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/10: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,552 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 June 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The macroeconomic events on June 12 could provide direction to Bitcoin and altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Two macroeconomic events could boost Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  this week. The \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s press conference following the rate decision and the Consumer Price Index (CPI) data, both due on June 12, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/2nd-highest-weekly-close-ever-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 could help Bitcoin break out from its tight range}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Investors anticipate the breakout to the upside, which could explain the solid buying last week. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  weekly fund flows report on June 10 shows {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-investment-products-june-2b-inflows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 more than $2 billion in inflows}}}\uc2  into \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products. That increased the digital investment product\u8217\'20\'19s five-week total inflows to $4.3 billion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/6c958c84-d54f-4be5-a052-a706d3ab566a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs acquired 25,729 Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-flows-will-send-btc-price-into-parabolic-run-traders-say"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 between June 3 and 7}}}\uc2 , a tad lower than the 29,592 Bitcoin bought in May. The purchase in the first week of June was equivalent to roughly two months\u8217\'20\'19 worth of mining supply, showing demand overtaking supply.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and select altcoins overcome their respective overhead resistance levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) hit a new all-time high last week, indicating that the bulls are in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/0c7b5eed-f3ca-4e8a-ab5a-137bf676687d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average (5,285) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside. The rally could reach 5,500.\par \par \uc2 If sellers want to prevent the upside, they will have to quickly yank the price below the moving averages. If they do that, the aggressive bulls may get trapped, resulting in long liquidation. The index could then slide toward 5,000.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) fell below the ascending channel on June 3, but the bears could not sink the price below 104.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/255a4c64-d952-4718-bfd6-b55d126154fa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 That started a rebound, which pushed the price back inside the channel on June 7. The bulls continued their purchase on June 10, propelling the price above the 50-day simple moving average (105). The strong recovery shows that several short-term bears may have been trapped, resulting in a short squeeze.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to push the price to 105.75 and subsequently to 106.50. This optimistic view will be negated if the price turns down sharply and skids below 104.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls managed to keep Bitcoin above the 20-day EMA ($68,726) but failed to start a strong rebound off it. This suggests a lack of aggressive buying at current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/bc59c3f3-8095-494e-b40b-500320f02157.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sink the price below the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the BTC/USDT pair could sink to the 50-day SMA ($65,906). This level may attract strong buying by the bulls because a break below the 50-day SMA will tilt the short-term advantage in favor of the bears. The pair may then fall to $60,000.\par \par \uc2 The $72,000 to $73,777 zone is the critical overhead resistance to watch out for. If buyers overcome this zone, the pair could pick up momentum and surge to $80,000 and eventually to $88,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is trying to find support at the 20-day EMA ($3,676), but the failure to push the price above $3,730 suggests that the bears are maintaining their pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/9eee23cf-7ee0-4263-a7f4-035388808b76.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just above the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand. If the price plummets below $3,600, the selling could pick up, and the ETH/USDT pair may collapse to the 50-day SMA ($3,374).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rises and maintains above $3,730, it will suggest solid buying on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to drive the price to the overhead resistance at $4,094. If this obstacle is overcome, the pair may reach $4,868.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $722 on June 6 and reached the breakout level of $635 on June 10. This is a significant level to watch out for as the bulls and the bears are expected to battle it out for supremacy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/8a1a90f5-06c6-4b68-81aa-5e51c0089505.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off $635 with strength, it will suggest that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support. The BNB/USDT pair will again try to rise to the overhead resistance of $722. A close above this resistance will clear the path for a move to the pattern target of $775.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price breaks below the breakout level, the pair could descend to the uptrend line. The bulls are expected to defend this level with all their might because if they fail in their endeavor, the pair may tumble to $560 and then to $536.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the breakout level of $162 on June 7, signaling that the bears are attempting a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/b32c39c8-8f57-4c02-b35e-af440e7acd39.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have defended the 50-day SMA ($157) for the past three days but have failed to push the SOL/USDT pair above the 20-day EMA ($164). This increases the risk of a breakdown to $140, which is expected to behave as a strong support.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength on the upside will be a break and close above $176. If that happens, the bulls will try to kick the price above the $189 resistance and challenge the formidable hurdle at $205.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) nosedived below the support line and the $0.46 support, but the lower levels attracted solid buying, as seen from the long tail on the candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/93c38a32-6902-44d6-bffd-95583f5f3ead.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The break below the triangle invalidated the developing ascending triangle pattern. The 20-day EMA ($0.51) has started to turn down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the negative zone, indicating that the bears are in command. Sellers will try to sink the price to the crucial support at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 If the price once again bounces off the $0.46 support, it will suggest that the bulls are aggressively defending the level. A break and close above the moving averages will signal that the XRP/USDT pair may remain inside the $0.46 to $0.57 range for a while.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-vs-buffett-btc-holders-104-cagr-steady-growth-portfolio"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin vs. Buffett: BTC holders' 104% CAGR dwarfs 'steady growth' portfolio}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($6.82) on June 9, indicating that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/fd9c64e1-99f1-49f4-9b57-21899ecbeeda.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to push the price to the overhead resistance of $7.67, which is likely to attract strong selling by the bears. However, if the bulls prevail, the TON/USDT pair could start the next leg of the uptrend toward $10.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the uptrend line, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern. The pair may then slump to $6 and subsequently to $5.60.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down and plunged below the moving averages on June 7, suggesting that the price may remain inside the $0.12 to $0.18 range for some time.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/f5741cee-b4d2-44f9-99e0-d00606b2dae2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.15) and the RSI in the negative territory signal that the bears have the edge in the near term. The DOGE/USDT pair could fall to $0.14 and thereafter to $0.12.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off $0.12 will suggest that the bulls remain buyers at lower levels. The next trending move is likely to begin on a break above $0.18 or below $0.12. Until then, random and volatile range-bound action may continue.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) witnessed sharp \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on June 7, followed by a drop below the symmetrical triangle pattern on June 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/9ce9162e-12dc-4307-8049-c855c6f87f9b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push the price back into the triangle on June 9, but the bears are trying to defend the level. If the price turns down and breaks below $0.42, it will signal that the bears have flipped the support line into resistance. That will increase the likelihood of a fall to $0.35.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if buyers propel the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.46), it will suggest that the breakdown may have been a bear trap. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then rally to the resistance of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDYvNjdiYWY3OGMtYjE3Mi00NGVlLTllOTAtY2E2YzA0MTVlMzdhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240610ek6a000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
