\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Weekly Roundup: VanEck  \highlight22\uc2 Bullish \highlight\uc2  on BTC, Crypto Queen\u8217\'20\'19s Grim Fate, & More\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 876 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 June 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ls-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ls-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Altcoins}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ls-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Technology}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ls-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Business}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ls-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Web3}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ls-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Security}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ls-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22Regulation\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 This week, VanEck CEO \uc2 Jan van Eck\uc2  predicted that Bitcoin could see stellar gains and eventually soar to half the market cap of gold. The world also learned the grim fate of Crypto Queen Ruja Ignatova.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\par \par \uc2 Renowned financial author and billionaire {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/rich-dad-poor-dad-author-kiyosaki-predicts-bitcoin-350000-by-august"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Robert Kiyosaki}}}\uc2  has predicted Bitcoin could reach a staggering $350,000 by August. Kiyosaki said the reason behind the tongue-in-cheek prediction was the incompetence of US leaders in politics and finance.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin analyst {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/bitcoin-to-half-a-million-this-cycle-according-to-planb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PlanB}}}\uc2  has also made a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  prediction for Bitcoin in his updated Stock-to-Flow model. According to PlanB, the model\u8217\'20\'19s data predicts that Bitcoin could reach $500,000. He predicted a strong surge for Bitcoin, adding that it could reach $100,000 soon.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 FDIC\uc2  published some shocking findings for the banking industry in its Quarterly Banking Profile for the first quarter of 2024. The report stated that several prominent banks were of serious concern or unviable. In such a scenario, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/63-banks-considered-to-be-of-serious-concern-or-unviable-bitcoin-anyone"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  could act as a hedge against a potential banking collapse.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/vaneck-ceo-predicts-bitcoin-could-soar-to-half-the-market-cap-of-gold"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Jan van Eck}}}\uc2 , the CEO of one of the biggest investment banks in the US, has predicted that the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest cryptocurrency will reach at least half the market capitalization of gold in five to ten years. Van Eck made the prediction in an interview with Scott Melker.\par \par \uc2 Altcoins\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/hulk-hogan-themed-memecoin-loses-15m-in-market-cap-within-minutes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Hulkamania (HULK)}}}\uc2 , a Solana-based meme coin allegedly promoted by professional wrestling legend Hulk Hogan, lost $15 million in market capitalization within minutes. The collapse occurred after Hogan deleted all posts promoting the meme coin and clarified that he did not make the posts promoting it.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/european-parliament-approves-new-crypto-regulations-to-fight-money-laundering"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 European Parliament}}}\uc2  has approved a new set of regulations for crypto companies. The new rules impact all crypto-asset service providers (CASPs) under the new Markets in Crypto-Assets (MiCA) law, making it mandatory for them to conduct due diligence to combat money laundering.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/gamestop-gme-massive-surge-ignites-crypto-memecoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 GameStop Tribute Token}}}\uc2  (GME), a token based on Solana, registered an increase of 38% on Friday. The surging interest in \uc2 GameStop\uc2  has also seen several meme coin traders placing their bets on other tokens in the meme coin ecosystem, such as BRETT, TRUMP, and DogWifHat.\par \par \uc2 Former US President {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/former-us-president-donald-trump-holds-over-32-million-in-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  owns over $32 million in crypto, having gone from being a vocal critic to a strong supporter of digital assets. Trump\u8217\'20\'19s pivot towards cryptocurrencies can be attributed to \uc2 Vivek Ramaswamy\uc2 , who has been advising the former president on key issues.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/cardano-foundation-announces-major-argentine-partnership-to-boost-blockchain-adoption"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano Foundation}}}\uc2  has announced a public partnership with the governor of the Entre R\u237\'00\'EDos Province, a move that can benefit the country\u8217\'20\'19s recent pivot towards crypto. Industry watchers are also hopeful the partnership could positively impact \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has failed to register any momentum in a highly popular crypto market.\par \par \uc2 Technology\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/coinbase-launches-smart-wallets-to-simplify-crypto-onboarding"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase}}}\uc2  has introduced smart wallets to help simplify the crypto onboarding process by eliminating complex processes and high fees generally associated with traditional crypto wallets. \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  hopes to onboard over a billion users through the new offering.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/iota-foundation-evm-mainnet-in-partnership-with-layerzero"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 IOTA Foundation}}}\uc2  has launched the IOTA EVM, a Layer2 solution that seamlessly integrates smart contract capabilities into the ITOA Network. The announcement comes only months after the launch of the Shimmer EVM.\par \par \uc2 Business\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/paxos-international-to-issue-interest-bearing-stablecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Paxos International}}}\uc2  will issue an interest-bearing US Dollar-pegged stablecoin called the Lift Dollar (USDL). The stablecoin will be regulated by the Abu Dhabi Global Market (ADGM) and will pay yield on interest earned by Paxos International on the reserves backing the asset.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/missing-crypto-queen-suspected-to-be-murdered-by-bulgarian-drug-lord"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ruja Ignotova}}}\uc2 , also called the \u8220\'20\'1CCrypto Queen,\u8221\'20\'1D may have been murdered by a notorious Bulgarian drug lord, according to new evidence that has recently come to light. \u8220\'20\'1CCrypto Queen\u8221\'20\'1D Ignatova had scammed investors out of billions, promising them high returns if they invested in her fake cryptocurrency, \uc2 OneCoin\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/deutsche-bank-partners-with-bitpanda-to-facilitate-seamless-crypto-transactions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Deutsche Bank}}}\uc2  announced a partnership with \uc2 Bitpanda\uc2  to facilitate seamless customer deposits and withdrawals for the Austrian crypto exchange. The partnership signals a changing attitude towards crypto as it gradually moves into mainstream finance.\par \par \uc2 Bankrupt cryptocurrency exchange {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/ftx-reaches-settlement-with-irs-on-24-billion-tax-bill"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 FTX}}}\uc2  has reached a settlement with the \uc2 United States Internal Revenue Service\uc2  (IRS) on its $24 billion tax bill. If approved, \uc2 FTX\uc2  will have to pay the \uc2 IRS\uc2  $200 million within 60 days and an additional $685 million as a subordinated claim at a later date.\par \par \uc2 Web3\par \par \uc2 Open-world blockchain game {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/illuvium-to-launch-open-beta-mainnet-on-july-25"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Illuvium}}}\uc2  has announced the launch of its open beta mainnet on July 25th. The announcement comes after a series of beta testing phases that began with the Private Beta 4 phase on April 30th.\par \par \uc2 Security\par \par \uc2 Decentralized exchange {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/velocore-addresses-7m-hack-in-postmortem-offers-10-white-hat-bounty"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Velocore}}}\uc2  has published a postmortem addressing a recent hack during which it lost $7 million. The decentralized exchange has offered the hacker a 10% bug bounty but is yet to receive a response.\par \par \uc2 Regulation\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Commodity Futures Trading Commission\uc2  (CFTC) has named the co-founder and CEO of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/cftc-names-ceo-of-aptos-labs-to-its-digital-assets-subcommittee"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Aptos}}}\uc2 , Mo Shaikh, to its subcommittee on digital assets. The CFTC\u8217\'20\'19s Digital Assets subcommittee is part of a larger committee that will advise the agency on \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  and rulemaking.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240610ek6900004\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
