\par\par \b \uc2 Cardano Foundation Announces Major Argentine Partnership To Boost Blockchain Adoption\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 614 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 June 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s New Partnership}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s Argentina Plans}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Argentina\u8217\'20\'19s Crypto Expansion}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Could This Partnership Revive \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ?}}}\par \par \uc2 The Cardano Foundation has announced a public partnership with a regional government in Argentina, in a move that could benefit the country\u8217\'20\'19s recent pivot towards crypto.\par \par \uc2 Many are hopeful the partnership could act as a catalyst for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s native token, which has failed to generate any momentum in an increasingly competitive market.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s New Partnership\par \par \uc2 According to an announcement by the Cardano Foundation, Rogelio Frigerio, the governor of the Entre R\u237\'00\'EDos Province, and Rafael Fraga, LATAM Lead for Business Development at the Cardano Foundation signed the agreement to make the partnership official. The partnership will focus primarily on facilitating blockchain adoption in the Entre R\u237\'00\'EDos Province. The Cardano Foundation took to X to share the news of the partnership, stating,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe are delighted to announce a new partnership in Argentina! Following a public signing between @frigeriorogelio and @rafaelfraga_f, the #CardanoFoundation is collaborating with Entre R\u237\'00\'EDos state to further #blockchain adoption.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 While details about the collaboration remain sketchy, it will likely be part of Argentina\u8217\'20\'19s effort to improve and bolster its crypto sector. The country is working to grow its cryptocurrency ecosystem and create a clear regulatory framework for the industry.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s Argentina Plans\par \par \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 , the founder of Cardano, caught the attention of the president of Argentina, \uc2 Javier Milei\uc2 , through a social media interaction. The engagement between the two highlighted Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s interest in expanding its operations in Argentina, which comes at a time when Argentina is actively embracing blockchain technology and crypto. The interaction began with an update from \uc2 Dario Epstein\uc2 , Director at Research For Traders, who stated that a technology company specializing in third-generation blockchain and a focus on decentralized governance had gotten in touch with him. He also added that the company was keen on establishing itself in Argentina.\par \par \uc2 Hoskinson replied to the post, praising Argentina\u8217\'20\'19s tech talent, indicating that the company in question could be Cardano.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COver the past eight years, developers from Argentina like ATIX\u8217\'20\'19s Alan Verbner have been invaluable in the development of some of Cardano. Argentina has some of the brightest minds in our industry, and it has been a privilege to work with them.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Argentina\u8217\'20\'19s Crypto Expansion\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/05/bilateral-talks-el-salvador-shares-bitcoin-regulatory-expertise-with-argentina"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Argentina}}}\uc2  is looking to significantly boost its crypto infrastructure. The country\u8217\'20\'19s National Securities Commission recently announced a partnership with El Salvador\u8217\'20\'19s National Commission of Digital Assets, with the goal of exploring Bitcoin adoption and crypto \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Argentina plans to leverage its technology sector expertise to enhance its crypto services' efficiency. The move came after the country\u8217\'20\'19s Minister of Foreign Relations and International Commerce, Diana Modino, spearheaded a move to use Bitcoin and other cryptocurrencies in contracts.\par \par \uc2 The recent election of \uc2 Javier Milei\uc2  as president has played a crucial role in shifting Argentina\u8217\'20\'19s stance on cryptocurrencies. Milei\u8217\'20\'19s administration has embraced cryptocurrencies and is planning to use them in payments under specific conditions.\par \par \uc2 Could This Partnership Revive \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ?\par \par \uc2 While the cryptocurrency space has seen considerable growth over the past few months, Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s native \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  token has struggled. According to data from CoimMarketCap, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is currently trading at $0.47, and while it has registered a growth of 40% over the past year, it has struggled to maintain its momentum. Market watchers are hopeful the collaboration can have a positive impact on \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240608ek670000a\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/7: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, SHIB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,570 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 June 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Traders continue to accumulate Bitcoin ETFs, signaling that they expect the uptrend to resume.\par \par \uc2 Traders have been eagerly waiting for Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) to break out of its range, but that has not yet happened. The longer the price remains inside the range, the greater the force needed for the breakout. A \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign is that the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds have witnessed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-inflows-price-stagnant-crypto-traders-analysis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 net inflows for 19 days in a row}}}\uc2 . This shows solid buying in anticipation of the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Other than Bitcoin ETFs, firms are also directly investing in Bitcoin. A June 6 S-3 filing by Nasdaq-listed medical manufacturer \uc2 Semler Scientific\uc2  shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/semler-scientific-now-holds-828-bitcoin-150m-plan-buy-more"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 it owns 828 Bitcoin}}}\uc2 , having purchased its first lot of 581 Bitcoin on May 28. The firm said it has kept its options open to raise an additional $150 million of debt securities, primarily for general corporate purposes, including Bitcoin purchases.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/2f88e571-595a-41b6-9dd9-fe5e05246ec1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 In addition to the growing demand for Bitcoin ETFs, the institutions seem to be showing interest in investing in altcoins. According to a June 6 report from The Information, asset manager \uc2 Franklin Templeton\uc2  is considering a private fund that will {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/franklin-templeton-altcoin-focused-crypto-fund"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 expose institutional investors to altcoins}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Could buyers maintain the momentum and propel Bitcoin to a new all-time high? Will that boost buying in select altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull Bitcoin back below the psychological level of $70,000 on June 6 but the bulls held their ground. This suggests that the buyers are trying to flip the $70,000 level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/4250e42b-3147-4bbf-8580-9c03e5ae5050.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($68,609) and the relative strength index (RSI) are in the positive zone, indicating that the bulls have the edge. The BTC/USDT pair could rise to the stiff overhead resistance at $73,777.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $73,777, it is likely to find support at the 20-day EMA. A bounce off this level will increase the likelihood of a break above $73,777. The pair may then climb to $80,000 and later to $88,000.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a break below the 20-day EMA will signal that the range-bound action may extend for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been struggling to start a strong recovery off the $3,730 support, indicating that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/c53e2d26-883b-46d3-918f-c0c818cec6c5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the upsloping 20-day EMA ($3,684) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory suggest that the bulls are in control. If the price rises from the current level and above $3,900, the ETH/USDT pair could move to $3,977 and eventually to $4,094.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price continues lower and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls have given up and are booking profits. That could sink the pair to the 50-day simple moving average ($3,342).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is in an uptrend, but the rally is facing resistance near $722, suggesting profit-booking from short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/73263270-cc09-4fbe-bd28-2581c2adfcd9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to yank the price down to the breakout level of $635. If the BNB/USDT pair rebounds off this level with strength, it will signal that the bulls have flipped $635 into support. That will improve the prospects of a rally to the pattern target of $775.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the $635 support. The selling could intensify after the bears sink the price below the uptrend line. That may start a down move to $536.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) once again took support at the 20-day EMA ($167) on June 6, indicating that the bulls are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/299a2910-acdd-4bfc-8947-5cb016ecc3c2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to retain their advantage and push the price to $189. This level may act as a hurdle, but it is likely to be crossed. The SOL/USDT pair could then attempt a rally to the formidable resistance of $205.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the up move, they will have to quickly drag the price below the 50-day SMA ($156). If they do that, the pair may drop to $140 and subsequently to the critical support at $116.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade near the moving averages, indicating a lack of aggressive buying or selling by the traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/bf867fb9-2ff1-4305-975e-b027f7e3f856.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest that the dull price action may continue for a while. If the price breaks and closes above $0.54, it will indicate that the bulls are trying to make a comeback. The XRP/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance of $0.57.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and plunges below the support line, it will negate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern. The pair may fall to the $0.46 support.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck between $0.18 and the 50-day SMA ($0.15) for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/86f3f07a-2387-4516-8b53-c228df9bc56f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  near the midpoint suggest that the range-bound action may continue for some more time. If the price turns up from the moving averages, the bulls will attempt to push the DOGE/USDT pair to $0.18.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break and close below the 50-day SMA will signal that the bulls have given up. That could start a drop to $0.14 and thereafter to the pivotal support at $0.12. The bulls are expected to defend this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) nudged above the $7.67 overhead resistance on June 7, indicating that the bulls are trying to resume the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/408b1eb1-a49b-430f-9544-0be2c83105f2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($6.77) and the RSI near the overbought territory suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers drive and maintain the price above $8, the TON/USDT pair could rally to $10.\par \par \uc2 The crucial support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA. A bounce off this support will suggest that the bulls are in control, but a break below it will signal that the buyers are losing their grip. The pair may then slide to the 50-day SMA ($6.25).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-dips-bitcoin-schizophenic-new-us-jobs-data"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price dips 1.8% as Bitcoin tackles 'schizophenic' new US jobs data}}}\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages on June 5 but could not build upon the strength.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/dfe9e4c4-2abc-4c92-b2e4-acc8a73a473c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pull the price below the moving averages and the support line. If they manage to do that, the ascending triangle pattern will be invalidated, which could start a slide to $0.000018.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up from the current level, it will suggest that the bulls are aggressively defending the support line. The SHIB/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance of $0.000030.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a symmetrical triangle pattern for several days, signaling a tussle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/723dc04d-2fff-45f9-b988-235e71d1778e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 After hesitating for a few days, traders pushed the price above the moving averages on June 7. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could reach the triangle\u8217\'20\'19s resistance line, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense. If buyers overcome the barrier, the pair could rally to $0.62. There is a minor resistance at $0.57, but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down sharply from the resistance line, it will indicate that the bulls are booking profits. That may keep the pair stuck inside the triangle for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been trading close to the moving averages for the past few days, signaling a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/726b4d23-aae0-461a-8287-0027abe02fbf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price maintains above the moving averages, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to $42.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below $34, it will suggest that the bears are trying to take charge. The pair could then slide to $29, where buyers are likely to step in. The next directional move is expected to begin above $42 or below $29.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDYvN2NmNGNkNzItNGMwZS00Y2VjLWIzNDgtMDQ0ZDk3YmUwOTE1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240607ek67000ba\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
