\par\par \b \uc2 Post-Keynote 2, BlockDAG Celebrates a Massive 850% Uplift in Price, Leading Over Cardano and Optimism\b0\par\par\uc2 Adrian Barkley \par \uc2 652 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 June 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Analyzing Cardano's Declining Market Performance}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Predicting Optimism's Market Trends and Risks}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BlockDAG Keynote 2: Catalyzing a Crypto Revolution}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Conclusion}}}\par \par \uc2 While Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) shows promising decentralized exchange (DEX) activity, its market price remains sluggish. Simultaneously, the fluctuating investor confidence in Optimism (OP) highlights its uncertain future.\par \par \uc2 Capturing the limelight, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://blockdag.network/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BlockDAG (BDAG)}}}\uc2  has achieved an impressive 850% increase in value, driven by its successful launch of Keynote 2. Broadcasted with a captivating lunar theme, this event introduced significant advancements aimed at transforming the blockchain landscape.\par \par \uc2 Analyzing Cardano's Declining Market Performance\par \par \uc2 Despite a spike in its DEX activity, with daily transactions exceeding 23 million \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Cardano's market price continues to falter, currently at $0.4489, down from $0.512. Indicators like the Relative Strength Index (RSI) and Chaikin Money Flow (CMF) point to a prevailing \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend, suggesting a decrease in \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum and capital inflow.\par \par \uc2 Furthermore, the total value locked (TVL) in Cardano's ecosystem has decreased from $430 million to $230 million, indicating diminished interest in its decentralized applications and NFTs, affecting \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's market value and overall sentiment.\par \par \uc2 Predicting Optimism's Market Trends and Risks\par \par \uc2 Currently priced at $2.40, Optimism has seen a slight increase of 0.99%. Price predictions for 2024 vary, ranging from $1.98 to $5.88, with a more optimistic projection for 2025 suggesting a potential peak. Although recent sentiments lean towards the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the long-term forecast remains positive, with expectations that OP's value could reach over $14,000 by 2035, showcasing significant growth prospects.\par \par \uc2 BlockDAG Keynote 2: Catalyzing a Crypto Revolution\par \par \uc2 BlockDAG's latest keynote, set against a moon-themed backdrop, has unveiled several crucial updates, including improvements to their blockchain infrastructure and introducing a new Low Code/No Code functionality. This feature enables even those without technical expertise to develop and manage applications, significantly broadening the accessibility of blockchain technology. These updates have played a central role in the 850% surge in BlockDAG\u8217\'20\'19s value. The keynote detailed the progressive development of BlockDAG's Directed Acyclic Graph (DAG) technology, which enhances transaction speed and security by enabling simultaneous transaction confirmations, thus boosting scalability and efficiency. The anticipated mainnet will launch in four months, following an extensive development and testing period that includes a testnet phase starting in mid-August.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, the recent rollout of the X1 miner app\u8217\'20\'19s beta version has contributed to BlockDAG's presale triumph. Compatible with Android and iOS, this app allows users to mine up to 20 BDAG daily using their smartphones. Its user-friendly interface and features designed to increase mining rates through daily interactions have sparked interest among cryptocurrency enthusiasts. These innovations highlight BlockDAG's technological capabilities and community engagement, which have helped raise over $41.9 million in the 16th batch of its presale, hinting at significant growth opportunities for early investors with a potential return on investment exceeding 30,000 times.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 BlockDAG's recent innovations are redefining the cryptocurrency landscape, providing cutting-edge technology and creative solutions. With the successful launch of Keynote 2 from the Moon and the beta release of the X1 Miner app, BlockDAG has established itself as a dominant player in the cryptocurrency arena.\par \par \uc2 The substantial 850% rise in value highlights the market's confidence in BlockDAG's future prospects. For those looking for the next major crypto investment, BlockDAG offers a promising avenue to be part of a pioneering movement in blockchain technology.\par \par \uc2 Join BlockDAG Presale Now:\par \par \uc2 Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://blockdag.network"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://blockdag.network}}}\par \par \uc2 Presale: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://purchase.blockdag.network/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://purchase.blockdag.network}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/blockDAGnetworkOfficial"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/blockDAGnetworkOfficial}}}\par \par \uc2 Discord: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://discord.gg/Q7BxghMVyu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://discord.gg/Q7BxghMVyu}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240606ek650000b\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/5: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, SHIB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,527 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 June 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Strong inflows into the spot Bitcoin ETFs show that investors believe the range-bound action is a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is trying to build upon its gains above the psychological support of $70,000. The sentiment received a boost after the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds recorded the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-second-best-inflow-day-887-millon"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second highest inflows of $887 million}}}\uc2  on June 4, per Farside Investors data.\par \par \uc2 Analysts are closely watching next week\u8217\'20\'19s United States Consumer Price Index (CPI) data. After the 0.1% drop in the CPI data on May 15, Bitcoin started a 7% rally over the following five days. 10x Research head of research, Markus Thielen, believes that if the year-on-year CPI is 3.3% or lower, it could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-new-high-slowing-us-inflation-employment-data"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 propel Bitcoin to a new all-time high}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/2debbc07-2d13-46cd-a5b9-956d4d56092e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Fidelity Investments\uc2  head of \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategies Matt Horne said in a June 4 CNBC report that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fidelity-exec-says-most-investors-should-have-some-bitcoin-allocation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 investors should consider a 1-5% allocation to Bitcoin}}}\uc2 . Such an investment will minimize risk even if Bitcoin were to go to zero, but it will benefit the portfolio if Bitcoin continues its uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Could buyers drive Bitcoin and select altcoins above their respective overhead resistance levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke and closed above the symmetrical triangle pattern on June 4, indicating that the uncertainty resolved in favor of the buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/c986e4d3-5582-436f-b934-38b310af40eb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($68,135) has started to turn up gradually, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is in the positive zone, indicating an advantage to the bulls. The BTC/USDT pair is likely to rally to $73,777, which will likely be a formidable resistance.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from $73,777, it will suggest that the range-bound action may extend for a few more days. On the other hand, a break above $73,777 will clear the path for a rally to $80,000 and then to $88,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a tight range near the critical support of $3,730, signaling that the bulls are defending the level but have failed to start a strong rebound off it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/9fbd44e4-f4a6-4943-b78c-ee113df79512.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($3,652), it will suggest that the bulls have given up. That may start a downward move to the 50-day simple moving average ($3,310) and eventually to $2,850.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price jumps from the current level with force, it will signal aggressive buying by the bulls. A break and close above $4,100 will suggest the resumption of the uptrend. The ETH/USDT pair may then surge to $4,868.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) pole-vaulted above the $635 resistance on June 4, completing an ascending triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/6f8bf25e-cb17-4f25-bbe9-aa4e46b844bf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls maintained their buying and pushed the price above the $692 overhead resistance on June 5. If buyers sustain the higher levels, the BNB/USDT pair could extend the up move to the pattern target of $775.\par \par \uc2 Generally, after rising above a strong overhead resistance level, the price turns down and retests the breakout level. The bears will try to pull the price to $635. If buyers flip the level into support, the uptrend may resume. The bears will be back in the game if they sink the pair below the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rose from the breakout level of $162 on June 3, signaling that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/6820f626-3e9e-400c-8d3a-6db9335d1150.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($166) is gradually sloping up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in positive territory, indicating that the bulls are in command. The SOL/USDT pair could reach $189, and then the overhead resistance at $205.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and plunges below the 50-day SMA ($155). The pair could then drop to $140, where the bulls will try to arrest the decline.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been clinging to the moving averages for several days, indicating uncertainty about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/481d1fc2-7428-42a7-8ca5-5fd6542c4a8b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to push the price to the overhead resistance of $0.57. A break and close above this barrier will complete the ascending triangle pattern, which could start an up move to the pattern target of $0.68.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the support line, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. That could sink the XRP/USDT pair to the crucial support at $0.46. A bounce off this level may keep the pair inside the $0.46 to $0.57 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($0.15) on June 3, indicating robust demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/a8be9a0d-adee-4df4-8329-eb6ed27af364.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance of $0.18, which is an important level to watch out for. If buyers pierce this resistance, the pair could rally to $0.21 and after that to $0.23.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. The short-term trend will turn negative on a break below the 50-day SMA. The pair may then slump to $0.14.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) skyrocketed above the $7.67 overhead resistance on June 5, but the long wick on the candlestick shows that the bears are aggressively defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/95508968-6952-479a-be08-9e2915b93e86.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, it is likely to find support at the 20-day EMA ($6.60). A strong rebound off this support will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. That will improve the prospects of a rally above $7.67. The TON/USDT pair may then climb to $10.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down sharply and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the pair may swing between $6 and $7.67 for a while.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bnb-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is the BNB price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to sink Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) below the support line on June 4, but the long tail on the candlestick shows solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/04ee2345-3a44-4944-ab5f-156ca545b545.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to push the price above the overhead resistance of $0.000030. If they manage to do that, the SHIB/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern. That could start an upmove toward the overhead resistance level of $0.000039. There is a minor resistance at $0.000033, but it will likely be crossed.\par \par \uc2 The support line remains the key level to watch out for on the downside because a close below it could sink the pair to $0.000018.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on June 3, signaling that the bulls continue to defend level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/c91a5052-d17c-4e7b-bbe4-65ddb0189508.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rises and maintains above the moving averages, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could gradually attempt a move to the resistance line. The bulls may find it difficult to push the price above the triangle, but if they do, the pair could pick up momentum and surge toward the pattern target of $0.62.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to drag the price below the triangle. If they succeed, the pair may tumble to $0.35.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the moving averages for the past few days, but the bears failed to extend the decline. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/10b5be36-6811-4d42-97f1-89125b9c0f4e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. If bulls drive the price above the moving averages, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $42.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated if the price turns down sharply and plummets below the $34 support. The pair could then reach the strong support of $29. A rebound off this level will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound for longer.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDYvYWE0M2VlMTAtZjcyYy00MGY0LWE2MWUtNDg3OWMyYThlNThhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240605ek650008k\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/3: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,593 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 June 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The bulls have stepped up their efforts to resume the up move in Bitcoin and select altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) bounced off its firm support, and the bulls are trying to push the price above the psychologically crucial level of $70,000. Several analysts believe the consolidation will resolve to the upside, and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bull-flag-joins-macd-to-tease-new-btc-price-all-time-high-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin will rise to a new all-time high}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Veteran trader Peter Brandt said in a report that Bitcoin's halving date historically falls {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-bull-run-130k-september-2025"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in the middle of the bull cycle}}}\uc2 . In 2020, the bull market started 16 months before the halving and topped out 18 months after the event. If Bitcoin follows a similar pattern, Brandt expects the cycle top to be \u8220\'20\'1Cin the $130,000 to $150,000 range.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/f415dcea-8bb4-4e6b-91b9-35274b5ab1e8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Not only Bitcoin but even Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) could surprise to the upside. According to CryptoQuant data, traders have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-etf-approval-eth-exodus-potential-supply-squeeze"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 withdrawn nearly 797,000 Ether}}}\uc2  between May 23 and June 2. Analysts expect Ether to witness a supply squeeze and hit a new all-time high after Ether exchange-traded funds start trading.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and select altcoins overcome their respective overhead resistance levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) fell below the breakout level of 5,265 on May 30 and reached the 50-day simple moving average (5,181) on May 31.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/72bb462c-910f-4931-9ef1-b7831c85816d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The solid rebound off the 50-day SMA suggests that the sentiment remains positive, and traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity. However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They will attempt to stall the relief rally in the 5,265 to 5,342 zone.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead zone and breaks below the 50-day SMA, it will signal the start of a deeper correction toward 5,000. On the other hand, if buyers shove the price above 5,342, the index could reach 5,500.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) turned down from the 50-day SMA (105) on May 30 and slipped below the support line of the ascending channel on June 3.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/51c51296-b503-4e85-acad-f37d7020b96b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day exponential moving average (105) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative zone give the bears a slight edge. If the price sustains below the channel, the index could decline to 103.17 and later to 102.35.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rises and breaks above the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that the breakdown was a bear trap. That could result in short covering, pushing the index to 105.75 and subsequently to 106.50.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears failed to sink and maintain Bitcoin below the support line of the triangle even after several attempts. That may have attracted buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/411c3197-f095-4707-8f32-3e64bb32eca5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the triangle will suggest that the uncertainty has resolved in favor of the bulls. The BTC/USDT pair could then attempt a rally to the strong overhead resistance at $73,777. If bulls pierce this level, the pair could skyrocket to $80,000.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to remain in the game, they will have to quickly drag the price below the triangle\u8217\'20\'19s support line. That will open the gates for a possible drop to the critical support at $59,600.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether has been holding above $3,730 for several days, signaling that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/162b3ec1-fe2b-467b-88de-834bf05b64cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($3,619) and the RSI in the positive zone suggest that the bulls have the upper hand. Buyers will try to clear the minor obstacle at $3,977 and challenge the overhead resistance of $4,100.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below $3,730, it will suggest that the bears are trying to make a comeback. The selling could pick up after bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA. The ETH/USDT pair may then slump to the 50-day SMA ($3,282).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 After trading in a small range for several days, BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rose sharply on June 3, signaling that the bulls are attempting to seize control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/6ddbb15d-bf3f-4197-8c12-c8b8472e9515.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the $635 resistance will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern. That could start the next leg of the uptrend to $692. This level is expected to behave as a significant barrier, but if crossed, the BNB/USDT pair may soar to the pattern target of $775.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down sharply from the overhead resistance and plunges below the uptrend line. Such a move will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup and pull the price to $536.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the breakout level of $162.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/0aca4144-bf80-4116-ac54-8e2188b10b3f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears prevail and sink the price below $162, the SOL/USDT pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($153). This level may act as a minor support but is likely to be broken. The pair may then slide to $140.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the downside, they will have to quickly push the price above $174. If they do that, the pair could rally to $189 and thereafter to $205. The bulls may find it difficult to conquer the $205 resistance.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the 20-day EMA ($0.52) for the past few days, but the bears have failed to sink the price below the support line. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/99149f99-7d38-4cca-b994-f66f2b4b8127.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to push the price above the moving averages. If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair will attempt a rally to the overhead resistance of $0.57. Buyers will have to overcome this barrier to complete the ascending triangle pattern.\par \par \uc2 The key level to watch out for on the downside is the support line. If the level cracks, the pair could tumble to the critical support at $0.46. A strong rebound off the support could keep the pair inside the $0.46 to $0.57 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-battles-key-resistance-100k-btc-price-magnet"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin battles key resistance as trader flags $100K BTC price 'magnet'}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) rallied sharply on June 2 and broke above the immediate overhead resistance at $6.73, signaling a slight advantage to the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/edfd2ecb-e1af-4918-8862-0223e5db70b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the buyers are struggling to sustain the higher levels. This suggests that the bears are selling in the zone between $7 and $7.67. If the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($6.43), it will suggest that the bulls are buying the dips. That will improve the prospects of a rally to $7.67.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. The near-term trend will favor the bears if they can sink the TON/USDT pair below $6.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the 50-day SMA ($0.15), indicating that the bulls are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/ae03f10f-ca54-4f1d-9dc1-611e34c3989b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to drive the price to the overhead resistance of $0.18. This is an important resistance to watch out for because a break and close above it will open the doors for a possible rally to $0.21.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from $0.18, it will signal that the bears are active at higher levels. That could keep the DOGE/USDT pair stuck between $0.18 and the 50-day SMA for a while. A break below the 50-day SMA will tilt the short-term advantage in favor of the bears. The pair may then dive toward $0.14.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to defend the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), signaling buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-06/4f37caf4-9037-427c-860f-f8bd439a9aa3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to drive the price above the moving averages to suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may extend its stay inside the triangle for some more time. The pair could then reach the resistance line where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will signal that every minor rise is being sold into. That will enhance the prospects of a break below the triangle. The pair could descend to the strong support at $0.35.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDYvMDBlNjFiZTktOTI2OC00Y2IxLTk0MDEtYjhmOTVmYzI4ZWZjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240603ek63000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
