 soared by 75% after breaking past its previous all-time high of $0.00001086. Over the last month, PEPE has surged by 153%, establishing a new all-time high at $0.00001723. This impressive rally was fueled by increased investor interest and a robust community rallying behind the coin.The week saw PEPE trading well above its previous highs, signifying strong \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. This growth spurt positioned PEPE as one of the top-performing altcoins, drawing attention from both retail and institutional investors. However, while PEPE\u8217\'20\'19s performance was noteworthy, it paled in comparison to the explosive growth witnessed by Retik Finance (RETIK).\par \par \uc2 Retik Finance\u8217\'20\'19s Phenomenal Presale Success\par \par \uc2 Retik Finance (RETIK) has recently pulled off what can only be described as a spectacular feat in the world of cryptocurrency. During its presale season, RETIK swiftly accumulated an astonishing $32,050,000 within just 70 days. This achievement far exceeded initial investor expectations, which projected that the presale would take approximately nine months to sell out 400 million RETIK tokens. Early investors in RETIK were handsomely rewarded with a quick 4x return on investment (ROI) during the presale period. The presale saw RETIK\u8217\'20\'19s price soar from $0.030 to $0.12. This meteoric rise set the stage for its launch on several major exchanges.\par \par \uc2 Explosive Launch and Market Debut\par \par \uc2 Last week, RETIK was listed on multiple prominent exchanges, including Uniswap, MEXC, Bitmart, LBank, CoinW, Digifinex, Bitrue, and P2PB2B. The trading debut was nothing short of phenomenal. Within hours of being listed, the price of Retik Token skyrocketed to an all-time high (ATH) of $3.02. This incredible surge brought RETIK\u8217\'20\'19s market capitalization close to $3 billion, cementing its status as a major player in the cryptocurrency market. From its initial presale price, RETIK offered investors a staggering 100x return, and from its launch price, a 20x return.\par \par \uc2 Retik Finance\u8217\'20\'19s Ecosystem and Staking\par \par \uc2 Retik Finance isn\u8217\'20\'19t just about its token price. The platform has also launched Retik Swap, an innovative feature that adds significant utility to the RETIK token. Investors can stake their RETIK tokens on the Retik Finance website, allowing them to earn additional rewards and participate in the growth of the platform. The ability to stake RETIK provides a passive income stream for investors, further enhancing the appeal of holding the token long-term. This staking mechanism, combined with the rapid appreciation of RETIK\u8217\'20\'19s value, has positioned Retik Finance as a formidable force in the crypto world.\par \par \uc2 Outpacing Major Cryptocurrencies\par \par \uc2 As of writing, Retik Finance\u8217\'20\'19s price has surpassed that of well-established cryptocurrencies like Polygon (MATIC) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ). This remarkable achievement highlights RETIK\u8217\'20\'19s exceptional performance and the strong market confidence it has garnered. The rapid rise of RETIK is a testament to the effectiveness of its presale strategy and the robust demand for its token. By surpassing major cryptocurrencies in such a short period, Retik Finance has demonstrated its potential to become a leading player in the market.\par \par \uc2 What\u8217\'20\'19s Next for Retik Finance?\par \par \uc2 The future looks bright for Retik Finance. With its strong presale performance, successful launch, and robust staking options, the platform is well-positioned for continued growth. The next phase of development will likely focus on expanding its ecosystem, integrating more DeFi functionalities, and enhancing its platform\u8217\'20\'19s usability. Investors and analysts will be closely watching RETIK\u8217\'20\'19s progress as it continues to develop and release new features. The early success of Retik Finance suggests that it has the potential to reshape the landscape of decentralized finance (DeFi).\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 Pepe Coin (PEPE) undoubtedly had a strong week, breaking new all-time highs and generating significant returns for its investors. However, the extraordinary performance of Retik Finance (RETIK) overshadowed PEPE\u8217\'20\'19s achievements. From its remarkable presale success to its explosive market debut and subsequent outperformance of major cryptocurrencies, RETIK has set a new standard in the crypto space. As the market continues to evolve, Retik Finance\u8217\'20\'19s innovative approach and robust platform could see it become one of the leading names in the industry. For now, investors can revel in the impressive returns and look forward to what the future holds for RETIK.\par \par \uc2 Visit the links below for more information about Retik Finance (RETIK):\par \par \uc2 Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://retik.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://retik.com}}}\par \par \uc2 Whitepaper: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://retik.com/retik-whitepaper.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://retik.com/retik-whitepaper.pdf}}}\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.twitter.com/retikfinance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.twitter.com/retikfinance}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.t.me/retikfinance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.t.me/retikfinance}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240601ek5v00003\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/31: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, SHIB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,505 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Analysts believe that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s consolidation is likely to break out to the upside.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound for several days, indicating a tussle between the bulls and the bears for supremacy. Trading firm Mosaic Asset believes that \u8220\'20\'1Cloosening financial conditions\u8221\'20\'1D could boost a risk-on trade, and Bitcoin could be on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-69k-hot-us-macro-dollar"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 verge of a breakout}}}\uc2  to the upside.\par \par \uc2 CryptoQuant founder and CEO Ki Young Ju said in a post on X that Bitcoin remained near $10,000 for six months in 2020 with high on-chain activity before skyrocketing to $64,000 in 2021. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whale-accumulation-2024-cryptoquant-ceo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 A similar trend was being seen in 2024}}}\uc2 , with \u8220\'20\'1C$1B added daily to new whale wallets, likely custody.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/d5907e8a-6f20-4db0-b857-ccc376235119.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Although a breakout has eluded Bitcoin, the bulls have achieved nearly an 11% rally in May. That is the first positive close after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-monthly-close-above-69k-epic-new-analysis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 three years of negative monthly performance in May}}}\uc2 . That gives positive momentum to the buyers to extend the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  performance in June.\par \par \uc2 Could buyers defend the support levels in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rebounded off the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on May 30, but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/4ceba974-e962-48e9-9eff-2dd122698285.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to shove the price above the triangle to gain the upper hand. That could start a rally to the overhead resistance of $73,777. The bears are expected to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price continues lower and breaks below the support line, it will suggest that the bears have seized control. The BTC/USDT pair could then tumble to $64,600 and eventually to the crucial support at $59,600. The bulls are likely to buy in the zone between $56,550 and $59,600.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is once again attempting to bounce off the breakout level of $3,730, signaling that the bulls are defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/72aad624-89bd-4d85-90c7-38630aea891b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($3,559) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that the bulls have the upper hand. Buyers will try to propel the price to the stiff overhead resistance of $4,100. This is an important level for the bears to defend because a break above it will clear the path for a rally to $4,868.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the ETH/USDT pair turns down and breaks below $3,730, it will suggest that the positive momentum has weakened. The advantage will tilt in favor of the bears if they yank the price below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually slipping toward the uptrend line, which is likely to act as a strong support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/69690583-e53b-4299-8c1d-6f9a9a23ceaf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the uptrend line with force, the bulls will again try to push the BNB/USDT pair to the overhead resistance at $635. If this level is scaled, the pair will complete an ascending triangle pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a pattern target of $775.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price dives below the uptrend line, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern. That could accelerate selling and sink the pair to $536 and subsequently to the vital support at $495.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to start a strong bounce in Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) from the 20-day EMA ($165) shows a lack of demand at the current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/e3eeb39e-1ae9-418a-ad9d-fa43a510310d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position by pulling the price below $162. If they do that, the SOL/USDT pair could drop toward $140. There is a minor support at the 50-day SMA ($152) but it is unlikely to hold.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $174, it will suggest that the bulls are trying to retain the advantage. The pair could then climb to $189 and eventually to $205.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears are pulling XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) below the moving averages. If they succeed, the next stop is likely to be the support line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/fac66c24-26c8-4023-9481-d123a436c050.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have defended the support line on three previous occasions, hence they will try to do that again. If the price rebounds off the support line with strength, the XRP/USDT pair could rise to $0.57. A break and close above $0.57 will complete the ascending triangle pattern, which has a pattern target of $0.68.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price continues lower and breaks below the support line, it will suggest that the bulls have given up. The pair may then plunge to the critical support at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to maintain Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages, indicating that the bears are selling on every minor recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/a3ac9a4d-234a-4f98-94d1-2a0746917b6f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price skids below the 50-day SMA ($0.15), the DOGE/USDT pair could decline to $0.14. This level may act as a floor, but if broken, the slide could extend to the crucial support at $0.12.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off $0.14, it will signal demand at lower levels. The pair may then consolidate between $0.14 and $0.18 for a while. A break and close above $0.18 will open the doors for a rally to $0.21.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) continues to trade near the moving averages, indicating a lack of aggressive buying or selling by the traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/01775559-5ed9-4856-9855-f913cd8f3ba8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($6.39) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest that the range-bound action between $4.72 and $7.67 may extend for a few more days. If the price breaks below $6, the short-term advantage could tilt in favor of the bears. The TON/USDT pair could then drop to $4.72.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break above $6.73 will suggest that the bulls are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair may then climb to $7.67.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-solid-bitcoin-indicators-predicting-btc-price-75k-in-june"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3 solid Bitcoin indicators predicting BTC \b  \highlight22price rise\b0 \highlight22  to $75K in June}}}\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Tha failure of the bulls to push Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $0.000030 has resulted in a pullback to the 20-day EMA ($0.000025).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/c41dba76-55c1-44be-bc3c-278376b847e7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the moving averages, the bulls will again try to drive the SHIB/USDT pair above $0.000030. If they manage to do that, the pair could rally to $0.000033 and after that to $0.000039.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price continues lower and breaks below the support line, it will signal that the bears are attempting a comeback. The pair may then slump to $0.000018, where the buyers are likely to step in.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) continued lower and reached the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern. The bulls are expected to defend the level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/1f13ece0-4518-4907-b2ae-658985d19234.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off the support line and rises above the moving averages, it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may remain inside the triangle for some more time. A break and close above the triangle could start a strong up move toward $0.62.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below the support line, it will signal that the uncertainty has resolved in favor of the bears. That could start a downward move toward the next support at $0.35.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between $29 and $40 for the past few days, signaling a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/599cfb42-3b7c-4911-867f-a8d29b2d742a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price skids below the 50-day SMA ($36), the bears will attempt to pull the AVAX/USDT pair to the strong support at $29. This level is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls, keeping the pair inside the range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 The next directional move is likely to begin after the price breaks above $42 or below $29. If the $42 level is taken out, the pair may surge to $50. On the downside, a break below $29 could sink the pair to $20.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvMzBkOTM1NmEtOTkxNy00ZjU0LWIwNzgtOTNmYmZiOWUzMTJkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240531ek5v000bc\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 why is bitcoin price down\par \b \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price down today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 653 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price fails to find footing at key support levels, leading some traders to fear a longer wait before a return to all-time highs.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price dropped 3.5% to as low as $66,584 on May 31 as the broader market correction reinforced BTC\u8217\'20\'19s resistance at the $69,000 level. BTC is now trading 9% below its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-new-73-6-k-all-time-high-etfs-eat#:~:text=Data%20from%20Cointelegraph%20Markets%20Pro,dip%20before%20abruptly%20heading%20higher."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $73,835 all-time high reached on March 14}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/b21ceb8b-7868-48f9-9e41-4d135407842d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/YbWa0yVI/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.tradingview.com/x/YbWa0yVI/}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/IrzodOwi/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC drop below $68,000 leads to a marketwide sell-off\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price fell below $68,000 at the Wall Street open on May 31, causing a marketwide sell-off that saw the global crypto market capitalization drop 2.2% over the past 24 hours to rest at $2.5 trillion, according to data from CoinMarketCap.\par \par \uc2 Other top 10 non-stablecoin cryptocurrencies are also flashing red, with Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) down 0.8% over the last 24 hours. Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), BNB Chain\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2 , Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) have slumped more than 2% over the same time period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/dae03515-eb25-418a-842d-1bbe01df2960.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top 10 cryptocurrencies by market capitalization. Source: CoinMarketCap\par \par \uc2 Memecoin\u8217\'20\'19s were also tumbling after recording an impressive performance over the last few days. Just like DOGE, Shiba Inu\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  is down 6.4%. The new memecoins in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-memecoin-presales-hit-peak-degeneracy-over-one-hundred-million"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ecosystem}}}\uc2 , Dogwifhat (WIF) and Book of Meme (BOME), each recorded the largest losses of more than 5%.\par \par \uc2 Independent crypto trader Bloodgood observed the slump in memecoins, saying that when the frenzy is over, \u8220\'20\'1Ccapital will rotate to quality.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/135c5324-5150-4ea0-946f-794a351f9495.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/bloodgoodBTC/status/1796451576762290609"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloodgood}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC longs rekt\par \par \uc2 The broader liquidation of long positions versus the short ones has further fueled Bitcoin's underperformance today.\par \par \uc2 Notably, the Bitcoin derivatives market has witnessed approximately $144 million worth of liquidations in the last 24 hours, out of which $105.14 million were long. When long positions are liquidated, it generally involves selling off the asset (voluntarily or by the broker), which can drive the price down further.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/0df69f91-db9f-46cd-b4e1-164133813721.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market's liquidation heatmap. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin's open interest (OI) has flattened around $33 billion but remains lower compared to its 2024 peak of around $39.3 billion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/db145e56-8125-4e29-a843-394a480e0849.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin OI in recent weeks. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the cryptocurrency's funding rate is positive at 0.016% per week, showing the interest longs are ready to pay short to keep their positions open. Still, the funding rate has dropped significantly compared to its 2024 peak of over 2% per week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/70f83474-2c0c-4aae-8cf2-fde7faf29529.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin funding rate in recent weeks. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 The substantial drop in the funding rate and a reduced open interest from its peak might suggest a reduction in speculative trading or a decrease in overall market confidence.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-ether-options-expiry-impact"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $8.2B in Bitcoin and Ether options expire, here\u8217\'20\'19s how it could impact the markets}}}\par \par \uc2 It could also reflect a shift in trader expectations about future price movements, possibly anticipating less \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  or fewer strong upward price movements.\par \par \uc2 BTC price faces stiff resistance from the $69,000 level\par \par \uc2 From a technical perspective, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price decline today is part of a failed attempt to scale higher after testing a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/traders-say-bitcoin-price-fights-last-resistance-at-69k-before-new-all-time-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 key resistance}}}\uc2  from its old all-time highs at $69,000. This barrier has underpinned the BTC price over the last 10 weeks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/9d962fc0-774a-48ea-8217-b6e89c96712f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD weekly price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 According to this setup, following the resistance line breach, the price could climb higher, potentially steering BTC towards all-time highs above $73,800 and later into price discovery.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTEvZDM2MDViNmItMGVmZi00NmY2LWE0NmYtYjE1ZWMzYjNlY2JlLmpwZWc=.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240531ek5v000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, SHIB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,486 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s range-bound action has not stopped investors from snapping up Bitcoin ETFs.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) remains in sideways price action, but a positive sign is that the investors have continued to buy the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds. Farside Investors data shows {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-due-new-all-time-high-ether-etf-nears-end"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 net positive inflows into the ETFs}}}\uc2  for the past 11 days.\par \par \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  data shows that Bitcoin investment products saw more than $1 billion in inflows last week. Along with institutional investors, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-investment-inflows-hit-1b-as-long-term-holders-accumulate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 whales also seem to be accumulating Bitcoin}}}\uc2 . Glassnode analysts said in The Week On-chain report that long-term investors were \u8220\'20\'1Cbeginning to re-accumulate coins for the first time since Dec 2023.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/5f0fa914-6a07-49f7-98c0-30c4384f0793.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 According to the \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  filings, more than {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-income-bond-funds-buy-bitcoin-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 600 United States investment firms have invested}}}\uc2  in spot Bitcoin ETFs since January. The ETFs have bought 855,619 Bitcoin since launch, with an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-exchange-traded-products-hold-over-1-million-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 average of 6,200 Bitcoin per day}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Could the buying in Bitcoin ETFs boost Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price above the overhead resistance? Will the altcoins also follow? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to propel and maintain the price above $70,000 has pulled Bitcoin to the 20-day exponential moving average ($67,169).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/c4a0098a-6ad1-4ada-8b8f-abdcb178bfff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a symmetrical triangle formation. If the price breaks below the triangle, it will signal that the advantage has tilted in favor of the bears. The pair could drop to $64,600 and eventually to $59,600.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the support line and breaks above the triangle, it will indicate that the bulls remain in command. The pair will then attempt a move to $73,777. If bulls overcome this obstacle, the rally could reach $80,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $3,977 on May 27, signaling that the bears are fiercely defending the $4,000 to $4,100 resistance zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/e91676d9-d2e7-4202-89c0-1e143b9bb2ba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is the breakout level of $3,730. If bulls flip this level into support, the ETH/USDT pair will make one more attempt to surge above the $4,100 resistance. If this level is cleared, the pair may rally to $4,868.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price continues lower and plummets below $3,730, it will signal that the bears are trying to make a comeback. The pair may then drop to the 20-day EMA ($3.,537) and subsequently to $3.050.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have kept BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages for the past few days but failed to push the price to the overhead resistance of $635.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/17e82068-f6e9-4819-9ab1-49e4442f0733.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the uptrend line. If that happens, the ascending triangle pattern will be negated, and the BNB/USDT pair could slide to $536 and then to $495.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price bounces off the moving averages and breaks above $635, it will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. The pair could then travel to $692 and later to the pattern target of $775.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have successfully held \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the breakout level of $162 but have been unable to start a strong recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/dbf0a1e4-2ac9-441c-b4f8-e683d11b1daf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Failure to move higher will encourage the bears to tug the price below $162. If they manage to do that, the SOL/USDT pair could tumble toward $140 and subsequently to critical support near $116.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price moves up from the current level, the SOL/USDT pair could reach $189. The bears will try to stall the relief rally at $189, but the level is likely to be crossed. The pair may then reach the formidable barrier at $205.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been clinging to the moving averages for the past few days, indicating a lack of aggressive buying or selling by the traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/0dff7392-9a77-4c14-a95c-00c188e130f3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price dips and maintains below the moving averages, the XRP/USDT pair could slide to the support line. If the price rebounds off the support line with strength, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the pair above $0.57. If they succeed, the ascending triangle pattern will complete.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break and close below the support line will invalidate the triangle and open the door for a fall to the crucial support at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have not allowed Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) to slide below the 20-day EMA ($0.16), indicating that the dips are being purchased.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/8e193d8b-e145-46e3-93d2-d070cbce43f7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. If buyers overcome the barrier at $0.18, the DOGE/USDT pair is likely to ride up to $0.21.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the bulls have given up. That could sink the price to $0.14 and keep the pair inside the $0.12 to $0.17 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) has been finding support at the moving averages, but the bulls are struggling to start a strong rebound off it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/a4b7aea7-0e83-4463-9741-5adda27619b2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers will gain the upper hand if they drive and sustain the price above $6.73. If they do that, the TON/USDT pair could start a rally to the overhead resistance of $7.67. This is an important level for the bears to defend because a break above it will signal the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to quickly drag the price below the $6 support. The pair could slide to $5.50 and thereafter to the strong support at $4.72.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-cut-selling-by-nearly-50-73-8-k-research"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin 'diamond hands' cut selling by nearly 50% at $73.8K}}}\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) surged above the symmetrical triangle pattern on May 27, indicating that the uncertainty resolved in favor of the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/5a80397f-a2ba-4ae6-bc02-2fb9dfd9304e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.000025) has started to turn up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive territory, signaling that the bulls have the upper hand. There is a minor resistance at $0.000030, but it is likely to be crossed. The SHIB/USDT pair may then climb to $0.000033.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, it is likely to find support at the moving averages. The bears will have to pull the price below the support line to start a decline toward the 78.6% retracement level of $0.000017.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) remains stuck inside a symmetrical triangle pattern, signaling a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/2c8fff70-047c-460a-8117-492162174341.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rises above the moving averages, the bulls will try to push the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to the resistance line. A break and close above the triangle will signal the start of a strong recovery. The pair may climb to $0.57 and then to $0.63.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price continues lower, the bears will try to pull the pair to the support line. A break and close below the triangle will indicate the resumption of the downtrend. The next level to watch on the downside is $0.35.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) is trying to take support at the moving averages, indicating that the bulls are buying on minor dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/9339d0b6-1167-4eae-9acd-045259022cef.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($36.97) and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. Buyers will have to shove and maintain the price above $41.80 to start the rally toward $50.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price breaks below the moving averages, the bears will try to pull the AVAX/USDT pair to $29. A strong bounce off this support will signal that the pair may remain stuck inside the $29 to $40 range for some time.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvNjQ3NzNlMjktYzJhMi00OTc3LWFhNzItMGYxZmI4MDcxZDM1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240530ek5u0002w\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Binance\par \b \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Cointelegraph \par \uc2 609 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 A lot happened in crypto today! Cointelegraph explores the latest events impacting the Bitcoin price, altcoins, DeFi, Web3, NFTs and more.\par \par \uc2 Analysts are now tipping a late June or early July launch for U.S. spot Ether ETFs as S-1 filings are beginning to come in. Crypto exchange \uc2 Gemini\uc2  will begin distributing billions of dollars locked up in its now-defunct lending program; and bad news for Cardano: The recent rush of memecoin launches knocked it out of the crypto top 10.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum ETF June launch \u8216\'20\'18legit possibility\u8217\'20\'19 as \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  files S-1\par \par \uc2 United States spot Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) exchange-traded funds (ETFs) have a \u8220\'20\'1Clegit possibility\u8221\'20\'1D of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ether-etf-launch-june-possible-blackrock-amended-s-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launching by late June}}}\uc2 , according to analysts, after \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  updated a key filing necessary for launch.\par \par \uc2 On May 29, \uc2 BlackRock{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2000638/000143774924018610/iset20240522_s1a.htm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 updated}}}\uc2  its Form S-1 for its iShares Ethereum Trust (ETHA) with the \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  nearly a week after the regulator approved {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-spot-ether-etf-approved"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 its 19b-4 filing}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 both need approval for the ETF to start trading.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/97c96b30-8a39-4aab-8edf-491b1448bf46.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CGood sign. [Probably] see rest roll in soon.\u8221\'20\'1D Bloomberg ETF analyst \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2  said in a May 29 X {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/EricBalchunas/status/1795934675380109479"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 post}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 There will likely be another round to \u8220\'20\'1Cfine tune\u8221\'20\'1D SEC comments, he added \u8212\'20\'14 but an \u8220\'20\'1Cend of June launch [is] a legit possibility.\u8221\'20\'1D However, Balchunas kept his approval odds for around July 4, adding that an earlier approval would be a \u8220\'20\'1Clong shot.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Gemini\uc2  set to return $2.18B to Earn users\par \par \uc2 Following an 18-month withdrawal freeze, cryptocurrency exchange \uc2 Gemini\uc2  has announced that it will {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/gemini-returns-2-18-billion-earn-users"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 distribute $2.18 billion}}}\uc2  to users of the Earn lending program.\par \par \uc2 According to the May 29 announcement, \uc2 Gemini\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Earn users will be made whole for participating in the now-defunct program. When the distributions are complete, users will have received 232% of the value of their digital assets back. That includes initial deposits, plus any appreciation of assets that were lent out through the Earn program.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis means, for example, if you had lent one Bitcoin in the Earn program, you will receive one Bitcoin back. And it means that you will receive any and all appreciation of your assets since you lent them into the Earn program,\u8221\'20\'1D the company said on X.\par \par \uc2 The distribution was announced after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/genesis-global-secures-court-approval-for-3b-payout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto lending firm Genesis}}}\uc2  was recently approved to pay out $3 billion in creditor claims. \uc2 Gemini\uc2  had billions of dollars in client funds locked up at \uc2 Genesis\uc2  when the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-lender-genesis-files-for-bankruptcy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lender filed for bankruptcy}}}\uc2  in January 2023.\par \par \uc2 Memecoin mania sees Cardano knocked out of the top 10 crypto rankings\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  memecoin run over the past couple of weeks has helped {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/memecoin-mania-cardano-out-top-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Shiba Inu dethrone Cardano}}}\uc2  from the top-10 crypto rankings by market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 The memecoin mania has seen another \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  run over the past couple of weeks, with Pepe ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/pepe-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PEPE}}}\uc2  ), Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ), Dogwifhat (WIF) and several others touching new all-time highs (ATHs). Many of these memecoins have dethroned several crypto heavyweights.\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), once ranked third in the crypto rankings during the 2020-21 bull run, is currently placed 11th after SHIB. Shiba Inu currently has a market cap of $16.4 billion, while Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s market cap is $16.3 billion.\par \par \uc2 \u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0BCardano is trading at $0.45, more than 80% below its all-time high of over $3.10. At a time when Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and other altcoins have recovered most of their losses from the last cycle and some are making new ATHs, Cardano, similar to \uc2 Ripple\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), seems to be stuck in a price range.\par \par \uc2 Additional reporting by Geraint Price, Sam Bourgi and Felix Ng.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDYvNzhkNzg3NjEtM2JkMi00NTY5LTk2YTctNjJhOTdmMGExYjBhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240530ek5t0000b\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Binance\par \b \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Cointelegraph \par \uc2 608 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 A lot happened in crypto today! Cointelegraph explores the latest events impacting the Bitcoin price, altcoins, DeFi, Web3, NFTs and more.\par \par \uc2 Crypto exchange \uc2 Gemini\uc2  will begin distributing billions of dollars locked up in its now-defunct lending program. Bad news for Cardano: The recent rush of memecoin launches knocked it out of the crypto top 10. Meanwhile, former \uc2 FTX\uc2  executive \uc2 Ryan Salame\uc2  was sentenced to 7.5 years in prisreceived a 7.5-year prison sentence on May 28.\par \par \uc2 Gemini\uc2  set to return $2.18B to Earn users\par \par \uc2 Following an 18-month withdrawal freeze, cryptocurrency exchange \uc2 Gemini\uc2  has announced that it will {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/gemini-returns-2-18-billion-earn-users"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 distribute $2.18 billion}}}\uc2  to users of the Earn lending program.\par \par \uc2 According to the May 29 announcement, \uc2 Gemini\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Earn users will be made whole for participating in the now-defunct program. When the distributions are complete, users will have received 232% of the value of their digital assets back. That includes initial deposits, plus any appreciation of assets that were lent out through the Earn program.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis means, for example, if you had lent one Bitcoin in the Earn program, you will receive one Bitcoin back. And it means that you will receive any and all appreciation of your assets since you lent them into the Earn program,\u8221\'20\'1D the company said on X.\par \par \uc2 The distribution was announced after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/genesis-global-secures-court-approval-for-3b-payout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto lending firm Genesis}}}\uc2  was recently approved to pay out $3 billion in creditor claims. \uc2 Gemini\uc2  had billions of dollars in client funds locked up at \uc2 Genesis\uc2  when the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-lender-genesis-files-for-bankruptcy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lender filed for bankruptcy}}}\uc2  in January 2023.\par \par \uc2 Memecoin mania sees Cardano knocked out of the top 10 crypto rankings\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  memecoin run over the past couple of weeks has helped {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/memecoin-mania-cardano-out-top-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Shiba Inu dethrone Cardano}}}\uc2  from the top-10 crypto rankings by market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 The memecoin mania has seen another \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  run over the past couple of weeks, with Pepe ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/pepe-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PEPE}}}\uc2  ), Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ), Dogwifhat (WIF) and several others touching new all-time highs (ATHs). Many of these memecoins have dethroned several crypto heavyweights.\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), once ranked third in the crypto rankings during the 2020-21 bull run, is currently placed 11th after SHIB. Shiba Inu currently has a market cap of $16.4 billion, while Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s market cap is $16.3 billion.\par \par \uc2 \u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0BCardano is trading at $0.45, more than 80% below its all-time high of over $3.10. At a time when Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and other altcoins have recovered most of their losses from the last cycle and some are making new ATHs, Cardano, similar to \uc2 Ripple\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), seems to be stuck in a price range.\par \par \uc2 Former \uc2 FTX\uc2  executive sentenced to prison\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ftx-exec-ryan-salame-sentenced-guilty-plea"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ryan Salame}}}\uc2 , the former co-CEO of \uc2 FTX Digital Markets\uc2 , was slapped with a 7.5-year prison sentence on May 28.\par \par \uc2 Judge Lewis Kaplan handed down the sentence in the U.S. District Court for the Southern District of New York. Salame was found guilty of conspiracy to operate an unlicensed money transmitting business and engaging in fraudulent campaign financing. He {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ftx-exec-plead-guilty-criminal-charges"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pleaded guilty to the charges}}}\uc2  in September 2023.\par \par \uc2 "\uc2 Ryan Salame\uc2  agreed to advance the interests of \uc2 FTX\uc2 , \uc2 Alameda Research\uc2 , and his co-conspirators through an unlawful political influence campaign and through an unlicensed money transmitting business, which helped \uc2 FTX\uc2  grow faster and larger by operating outside of the law,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.justice.gov/usao-sdny/pr/former-ftx-executive-ryan-salame-sentenced-90-months-prison"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  U.S. Attorney \uc2 Damian Williams\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ftx-bahamas-co-ceo-ryan-salame-blew-the-whistle-on-ftx-and-sam-bankman-fried"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Salame exposed FTX's fraud}}}\uc2  in November 2022, mere days before \uc2 Sam Bankman-Fried\uc2  stepped down as CEO. In March, Bankman-Fried was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sam-bankman-fried-sentenced-years-prison-hold"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sentenced to 25 years in prison}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Additional reporting by Geraint Price, Sam Bourgi and Felix Ng.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDYvNzhkNzg3NjEtM2JkMi00NTY5LTk2YTctNjJhOTdmMGExYjBhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240529ek5t000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Binance\par \b \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Cointelegraph \par \uc2 622 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 A lot happened in crypto today! Cointelegraph explores the latest events impacting the Bitcoin price, altcoins, DeFi, Web3, NFTs and more.\par \par \uc2 Bad news for Cardano as the recent rush of memecoin launches knocks it out of the crypto top 10. Former \uc2 FTX\uc2  executive \uc2 Ryan Salame\uc2  received a 7.5-year prison sentence on May 28. A memecoin created by ChatGPT has reached a valuation of $638 million in a little over a year.\par \par \uc2 Memecoin mania sees Cardano knocked out of the top 10 crypto rankings\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  memecoin run over the past couple of weeks has helped {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/memecoin-mania-cardano-out-top-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Shiba Inu dethrone Cardano}}}\uc2  from the top-10 crypto rankings by market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 The memecoin mania has seen another \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  run over the past couple of weeks, with Pepe ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/pepe-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PEPE}}}\uc2  ), Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ), Dogwifhat (WIF) and several others touching new all-time highs (ATHs). Many of these memecoins have dethroned several crypto heavyweights.\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), once ranked third in the crypto rankings during the 2020-21 bull run, is currently placed 11th after SHIB. Shiba Inu currently has a market cap of $16.4 billion, while Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s market cap is $16.3 billion.\par \par \uc2 \u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0BCardano is trading at $0.45, more than 80% below its all-time high of over $3.10. At a time when Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and other altcoins have recovered most of their losses from the last cycle and some are making new ATHs, Cardano, similar to \uc2 Ripple\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), seems to be stuck in a price range.\par \par \uc2 Former \uc2 FTX\uc2  executive sentenced to prison\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ftx-exec-ryan-salame-sentenced-guilty-plea"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ryan Salame}}}\uc2 , the former co-CEO of \uc2 FTX Digital Markets\uc2 , was slapped with a 7.5-year prison sentence on May 28.\par \par \uc2 Judge Lewis Kaplan handed down the sentence in the U.S. District Court for the Southern District of New York. Salame was found guilty of conspiracy to operate an unlicensed money transmitting business and engaging in fraudulent campaign financing. He {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ftx-exec-plead-guilty-criminal-charges"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pleaded guilty to the charges}}}\uc2  in September 2023.\par \par \uc2 "\uc2 Ryan Salame\uc2  agreed to advance the interests of \uc2 FTX\uc2 , \uc2 Alameda Research\uc2 , and his co-conspirators through an unlawful political influence campaign and through an unlicensed money transmitting business, which helped \uc2 FTX\uc2  grow faster and larger by operating outside of the law,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.justice.gov/usao-sdny/pr/former-ftx-executive-ryan-salame-sentenced-90-months-prison"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  U.S. Attorney \uc2 Damian Williams\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ftx-bahamas-co-ceo-ryan-salame-blew-the-whistle-on-ftx-and-sam-bankman-fried"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Salame exposed FTX's fraud}}}\uc2  in November 2022, mere days before \uc2 Sam Bankman-Fried\uc2  stepped down as CEO. In March, Bankman-Fried was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sam-bankman-fried-sentenced-years-prison-hold"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sentenced to 25 years in prison}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 ChatGPT-coded memecoin reaches $638 million market cap\par \par \uc2 A memecoin created using the popular \uc2 OpenAI\uc2  chatbot ChatGPT with an initial budget of $69 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/turbo-memecoin-chatgpt-surges-638m"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reached a valuation}}}\uc2  of $638 million over a year after it was first deployed.\par \par \uc2 On May 28, prices for the memecoin called Turbo surged to a new all-time high of $0.009302. This boosted the meme token\u8217\'20\'19s market capitalization to about $638 million, according to coin information tracker CoinGecko.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/aa90175a-8933-43b7-bc24-cddc4c76c7d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 1-year price chart for the Turbo token. Source: CoinGecko\par \par \uc2 The meme token saw significant gains in the last three months, catapulting from a $27 million valuation to over $600 million. This indicates a 2,262% increase in market capitalization over the past 90 days.\par \par \uc2 Digital artist Rhett Mankind, the creator of Turbo, believes that the token\u8217\'20\'19s success can be attributed to its decentralized nature. On the project\u8217\'20\'19s official website, Mankind mentioned that the token \u8220\'20\'1Cexploded in popularity\u8221\'20\'1D due to his lack of involvement in its management.\par \par \uc2 Mankind {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rhett/status/1650265724198465538"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 created}}}\uc2  the Turbo memecoin in April 2023. The digital artist used creative prompts to guide the artificial intelligence (AI) chatbot in making what he described as \u8220\'20\'1Cthe next great\u8221\'20\'1D memecoin.\par \par \uc2 Additional reporting by Geraint Price, Sam Bourgi and Felix Ng.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/i