 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscription.cointelegraph.com/?_gl=1*7499wx*_ga*MTQ0MzQ0NzI4Ny4xNzE2MzY1NTA0*_ga_53R24TEEB1*MTcxNjM2NTUwNC4xLjEuMTcxNjM2Njg2MC4wLjAuMA.."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD hovering below $68,000 after spiking to weekly highs.\par \par \uc2 The trip to $70,600 during the Memorial Day holiday in the United States came without institutional involvement, for example in the form of demand for the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs).\par \par \uc2 Despite rapidly gaining momentum, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s latest rally failed to endure for long before the market retraced all of its progress.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  came amid {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/mt-gox-labeled-bitcoin-wallet-moves-millions-new-address"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new movement of BTC worth $7 billion}}}\uc2  from wallets linked to defunct exchange \uc2 Mt. Gox\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAnd there is a full retrace of that recent pump as expected,\u8221\'20\'1D popular trader Credible Crypto wrote in part of his {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/CredibleCrypto/status/1795304320654774459"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ongoing commentary}}}\uc2  on X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ).\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CLet\u8217\'20\'19s see what kind of reaction we get here at the lows.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/72d6e75d-4938-48be-bf35-2ca3a2a523a6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC liquidation heatmap (screenshot). Source: CoinGlass\par \par \uc2 The latest data from monitoring resource {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coinglass.com/pro/futures/LiquidationHeatMap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinGlass}}}\uc2  highlighted liquidity concentrations around spot price, with the area around $67,000 now the nearest point of interest below.\par \par \uc2 Responding to the past 24 hours\u8217\'20\'19 moves, fellow trader Daan Crypto Trades revealed a positive impact on market structure \u8212\'20\'14 a removal of leverage.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAll positions entered during yesterday's move were flushed out and the funding rate is back to neutral,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/DaanCrypto/status/1795345433101037824/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  on X alongside a chart of open interest data.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CETH is a bit stronger still but as long as BTC is within its bigger range we'll keep seeing more of this low timeframe chop.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/139338c1-7f67-4713-aec6-75152c87bfec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD chart. Source: Credible Crypto/X\par \par \uc2 BTC price performance thus continued to hinge on overcoming key resistance and flipping it to support.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  BTC price visions unfazed\par \par \uc2 As {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-preps-most-parabolic-phase-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph reported}}}\uc2 , the greatest challenge remains the 2021 all-time highs of $69,000 and the subsequent trip to $73,800 this year.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-5-27-spx-dxy-btc-eth-bnb-sol-xrp-ton-doge-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 5/27: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Zooming out, popular trader Jelle revealed a mere consolidatory structure on monthly timeframes despite the lack of upward momentum since March.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/1f85f1da-80b7-4f64-bf8e-a06d9eddb069.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: Jelle\par \par \uc2 In a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/CryptoJelleNL/status/1795358830039371902/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 further post}}}\uc2 , he considered a broader BTC price range in place all the way since mid-2017 \u8212\'20\'14 when BTC/USD hit historical all-time highs of $20,000 two cycles ago.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin has spent the past 6.5 years inside this rising channel, and I don't expect that to change anytime soon,\u8221\'20\'1D he confirmed.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf history is any indication, it's time for another trip towards the highs of the channel. 6-figure Bitcoin is coming.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/f890cd16-256a-4e7e-b609-3acac1a0a4ab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD chart. Source: Jelle/X\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvYzFlNTcxNzctOGY1ZC00OGMyLWEwOGMtZjg4NjY5ZDk1Y2FjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240528ek5s0002u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
