allows different financial systems and institutions to connect and work together more easily. With the altcoin price at $0.09534 as of April 13, it experienced a massive boost within six weeks, making it to trade at $0.01115 on May 24, marking almost 15% increase.\par \par \uc2 One of the key triggers to the current boost in the value of Stellar, was a recent announcement on a series of network upgrades. Firstly, on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/community/post/336375079/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 May 30}}}\uc2 , the team behind Stellar platform plans to release stable versions of the core Stellar software. The core Stellar software is a replicated stage machine that maintains a local copy of a cryptographic ledger and processes transactions against it.\par \par \uc2 After core Stellar release, a Testnet reset on June 11 will follow, allowing developers to begin testing the features of Protocol 21, an upgrade launched on May 14, aimed at enhancing Smart Contracts. Finally, on June 18th, the Stellar community will vote to officially activate the Protocol 21 on the main Stellar blockchain.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) soars 9.5% on real-fi launch: ushering in a new era for blockchain finance\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) as mentioned earlier is among the top altcoins rallying up amid the market bull run, with the token experiencing a 9.5% surge within the past 10 days, to trade at a current price of $0.461. This surge was attributed to the launch of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/community/articles/664f690a2500562ca878bcd1/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Real-Fi}}}\uc2 , a new initiative by the Cardanoblockchain platform, which is famous for its scientific approach and is poised to initiate a new era for the blockchain industry.\par \par \uc2 The primary goal of Real-Fi is to create genuine financial services and products for Cardanousers, such as loans, mortgages, insurance, and other traditional financial instruments, but built using blockchain technology..\par \par \uc2 Can Raboo trigger the meme coin revolution and rally 1000x? Experts weigh in\par \par \uc2 While top altcoins maximize the overall \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend of the market to deliver remarkable gains for investors, Raboo also stands at the forefront, introducing unique and advanced technology blended with Social-Fi features. With a target to revolutionize the meme sector by allowing investors to monetize their content and earn token rewards, as well as enjoy real-world applications of virtual economies, Raboo continues to flaunt its potential of becoming one of the best altcoins to invest in 2024.\par \par \uc2 According to experts, Raboo's Social-Fi features will significantly transform the way people use cryptocurrencies, as it seeks to combine elements of social media engagement with financial incentives to create a dynamic and interactive platform. Furthermore, as users take part in the platform's meme-generating challenges, competitions, and special giveaways, they can expect interesting rewards based on their creative skills.\par \par \uc2 In addition to its Social-Fi features, Raboo boasts significant surge potential up to 1000x in the current bull run. This makes Raboo a compelling choice for those seeking opportunities that offer both financial rewards and community engagement. Moreover, with $RABT currently in stage 3 of its presale selling at just $0.0042 per token, investors have the opportunity to gain entry into the $62 billion meme market at an affordable price while anticipating the potential 100x rally at launch.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 Amid the current market bull run, Stellar has seen gains due to planned network upgrades. Similarly Cardano has also rallied due to the launch of its Real-Fi initiative, which brings real financial services to the blockchain. Interestingly, Raboo, a newcomer, has caught the eyes of many investors with its unique Social-Fi features that aim to revolutionize the meme sector. Experts believe this new cryptocurrency could transform the industry and see a significant surge potentially up to 1000x.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://rabootoken.com/?&utm_source=marketing&utm_campaign=CRDA&utm_id=2605-7%20%5Ch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 You can participate in the}}}\uc2  Raboopresale here:\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/RabootokenPortal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/RabootokenPortal}}}\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Raboo_Official"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://twitter.com/Raboo_Official}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the viewsof Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240528ek5r00002\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 spot Ether ETFs\par \b \uc2 Spot Ether ETFs are now officially legal in the US: Law Decoded\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By David Attlee \par \uc2 597 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The SEC approved the 19b-4 filings from \uc2 VanEck\uc2 , \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 , \uc2 Fidelity\uc2 , Grayscale, \uc2 Franklin Templeton\uc2 , ARK 21Shares, Invesco Galaxy and Bitwise.\par \par \uc2 In a second landmark decision this year, the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-approves-ether-etf-without-gensler-vote"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 given the regulatory green light}}}\uc2  to spot Ether exchange-traded funds (ETFs) in the country.\par \par \uc2 The SEC approved the 19b-4 filings from \uc2 VanEck\uc2 , \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 , \uc2 Fidelity\uc2 , Grayscale, \uc2 Franklin Templeton\uc2 , ARK 21Shares, Invesco Galaxy and Bitwise, approving the rule changes allowing spot Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) ETFs to be listed and traded on their respective exchanges.\par \par \uc2 Unlike the spot Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) ETFs {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-spot-ether-etf-approved"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 approved via voting by a five-member committee}}}\uc2  including SEC Chair \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2 , spot Ether ETFs were approved by the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s Trading and Markets Division.\par \par \uc2 Another major difference between the approval processes of the two crypto ETFs is that all 10 BTC ETFs started trading the day after their approval, as they also got S-1 form clearance.\par \par \uc2 Spot Ether ETFs might be weeks or months away from debuting on exchanges, as the ETF filers have yet to receive their S-1 SEC registration.\par \par \uc2 Hong Kong orders \uc2 Worldcoin\uc2  to freeze operations on the island\par \par \uc2 Hong Kong\u8217\'20\'19s Office of the Privacy Commissioner for Personal Data (PCPD) has concluded its inquiry into the \uc2 Worldcoin\uc2  project, determining that its operations in Hong Kong violated its Personal Data (Privacy) Ordinance.\par \par \uc2 Privacy Commissioner \b \highlight22\uc2 Ada\b0 \highlight\uc2  Chung Lai-ling issued an enforcement notice to \uc2 Worldcoin\uc2 , ordering the immediate halt of all project operations in Hong Kong that involve scanning and collecting irises and facial images of the public using iris scanning devices.\par \par \uc2 According to the PCPD, collecting face images was unnecessary for verifying the humanness of participants, as the iris scanning device operators were already capable of performing this verification in person at the operating locations, making the scanning or collection of face images an unnecessary step.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/hong-kong-halts-worldcoin-privacy-violations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Continue reading}}}\par \par \uc2 Binance\uc2 .US to reinstate Florida money services license\par \par \uc2 Binance\uc2 .US has scored a victory in its appeal of the suspension of its money-services business license in Florida. The Florida First District Court of Appeal found the emergency suspension order issued by the state Office of Financial \b \highlight22\uc2 Regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  (OFR) lacked legal justification.\par \par \uc2 The suspension of the Binance.US Florida license came in response to \uc2 Binance\uc2  CEO {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/breaking-binance-changpeng-zhao-pleads-guilty-violating-anti-money-laundering-requirements-wsj"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Changpeng Zhao\u8217\'20\'19s guilty plea}}}\uc2  in federal court on Nov. 21, 2023, to violating U.S. Anti-Money Laundering law.\par \par \uc2 The appeals court cited state law that determined the OFR \u8220\'20\'1Cmay\u8221\'20\'1D suspend a money-services business license \u8220\'20\'1Cby any procedure that is fair under the circumstances\u8221\'20\'1D if the agency provides reasons to show the decision is fair. Further, the agency did not discuss less harsh alternatives to suspension.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-us-wins-florida-license-appeal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Continue reading}}}\par \par \uc2 CBDC Anti-Surveillance State Act passes US House\par \par \uc2 The CBDC Anti-Surveillance State Act passed the \uc2 U.S. House of Representatives\uc2  in a largely partisan vote. The bill, which must still face a vote in the Senate, amends the Federal Reserve Act of 1913 to prohibit \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  banks \u8220\'20\'1Cfrom offering certain products or services directly to an individual, to prohibit the use of central bank digital currency for monetary policy, and for other purposes.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The Republican-backed bill\u8217\'20\'19s debate was sparsely attended. Republican supporters spoke about the potential abuse of a central bank digital currency (CBDC), while Democrats concentrated on innovation, the dollar\u8217\'20\'19s international competitiveness and the bill\u8217\'20\'19s allegedly poor drafting. Representative Brad Sherman called the bill a \u8220\'20\'1Cword salad\u8221\'20\'1D that favored \u8220\'20\'1Ccrypto bros.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cbdc-anti-surveillance-state-act-passes-house"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Continue reading}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvZDdhYjlkMDctOTJiNi00YmVlLTg0ODYtNzIyYjNhZWMzYzE5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240527ek5r000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/27: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,579 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and Ether are moving toward their formidable overhead resistance levels, signaling that the bulls are focused on taking control.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) cleared the $70,000 psychological barrier on May 27 after a three-day struggle. This suggests that the bulls remain in control. However, some analysts do not believe a breakout is likely in the near term. Analyst Rekt Capital highlighted that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-preps-most-parabolic-phase-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 post-halving reaccumulation phase}}}\uc2  typically lasts for 160 days. Hence, Bitcoin may remain sideways for a few more weeks.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s muted performance and the approval for spot Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) exchange-traded funds (ETFs) have shifted focus to Ether. Several analysts are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Ether, and they expect it to rally. DeFiance Capital founder Arthur Cheong said in a post on X that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ether-gains-5-percent-in-24-hours-post-etf-approval-pump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ether could rally to $4,500}}}\uc2  before the launch of the spot ETFs.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/8d5c423e-62c9-43ca-adc5-cbb6083348c0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 It is not only Ether; analysts are also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/traders-hope-insane-pump-altcoins-approach-key-resistance-levels"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  on altcoins}}}\uc2 . Analysts believe that, similar to previous cycles, after the rally in Bitcoin and Ether, it is time for altcoins to play catch up.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and Ether lead the cryptocurrency markets higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) has been holding above the breakout level of 5,265 since May 15, indicating that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/60cbba6d-d2e1-4110-8e7f-09f1db81a3f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average (5,233) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate that the bulls have the edge. If buyers overcome the barrier at 5,350, the index could start its journey to 5,500.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 50-day simple moving average (5,172), it will suggest that the markets have rejected the breakout. That could sink the index to the 5,000 to 4,950 support zone.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) attempted a recovery last week, which stalled at the moving averages. This suggests that the bears remain sellers on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/5900a77b-1636-4854-bfbe-c58a3652f01e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sink the price to the support line of the ascending channel. This is a crucial support to watch out for because a break below it may start a new downtrend. The index may drop to 103.17 and later to 102.35.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the current level or the support line and breaks above the moving averages, it will signal that the index may remain inside the channel for some more time. The index will attempt to rise to 105.75 and then to 106.50.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bounced off the 20-day EMA ($66,798) on May 24 and has risen above the $70,000 level on May 27, indicating that the bulls are trying to strengthen their hold.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/9189278c-2c5f-4300-a9f8-60aed8831df6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair is likely to rally to the formidable overhead resistance at $73,777. The bears are expected to defend this level with all their might because if they fail in their endeavor, the pair could surge to $80,000 and later to $84,000.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down sharply from the overhead resistance and breaks below the moving averages, it will signal that the pair may remain stuck inside the $59,600 to $73,777 range for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether turned up from $3,730 on May 26, suggesting that the bulls have flipped the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/15fcadbe-85b3-4cc4-9306-c83ce81596e1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to maintain the price above $3,950. If they manage to do that, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the stiff overhead resistance of $4,100. If bulls clear this barrier, the pair may pick up momentum and surge toward $4,868.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to drag the price back below the breakout level of $3,730. That could start a decline to the 20-day EMA ($3,455), which is likely to act as a strong support. If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to propel the pair to $4,100.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has stayed above the moving averages for the past few days, but the bulls have failed to challenge the $635 resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/4884ccc2-439e-4768-9d45-402c6febb642.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The gradually rising 20-day EMA ($595) and the RSI above 58 suggest that the bulls have a slight edge. The bulls will try to drive the BNB/USDT pair above $635. If they can pull it off, the pair may start the next leg of the uptrend toward $692.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and dives below the uptrend line, it will signal that the pair may extend its stay inside the range. The pair may then drop to $536 and subsequently to $495.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has dropped to the breakout level of $162, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/90bbd632-b56a-426b-950d-84f872e975bf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($164) is flattening out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just above the midpoint, signaling a minor advantage to the bulls. If the bounce sustains, the bulls will try to drive the SOL/USDT pair to $189 and, after that, to the overhead resistance at $205.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down and breaks below $162, it will signal that the bulls have given up. That could start a downward move to $140 and later to $126. The bulls are expected to defend this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) started a bounce off the 20-day EMA ($0.52) on May 24, but they could not build upon this strength. This shows that the recovery attempts are being sold into.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/0efe0733-625c-44dc-accf-e7a83449f79f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position by pulling the price below the moving averages. If they do that, the XRP/USDT pair could slide to the support line. The bulls are likely to buy the dip to this level.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level or the support line and breaks above $0.57, it will complete an ascending triangle pattern. The pair could then attempt a rally to the pattern target of $0.68.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/pepe-memecoin-hits-record-high-risks-40-crash-june"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pepe memecoin hits record high but risks a brutal 40% crash by June}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) has been trading near the 20-day EMA ($6.36) for the past few days, signaling a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/66d04678-c6a0-4dd6-901e-cbd2d9ff3e85.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rises and breaks above $6.75, it will tilt the short-term advantage in favor of the bulls. The TON/USDT pair will then attempt a rally to $7.67, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break and close below $6 will suggest that the bears have the upper hand. That could start a decline to $5.50 and thereafter to $4.72. A strong bounce off this level will suggest that the pair may remain inside the range for some more days.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been oscillating near the $0.17 level for the past few days, indicating a tussle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/13bda6f3-681e-403e-9555-e75802399eee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.16) and the RSI above 58 suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers sustain the price above $0.17, the possibility of a break above $0.18 increases. The DOGE/USDT pair may then surge to $0.21.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns around and plummets below the moving averages, it will signal that the bears continue to sell on every minor rally. The pair may then slide to $0.14 and remain inside the range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), signaling a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/debb33ed-dab1-4def-879c-1dc8659d39c1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sink the price below the support line. If they succeed, it will signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may plummet toward the next support at $0.35.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the current level or the support line, it will suggest that the pair may remain inside the triangle for some time. A break and close above the resistance line will tilt the advantage in favor of the bulls. The pair may then start a move toward $0.62.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvNTdmNmE1NmQtMzA5Ny00MmE2LWE2YmYtNjc0NGNkMGU1NjBkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240527ek5r000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Michael Saylor\par \b \uc2 \u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0BSpot Ethereum  \highlight22\uc2 ETF approval \highlight\uc2  'may be better for Bitcoin' \u8212\'20\'14 \uc2 Michael Saylor\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Ciaran Lyons \par \uc2 506 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Saylor argues that the approval of a spot \uc2 Ether ETF\uc2  will prompt new investors to recognize crypto as an asset class, yet most of their allocation will still flow towards bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  founder \uc2 Michael Saylor\uc2  has changed his tone on spot Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) exchange-traded funds (ETFs), arguing that the recent nod from the United States regulator is only good news for Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) as well.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIs this good for Bitcoin or not? Yeah, I think it\u8217\'20\'19s good for Bitcoin, in fact, I think it may be better for Bitcoin because I think that we are politically much more powerful supported by the entire crypto industry,\u8221\'20\'1D Saylor told Bitcoin podcaster Peter McCormack on the May 25 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lwmyaxpJwoc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 episode}}}\uc2  of What Bitcoin Did podcast.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThey serve as another line of defense for Bitcoin,\u8221\'20\'1D he said, following the news that the \uc2 U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-spot-ether-etf-approved"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 approved eight spot Ether ETFs}}}\uc2  to be listed on their respective exchanges on May 23.\par \par \uc2 Saylor reiterated that this will "accelerate institutional adoption," as previously wary investors will now recognize {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutional-adoption-blockchain-crypto-at-its-highest-point-block-daemon-bitcoin-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto as a legitimate asset class}}}\uc2 . Furthermore, Saylor explained they will allocate capital across the various crypto assets, but Bitcoin will still receive the majority of allocated capital as "the leader" of cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI think mainstream investors will say oh there is a crypto asset class now, maybe we\u8217\'20\'19ll allocate 5% or 10% to the crypto asset class, but Bitcoin will be 60% or 70% of that,\u8221\'20\'1D he claimed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/ee060db4-11e6-4101-985c-f46bf2c28237.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Michael Saylor\uc2  talking to host Peter McCormack on the What Bitcoin Did podcast. Source: \uc2 YouTube\uc2 /What Bitcoin Did\par \par \uc2 Saylor acknowledged his opinion has changed on spot Ether ETFs, given he previously was under the impression that there was a slim chance of SEC approval.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CTwo weeks before, the world looked like Bitcoin was going to be the only asset securitized and offered as a spot ETF by the Wall Street establishment and it was going to spread as the one legitimate crypto asset,\u8221\'20\'1D he explained.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-rally-stalls-at-3800-is-etf-decision-already-priced-in"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum rally stalls at $3.8K \u8212\'20\'14 Is SEC ETH ETF decision already priced in?}}}\par \par \uc2 On May 3, Cointelegraph reported that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/michael-saylor-sec-ether-security"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Saylor predicted that the SEC}}}\uc2  would classify ETH as a security, followed by BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ), Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) being viewed in the same way.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNone of [these tokens] will ever be wrapped by a spot ETF, none of them will be accepted by Wall Street, none of them will be accepted by mainstream institutional investors as crypto assets,\u8221\'20\'1D said Saylor.\par \par \uc2 Saylor's change in tone on What Bitcoin Did did not go unnoticed by the wider crypto community.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CChanging his tune a bit,\u8221\'20\'1D Bitcoin commercial litigator Joe Carlasare posted in a May 25 X {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/JoeCarlasare/status/1794469215648251930"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 post}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIs the next step Saylor buying ETH? That\u8217\'20\'19s a serious 180,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/fourthesauri/status/1794556114488479933"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2  crypto analyst Ricky Bobbyy.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2500-film-about-ftx-collapse-amazon-prime-with-help-from-mom/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The $2,500 doco about FTX collapse on Amazon Prime\u8230\'20\'26 with help from mom}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvNzQ3YTJhZTMtNTI1OC00NjA2LWEzOGEtZDEwMmMwZjA0NDljLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240526ek5q00001\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
