ains strong. With its all-time high market capitalization and impressive returns for early investors, the project has demonstrated its ability to deliver substantial value to its stakeholders. As such, now may indeed be the right time to consider investing in Retik Finance, as it continues to make waves in the ever-changing world of digital assets. In conclusion, Retik Finance's recent achievements and its potential for future growth make it a promising investment opportunity for those looking to diversify their portfolios and capitalize on the expanding cryptocurrency market.\par \par \uc2 Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ): A High-Performance Blockchain Platform:\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) is a high-performance blockchain platform designed to support decentralized applications (dapps) and crypto-currencies. It is known for its fast transaction speeds and low fees, making it an attractive option for developers and investors alike. \uc2 Solana\uc2 's integration of AI and its developer environment for Ethereum (ETH) developers further increase its potential for growth in the coming years. Based on analysis, \uc2 Solana\uc2 's price is expected to increase by 12.45% to $201.37 by June 21, 2024. Our technical indicators suggest a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment, and the Fear & Greed Index indicates extreme greed. Over the last 30 days, \uc2 Solana\uc2  has had 14 green days (47%) with a price \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  of 8.67%. Considering these factors, it may be a good time to invest in Solana.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 As the cryptocurrency market continues to evolve, it's essential to stay informed about new projects and investment opportunities. While Dogecoin may no longer be a good investment choice for those seeking significant returns, Retik Finance and \uc2 Solana\uc2  offer promising alternatives with the potential for 45x gains in 2024. By diversifying your portfolio with these two tokens, you can position yourself for success in the ever-changing world of cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 Visit the links below for more information about Retik Finance (RETIK):\par \par \uc2 Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://retik.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://retik.com}}}\par \par \uc2 Whitepaper: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://retik.com/retik-whitepaper.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://retik.com/retik-whitepaper.pdf}}}\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.twitter.com/retikfinance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.twitter.com/retikfinance}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.t.me/retikfinance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.t.me/retikfinance}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the viewsof Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240525ek5o00002\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,591 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Despite this week's correction, Bitcoin and Ethereum look ready to bounce off their key support levels and challenge their all-time highs in the near future.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-spot-ether-etf-approved"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 greenlighted several spot Ether exchange-traded funds}}}\uc2  on May 23, but the decision failed to ignite Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) or the crypto markets. Does this mean that the ETF decision was already priced in? It is difficult to judge by the initial reaction because Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price had also dipped just after the approval of the spot Bitcoin ETFs. However, the price turned around after a few days and skyrocketed to a new all-time high.\par \par \uc2 The approved spot Ether ETFs are expected to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ether-etf-launch-next-month-certainly-possible-analysts-say"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launch by mid-June}}}\uc2 , according to Bloomberg ETF analyst \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2 . He projects the Ether ETFs to garner roughly 10-15% of the inflows seen by the Bitcoin ETFs. Once money starts flowing into Ether ETFs, the spot market is likely to respond favorably.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/790c2afc-52ac-42bb-9c9c-fc7bc77c36bc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Although Bitcoin remains stuck in a sideways price action, Fundstrat Global Advisors managing partner and head of research \uc2 Tom Lee\uc2  remains uber \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . In an interview with CNBC, Lee said their base case for Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-150k-in-2024-base-case-tom-lee"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 by the end of the year is $150,000}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and select altcoins rebound off their immediate support levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin reversed direction from $71,979 on May 21, and the price has reached the moving averages. This suggests that the bears are trying to keep the price inside the range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/b38d6a4d-f136-4553-b00a-54d6d4d8f99f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the moving averages with strength, the bulls will again try to push the BTC/USDT pair to the overhead resistance at $73,777. A break and close above this level could clear the path for a rally to $80,000 and then $84,000.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the bulls have given up. The pair may then collapse to the strong support at $59,600. This level is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long wick and the long tail on Ether\u8217\'20\'19s May 23 candlestick show a tussle between the buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/70661886-5c1d-47ac-a49f-f572ca3c4757.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price has dipped below $3,730, an important level for the bulls to defend. If the price maintains below $3,730, the ETH/USDT pair could decline to the 20-day EMA ($3,313). A strong bounce off this level will suggest that the bulls continue to buy on dips. The buyers will make one more attempt to overcome the obstacle at $3,730.\par \par \uc2 The bears are expected to mount a strong defense in the zone between $3,730 and $4,100 because if this resistance is cleared, the pair could surge to $4,868.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the stiff overhead resistance of $635 on May 21, indicating that the bears are aggressively defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/a7768e49-514b-49b2-b0e9-6da2b8089fd9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair has reached the moving averages, which is an important support to watch out for. If the price bounces off the moving averages with strength, it will signal that the bulls are buying on minor dips. That will improve the prospects of a break above $635. The pair could then start its march toward $692.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price breaks below the moving averages and the $560 support, it will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the range.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $189 on May 21, signaling that the bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/fef58652-8827-41d1-a7d0-46850db41a6e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls bought the dip near the breakout level of $162 on May 23 but could not build upon it. Sellers are again trying to sink the price below $162. If they can pull it off, the SOL/USDT pair may drop to $140.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off $162, it will signal that the bulls are attempting to flip the level into support. Buyers will have to overcome the barrier at $189 to start a rally to $205, where the bears may pose a strong challenge.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been witnessing volatile moves near the moving averages, indicating a tough tussle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/e6317e35-c07c-4ac5-8b26-ab008fde6882.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to tug the price below the moving averages and the support line. If they manage to do that, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to the crucial support at $0.46. This level is expected to attract strong buying by the bulls. A strong rebound off $0.46 could extend the consolidation for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to clear the overhead hurdle at $0.57 to signal that the bears are losing their grip. That may start a rally to $0.67 and eventually to the formidable resistance at $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck between the 50-day SMA ($0.16) and the overhead resistance at $0.17 for the past three days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/d7858923-bdc5-41f4-8aa8-042b1916edd3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull the price below the moving averages on May 23, but the bulls held their ground. The bulls are again attempting to propel the DOGE/USDT pair above $0.17. If they can pull it off, the pair may start an up move to $0.21.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to defend the $0.17 level and drag the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.16). If that happens, the pair could slide to $0.13. Such a move will suggest that the pair remains inside the $0.12 to $0.17 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) bulls are struggling to start a bounce off the moving averages, suggesting that the bears have maintained their pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/d23ca56f-59dc-49f3-b3ad-8590994844be.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price skids and maintains below the 50-day SMA ($6.12), it will signal that the TON/USDT pair may start a downward journey to $5.57 and later to $4.72. Buyers are expected to fiercely defend the $4.72 level. That could keep the price stuck inside the $4.72 to $7.67 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move is expected to begin on a break above $7.67 or a drop below $4.72. Until then, random and volatile price action is likely to continue.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dominance-risks-18-month-uptrend-ether-etf-launch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin dominance risks breaking 18-month uptrend on Ether ETF launch}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) price action of the past few days has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/d2d57949-a65a-4605-b6e3-bec436d86157.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($0.47) and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may remain inside the triangle for a while. If the price remains below the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to tug the pair below the triangle. If they do that, the pair may dive to the next support at $0.35.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level, the bulls will try to drive the pair above the resistance line. If they succeed, the pair may rally to $0.57 and then to $0.62.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned down and fell below the breakout level of $40 on May 23, indicating that bears remain active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/3c109abc-47d1-4cb0-9020-d60138866551.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A minor advantage for the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to slip below the moving averages. If the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $42, it will suggest a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. The AVAX/USDT pair could then surge to $50.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price breaks below the moving averages, selling could pick up, and the pair may plummet toward $34 and then $29.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) re-entered the symmetrical triangle pattern on May 23, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/3e797819-54d9-417a-908d-129f7473553b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. The sellers will have to sink the price below the support line to gain the upper hand. If they do that, the SHIB/USDT pair could move down to the 78.6% retracement level of $0.000017.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to drive the price above $0.000027 to clear the path for a rally to the $0.000030 to $0.000033 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy8zYTA3OTQ3N2VkYzQ0NjlmZDVjZTJiMDQ0NTYyYjUzZC5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240524ek5o000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
