ce (RCOF)}}}\uc2 . This crypto trading platform is tied to real-world assets like stocks and bonds, which would allow users to build their portfolios and enjoy up to 50X returns.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Bonk (BONK) Struggle to Break Past Resistance Levels\par \par \uc2 Bonk (BONK) is a dog-themed token built on the Solana (SOL) blockchain. Its launch sparked a meme coin frenzy and increased investor\u8217\'20\'19s confidence after making them one of the biggest gainers in 2022.\par \par \uc2 The coin is trading at $0.00002551, gaining 5.53% of its value in the past seven days. Despite this surge, it has witnessed selling pressure in the last 24 hours, dropping by 2.83%.\par \par \uc2 It has also failed to break out and close above its resistance level to rally towards an all-time high. Over the past months, Bonk (BONK) has consistently ranged between $0.0000258 and $0.0000202.\par \par \uc2 Market analysts predict that if the coin breaks past the current level, the next resistance will be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.analyticsinsight.net/price-analysis/bonk-price-analysis-bonk-to-hit-all-time-highs-yes-but-only-if-these-levels-are-broken-out"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $0.00003563}}}\uc2 . Sadly, the meme coin frenzy has declined, and many investors are looking to make long-term gains from trading crypto and stocks on RCO Finance (RCOF).\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has struggled between $0.5 and $0.4. It has declined by 1.66%, attaining a $0.4664 price point. Due to this low price action, the coin\u8217\'20\'19s daily trading volume has plummeted from $1.53 billion in March to $319 million.\par \par \uc2 Although Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has made rebound attempts by gaining 5.11% over the past week, its sell-off has continuously risen. Many cryptocurrency holders believe the coin\u8217\'20\'19s correction cycle will propel it to