tment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240523ek5m0000i\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Cardano's 'centralization' concerns put a 30%  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2  price crash in play\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 643 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano whales are accumulating \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  during the period of correction, paying no attention to the centralization warning.\par \par \uc2 Cardano's ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) price has declined by 7.25% to reach $0.474 on May 22, two days after cryptocurrency analyst Justin Bons accused the blockchain project of being extremely centralized.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/07de4312-b8d9-4aa0-9ffb-14a8dfcf95d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Bons {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Justin_Bons/status/1792596572749869355"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 argued}}}\uc2  that Input Output Global (IOG), the parent company of Cardano, controls 5 out of 7 of the blockchain's "genesis keys," cryptographic keys that were used to sign and establish the initial block of the Cardano blockchain back in 2015.\par \par \uc2 "The genesis keys allow code changes to be pushed out seamlessly without a hard fork," the analyst said, adding:\par \par \uc2 "This means IOG could halt the chain, change emission schedules, censor & far more That is an unprecedented degree of centralized control for an L1 chain."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/aed06224-2966-4f4b-9ec2-b9e3f19d732b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: X\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's decline after Bogs's comments triggered a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup that could lead to another 30% price crash by June.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  risks triangle breakdown ahead\par \par \uc2 Cardano's ongoing correction further comes after reaching a familiar descending trendline resistance, which is part of a prevailing symmetrical triangle pattern.\par \par \uc2 A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-is-an-ascending-triangle-pattern-and-how-to-trade-it"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 symmetrical triangle in a downtrend}}}\uc2  is considered a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  continuation pattern, characterized by the formation two converging trendlines: one ascending and the other descending. As a rule of technical analysis, this pattern resolves after the price breaks below the lower trendline and drops by as much as the maximum triangle height.\par \par \uc2 As of May 22, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's price was correcting after testing the triangle's upper trendline. It now eyes an extended retreat toward the lower trendline at around $0.44, down 6.5% from the current price levels, by the end of May.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/3bc5302b-4c96-485d-aae8-10b9611c5606.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A decisive symmetrical triangle breakdown could cause \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's price to drop toward the $0.336-0.366 area\u8212\'20\'14approximately 20-25% from the current price level, depending on the breakdown point.\par \par \uc2 On a brighter note, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's price is bouncing after testing its multi-month ascending trendline support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/c674ea2e-0a6a-4838-9902-2b59c8e7060c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD 3D price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A broader rally is possible if the price breaks above its 50-3D (the red wave) and 200-3D (the blue wave) exponential moving averages (EMA). In that case, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's initial upside target would be around $0.67, up around 35% from the current price levels.\par \par \uc2 The $0.67-level served as resistance in December 2023 and May 2022.\par \par \uc2 Cardano whales are accumulating\par \par \uc2 Cardano's ongoing price correction coincides with a slight rise in the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  supply held by its richest addresses, indicating that these whales have ignored Bogs's warnings about Cardano's so-called centralization.\par \par \uc2 For instance, entities that hold 10 million-100 million \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  (black) and 100 million-1 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  (teal) tokens have increased their holdings in the past 24 hours. This trend shows that most whales are buying the price dip in anticipation of further gains.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/64048362-07e8-415a-9735-a5769d6e480f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  supply whale distribution. Source: Santiment\par \par \uc2 Looking broadly, the 10 million-100 million cohort shows a sharp increase in \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  holdings around the end of March, followed by some stabilization. Meanwhile, the 100 million-1 billion cohort has steadily increased, particularly notable from mid-March onward.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-ether-etf-ether-price-sec"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Rally or dud: What to expect if spot Ether ETFs are approved}}}\par \par \uc2 During this period, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's price has dropped by over 20%, suggesting that most Cardano whales anticipate the price rising further in the long term.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvOTc3NTAyM2UtODc3OC00ZTdlLTg2M2ItODRkNDE5ZmUxZDJjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240522ek5m000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Why is Cardano price down today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 611 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  token continues to fall as activity on the network and the altcoin\u8217\'20\'19s trading volume remain in a downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s native ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) token took on a big portion of the daily losses incurred during the April 10 cryptocurrency market rout.\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscription.cointelegraph.com/?_gl=1*13dnpkr*_ga*MTAxMzE3MDgyMS4xNzA2Nzk5MzMw*_ga_53R24TEEB1*MTcxMjc3MjU3OC4yNjMuMS4xNzEyNzczNzk2LjAuMC4w"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  reveals that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price fell to an intraday low of $0.558 on April 10, down 3% over the last 24 hours.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/e60e7b87-976c-4391-9905-9b35dc64793e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/NoFHAxT1/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 What are the factors driving \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price down today?\par \par \uc2 Weak on-chain metrics underly \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s downside\par \par \uc2 Data from Token Terminal reveals that the drop in \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price coincides with a modest drop in the token\u8217\'20\'19s trading volume and the number of core developers.\par \par \uc2 Notably, the number of unique \uc2 GitHub\uc2  daily users who made more than one commit to the blockchain\u8217\'20\'19s public \uc2 GitHub\uc2  repository reduced from a three-month high of 146 developers on March 6 to 122 on April 10, representing a 16.5% decline.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/e31fa00a-affa-4624-91b5-eac0167ac8d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  daily trading volume vs. core developers. Source: Token Terminal\par \par \uc2 Transaction volume decreased by 80.7% from approximately $2.189 billion to $421 million over the same period.\par \par \uc2 Additional data from DefiLlama suggests that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/what-is-total-value-locked-tvl-in-crypto-and-why-does-it-matter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 total value locked}}}\uc2  (TVL) on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/a-beginners-guide-to-the-cardano-network-and-the-ada-ecosystem"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano}}}\uc2  network decreased from $473.33 million on March 16 to $371.51 million on April 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/fbcad66f-1d1b-4e35-86d9-edd7f0118055.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano total value locked, USD. Source: DefiLlama\par \par \uc2 The decline in trading volume, active core developers, and TVL coincides with \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s 27% \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the same period, hinting that these metrics have influenced \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s short-term price trends\u8212\'20\'14and April 10 is no different.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price charts show weak market structure\par \par \uc2 Technicals suggest that the ongoing correction in the price of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is part of a corrective cycle that started in mid-March after the token hit a two-year high of $0.81.\par \par \uc2 Traders booked profits as \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-s-3-ways-the-relative-strength-index-rsi-can-be-used-as-a-sell-signal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 relative strength index}}}\uc2  (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) on the daily chart became overbought after crossing 70.\par \par \uc2 An \uc2 RSI\uc2  reading above 70 means the asset is becoming overvalued and may undergo trend reversal or corrective pullback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/3876b980-e5b1-45ca-8a63-77c154d756ff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is following an extended downtrend, confirmed by its downward movement inside a descending parallel channel. The \uc2 RSI\uc2  is positioned at 48, suggesting that the market conditions still favor the downside.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-retail-interest-low-compared-last-bull-run"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Retail interest in crypto \u8216\'20\'18quite low\u8217\'20\'19 compared to last bull run \u8212\'20\'14 LunarCrush CEO}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price faces a difficult recovery\par \par \uc2 The recent retracement in \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price showed signs of further weakness after rejection from the descending channel\u8217\'20\'19s upper boundary at $0.61\u8212\'20\'14 confirming a stiff barrier around this level. If the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  bulls fail to flip this level to support, then the likelihood of continuing its prevailing downtrend will be much higher.\par \par \uc2 This negative outlook is corroborated by on-chain data from IntoTheBlock. Its In/Out of the Money Around Price (IOMAP) model showed that the channel\u8217\'20\'19s upper boundary at $0.61 sat just above the $0.58 to $0.60 price range, where approximately 2.17 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  were previously bought by roughly 132,970 addresses.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/3f63c389-3703-4a6f-851a-d8ee64d961e6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano IOMAP chart. Source: IntoTheBlock\par \par \uc2 This resistance was robust enough to absorb any buying pressure attempting to push the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price higher. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  bulls must flip this zone into support to avoid further losses.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDYvZTIzMDE1ZGQtODcyOC00YjI3LTgzYjctODgxYTY1YjUwMTlhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240522ek5m000ba\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/22: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,542 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin, Ethereum and several memecoins are the star performers this week, but charts suggest a handful of altcoins intend to follow.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) jumped up sharply on May 20, but the price remains inside a range. Typically, traders sell when the price nears the overhead resistance, but the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-bitcoin-etf-hits-6-week-inflow-high-btc-rally"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inflows into the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds}}}\uc2  show that buying continues. Farside Investor\u8217\'20\'19s data shows total inflows of $500 million into the spot Bitcoin ETFs on May 20 and 21.\par \par \uc2 However, several analysts are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ether-price-2-month-high-bitcoin-btc-price-69k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 concerned about Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s short-term price action}}}\uc2 . Bollinger Bands creator \uc2 John Bollinger\uc2  told his X followers that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s formation suggests a short-term consolidation or a pullback. Similarly, trading resource Material Indicators cautioned that one of its proprietary trading tools was signaling a \u8220\'20\'1Cclear\u8221\'20\'1D down signal, which would invalidate above $71,500.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/bc3cf2b9-702d-4b4d-b979-3939c0f2b848.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin awaits a breakout, the action is gradually shifting to Ether in anticipation of a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/vaneck-spot-ether-etf-listed-dtcc-awaits-sec-approval"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 possible approval for the spot Ether ETFs}}}\uc2  in the United States. Approval will likely boost sentiment in the cryptocurrency sector, catapulting select altcoins higher.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and the major altcoins surprise to the upside? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin cleared the $68,000 barrier on May 20, but the bulls could not push the price to the overhead resistance at $73,777.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/ee8b57e6-54ef-4821-bb0f-64668f5dcdba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, a positive sign is that the bulls are trying to keep the price above the psychological level at $70,000. If they can pull it off, the BTC/USDT pair is expected to have another shot at $73,777. If the bulls prevail, the pair may rally to $80,000 and then to $84,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down sharply from the current level or the overhead resistance, it will suggest that the bears are fiercely defending the $73,777 level. That suggests the consolidation may continue for some more days.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) pole vaulted above the resistance line of the descending channel pattern on May 20, signaling a potential trend change.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/4c771561-265c-4c7b-bdc7-f4c253c17cdb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls strengthened their position further by pushing the price above the resistance at $3,730. If buyers retain the price above $3,730, it will signal that the bears have given up. The ETH/USDT pair may rally to $4,100. If this level is also cleared, the bulls will try to kick the price to $4,868.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down sharply and plunges below $3,730, it will signal that the bears remain sellers at higher levels. The pair may then slide to the 20-day EMA ($3,224).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on May 20 and rose above the resistance line. This shows that the uncertainty resolved in favor of the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/d590e597-7ab9-419f-b01a-134d701f9111.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair reached the pivotal overhead resistance of $635 on May 21. This level is likely to act as a stiff hurdle, but if the bulls do not cede ground to the bears, it will improve the prospects of an upside breakout. A close above $635 could clear the path for a rally to $692.\par \par \uc2 The important support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($590) and then the support line. A break below this level suggests that the pair may extend its stay inside the $495 to $635 level for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rose above the immediate resistance of $185 on May 20, but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/80d493a0-b2fb-4407-93bb-cbe4d9ff4bd8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price slipped below $185 on May 21, suggesting that the bears have not given up. However, the upsloping 20-day EMA ($161) and the RSI in the positive zone signal that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If buyers overcome the obstacle at $165, the SOL/USDT pair could retest the critical overhead resistance of $205. This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) to the overhead resistance of $0.57 on May 21, but the long wick on the candlestick shows that the bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/456348a2-b02c-4b18-9c7b-908488c9edf2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the moving averages, it will signal that the bulls are attempting to flip the level into support. If they manage to do that, the prospects of a rally above the overhead resistance of $0.57 increase. The XRP/USDT pair could then surge toward $0.67.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price continues lower and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls have given up. The pair could then drop to the support line, where the bulls will try to arrest the decline.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) attempted to bounce off the moving averages on May 20 but the bulls could not build upon the momentum.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/ff62d267-4bd9-493e-936f-51e0e18d2ba7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($6.35) has flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, suggesting that the TON/USDT pair could oscillate between $4.72 and $7.67 for some time. If the price rises above $6.73, the pair may reach the overhead resistance of $7.67.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price continues lower and breaks below the 50-day SMA, it will signal that the bears have the edge in the short term. That could open the doors for a fall to $5.50 and later to $4.72.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the $0.17 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/a0907d86-d41c-44be-bef0-7f6766e99001.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.15) has started to turn up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive territory, indicating advantage to buyers. If the bulls drive and maintain the price above $0.17, the DOGE/USDT pair is likely to accelerate toward $0.21.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is the crucial support to watch on the downside. If the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it suggests that the pair may remain inside the range for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) skyrocketed above the 50-day SMA ($0.49) on May 20, but the bulls could not clear the hurdle at $0.52.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/49f49dfb-7099-492f-90a2-5e4feb030dab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pull the price below the moving averages, but the bulls are expected to defend the level. If the price turns up from the moving averages, the bulls will again attempt to overcome the obstacle at $0.52. If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could soar to the overhead resistance of $0.57.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the bears remain active at higher levels. The pair may then drop to the support line.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the 20-day EMA ($36.62) on May 20 and rose above the $40 overhead resistance on May 21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/97f700be-7663-49c8-9f6d-61de0b9450c1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive territory, indicating advantage to buyers. The AVAX/USDT pair could attempt a rally to the psychological resistance of $50. This level is likely to attract solid selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to yank and maintain the price below the 20-day EMA. That may trap the aggressive bulls, resulting in a long liquidation. The pair may then slump toward the $29 support.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) surged above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on May 20, but the bulls are struggling to maintain the momentum.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/b5473c3e-727e-40c0-9815-3da91a9c65f7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pull the price back into the triangle. If they do that, it will suggest that the recent breakout may have been a fake move. That could keep the price stuck inside the triangle for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $0.000027, it will signal that lower levels are being bought. The SHIB/USDT pair could then rally to $0.000030.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvMmUxNTA1ZTgtNjk2Ni00NmQ1LWEzNWUtMzMyYzllMDQ5ZTIwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240522ek5m000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
