tocurrency, innovations, and new projects constantly challenge established players. One such challenger making significant waves is Retik Finance (RETIK), which has seen explosive growth following its high-profile exchange launch in 2024. Often touted as a formidable alternative to Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Retik Finance\u8217\'20\'19s emergence is reshaping the landscape of decentralized finance (DeFi) with its groundbreaking approach and robust ecosystem.\par \par \uc2 The Rise of Retik Finance (RETIK)\par \par \uc2 Retik Finance\u8217\'20\'19s journey to prominence began with a highly successful presale that raised over $32 million in less than three months. This impressive fundraising milestone not only highlighted the strong investor confidence in the project but also set the stage for its ambitious plans in the DeFi space. The anticipation surrounding Retik Finance\u8217\'20\'19s official launch reached a fever pitch as the date approached, culminating in a listing on multiple top-tier exchanges, including Uniswap, on May 21, 2024.\par \par \uc2 Why Retik Finance (RETIK) Stands Out\par \par \uc2 Innovative Ecosystem\par \par \uc2 Retik Finance (RETIK) offers a comprehensive suite of financial tools designed to bridge the gap between traditional finance and cryptocurrencies. The project\u8217\'20\'19s ecosystem includes:\par \par \uc2 Retik Wallet: A secure, user-friendly wallet for managing digital assets.\par \par \uc2 DeFi\uc2  Debit Cards: These cards enable users to spend their cryptocurrencies in real-world transactions, providing seamless integration between digital and traditional finance.\par \par \uc2 Retik Pay: A smart payment gateway that facilitates cross-border transactions with ease.\par \par \uc2 AI-Powered P2P Lending: Utilizing artificial intelligence to match borrowers and lenders efficiently, promoting financial inclusion and autonomy.\par \par \uc2 Cutting-Edge Technology\par \par \uc2 At the heart of Retik Finance\u8217\'20\'19s appeal is its advanced technological framework. The platform leverages blockchain technology and smart contracts to create a transparent, secure, and efficient financial environment. This innovative approach ensures that users can conduct transactions with confidence, knowing that their assets are protected by state-of-the-art security measures.\par \par \uc2 Comparison to Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 Cardano has long been celebrated for its rigorous academic approach and strong emphasis on security and scalability. However, Retik Finance is rapidly emerging as a viable alternative, particularly for those interested in the DeFi sector. While Cardano focuses on creating a secure and scalable infrastructure for decentralized applications (dApps) and smart contracts, Retik Finance offers a more comprehensive suite of DeFi tools designed to facilitate everyday financial transactions.\par \par \uc2 Enhanced User Experience\par \par \uc2 One of the key differentiators between Retik Finance and Cardano is user experience. Retik Finance\u8217\'20\'19s DeFi debit cards and Retik Pay gateway are designed with the end-user in mind, offering practical solutions for integrating digital assets into everyday life. This focus on usability makes Retik Finance an attractive option for both seasoned crypto enthusiasts and newcomers to the space.\par \par \uc2 The Impact of the Exchange Launch\par \par \uc2 The listing of Retik Finance on multiple top-tier exchanges marked a significant milestone in its journey. The launch was not just a simple listing but a grand event that drew the attention of the entire crypto community. Within hours of the launch, RETIK\u8217\'20\'19s value saw a substantial increase, with trading volumes soaring and investor interest reaching new heights.\par \par \uc2 Market Reaction\par \par \uc2 Analysts have been quick to note the positive \b \highlight22\uc2 market reaction\b0 \highlight\uc2  to Retik Finance\u8217\'20\'19s launch. The token\u8217\'20\'19s price appreciated rapidly, reflecting the high demand and strong investor confidence in the project. This surge in value is expected to continue as more investors become aware of Retik Finance\u8217\'20\'19s unique offerings and potential for growth.\par \par \uc2 Long-Term Prospects\par \par \uc2 Looking ahead, Retik Finance (RETIK) is well-positioned to capitalize on its early success. The project\u8217\'20\'19s roadmap includes further developments in its ecosystem, including the introduction of additional financial tools and services. These innovations are expected to drive further adoption and cement Retik Finance\u8217\'20\'19s position as a leader in the DeFi space.\par \par \uc2 Community and Developer Support\par \par \uc2 A strong community and active developer support are crucial for the success of any cryptocurrency project. Retik Finance has quickly garnered a dedicated following, with a vibrant community of users and developers contributing to its growth. This active engagement ensures continuous improvement and innovation, keeping the project at the forefront of the DeFi sector.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion: A New Era in DeFi\par \par \uc2 Retik Finance\u8217\'20\'19s explosive entry into the market following its high-profile exchange launch signals the dawn of a new era in decentralized finance. As a formidable alternative to Cardano, Retik Finance offers a unique blend of innovative technology, user-friendly solutions, and robust security features. The project\u8217\'20\'19s comprehensive ecosystem addresses real-world financial challenges, making it a compelling choice for investors and users alike. With analysts predicting further value appreciation and a growing community of supporters, Retik Finance is poised to make a lasting impact on the DeFi landscape. As the project continues to evolve and expand, it promises to redefine the way individuals interact with financial systems, setting new benchmarks for the industry and paving the way for the widespread adoption of decentralized finance solutions.\par \par \uc2 Visit the links below for more information about Retik Finance (RETIK):\par \par \uc2 Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://retik.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://retik.com}}}\par \par \uc2 Whitepaper: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://retik.com/retik-whitepaper.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://retik.com/retik-whitepaper.pdf}}}\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.twitter.com/retikfinance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.twitter.com/retikfinance}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.t.me/retikfinance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.t.me/retikfinance}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240522ek5l0000j\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 why is solana price up\par \b \uc2 Why is Solana (SOL) price up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 863 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Analysts believe \uc2 Solana\uc2  will be next in line for a spot ETF if an Ethereum one is approved later this week.\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), the native cryptocurrency of the Solana network, has surged over 13.58% in the last 48 hours to reach an intra-day high of $188 on May 21. \uc2 SOL\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s monthly returns stand around 18% and 65% in the 90-day timeframe.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/b62a39da-d48c-4fc9-a9d5-42ee1ecd9a7d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s performance over the last day has been accompanied by a leap in its trading volume, which has increased by 80% to $5.5 billion. This increase in price and trading activity has seen its total market capitalization increase to $80.5 billion, cementing its position as the fifth largest cryptocurrency, according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/solana/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data}}}\uc2  from CoinMarketCap.\par \par \uc2 The uptick in \uc2 SOL\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s value so far in 2024 can be linked to several factors, including a continued outperformance of Solana-based memecoins. Meanwhile, key optimistic news updates have boosted the interim demand for riskier assets, including \uc2 Solana\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Prospects of \uc2 Solana\uc2  being the next ETF candidate bolster \uc2 SOL\uc2  price\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-community-turns-bullish-eth-etf-approval"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 emergence of the news}}}\uc2  that the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  was engaging {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fidelity-amends-ether-etf-filing-removes-eth-staking"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 issuers}}}\uc2  and exchanges concerning spot Ethereum exchange-traded funds (ETFs) has increased the odds of approval later this week.\par \par \uc2 A Polymarket survey asking if an \uc2 Ether ETF\uc2  would be approved by May 31 jumped from 10 cents to 71 cents, representing a 71% chance that approval will take place by then.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/6b3ca6a9-2d2a-469c-94a9-f42934e4685a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Chances of Ethereum approval by May 31. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://polymarket.com/event/ethereum-etf-approved-by-may-31?tid=1716301034668"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polymarket}}}\par \par \uc2 As such, the potential approval of a spot Ethereum ETF this week has sparked discussions among analysts about the possible implications for other top-cap cryptocurrencies, including Solana.\par \par \uc2 According to Matrixport co-founder Daniel Yan, a \u8220\'20\'1Cbuy \uc2 SOL\uc2 /ETH\u8221\'20\'1D would be a better trade than a \u8220\'20\'1Cbuy ETH\u8221\'20\'1D if an Ethereum ETF is approved later this week. One reason he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/_D_Y_A_N/status/1792817019899019584"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gave}}}\uc2  for this was that \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 SOL\uc2  will be the No.1 next in line if ETH ETF gets approved.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Another analyst and X user Gumshoe {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/0xGumshoe/status/1792638863707414740"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  a spot Ethereum \b \highlight22\uc2 ETF approval\b0 \highlight\uc2  is \u8220\'20\'1Cmore \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for \uc2 SOL\uc2  than ETH.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Sharing sentiments similar to Yan\u8217\'20\'19s on trades, Gumshoe argued that if an Ethereum ETF were approved, the next ETF would be \uc2 SOL\uc2 . They added that there is \u8220\'20\'1Cless reason to buy ETH\u8221\'20\'1D if the ETF is rejected, as \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 SOL\uc2  is more attractive.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 As market participants remain hopeful that the SEC will approve a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/what-are-ether-futures-etfs-and-how-do-they-work"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spot Ethereum ETF}}}\uc2 , the crypto price continues to pump, with \uc2 SOL\uc2  among the beneficiaries.\par \par \uc2 Solana-based memecoins are exploding\par \par \uc2 Since the start of April, over one million new tokens {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/over-one-million-new-tokens-memecoins-launch-april-solana-base"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 have been created}}}\uc2 , with over 370,000 new tokens emerging on Ethereum and over 640,000 new tokens launched on Solana. According to a Dune Analytics dashboard {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://dune.com/hashed_official/pumpdotfun"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pump.fun}}}\uc2 , 466,914 of the 643,000 new tokens on Solana were memecoins.\par \par \uc2 The growth in \uc2 Solana\uc2  token launches coincides with an impeccable price performance displayed by memecoins in this ecosystem.\par \par \uc2 The latest market recovery has been accompanied by an explosion in the prices of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bonk-popcat-and-solana-memecoins-stay-green-even-as-bitcoin-price-drops"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana-based memecoins}}}\uc2  led by Bonk (BONK), which is up 35% over the last 24 hours. Other notable gains have been made by Popcat (POPCAT) and Myro (MYRO), which have increased by 13.8% and 7.9% over the same time period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/f762e868-bcb1-4f75-9805-86e1bbcb8c82.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Performance of Solana-based memecoins. Source: CoinGecko\par \par \uc2 The rising prices of Solana-based memecoins coincide with a rise in the total value locked (TVL) across its ecosystem\u8212\'20\'14from 19.15 million \uc2 SOL\uc2  on March 19 to 28.90 million SOL on May 21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/771ffb97-7933-4120-9053-65c792d0a2ca.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  total value locked. Source: DefiLlama\par \par \uc2 The influx of new tokens, particularly memecoins on Solana, indicates heightened activity and growing adoption of the platform. More token launches typically lead to increased transactions and network usage, driving demand for \uc2 SOL\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-5-20-spx-dxy-btc-eth-bnb-sol-xrp-ton-doge-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 5/20: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  technical setup highlights more upside for \uc2 SOL\par \par \uc2 Despite some showing topping patterns, \uc2 SOL\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s market setup points to a sustained recovery for the layer 1 token. The recent support bounce near $170 has sparked increased interest, with \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  reporting approximately $4.9 million in inflows into Solana investment products last week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/1f9e07de-59ee-4394-afe3-13f2986a374a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/IWuwJq7D/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, \uc2 SOL\uc2  is trading 15% below the $210 range high reached on March 18. The 50-day EMA is at $154 and a positive \uc2 RSI\uc2  indicates that market conditions still favor the upside.\par \par \uc2 Breaching the $200 resistance suggests that the \uc2 SOL\uc2  price is on the path to $210, though this level may trigger profit-booking, leading to a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break below the 50-day EMA at $154 and the 100-day EMA at $144 could signal a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  downturn, with potential drops to $140 and $120.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMTAvMGI5ODY4NjktYWFhMi00ZDZmLTlkMTYtNzc1NDhlNGI4ZTcwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240521ek5l000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin ETF\par \b \uc2 CPI report spurs $932M inflows into crypto investment funds\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Ana Paula Pereira \par \uc2 445 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment funds attracted $932 million following the latest U.S. CPI report, while Ether faced $23 million in outflows amid SEC ETF concerns.\par \par \uc2 Crypto-based investment products saw a significant inflow over the previous week, marking the second consecutive week of positive flows since the recent market downturn.\par \par \uc2 According to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  data, \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products amassed $932 million between May 13 and 17, driven by an immediate response to the U.S. Consumer Price Index (CPI) report, which seemed to show that inflationary pressures were moderating again. Despite higher nflows, weekly volumes remained relatively low at $10.5 billion, a sharp contrast to the $40 billion observed in March.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CInterestingly, the inflows were an immediate response to the lower-than-expected CPI report on Wednesday, with the latter 3 trading days of the week making up 89% of the total flows, highlighting our view that Bitcoin prices have recoupled to interest rate expectations.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The May 15 CPI report {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bls.gov/news.release/cpi.htm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 revealed}}}\uc2  that inflation rose by 0.3% in April, following a 0.4% increase in March. The CPI grew by 3.4% year over year, driven by significant increases in the energy and food sectors.\par \par \uc2 In a previous analysis, CoinShares Research noted that after spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) were approved in the United States in January, factors influencing Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://blog.coinshares.com/bitcoins-price-dynamics-federal-reserve-policies-and-economic-shifts-in-focus-1c5bf612de67"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 re-aligned with market expectations}}}\uc2  around interest rates.\par \par \uc2 Grayscale\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  saw minor inflows over the week, totaling $18 million. Since its conversion in January, the fund has witnessed outflows of $16.6 billion. Regionally, Hong Kong and Canada experienced outflows of $83 million and $17 million, respectively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/a8fbfa0f-6b2a-49bf-993f-08a3add8f421.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 According to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 , a wide range of altcoin funds saw inflows over the previous week, including Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), each seeing net flows of $4.9 million, $3.7 million and $1.9 million, respectively. Conversely, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) funds saw outflows of $23 million.\par \par \uc2 Ether prices are still under pressure due to concerns about over how the \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC) will decide on spot Ether ETFs. The Commission\u8217\'20\'19s first deadline over the crypto ETF is set to expire on May 23.\par \par \uc2 Two ETF analysts, James Seyffart and \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2 , have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-reconsidering-spot-ether-etf-denial-analysts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 revised their prediction}}}\uc2  regarding the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s approval of spot Ether ETFs. Initially expecting a denial, the analysts now believe there is a 75% chance of approval after hearing new information about the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s stance.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/real-risks-ethena-stablecoin-model-not-ones-you-think/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The real risks to Ethena\u8217\'20\'19s stablecoin model (are not the ones you think)}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvODkxMTRlZGYtODBhOC00MDk2LWEwYTUtOTE2NzVjZjY0OWEwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240520ek5k000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/20: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,569 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls might try to press the price through the $73,777 all-time high and altcoins look ready to follow.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rallied last week, but it remains inside a large range. Has Bitcoin topped out, or will the rally resume? That is the central question in every trader\u8217\'20\'19s mind. Analyst \u8220\'20\'1CELI5 of TLDR\u8221\'20\'1D said in a X post that five out of seven on-chain indicators show that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/5-on-chain-indicators-suggest-bull-run-just-beginning"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bull market may be just getting started}}}\uc2 , while two show topping patterns.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s bounce off the psychological support near $60,000 seems to have triggered buying interest in the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds. Farside Investors data shows {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/etfs-buy-3x-new-btc-supply-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 roughly $950 million in inflows}}}\uc2  last week, the best weekly performance since March. If the inflows sustain, Bitcoin could surprise to the upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/33dc6950-16c2-4ee3-85b4-784cd8da8f00.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Markus Thielen, the head of research at 10x Research, is \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin. Thielen said in a report that their \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  model predicts a new all-time high if Bitcoin crosses above $67,500.\par \par \uc2 Will bulls clear the overhead barrier in Bitcoin and retest the lifetime high? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) broke out to a new all-time high on May 15, indicating that the bulls are firmly in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/60ab5aaf-08c3-4632-975a-ab4198b557b9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They will try to pull the price back below the breakout level of 5,265. If they manage to do that, it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. The index may slump to the 20-day exponential moving average (5,202).\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the moving averages with strength, it will signal that the trend remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The index will then make another attempt to march ahead toward 5,500. On the contrary, if the price breaks below the moving averages, it will tilt the short-term advantage in favor of the bears. The index could then plunge to 5,000.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) rebounded off the support line of the ascending channel pattern on May 16, but the recovery turned down from the 50-day simple moving average (105).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/64e72980-47d5-428a-8466-d754bf96829c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA (105) And the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory suggest that bears have the upper hand. Sellers will try to tug the price below the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line. If they do that, the index could descend to 103.17 and then to 102.35.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the support line, it will signal that the bulls are fiercely defending the level. Buyers will have to drive the price above the moving averages to suggest that the index may remain inside the channel for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been trading in a tight range near the $68,000 level for the past three days. Tight ranges near overhead resistance levels generally resolve to the upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/dbf9ceca-007e-4b7c-b221-5c35cfbb29ed.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($64,371) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the $68,000 level is conquered, the BTC/USDT pair could start its journey to $73,777. This level may witness strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are the crucial support to watch for on the downside. A break and close below the moving averages suggest that the bulls have given up. The pair may dump to $59,600 and subsequently to $56,552.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the resistance line on May 19, but the bulls did not allow the price to dip below the 20-day EMA ($3,048).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/18fc3921-1eff-46f4-bb12-d4974f5b0c03.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will again attempt to shove the price above the resistance line. If they do that, it will signal a potential trend change in the near term. The ETH/USDT pair could rally to $3,400 and thereafter to the overhead resistance at $3,730.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to maintain their hold, they will have to pull the price below the 20-day EMA and sink the pair below the critical support at $2,850. The pair could then collapse to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been clinging to the moving averages for the past few days, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/e4ee6b4c-d5ed-419d-9454-dc399ddf1e66.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint do not clearly favor either the bulls or the bears. If the price falls below the support line of the triangle, it will suggest that bears have seized the advantage. The BNB/USDT pair could then decline to $536.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the support line and rises above the resistance line, it will signal that bulls have the edge. The pair could then retest the overhead resistance at $635.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually moving toward the immediate resistance at $185, signaling demand from the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/aad2c80f-35ad-4e02-9603-367990bf6409.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull the price below the breakout level of $162 on May 19, but the bulls held their ground. The $185 level may act as a minor hurdle, but if bulls overcome this obstacle, the SOL/USDT pair could surge to $205.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or $185 and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the bears are active at higher levels. The pair may then drop toward $140.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA $0.52 on May 17, but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that the bears are selling on relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/dc935329-00e9-4e0f-9fc3-57d8c0bd3a28.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price is getting squeezed between the support line and the 50-day SMA ($0.53). The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the support line could sink the XRP/USDT pair to the critical support at $0.46. This level is likely to witness solid buying by the bulls because a break below it may open the doors for a drop to $0.41. On the upside, if bulls pierce the 50-day SMA resistance, the pair could soar to $0.57.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/is-bitcoin-price-going-to-crash-again"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Is Bitcoin price going to crash again?}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) has been trading inside a wide range between $4.72 and $7.67 for several days, indicating uncertainty about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/1ca7e68e-65b9-47a4-8f11-56ea502141e3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA ($6.35) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest that the TON/USDT pair may remain inside the range for a while longer. If the price rebounds off the moving averages with strength, the pair will again attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $7.67.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price continues lower and breaks below the 50-day SMA ($6.02), it will suggest that the bears have a slight edge. The pair could then descend to the vital support at $4.72. The bulls are expected to vigorously defend the level.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the 20-day EMA ($0.15) for the past few days, signaling a balance between buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/6a7fd29f-64f2-42d4-b823-d39981772894.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest that the DOGE/USDT pair may remain inside the $0.12 to $0.17 range for some time. If the price rises and breaks above $0.17, it will signal that the correction may be over. The pair could then surge to $0.21.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price breaks below $0.12, it will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern, clearing the path for a drop to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to push Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day SMA ($0.49), signaling that the bears are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/28eca26c-df33-4dd0-801b-e84086c3ddc4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to tug the price below the 20-day EMA and challenge the support line. If the price rebounds off this level, it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may stay inside the triangle for a while.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level, the bulls will again attempt to overcome the obstacle at the resistance line. If they succeed, the pair may start its northward march toward $0.52 and then $0.57.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvNGExNTYxOWQtYTNmMC00ZTlhLWE5MjgtYTg0YjI0ODk5ZTU4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240520ek5k000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 create memecoin\par \b \uc2 How to create a memecoin on Solana?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Max Moeller \par \uc2 1,279 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Learn how to create a memecoin on Solana, a popular DeFi blockchain platform ripe for token creation.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/meme-coins-betrayal-crypto-ideals-or-true-purpose/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Memecoins}}}\uc2  are a prevalent part of the overall crypto ecosystem. Some memecoins, such as Pepe ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/pepe-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PEPE}}}\uc2  ), Dogwifhat (WIF) and Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ), hold a spot in the top 50 cryptocurrencies by market capitalization among Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), and other memecoin projects such as Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ), which are often in the news.\par \par \uc2 With such a buzz around memecoins, many may wonder how to create them on blockchain networks like \uc2 Solana\uc2 . This Solana token creation tutorial will cover creating a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-memecoin-hits-328-trillion-market-cap-but-its-honeypot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 memecoin}}}\uc2  on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-is-solana-and-how-does-it-work"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana blockchain}}}\uc2 , discuss the fundamentals of a memecoin, and explain how to market it.\par \par \uc2 What is a memecoin?\par \par \uc2 A memecoin is a cryptocurrency with little intended value. Rather than providing financial utility, such as the Ethereum network\u8217\'20\'19s capacity to host decentralized applications, a memecoin exists to capture a moment in popular culture. For example, Shiba Inu\u8217\'20\'19s creator built it simply because the Shiba Inu dog breed is a popular meme.\par \par \uc2 Memecoins that become popular may eventually gain utility in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/defi-a-comprehensive-guide-to-decentralized-finance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decentralized finance (DeFi)}}}\uc2  space. Many online stores now accept Dogecoin \u8212\'20\'14 one of the most popular memecoins \u8212\'20\'14 in exchange for goods and services. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-drops-bitcoin-payments-merchants-platform"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase Commerce}}}\uc2 , a payment processing service, began accepting DOGE in 2021.\par \par \uc2 While everyone invests for different reasons, users typically invest in memecoins because they start out at a low value or because the investor finds the meme funny. However, investors have fallen victim to memecoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-to-identify-and-avoid-a-crypto-pump-and-dump-scheme"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pump-and-dump}}}\uc2  schemes, losing thousands of dollars in the process. It\u8217\'20\'19s important that investors only invest what they can afford to lose.\par \par \uc2 Memecoins may be built on existing networks like Ethereum, BNB Chain or Solana, though some projects, such as Dogecoin, have their own blockchain networks.\par \par \uc2 Can I create a memecoin without development knowledge?\par \par \uc2 Users can create a memecoin without knowing how to code or develop software. Services like the Orion Tools {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-are-dapps-everything-there-is-to-know-about-decentralized-applications"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decentralized application (DApp)}}}\uc2  allow the creation of coding-free tokens. In the case of Solana, users must abide by the \uc2 Solana\uc2  token standards.\par \par \uc2 Prerequisites before creating a memecoin on Solana\par \par \uc2 Creating a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/you-can-now-create-a-shitcoin-in-less-than-23-seconds"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 successful memecoin}}}\uc2  on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/solana-sol-ecosystem-overview"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana}}}\uc2  blockchain requires some forethought.\par \par \uc2 Step 1: Choosing a meme\par \par \uc2 When deciding which meme to pick to create a memecoin, it\u8217\'20\'19s best to do some research. Is the meme popular enough to warrant a token? Does it have a dedicated subreddit or other online community? Is it referenced by big \uc2 YouTube\uc2  videos or used by the general public? If so, it\u8217\'20\'19s probably a good option for creating a memecoin.\par \par \uc2 Step 2: Utility plans\par \par \uc2 Is there a larger plan in place? If a user intends for their memecoin to have utility beyond a simple investment, it\u8217\'20\'19s best to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-is-a-white-paper-a-beginners-guide-on-how-to-write-and-format-one"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 create a white paper}}}\uc2  or website that details its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-is-tokenomics-a-beginners-guide-on-supply-and-demand-of-cryptocurrencies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tokenomics}}}\uc2  and future plans. This validity will help grow a dedicated community, as they\u8217\'20\'19ll have a plan to rally around.\par \par \uc2 Step 3: Time commitment\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-to-create-and-launch-a-cryptocurrency-token-with-tokenmint"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrency development}}}\uc2  can be a lengthy endeavor. Creating the token is just the start. Users must market it, monitor a growing community and eventually create utility. These processes require dedication and, in some cases, a deep understanding of the \uc2 Solana{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/no-code-blockchain-development"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 blockchain development}}}\uc2  ecosystem.\par \par \uc2 Step-by-step guide to creating a memecoin on Solana\par \par \uc2 There are various token creation applications and extensions for creating a memecoin on Solana. Many allow users to avoid {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-are-smart-contracts-a-beginners-guide-to-automated-agreements"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 smart contract}}}\uc2  development and build a memecoin without development knowledge. Users should be wary, as a few scam token creation services exist. This guide will cover the Orion Tools Solana token creation platform.\par \par \uc2 To start, users must acquire a Solana wallet. One of the most popular Solana wallets is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/phantom-wallet-ceo-explains-why-wallets-must-move-to-be-multichain"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Phantom Wallet}}}\uc2 . Upon acquiring a wallet, head over to the Orion Tools DApp and navigate to their token creator.\par \par \uc2 The token creator provides some \uc2 Solana\uc2  tokenization details to fill out, such as the token\u8217\'20\'19s name, its symbol and its total supply.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/754993d6-c6d7-4200-b053-d4798cf806eb.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 After inputting the name, users should input the token symbol and their desired decimal count. Token creators that want a larger token supply should have a lot of decimals.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/ca73d9e3-bbdb-4215-a2d9-ddd6c9f47d2a.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 When listed on an exchange, the symbol provides a memecoin with a ticker for easy identification. Otherwise, Orion recommends having nine decimal points for a meme token.\par \par \uc2 The next step is to input the desired supply and token image. Token supply dictates how much of a token actually exists.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/515aa4a1-b5b4-4cd9-8062-18f138771a53.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Then, the user needs to create a token description \u8212\'20\'14 a short few sentences describing the token\u8217\'20\'19s use case.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/72450ce9-f333-46f4-90e4-3215be9be19b.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Once the Solana token standards are in place, the token creator must click \u8220\'20\'1CCreate Token.\u8221\'20\'1D A wallet transaction confirmation detailing the transaction and its transaction fee will appear, which must be paid in Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) token. Users must have the required amount in their wallet to initiate a valid transaction.\par \par \uc2 Now that the token is created, if a user wants to create a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/defi-liquidity-pools-explained"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 liquidity pool}}}\uc2 , they must use the \u8220\'20\'1CCreate a Liquidity Pool\u8221\'20\'1D tool below the \u8220\'20\'1CCreate Token\u8221\'20\'1D tool they just finished with. They can simply select the created token and click \u8220\'20\'1CRevoke Freeze Authority.\u8221\'20\'1D This will cost another transaction fee, but it allows the creator to retain control over their asset. However, liquidity pools are necessary for long-term projects, as they allow traders to acquire the token.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/a09b38e0-3d63-4024-8c8b-03d2bee193af.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s also best to click \u8220\'20\'1CRevoke Mint Authority\u8221\'20\'1D to secure the Solana token minting process, preventing others from minting the token, which will charge yet another transaction fee. Finally, after the transactions are cleared, the created token will appear in the connected wallet.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/0fe72647-b30d-48df-993f-46a8f1d1ce15.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Now that the token is created, the creator can build a liquidity pool or market for their asset using Raydium or Invariant or share their token privately with friends. Creating a liquidity pool enables anyone to trade the token and is a popular choice for many involved in memecoin creation.\par \par \uc2 Marketing a memecoin created on the Solana blockchain\par \par \uc2 After creating a memecoin, users likely want to build momentum before its \uc2 Solana{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/a-beginners-guide-on-how-to-get-your-crypto-token-listed-on-an-exchange"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 token deployment on an exchange}}}\uc2 . There are a few ways to do this.\par \par \uc2 Creating a Telegram or Discord channel\par \par \uc2 Most memecoins have their own Telegram or \uc2 Discord\uc2  channel to promote news around the token and make announcements. A Telegram or \uc2 Discord\uc2  channel is a free way to bring awareness to a memecoin and serves as a space for users to discuss and ask questions about it.\par \par \uc2 Promoting the memecoin on social media\par \par \uc2 Promoting a memecoin on platforms like X or Reddit can help grow its community and inform users of its Solana token issuance date. For example, creating unique memes and posting them on relevant meme subreddits might draw attention to the project.\par \par \uc2 Influencer marketing\par \par \uc2 If the token creator has the funding to pay for it, they can promote their memecoin via influencers. Influencers and memes tend to go hand in hand, and if the memecoin is based on a large enough audience, one should have no problem partnering with an influencer or two.\par \par \uc2 Is it profitable to create a memecoin?\par \par \uc2 Creating a profitable memecoin is highly uncertain and not specific to \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s token economics. While popular memecoins like DOGE have seen success, most do not achieve significant profit.\par \par \uc2 Profitability often hinges on effective marketing, a strong community and a compelling meme that resonates with a broad audience. The inherent \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and unpredictability of cryptocurrency markets further complicate the potential success of a new memecoin, making it a risky venture.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvNmI5ODg1YjUtMzU4Zi00Yjg5LTlkYWMtNTA4Y2JhZjI4MTQ4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240520ek5k0008e\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,581 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins could continue their march higher as bulls attempt to clear the overhead hurdles.\par \par \uc2 The bears' failure to sink and sustain Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) below the psychological level of $60,000 seems to have attracted buyers who are trying to propel the price toward the range resistance. The current upmove does not guarantee a breakout from the range but reduces the possibility of a sharp correction in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recovery has boosted the daily volume in United States spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds. Market research firm Santiment said in a X post that the volume of the seven largest U.S. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-volumes-7-week-high-btc-price-67k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spot Bitcoin ETFs surged to $5.65 billion}}}\uc2 , the highest since March 24.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/a529b089-8ba5-439f-8773-9b746fb8392b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs have been a massive success, with 937 professional firms investing in them as of March 31, according to a X post by K33 Research senior analyst Ventle Lunde. The post added that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitwise-cio-says-btc-etfs-are-huge-success-and-13f-filings-make-him-incredibly-bullish"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 professional investors acquired $11.06 billion}}}\uc2  of spot Bitcoin ETFs, amounting to 18.7% of the total assets under management.\par \par \uc2 The arrival of institutional investors is good news for Bitcoin as the investors waiting on the sidelines are likely to enter on dips, which could limit the downside in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and select altcoins extend their up move? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin skyrocketed above the moving averages on May 15, and the bulls successfully defended the level during the retest on May 16.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/271f32bd-213f-47d7-8e96-c65e04af20db.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($63,507) has started to turn up gradually, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) has jumped into the positive territory, indicating that the bulls have a slight edge. There is a minor resistance at $68,000, but it is likely to be crossed. The BTC/USDT pair may then travel to the stiff overhead resistance at $73,777.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $68,000 and breaks below the moving averages, it will signal that the bears continue to sell on relief rallies. That could keep the pair range-bound between $68,000 and $56,500 for a while.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are back in Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) as the bears failed to sink the price below the strong support at $2,850.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/03a09511-7f80-4b22-bddb-0a4946a283d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair could reach the resistance line of the descending channel pattern, where the sellers are expected to mount a strong defense. If the price turns down sharply from the current level or the resistance line, the bears will make another attempt to tug the price below $2,850.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if buyers kick the price above the channel, it will signal that the downtrend could be ending. The pair may climb to $3,400 and thereafter attempt a rally to the solid resistance at $3,730.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) fell below the moving averages on May 14, but the bulls held the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/0f9b4efb-a917-4275-8d57-c998bbeede0e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair is preparing for an eventual breakout from the triangle. If the price turns down and plunges below the triangle, it could start a downward move to $536 and then to $495.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price continues higher and breaks above the triangle, it will suggest that the bulls have the upper hand. The pair could move up to $635, which may act as a minor hurdle but is likely to be crossed. The next stop is expected to be $692.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned up sharply on May 15 and surged above the moving averages, signaling that the bulls are attempting a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/540362ba-cd09-4a0f-8c38-e95bece1d895.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers continued their purchases and pushed the price above the $162 resistance on May 17. This clears the path for a possible rally to $185 and eventually to the formidable resistance at $205.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to prevent the upside, they will have to halt the rally and pull the price back below the moving averages. The bears will gain further strength on a slide below $140.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to rise toward the 50-day SMA ($0.54), indicating that the selling pressure is reducing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/03ed80b7-731c-4c1e-8b4f-0e077b2664dc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 50-day SMA may act as a minor hurdle, but if the bulls successfully defend the 20-day EMA on the way down, the XRP/USDT pair could reach the overhead resistance of $0.57. This level may again attract strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the 50-day SMA and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears sell on every minor rally. The pair could then descend to the support line and subsequently to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($6.34) on May 16, but the bulls are struggling to sustain the recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/050e14bc-1bdc-44c2-9d23-2a70146e323e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will again try to sink the price below the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, it will suggest that the TON/USDT pair will remain stuck inside the large range between $4.72 and $7.67 for several more days.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the 20-day EMA with force, it will signal that the bulls are aggressively defending the level. That will increase the likelihood of a retest of the overhead resistance of $7.67. If this level is crossed, the pair may rise to $9.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $0.17 and $0.12 for several days, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/fee4ff91-3933-4a85-965e-89a4f83bb443.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($0.15) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. If the price maintains above the 20-day EMA, the bulls will try to challenge the overhead resistance at $0.17. A break above this level could push the DOGE/USDT pair to $0.21.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break below the 20-day EMA could open the doors for a possible fall to the solid support at $0.12. A break and close below this support will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern, starting a collapse to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-golden-cross-last-sparked-170-btc-price-gains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin preps 'golden cross' which last sparked 170% BTC price gains}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) tight range trading between the 20-day EMA ($0.46) and the support line resolved to the upside on May 16.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/98c76a5d-aa03-4daf-a0bf-81de17c05943.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair is likely to start an up move that may face resistance at the 50-day SMA ($0.50) and then at $0.52. If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, it is likely to find support at the 20-day EMA. That will signal a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. The pair could then rally to $0.57.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the support line.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $29 and $40 for the past few days with no signs of a breakout in either direction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/5415e1d8-d7e7-463a-8722-1184ab7ccd02.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($35) on May 17, which opens the gates for a rise to $40. If buyers overcome the barrier at $40, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could move toward $50.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down sharply from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the pair may remain range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on May 16, indicating that the bears are defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/722750d5-ec9d-4832-9114-d71317b471d4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($0.000024) and the RSI just above the midpoint do not give any hint about the direction of the next breakout. Hence, it is better to wait for the price to break above or below the triangle before taking a directional view.\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower and breaks below the triangle, it will signal that the uncertainty has resolved to the downside. The SHIB/USDT pair could plummet to the 78.6% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.000017.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up and breaks above the triangle, it will suggest that the bulls have seized control. The pair could surge to $0.000030 and then to $0.000033.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvNTU4M2Y2YTItNWM3NC00NTU4LTlhZTgtOTIyMTdkYzk4ZGQzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240517ek5h000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
