ld{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/PawFury"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/PawFury}}}\par \par \uc2 CoinMarketCap: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/pawfury/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/pawfury/}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240517ek5g0000f\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/15: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, TON, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,658 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Better than expected, CPI figures appear to have triggered buying in Bitcoin and select altcoins.\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) and the Nasdaq Composite soared to a new lifetime high after the United States Consumer {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-64-7-k-us-cpi-core-inflation-3-year-low"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inflation report came in less than expected}}}\uc2 . That ignited a rally in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), pushing the price above $66,000. The farther Bitcoin moves from $60,000, the less likely a breakdown is. However, that does not guarantee the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Galaxy Digital\uc2  founder and CEO \uc2 Mike Novogratz\uc2  said during the firm\u8217\'20\'19s first quarter earnings call that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-stay-55k-75k-zone-for-now-galaxy-digital-mike-novogratz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin was likely to consolidate}}}\uc2  between $55,000 and $75,000 before moving higher at the end of the current quarter.\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to sink Bitcoin below $60,000 seems to have attracted buyers. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows Weekly\u8221\'20\'1D report showed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-investment-funds-intake-130m-while-filings-reveal-new-spot-btc-etf-purchasers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inflows of $130 million}}}\uc2  into \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products this past week, the first such occurrence in five weeks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/631c0b1c-b08f-4513-8e10-26440cb8f6f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 State of Wisconsin Investment Board\uc2  (SWIB) disclosed investments in spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/wisconsin-investments-spot-bitcoin-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 worth roughly $164 million}}}\uc2 . Bloomberg ETF analyst \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2  said in a X post that more such investments by institutions could be expected as they \u8220\'20\'1Ctend to move in herds.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and select altcoins overcome the near-term resistance and move higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin surged above the 20-day exponential moving average ($62,765) on May 15, indicating that the bulls have absorbed the supply.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/107eda87-c810-4a9f-9c64-f5c0eb67e6ff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers maintain the momentum and propel the price above the 50-day simple moving average ($65,152), it will open the gates for a possible rally to the formidable resistance at $73,777. The bears may defend this level with all their might.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside move, they will have to defend the 50-day SMA and tug the price to the $59,600 support. The bulls are likely to defend this level aggressively, because if the support cracks, the BTC/USDT pair may plunge to 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $54,298.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) strong bounce off the $2,850 support on May 15 suggests that the bulls are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/a7dda561-6abf-4373-90b0-7f217ed1de46.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers shove the price above the 20-day EMA ($3,026), the ETH/USDT pair could rise to the resistance line of the descending channel. The bears are likely to mount a vigorous defense at the resistance line, but if the bulls prevail, the pair may start a rally to $3,400.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will signal that bears are selling on every minor rally. The pair could then retest the strong support at $2,850. A break below this support could start a downward move toward the support line of the descending channel.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) fell below the moving averages on May 14 but rebounded sharply off the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern. This suggests aggressive buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/39b42d87-694a-41af-8f9e-9643626bd322.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to gain control by kicking the price above the resistance line of the triangle. If that happens, the BNB/USDT pair could surge to $634 and then to $692. The pattern target of the setup is $726.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below the triangle, it will suggest that bears have gained control in the near term. The pair could dive toward $495 and subsequently to the pattern target of $434.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 20-day EMA ($146) on May 15, indicating that the selling pressure is reducing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/a113478d-42ac-4b27-84a0-0c54fa196485.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains above $145, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to $162. In a range, traders generally sell close to the resistance, and they are likely to do that again near $162. If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, it will signal that the pair may remain range-bound for a while.\par \par \uc2 A break above $162 or below $126 could start the next trending move. If the $162 level is taken out, the pair may climb to $205. On the other hand, a break below $126 could sink the pair to $100.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.51) on May 14, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/a80b2610-44e6-4004-802f-494dc028fc23.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are again attempting to drive the price above the 20-day EMA on May 15. If they can pull it off, the XRP/USDT pair may rally to the overhead resistance at $0.57. This level could prove to be a difficult barrier to cross.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to strengthen their position by pulling the price to the critical support at $0.46. Buyers are expected to defend this level aggressively. A strong rebound off $0.46 will signal that the range-bound action may continue for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to push Toncoin (TON) above the $7.67 resistance on May 13, but the long wick on the candlestick shows selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/e533039d-928e-4fb6-90a0-071238b99303.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A minor advantage in favor of the bulls is that they have not ceded much ground to the bears. This suggests that the bulls may take one more shot at the overhead resistance. If buyers propel and maintain the price above $7.67, it will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The TON/USDT pair could rally to $9.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down from the current level and plummets below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to prevent Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) from slipping below the neckline and completing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/1a1b9e3c-5df7-4d32-9a91-e561566b555d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($0.15) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a range-bound action in the near term. If the price rises above the 20-day EMA, the DOGE/USDT pair could reach the 50-day SMA ($0.17). This is an essentialt level for the bears to defend because a break above it could clear the path for a rally to $0.21.\par \par \uc2 The bears will seize control if they sink and sustain the price below the neckline of the H&S pattern. That could start a drop to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to maintain Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) below the support line on May 15 attracted solid buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/8ec7d011-81c1-4b56-acac-b9d50c178d6d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory suggest that the bears have the upper hand. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA and sustains below the support line, it will signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could descend to $0.35.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price continues higher and jumps above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are losing their grip. The pair may climb to the 50-day SMA ($0.51) and later to $0.57.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the 20-day EMA ($35) for the past few days, but the bears have failed to pull the price to the support of the range at $29. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/ef56bea3-7ad1-4266-8233-dac1fdd924b6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to push the price above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, it will suggest that the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could remain range-bound between $40 and $29 for a few more days. A break above $40 could start a rally to $50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bears are trying to take charge. The pair may then slump to the strong support at $29. If this level breaks down, it will indicate the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The pair may then decline to the next support at $25.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully guarded the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern in Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) on May 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/b0a7fd7a-f57d-4f30-9892-844be0fe8023.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA ($0.000023) and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. It is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout with certainty, hence it is better to wait for the price to rise above or fall below the triangle before placing large bets.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks above the triangle, it will suggest that the corrective phase may be over. The SHIB/USDT pair could rise to $0.000030 and then to $0.000033. On the contrary, a break below the triangle could open the doors for a fall to the 78.6% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.000017.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvZWE5NDkzOTEtNDAyMS00NjFkLWEyOTItM2JhYjA4YjE1NzAzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240516ek5f00009\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/13: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,541 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin continues to find buyers near $60,000, indicating that the sentiment remains positive, but prices could still remain range-bound for the foreseeable future.\par \par \uc2 Traders prefer a trending market rather than a range-bound one. Sometimes, when there is uncertainty about the next directional move, traders step to the sidelines, and that seems to be the case with Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 According to research firm Santiment, \u8220\'20\'1Cfear and indecision\u8221\'20\'1D could be the factors that have led to a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cpi-60k-btc-price-battle-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 drop in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s on-chain activity toward historic lows}}}\uc2 . The firm clarified that it does not necessarily mean that Bitcoin will fall more.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s consolidation is giving opportunities to investors to load up on Bitcoin. Japanese investment firm Metaplanet said it had made a \u8220\'20\'1Cstrategic shift\u8221\'20\'1D in its treasury management {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/metaplanet-bitcoin-reserve-asset-117-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 strategy to follow a Bitcoin-only approach}}}\uc2  in response to a sustained decline in the Japanese yen. Metaplanet announced a purchase of 117.7 Bitcoin at an average price of $65,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/328328fe-2d06-41df-8c43-6a224a8f7e6e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Generally, a consolidation near a lifetime high is a positive sign as it shows that traders are holding onto their positions as they anticipate the uptrend to continue. However, even after repeated attempts, if the overhead resistance is not crossed, traders may dump their positions, starting a sharp pullback.\par \par \uc2 Will bulls defend the essential support levels in Bitcoin and select altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index has continued its northward march toward the all-time high, indicating demand from the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/6f0ea72e-5a09-47cc-860c-29456a9900a5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average (5,140) has started to slope up, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) has jumped into the positive territory, indicating a slight advantage to the buyers. If the 5,265 level is taken out, the index may travel toward 5,500.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They will attempt to stall the up move at 5,265. If the price turns down from this level, the index may stay range-bound between 5,265 and 4,950 for a while.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) broke below the 20-day EMA (105) on May 9, indicating aggressive selling by the bears on every minor rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/26483234-ae50-4cbd-b556-d3d62455a9a7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sink the price to the 50-day simple moving average (104), which could again act as a strong support. If the price bounces off the 50-day SMA, the index may again attempt to rise above the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the index could rally to 106.50.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price continues lower and breaks below the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that the bears are in charge. The index may slump to the support line, which is likely to attract strong buying from the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to sustain Bitcoin above the 20-day EMA ($62,671), indicating that the bears are maintaining the pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/cbe267b5-04c0-4534-bd86-3e7b63f7b692.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest the range-bound action may extend for a few more days. If buyers maintain the price above the 20-day EMA, the BTC/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($65,426). This level may act as a stiff resistance, but if the bulls surpass it, the pair may climb to $73,777.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 50-day SMA, it will indicate that bears are active at higher levels. The pair may then slump to the critical support zone between $59,600 and $56,500.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the descending channel pattern, indicating that the bears are in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/47718d4d-c9e4-410d-9222-974cb236a3f5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price is attempting to bounce off $2,850, an important level for the bulls to defend. If this level breaks down, the ETH/USDT pair could start the next leg of the downtrend to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bulls. If they want to make a comeback, they will have to start a recovery and drive the price above the resistance line. The pair may then rise to $3,357 and later to $3,730.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the downtrend line and the moving averages, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/a5e08dbe-e0ab-45ef-8d57-ed080f6838ab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price skids below the moving averages, the short-term advantage will tilt in favor of the bears. The BNB/USDT pair could move downward to $536 and later to the crucial support at $495.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up and breaks above the downtrend line, it will suggest that the bulls have the upper hand. The buyers will attempt to push the price above $635 and resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke below the $140 support on May 13, but the bears could not pull the price to the pivotal support at $126.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/6daf93b9-8827-402e-9aab-10490439d889.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($146) and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price turns up and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest solid buying at lower levels. The pair may reach the stiff resistance at $162.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA and breaks below $137, it will signal that bears are trying to take charge. The SOL/USDT pair could descend to $126, which is when the bulls are expected to start buying.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the 20-day EMA ($0.52), but the bears have failed to sink the price to the essential support at $0.46.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/a77a6eb6-115f-4ace-9d00-415f7ddd1390.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI near 43 suggest that the bears have the edge. Any recovery attempt is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the XRP/USDT pair could dive to $0.46. Buyers are expected to fiercely defend this level.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $0.46 with strength and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the pair may extend its range-bound action for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) has been gradually moving higher toward the overhead resistance of $7.67, signaling demand from the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/d68c3bb9-78fa-47b2-8312-707d824da37c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are expected to pose a strong challenge at $7.67, but if the bulls do not give up much ground from this resistance, it will enhance the prospects of an upside breakout. The TON/USDT pair could then rally toward $9.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down sharply from the overhead resistance, it will indicate that the bears are not willing to relent. The pair could then descend to the moving averages, which is likely to act as a strong support.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating between the 50-day SMA ($0.16) and the horizontal support at $0.12 for some time.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/ddd09bb6-8d11-4392-a291-705a81f7c4cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to maintain the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.15). If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA. This is an important level for the bears to defend because a rally above it could open the doors for a rally to the overhead resistance zone between $0.21 and $0.23.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a break and close below $0.12 will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. The pair may then dive to the strong support at $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off the support line on May 13, an important short-term level for the bulls to guard.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/9104d962-6208-402f-8649-09cb96c6b3f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.46) and the RSI in the negative zone suggest that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If the price breaks and maintains below the support line, the next stop could be $0.40.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price continues higher and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that bulls remain buyers on dips. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may rise to the 50-day SMA ($0.52) and eventually to $0.57.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvMmFhYzMyZTEtMjQ4NS00N2NkLTg4MjktMDI0ZjM3MmVjMmNmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240514ek5d0000a\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
