\par\par \b \uc2 7 Cryptos Cheaper Than a Big Mac That Could Make You Wealthy\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 294 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 May 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BlastUP Presale: A Beacon of Predictability in the Volatile Crypto Space}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP Market Sentiment Shows Cautious Optimism Amid \b  \highlight22Volatility\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano Faces Mixed Market Sentiments; What's Next for \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ?}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 FLOKI Enjoys \b  \highlight22Bullish\b0 \highlight22  Trend Despite Recent \b  \highlight22Volatility\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bonk Token's Dynamic Market Performance Raises Optimism}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin Sees Surging Optimism Amid Volatile Market}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ondo Shows \b  \highlight22Bullish\b0 \highlight22  Signs Amid Market Fluctuations}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Shiba Inu Awaits Breakthrough Amid Fluctuating Sentiment}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Conclusion}}}\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrencies can be startling with their potential for growth. Imagine finding coins priced less than a snack that could potentially enhance one's wealth significantly. With the bull run of 2024 underway, smart choices could pave the way to prosperity. Savvy investors often look for such promising yet affordable coins. This article explores seven such cryptocurrencies, highlighting their low entry price and possibility for future gains. Interested readers may find valuable insights on where to direct their attention in a surging market.\par \par \uc2 BlastUP Presale: A Beacon of Predictability in the Volatile Crypto Space\par \par \uc2 Presale tokens are immune to market\u8217\'20\'19s wild swings with their price pinned to a certain level. Predictability is one of the key benefits of presale projects such as BlastUP.\par \par \uc2 BlastUP is the first launchpad on Blast, the only Layer 2 solution with native yield for ETH and stablecoins. In just a few weeks of its presale, this platform has raised nearly$6 million which speaks much for its wide recognition among savvy investors.\par \par \uc2 The presale of BlastUP tokens is underway, offering a decent chance to invest in a promising asset at a low price.\par \par \uc2 Don\u8217\'20\'19t Miss Out! Buy BlastUP Tokens at the Best Price! Act Fast! Supply of BlastUP Tokens is Limited - Secure Your Spot NOW! \par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240511ek5a00009\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/10: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,534 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins fall under pressure again as bears aim to take out the last remaining support levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) continues searching for direction as the bears and the bulls battle it out for supremacy. Glassnode founders Jan Happel and Yana Allemann believe the price will resolve to the upside. They said in a X post that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bullish-hammer-candle-price-reversal-crypto-traders"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 they expect Bitcoin to}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1CBLOW higher.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The uncertainty about the next directional move has not stopped purchases by the whales. Market intelligence firm Santiment said in a X post that whale wallets holding between 1,000 and 10,000 Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-reasons-why-bitcoin-traders-say-a-btc-price-trend-reversal-is-overdue"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 acquired roughly $941 million worth of Bitcoin}}}\uc2  in a 24-hour period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/a4528836-8e19-4e04-bda0-471788e2c16d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s long-term investors do not seem to be worried about the range-bound price action in the near term. In a recent interview with journalist \uc2 Mike Solana\uc2 , \uc2 Twitter\uc2  co-founder \uc2 Jack Dorsey\uc2  said that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jack-dorsey-predicts-bitcoin-price-worth-one-million-2030"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could skyrocket to at least $1 million}}}\uc2  by 2030 and even surpass the level from that point onward.\par \par \uc2 Could buyers continue to defend the support levels in Bitcoin and altcoins, or will the bears prevail? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls are trying to keep the price above the psychological support at $60,000 but are facing selling at the 20-day exponential moving average ($62,959).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/141ef8bc-388b-43bd-8a27-e2b4500433ae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) in the negative territory suggest that the bears have the upper hand. If the $59,650 support cracks, the BTC/USDT pair may plummet to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $54,298.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns up and breaks above the 50-day simple moving average ($65,620). The pair could then accelerate toward the critical overhead resistance of $73,777.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the 20-day EMA ($3,087) and the horizontal support at $2,850 for several days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/7cbe3cb9-0cf0-4dca-9b54-554de3ef9718.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory indicate advantage to sellers. A break and close below $2,850 will signal the resumption of the downtrend. The ETH/USDT pair may collapse to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line.\par \par \uc2 The zone between the 20-day EMA and the resistance line is likely to act as a critical resistance. Buyers will have to shove the price above this zone to suggest a potential trend change. The pair may climb to $3,350.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the moving averages on May 8, but the move lacked momentum, indicating hesitation to continue buying at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/19fbf02a-c7ef-449c-afe1-b653a0ba4037.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above the downtrend line, it will increase the likelihood of a rally to the overhead resistance of $635. This is an important level to watch out for because a break above it could open the doors for a rally to $692.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to tug the price below the moving averages. If they do that, the BNB/USDT pair may slump to $536 and then to the solid support at $495.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) fell below the 20-day EMA ($146) on May 8, but the bears could not sustain the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/8467f4ee-6a4b-4a3a-85c8-48fb8a291c89.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Solid buying by the bulls pushed the price back above the 20-day EMA on May 9, but the SOL/USDT pair could not reach the $162 resistance. The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $162, it will suggest that the bulls are back in the game. The pair may rise to $185 and later to $205. The critical support zone to watch on the downside is between $126 and $116.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $0.46 and $0.57 for the past few days, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/74166cf3-9fdf-47a7-bb50-bfdd9698dd99.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price slipped below the 20-day EMA ($0.52) on May 7, indicating that the bears are trying to take charge. Sellers will try to pull the price to the crucial support at $0.46, where buyers are expected to step in and defend the level with all their might. A strong bounce off $0.46 could extend the stay inside the range for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and maintain the price above $0.57 to suggest that the correction could be coming to an end.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) rebounded off the moving averages on May 8 and cleared the hurdle at the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $6.49 on May 10, signaling that the correction may be over.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/be4ba205-6bac-4338-947b-7e9466388668.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($5.81) has started to turn up gradually, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  has risen into positive territory, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. The TON/USDT pair will attempt a rally to $7.67.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down sharply from the current level or the overhead resistance at $7.67, it will suggest that bears remain active at higher levels. That could result in the formation of a range between $4.72 and $7.67.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to prevent Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) from retesting the neckline of the large head-and-shoulders pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/a6c5c986-cf57-4170-a568-c49c7acd6a05.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.15) to clear the path for a rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.17). This is an essential level for the bears to defend because a break above it could start a rally to $0.21.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the current level or the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that the DOGE/USDT pair may spend some more time inside the range. The trend is likely to turn \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the price skids below $0.12.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/telegram-toncoin-soars-50-may-3-reasons"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Telegram-linked Toncoin soars 50% in May for these 3 reasons}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) remains stuck between the 20-day EMA ($0.47) and the support line, indicating uncertainty among the bulls and the bears about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/6cd91900-48b0-48ef-af4e-700f483c08e8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory indicate advantage to bears. If the price breaks below the support line, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could move downward toward $0.35.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bulls are on a comeback. The pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($0.53) and later to the overhead resistance of $0.57. This zone is likely to witness strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $29 and $40 for several days, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/574e4eb2-b7b1-482a-8906-0e90bf03b8d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 In a range, traders usually buy the dips to the support and sell near the resistance. The price action in between could be random and volatile. If the price breaks above the 20-day EMA ($36), the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could reach $40.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that higher levels continue to attract sellers. The pair may slump to the solid support at $29. The next trending move is likely to begin above $40 or below $29.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade between the 20-day EMA ($0.000024) and the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/a4b9beeb-e34c-40c1-9d64-306fdb824bfe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 It is difficult to predict the direction of breakout from a triangle with certainty. Hence, it is better to wait for the price to escape the triangle before taking a directional view. If the price plunges below the triangle, it will signal that the bears have overpowered the bulls. The SHIB/USDT pair may then descend to the 78.6% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.000017.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest buying at lower levels. The pair may rally to the resistance line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvNjljZWIyNzQtMmE0Mi00ODI3LWI0NDUtZDY2ZDk2YmExMWEyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240510ek5a000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/8: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,591 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins look ready for a range-break, but the direction of it remains uncertain.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a see-saw battle between the bulls and the bears. After {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-62k-bitcoin-bulls-suffer-post-halving"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 receiving more than $595 million in inflows}}}\uc2  into the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds on May 3 and May 6, the tide turned on May 7 with an outflow of $15.7 million, according to Farside Investors data.\par \par \uc2 Irrespective of the short-term uncertainty, crypto bull Anthony Pompliano remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the long term. While speaking to CNBC, Pomp said that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s 200-day simple moving average hit a new all-time high above $50,000, indicating that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-record-high-200-day-moving-average"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long-term trend remains \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/3608503a-1a2c-4d3e-ae91-ca986a2d8d7c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The sideways price action has not deterred institutional investors from investing in spot Bitcoin ETFs. Quantitative trading firm \uc2 Susquehanna International Group\uc2  said in its filing that it had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/susquehanna-international-group-1-billion-bitcoin-etfs-portfolio"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 acquired more than $1 billion worth}}}\uc2  of shares of Bitcoin spot ETFs in the first quarter of 2024.\par \par \uc2 Could buyers protect the support levels in Bitcoin and altcoins and prevent a collapse? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recovery hit a wall at the 50-day simple moving average ($65,829) on May 6, indicating that the bears are vigorously defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/b49a480a-5bb5-43f0-99e7-59f3043bddcc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair could descend to $59,600 and later to $56,500, which remains the key support to watch out for. If the price plunges below $56,500, the next stop is likely to be the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $54,298 and then $50,000.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls want to prevent the downside move, they will have to quickly shove the price above the 50-day SMA. If they do that, the pair is likely to pick up momentum and rally to the overhead resistance at $73,777.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears are fiercely defending the zone between the 20-day exponential moving average ($3,116) and the resistance line of the descending channel pattern in Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/693848c7-fd7a-47ef-ba96-c589d14693ee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position by pulling the price below the vital support at $2,850. If they manage to do that, the ETH/USDT pair could start the next leg of the downtrend to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from $2,850, it will suggest that the bulls are protecting this level with vigor. The bulls will have to drive the price above the resistance line to signal a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the moving averages for the past few days, indicating uncertainty about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/ca85b9c0-f35b-4bb2-b76e-322dfbbe0f61.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains below the moving averages, the bears will try to yank the BNB/USDT pair down to $536 and next to the solid support at $495. A bounce off this level could signal that the range-bound action may extend for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $635, it will suggest that the bulls have overpowered the bears. The pair could then resume its uptrend toward the next target objective of $692.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating between $162 and $126 for several days, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/e34c0407-8565-4e3f-b40f-a2b21fdcda8d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA ($146) and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price slips below the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to pull the SOL/USDT pair down to $126. A break below this support could start a downtrend to the psychological support at $100.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns up and breaks above $162, it will indicate that the corrective phase may be over. The pair could rally to $185 and later to $205, which is likely to act as a stiff barrier.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) price action over the past few days has formed a tight range between $0.57 and $0.46. Traders generally sell near the resistance, and that is what happened on May 6.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/672c68e1-68f5-459c-a6fa-5815973da6b2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.53) has flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just below the midpoint, suggesting equilibrium between buyers and sellers. If the price remains below the 20-day EMA, the possibility of a drop to $0.46 increases.\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains above the 20-day EMA, the XRP/USDT pair could rise to $0.57. The bulls will have to drive and sustain the price above this resistance to seize control. The pair could then attempt a rally to $0.67.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned lower from the 50-day SMA ($0.17) on May 6 and fell below the 20-day EMA ($0.15) on May 7.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/40f5fece-e3d9-4e15-b674-64edb4248c2d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position and tug the price toward the crucial support at $0.12. This level is likely to witness solid buying by the bulls. If the price rebounds off the support, it will suggest that the DOGE/USDT pair may stay range-bound between $0.12 and the 50-day SMA for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to overcome the barrier at the 50-day SMA to open the doors for a possible rally to $0.21. On the downside, a break below $0.12 will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern and start a downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) turned down from the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $6.13, indicating that the bears are selling on relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/9576f07f-d84d-4164-a65a-a144e9858810.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($5.64) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. If the price rebounds off the moving averages with strength, the bulls will try to clear the overhead hurdle at the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $6.49. If they succeed, it will suggest that the corrective phase may be over.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, the advantage will tilt in favor of the bears if the price slips below the moving averages. The TON/USDT pair could then slump to the solid support at $4.72.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-solana-sol-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Solana (SOL) price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is getting squeezed between the 20-day EMA ($0.47) and the support line, signaling a breakout is around the corner.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/c7a1a134-7511-4a89-81f6-8e711119e69f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 It is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout with certainty, hence it is better to wait for the price to start a directional move before placing large bets. If the price breaks above the 20-day EMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($0.53) and later to $0.57.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and breaks below the support line, it will signal that the bears remain in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair may skid to $0.40, which is a necessary support to watch out for. A break below this level could sink the pair to $0.35.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance of $40 on May 6, signaling that the bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/b168a06e-5e22-43dc-b296-7e60f98dc212.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($36.44) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory point to a possible drop to the support of the range at $29. A bounce off this level could keep the pair stuck inside the $29 to $40 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 The advantage will tilt in favor of the bulls after they push and maintain the price above $40. Conversely, a break and close below $29 will indicate that the bears have seized control. The \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could dive toward the pattern target of $18.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 50-day SMA ($0.000026) on May 6, indicating that the bears are aggressively defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/2cf1b441-1f13-4d65-af00-aa1bcfa8c260.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern, signaling indecision between the bulls and the bears. If the price plummets below the triangle, it will indicate that the bears have the upper hand. The SHIB/USDT pair could then drop to the 78.6% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.000017.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price bounces off the triangle\u8217\'20\'19s support line, it will suggest demand at lower levels. The pair may spend some more time inside the triangle. A break and close above the triangle will signal advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvZDI0ZDVmMWEtZmJiZC00MDAyLTlhNGItZjQ0Yzc5NmI0MjNhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240508ek58000e4\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 What is Ethereum price\par \b \uc2 Why is Ethereum (ETH) price down today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Marcel Pechman \par \uc2 714 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 ETH price hangs on to the $3,000 level, but a handful of \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  headwinds continue to take their toll.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is struggling to maintain the $3,000 support level, experiencing a 4.1% decline in just two days. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum appears to be influenced by several factors, including the delay in launching an Ethereum spot exchange-traded fund (ETF) in the United States, decreased network usage, and a notable decrease in the ETH burn rate. As a result, Ether's price has dropped by 15% since April.\par \par \uc2 Recession risk increased, but stock buybacks got investors\u8217\'20\'19 attention\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been further dampened by remarks made by Susan Collins, the \uc2 Boston Federal Reserve\uc2  Chair, who suggested that resilient inflation may force the central bank to maintain higher interest rates for an extended period. According to Yahoo Finance, Collins' speech on May 8 highlighted the need for slower economic growth to reduce demand. As long as interest rates remain above inflation, there is less incentive for individuals and companies to take out loans for consumption or production.\par \par \uc2 On one hand, the potential negative impact on corporate earnings could benefit alternative assets such as cryptocurrencies. However, if investors fear a significant recession, many are likely to seek refuge in fixed-income and cash positions. The increased stock buybacks in the U.S. market, driven by well-capitalized companies, further complicate Ether's recovery path. Despite potential earnings growth, buybacks reduce sell pressure and compensate for a stagnant economy.\par \par \uc2 While Ether's performance might be influenced by the 3% correction in the total cryptocurrency market capitalization since May 6th, other altcoins like BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ), Tron (TRX), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), and \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) have outperformed Ether by 3% or more during the same period. Even when compared to Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether's price has lagged by 1.5%. This suggests that there are factors specific to Ether that are negatively impacting its price.\par \par \uc2 Ether price falls amid regulatory pressure and weak network activity\par \par \uc2 The possibility of an Ethereum U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 ETF approval\b0 \highlight\uc2  was dampened after the SEC {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/galaxy-ethereum-etf-sec-decision-moved-to-july"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 postponed its decision}}}\uc2  on the Invesco and Galaxy Digital proposal on May 6th, extending the deadline until July 2024. Moreover, the refusal of \uc2 U.S. SEC\uc2  Chair \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2  to clarify whether Ethereum could be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/gary-gensler-sec-gets-asked-too-many-crypto-questions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 considered a security}}}\uc2  during his appearance on CNBC's Squawk Box on May 7 has further eroded investor confidence in the ETF's prospects. Gensler's appearance followed six crypto-related lawsuits in 2024.\par \par \uc2 On-chain analysis for Ethereum has been unfavorable in recent weeks. According to ultrasound.money, the burn mechanism for Ether has hit its lowest levels in 2024.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/5bf6b46d-0147-4003-a858-77f07d0ab4dc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s 7-day burn and supply data. Source: ultrasound.money\par \par \uc2 The EIP-1559 protocol burns a fraction of the gas fees per transaction, so lower network demand leads to a higher ETH supply growth. The latest data shows an ETH 4,853 burn in 7 days, significantly lower than the ETH 17,628 issued in the same period. Although the 12,774 ETH supply increase in the past 7 days represents a mere 0.57% annualized inflation, the issue with Ethereum network's lesser use becomes more concerning when considering its second layer scaling solutions.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/public-blockchain-ledgers-not-fit-purpose-jpmorgan"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Public blockchain ledgers \u8216\'20\'18not fit for purpose,\u8217\'20\'19 says JPMorgan}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/187cfb4f-45ae-4f90-a8ed-6ee549ef03fc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Blockchains ranked by 7-day DEX volumes, USD. Source: DappRadar\par \par \uc2 The decline in Ethereum's demand has impacted its ecosystem, including projects like Arbitrum, Base, Polygon and ZkSync Era. In contrast, \uc2 Solana\uc2  and Thorchain have shown increased activity. Similarly, Sui and Avalanche experienced a comparatively smaller decline in decentralized exchange (DEX) volumes compared to other platforms.\par \par \uc2 The exact reasons behind investors' decision to sell Ether are unclear. However, there seems to be reduced confidence in the U.S. approving an Ethereum spot instrument. Additionally, recent network health metrics for Ethereum have deteriorated. The uncertainty surrounding recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/consensys-lawsuit-sec-ethereum"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 regulatory actions}}}\uc2  against the crypto industry, including \uc2 Consensys\uc2 , may also help explain the weakness in Ethereum's price.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTIvNzY1MTY5ZjktYTBmMC00MTdlLTgwYTctZTQ2YzYyZDU4ZjI2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240508ek58000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/6: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,610 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Charts suggest Bitcoin price will remain rangebound in the short term, which could give altcoins a chance to rally.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) witnessed increased \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  last week. The price recovered from an intraweek low of about $56,500 to finish above $64,000, a marginal gain of roughly 1.5% over the previous week. This shows that the sentiment remains positive, and lower levels are being purchased by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 According to Farside Investors data, the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds recorded net inflows of $378 million on May 3. Particularly encouraging was the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-gbtc-inflows-record-bitcoin-exchange-traded-fund-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $63 million inflow into the Grayscale Bitcoin Trust}}}\uc2  ETF, its first since its conversion into a spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  in January. Although it is too early to tell, early signs suggest that the incessant selling in the GBTC could end.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/0f871d34-55f7-4520-a04c-6ab02b217232.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recovery in 2024 has helped the sector attract venture capital funding in excess of $1 billion for two consecutive months in March and April, according to RootData. This was the first such occasion since October through November 2022.\par \par \uc2 What are the important resistance levels to watch out for in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears are struggling to sustain the S&P 500 Index below the moving averages, indicating solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/d22b4645-3f90-448e-8f12-37fecef50b73.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above the 50-day simple moving average (5,131), it will signal that the corrective phase may be over. The index may attempt a rally to the all-time high at 5,265, where the bulls are likely to encounter strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from 5,265, the index may enter a range for a few days. On the other hand, a break above 5,265 will indicate the resumption of the uptrend. The index may attempt a rally to 5,500. The important support on the downside is 5,000 and then 4,950.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) turned down from the 106.50 overhead resistance on May 1, indicating that the bears are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/376f36b4-dc6a-4218-9c9a-d6a6159ae0c2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price below the 20-day EMA (105.43) on May 2 and extended the fall to the 50-day SMA (104.56) on May 3. Lower levels attracted solid buying by the bulls, as seen from the long tail on the May 3 candlestick.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will increase the likelihood of a drop to the support line of the ascending channel. On the other hand, a break above the 20-day EMA could propel the price toward 106.50.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin surged above the 20-day EMA ($63,556) after a minor hesitation, but the bulls could not pierce the 50-day SMA ($65,937).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/92552fee-1bee-40d5-9a79-288acd90785a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, indicating a range-bound action in the near term. The BTC/USDT pair is likely to remain between $56,500 and $73,777 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the 50-day SMA could attract further buying, which could push the pair to the pivotal level of $73,777. The bulls are expected to face formidable resistance at this level because if it breaks down, the pair may start the next leg of the uptrend to $80,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke out of the 20-day EMA ($3,143) on May 6, but the long wick on the candlestick shows strong selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/160fdbca-bb26-4185-bc9d-d7c1ac8d694a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sellers will try to build upon their strength and pull the price down to the vital support at $2,850. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a drop below it could result in a decline to the support line of the descending channel.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns up from the current level and soars above the resistance line. Such a move will suggest a potential trend change. The ETH/USDT pair may then rise to $3,730.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rose above the moving averages on May 3, signaling that the bulls are trying to push the price to the overhead resistance of $635.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/247550b1-2833-4972-81e1-37cf43c450f6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears have successfully protected the $635 level on four previous occasions, hence they will try to do the same again. If the price turns down sharply from the overhead resistance, it will suggest that the BNB/USDT pair may oscillate between $495 and $635 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above $635 will indicate the resumption of the uptrend. The pair may then climb to $692, where the buyers may face stiff resistance. On the way down, the bears will have to sink and maintain the price below $495 to seize control.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $126 and $162 for several days, indicating indecision about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/2186a58d-170f-4a77-a2c0-4e810c281fc4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($146) and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest that the range-bound action may continue for some more time. If the price maintains above the 20-day EMA, the SOL/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $162. Buyers may find it difficult to overcome this obstacle.\par \par \uc2 However, if the bulls bulldoze their way above $162, the pair may accelerate toward $205. This level is likely to act as a formidable resistance. On the downside, a break below the 20-day EMA could sink the pair to $126.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.53) on May 6, indicating that the corrective phase may be ending.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/bd92c9a7-f51b-4176-b6b7-b2c9d8c7bb48.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. This advantage will tilt in favor of the bulls if they drive the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.56). The XRP/USDT pair could then pick up momentum and climb to the stiff resistance at $0.67.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to protect the 50-day SMA and pull the price back below the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the pair may plummet toward the crucial support zone between $0.46 and $0.41.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-cardano-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) price up this week?}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) rose above the moving averages on May 3, indicating that the lower levels are attracting strong buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/65bc6604-2e2c-47fa-96ff-2c793786caa8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The relief rally is likely to face selling in the zone between the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $6.13 and the 61.8% retracement level of $6.49. If the price turns down from the overhead zone, the bears will try to strengthen their position by pulling the TON/USDT pair below the moving averages. That could tug the price to the pivotal support at $4.72.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price breaks above $6.49, it will signal sustained buying at higher levels. That could open the doors for a possible rise to $7.24 and thereafter to $7.67.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) recovery is facing selling at the 50-day SMA ($0.17), but a minor advantage in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to slip below the 20-day EMA ($0.15).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/6c109d7f-90a6-4d26-abd9-7ba5b85c4e13.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains above the 20-day EMA, the bulls will take another shot at the 50-day SMA. The repeated retest of a resistance level tends to weaken it. If this level is taken out, the DOGE/USDT pair could start a rally to $0.21.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside move, they will have to quickly pull the price back below the 20-day EMA. If they do that, it will suggest that the bears remain active at higher levels. The pair may then drop to $0.12.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) once again turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.47) on May 6, indicating that the bears continue to defend the level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/928dade0-cc02-4bd8-aefb-c7e593acd64b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to defend the $0.46 support because if this level breaks down, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could retest the crucial support at $0.40. Buyers are expected to fiercely defend this level.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the selling pressure is reducing. The pair could then attempt a rally to the overhead resistance at $0.57.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvOTc3OGJmZmUtYWViMy00ZjY3LTkwMDAtYTYyNmFmY2RhMWEyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240506ek56000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Why is Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) price up this week?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 690 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Broader market uptrends and \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 's proposal to partner with Bitcoin Cash are boosting Cardano prices at the start of this week.\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) experienced a notable rise at the start of this week, rising over 3.70% to reach $0.476 on May 6.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/f3f1cab6-456a-4e2f-832b-78b8810d7989.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rise today mirrors upside sentiment elsewhere in the crypto market. For instance, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), the leading cryptocurrencies by market cap, have risen by approximately 2.5% and 2.70%, respectively.\par \par \uc2 This uptrend reflects a growing interest in cryptocurrencies, spurred by a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-springs-62k-us-jobs-data-boosts-rate-cut-bets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 less aggressive monetary policy outlook}}}\uc2  from the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  for 2024. Concurrently, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is benefiting from several additional \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  catalysts discussed below.\par \par \uc2 Cardano founder teases Bitcoin Cash partnership\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's gains today follow the Cardano founder \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 's proposal to partner with Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 On May 4, Hoskinson {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-founder-proposes-bitcoin-cash-integration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 conducted}}}\uc2  a "hypothetical poll" on X, querying the community's interest in integrating Cardano with Bitcoin Cash. The poll had garnered over 14,360 votes as of May 6, with 68.1% in favor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/6b3331d7-b15a-4198-8364-e35ad43349b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: X\par \par \uc2 Hoskinson introduced the term "partnerchain" to suggest that Bitcoin Cash would need to be bridged or cross-chained for compatibility with Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s proposed upgrades. However, reaching an agreement on the technical specifics and achieving consensus among stakeholders and developers remains a necessary hurdle.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's crypto market dominance improves\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's gains today are largely attributed to a shift in capital from Bitcoin, which holds over 50% of the crypto market's valuation, to Cardano.\par \par \uc2 On May 6, the closely monitored \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /BTC pair rose by 1.54% to 729 satoshis. Simultaneously, the Cardano Dominance Index (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 .D), measuring \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's market cap relative to the total crypto market, also increased.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/ee7255a1-cadd-44bb-b168-929fdf6c7441.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 .D and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /BTC daily performance chart. Source: X\par \par \uc2 These developments suggest that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is gaining ground against Bitcoin while capturing a larger share of the total crypto market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 That is further visible in the net capital flows across crypto asset funds in April. Cardano funds received $1.5 million, but Bitcoin and Ether funds lost $54 million and $123.8 million, respectively, according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://blog.coinshares.com/volume-180-digital-asset-fund-flows-weekly-report-998dde70036b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinShares weekly report}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/af098849-00ff-4a0b-ad8d-c36e0afa1ce0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Flow by asset. Source: \uc2 CoinShares\par \par \uc2 Cardano shows signs of further recovery against Bitcoin, according to a growing \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence between \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /BTC and its daily relative strength index (RSI). That is akin to a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence signal in October-November 2023 that preceded a 30% rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/714f0558-faa4-4b13-8c4b-6f913b4057fa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /BTC daily price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Cardano price outlook\par \par \uc2 Cardano's gains today are part of a technical bounce initiating from its interim support level at around $0.455. Interestingly, this support level coincides with the trough of the right shoulder of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's prevailing inverse-head-and-shoulders (IH&S) pattern, as shown below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/1f910409-29a1-4205-ac64-a133e92f1705.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD four-hour price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 IH&S patterns resolve after the price breaks above the neckline resistance and rise by as much as the maximum distance between the head's trough and the neckline. Therefore, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's upside target comes to be around $0.543 in May if its price breaks above the neckline resistance at $0.476.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/extreme-greed-past-65k-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Back to extreme greed past $65K? 5 things to know in Bitcoin this week}}}\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a pullback from the IH&S neckline risks triggering a head-and-shoulder setup, as shown in the daily chart below. The point where a potential pullback might occur aligns with \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's descending trendline resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/ee6831d9-9f92-4e97-8f8a-4a3196837409.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downside of the pattern at $0.351, which is also a descending trendline support, is where the price might target in May if the pattern completes.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvZWUyNDI5NjYtNjU2OS00YWFhLTg0ZTEtZDAzY2FiYzMxMWIxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240506ek560008e\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin opens $63K futures gap as thin liquidity threatens BTC price\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 553 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin faces thin liquidity as a weekend rebound gathers pace \u8212\'20\'14 can BTC price performance stay so strong?\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) pushed to $64,500 on May 4 as out-of-hours trading produced fresh BTC price gains.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/5cf4a209-bf47-4ad2-a4ae-96158b3873ff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ups \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  as weekend begins\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscription.cointelegraph.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCGBP/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  confirmed new local highs of $64,522 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 a new peak for May.\par \par \uc2 Strength which appeared on United States employment data gathered speed into the daily close, fueled by encouraging crypto market recovery signals including the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-gbtc-inflows-record-bitcoin-exchange-traded-fund-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 first inflows for the Grayscale Bitcoin Trust (GBTC)}}}\uc2  in nearly three months.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD was up 5% month-to-date at the time of writing, per data from monitoring resource {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coinglass.com/today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinGlass}}}\uc2 , already contrasting with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-loses-60k-support-2-month-lows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 April\u8217\'20\'19s 15% losses}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/966cbbef-3c93-4b84-bb60-ea0c60673c12.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD monthly returns (screenshot). Source: CoinGlass\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHad a great push into the market close yesterday,\u8221\'20\'1D popular trader Daan Crypto Trades {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/DaanCrypto/status/1786749489287467519"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reacted}}}\uc2  in part of his latest coverage on X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ).\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhile I am liking how the charts are shaping up on the higher timeframes, I'll be patient and not start adding on green candles during the weekend. Will see how this plays out.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/e8ffdf1c-e45e-486e-8510-86aa6599c4aa.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD chart with \uc2 CME\uc2  futures data. Source: Daan Crypto Trades/X\par \par \uc2 An accompanying chart showed a clear divergence from the latest \uc2 CME Group\uc2  Bitcoin futures closing price, creating a \u8220\'20\'1Cgap\u8221\'20\'1D which BTC/USD tends to fill later on.\par \par \uc2 Despite the impressive weekend performance, some were concerned about the overall strength of the market in the absence of TradFi participation.\par \par \uc2 Keith Alan, co-founder of trading resource Material Indicators, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/KAProductions/status/1786747491150331961"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warned}}}\uc2  that a correction could easily come thanks to thin order book liquidity.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CLooking for bid liquidity to replenish to keep this rally going,\u8221\'20\'1D he told X followers retweeting an order book chart from Material Indicators.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COtherwise, it isn\u8217\'20\'19t going to take much to dump through thin liquidity.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/16c381be-64b7-4a95-816e-35a8279b497b.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT order book liquidity on Binance. Source: Material Indicators/X\par \par \uc2 Analysis: BTC price still below "main resistance"\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CredibleCrypto/status/1786678084827050322/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Summarizing}}}\uc2  his market views, meanwhile, popular trader and commentator Credible Crypto said that conditions may favor going short BTC below \u8220\'20\'1Cmain resistance\u8221\'20\'1D around $69,000.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-5-3-btc-eth-bnb-sol-xrp-doge-ton-ada-avax-shib"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 5/3: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Uploading a chart to X, he forecast two possible outcomes for current BTC price action, with the current area comparatively short on liquidity.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CGreen path is ideal. We hold the local highs we broke above and continue up to the major resistance. This will allow me to fill shorts on a number of alts across the board. Red path is not ideal. We fail to hold this reclaim, see an \u8216\'20\'18early\u8217\'20\'19 breakdown, and ideal short zones for most alts I'm eyeing up are not met,\u8221\'20\'1D he wrote.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/14db6628-d9a4-41e6-a19f-593963c3025b.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD chart. Source: Credible Crypto/X\par \par \uc2 Credible Crypto added that long BTC positions would be of interest should BTC/USD dip below $56,000.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvNmIyMDkyYWQtYmE4OS00MjQxLTliMjAtOTlhZDY3ZjYxMGU1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240504ek540008d\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 regulation\par \b \uc2 SEC will classify Ether as security, deny spot Ether ETFs \u8212\'20\'14 \uc2 Michael Saylor\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Turner Wright \par \uc2 337 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  executive chair \uc2 Michael Saylor\uc2  pushed the benefits of Bitcoin investments to a crowd at the company\u8217\'20\'19s Bitcoin For Corporations conference.\par \par \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  executive chair {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/top-people-in-crypto-and-blockchain-2023/michael-saylor"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Michael Saylor}}}\uc2  speculated that the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  will deny listing and trading of spot Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) exchange-traded funds.\par \par \uc2 Speaking at \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Bitcoin For Corporations conference on May 1, Saylor {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/saylor/status/1786128074138140956"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  the SEC would label ETH as a crypto asset security under its regulatory purview and not a commodity under the U.S. Commodity Futures Trading Commission. According to the \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  executive, the SEC could follow by treating tokens, including BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ), \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) and Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) as \u8220\'20\'1Ccrypto asset securit[ies] unregistered.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNone of [these tokens] will ever be wrapped by a spot ETF, none of them will be accepted by Wall Street, none of them will be accepted by mainstream institutional investors as crypto assets,\u8221\'20\'1D said Saylor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/405a5649-3bf2-4c30-a47e-de99e7a65a90.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/saylor/status/1786128074138140956"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Michael Saylor}}}\par \par \uc2 Saylor\u8217\'20\'19s remarks came as many experts expressed concerns about whether the SEC will {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-spot-etf-probably-rejected-van-eck-ceo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 approve the listing and trading}}}\uc2  of spot Ether ETFs on U.S. exchanges. The first significant deadlines for ETF applications from \uc2 VanEck\uc2  and ARK Invest will be May 23 and May 24, respectively.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-bitcoin-decentralized-identity-solution"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MicroStrategy to launch Bitcoin-based decentralized ID solution}}}\par \par \uc2 Unredacted portions of a lawsuit filed by \uc2 Consensys{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-gary-gensler-misleading-lawmakers-ether"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 alleged that the SEC}}}\uc2  launched an investigation into Ether as security as early as March 2023. SEC Chair \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2  avoided {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-house-committee-chair-repeatedly-presses-sec-chair-is-ether-a-commodity-or-a-security"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 answering direct questions}}}\uc2  on whether Ether was a security in an April 2023 hearing, despite previous statements suggesting otherwise.\par \par \uc2 Saylor is an outspoken proponent of BTC and a leading force behind \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  acquiring the cryptocurrency as a reserve asset. As of April 30, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-records-q1-net-loss-bitcoin-buying-spree-continues"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 firm held 214,400 BTC}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 worth more than $13 billion at the time of publication.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/get-bitcoin-or-die-tryin-why-hip-hop-stars-love-crypto/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Get Bitcoin or die tryin\u8217\'20\'19: Why hip hop stars love crypto}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvNDkzNTE5YzgtYWZmMS00MWY5LTkxZjAtZmIxMzg1ZWUxZTEzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240503ek53000e5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/3: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,635 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price is trading back above the all-important 20-day EMA, and if it holds it could be proof that bulls are back in control.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) bulls are trying to stage a comeback by pushing the price above the psychologically crucial level of $60,000. Veteran trader Peter Brandt said in a X post that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-correction-common-56k-lows-hold-peter-brandt"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 if Bitcoin holds the most recent lows}}}\uc2  and moves higher, it will be considered a \u8220\'20\'1Cvery common bull market continuation chart construction.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Analysts are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the long-term prospects of Bitcoin but do not expect the uptrend to start in a hurry. Bitfinex Alpha market report said that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-price-consolidation-ethereum-altcoin-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could stay range-bound}}}\uc2  for one to two months \u8220\'20\'1Cwith swings of $10,000 on either side.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/60a9b244-e2b9-4d68-b492-8b0abc5414dd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Traders are likely to keep a close watch on the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds. According to Farside Investors data, the Bitcoin ETFs witnessed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dumps-bull-market-excess-etf-outflows-500m"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 outflows of $563 million on May 1}}}\uc2 . The sentiment is likely to pick up after the Bitcoin ETFs witness net inflows for a few successive days. Former BitMEX CEO \uc2 Arthur Hayes\uc2  believes the sell-off has ended, and the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bottom-in-headed-slow-grind-higher-bitmex-arthur-hayes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto markets may head higher}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 What important resistance levels may act as a roadblock for the recovery? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is taking support in the zone between the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $58,017 and the 61.8% retracement level of $54,298.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/1f9f79ea-b95e-455b-898d-9f5730cb707d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price back above the breakdown level of $59,600 on May 3, indicating that the recent fall may have been a bear trap. However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They will try to stall the relief rally at the 20-day exponential moving average ($63,366) and then at the 50-day simple moving average ($66,151).\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then make one more attempt to sink the BTC/USDT pair below $56,500. If they succeed, the pair may slump to $54,298.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break above the 50-day SMA will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) fell below the $2,850 support on May 1, but the long tail on the candlestick shows solid demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/13c8a5fd-1a7b-4164-9f7f-244fb3b6755d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI below 45 show that the bears have a slight edge. If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA ($3,152), the bears will try to yank the ETH/USDT pair to the support line of the descending channel pattern.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the selling pressure could be reducing. The bulls will have thrust the pair above the resistance line to indicate the end of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been oscillating inside the large range between $495 and $635 for the past several days, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/50660821-957f-4234-9d9e-a256da90ad04.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the moving averages, the BNB/USDT pair could slide to the strong support at $495. Buyers are likely to buy this level and keep the range intact. However, if the bears prevail, the pair could start a downtrend to $460 and thereafter to $400.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price rises above the moving averages, the pair could climb to the overhead resistance of $635. This is a significant resistance for the bears to defend because a break above it could catapult the pair to $692.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) below the $126 support but could not maintain the lower levels, indicating buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/111a2015-5846-4af2-b34f-7fb92c8dd296.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USDT pair has reached the 20-day EMA ($145), an important level to watch out for. If buyers overcome this barrier, the pair may climb toward the overhead resistance of $162. This level may attract selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 The crucial support to watch on the downside is $126. If the price turns lower from the 20-day EMA and breaks below $126, it will signal the start of the next leg of the down move. The pair may then slump to $100.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) relief rally has reached the 20-day EMA ($0.53), an essential level for the bears to defend if they want to maintain control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/e349e833-256d-4f39-bdd7-43e63ea7432e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the sellers will again attempt to tug the XRP/USDT pair to the strong support zone between $0.46 and $0.41. Buyers are expected to aggressively protect this zone.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. If this hurdle is cleared, the pair could reach $0.57, which may again pose a strong challenge. A break above this resistance could open the doors for a potential rise to $0.62.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $0.12 support on May 1, indicating that the bulls are trying to defend the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/718b3f27-e081-4b02-8635-192c7043e57b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to push the price to the overhead zone between the 20-day EMA ($0.15) and the downtrend line. Sellers are expected to protect this zone with vigor.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this zone, the bears will again attempt to sink the DOGE/USDT pair below the neckline near $0.12. If they do that, the pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. That may start a down move to $0.10 and eventually to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the bulls propel the price above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) is finding support in the zone between the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $4.90 and the 61.8% retracement level of $4.25.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/85deebbc-f2a2-4338-882a-8f758d3d8b84.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The relief rally has reached the moving averages, which is an important level to watch out for. If the price turns down from the moving averages, the bears will again attempt to sink the TON/USDT pair below $4.25.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if buyers overcome the obstacle at the 20-day EMA ($5.53), it will suggest the start of a more robust recovery. The pair may then rise to $6.35, where the bears may mount a strong resistance.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-ethereum-options-expiry-volatility"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin and Ether options worth $2.4B set to expire May 3, max BTC pain at $61K}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to maintain Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the breakdown level of $0.46, but the bears are likely to put up an intense fight.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/3a7b4fc7-76bb-44b9-8407-0022ca32a488.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The zone between $0.46 and the 20-day EMA ($0.48) is likely to witness solid selling by the bears. If the price turns down sharply from this zone and breaks below $0.40, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may start the next leg of the downtrend to $0.35.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if buyers shove the price above the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the selling pressure is reducing. The pair may then ascend to $0.52 and later to $0.57, which may act as a strong hurdle.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) price action of the past few days has formed a range of $29 on the downside and $40 on the upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/d4d2a673-f151-4b4c-824c-89a3c2ec5de2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($36.56) and the RSI near 42 suggest that the bears have the upper hand. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will make another attempt to sink the AVAX/USDT pair below $29. If they manage to do that, the next leg of the down move to $27.24 may begin.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers kick the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest buying at lower levels. The pair may then climb to $40. A break and close above this level will indicate that the bulls are attempting a comeback.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Shiba Inu\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) May 1 candlestick shows that the bulls are trying to defend the $0.000020 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/f513e45e-0836-4b3f-923a-66e75e19dc97.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The recovery attempt is likely to face selling at the moving averages. If the price turns down sharply from the moving averages, it will increase the likelihood of a drop below $0.000020. If that happens, the SHIB/USDT pair may plunge to $0.000018.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to prevent the decline, they will have to drive and maintain the price above the moving averages. If they do that, it will indicate that the selling pressure is reducing. The pair may rise to $0.000028 and subsequently to $0.000033.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvOWNhNTRjY2QtZjFhNi00YmRmLWJhMTUtY2U3Y2M3OTE2Njc5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240503ek53000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 regulation\par \b \uc2 SEC will classify Ether as security, deny spot Ether ETFs \u8212\'20\'14 \uc2 Michael Saylor\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Turner Wright \par \uc2 333 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  executive chair \uc2 Michael Saylor\uc2  pushed the benefits of Bitcoin investments to a crowd at the company\u8217\'20\'19s Bitcoin For Corporations conference.\par \par \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  executive chair {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/top-people-in-crypto-and-blockchain-2023/michael-saylor"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Michael Saylor}}}\uc2  speculated that the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC) will deny listing and trading of spot Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) exchange-traded funds.\par \par \uc2 Speaking at \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Bitcoin For Corporations conference on May 1, Saylor {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/saylor/status/1786128074138140956"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  the SEC would label ETH as a crypto asset security under its regulatory purview and not a commodity under the U.S. Commodity Futures Trading Commission (CFTC). According to the \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  executive, the SEC could follow by treating tokens including {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2 , Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) as \u8220\'20\'1Ccrypto asset securit[ies] unregistered.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNone of [these tokens] will ever be wrapped by a spot ETF, none of them will be accepted by Wall Street, none of them will be accepted by mainstream institutional investors as crypto assets,\u8221\'20\'1D said Saylor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/405a5649-3bf2-4c30-a47e-de99e7a65a90.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/saylor/status/1786128074138140956"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Michael Saylor}}}\par \par \uc2 Saylor\u8217\'20\'19s remarks came as many experts expressed concerns about whether the SEC will {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-spot-etf-probably-rejected-van-eck-ceo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 approve the listing and trading}}}\uc2  of spot Ether ETFs on U.S. exchanges. The first significant deadlines for ETF applications from \uc2 VanEck\uc2  and ARK Invest will be May 23 and May 24, respectively.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-bitcoin-decentralized-identity-solution"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MicroStrategy to launch Bitcoin-based decentralized ID solution}}}\par \par \uc2 Unredacted portions of a lawsuit filed by \uc2 Consensys{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-gary-gensler-misleading-lawmakers-ether"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 alleged that the SEC}}}\uc2  launched an investigation into Ether as security as early as March 2023. SEC Chair \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2  avoided {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-house-committee-chair-repeatedly-presses-sec-chair-is-ether-a-commodity-or-a-security"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 answering direct questions}}}\uc2  on whether Ether was a security in an April 2023 hearing, despite previous statements suggesting otherwise.\par \par \uc2 Saylor is an outspoken proponent of BTC and a leading force behind \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  acquiring the cryptocurrency as a reserve asset. As of April 30, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-records-q1-net-loss-bitcoin-buying-spree-continues"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 firm held 214,400 BTC}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 worth more than $13 billion at the time of publication.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/get-bitcoin-or-die-tryin-why-hip-hop-stars-love-crypto/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Get Bitcoin or die tryin\u8217\'20\'19: Why hip hop stars love crypto}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvNDkzNTE5YzgtYWZmMS00MWY5LTkxZjAtZmIxMzg1ZWUxZTEzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240503ek53000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/1: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,544 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 May 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bears tighten their grip on the crypto market as Bitcoin price slices through a key support level to hit an intraday low at $56,500.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) sliced through the $60,000 support on May 1, signaling that the uptrend has weakened. While the fall has muddied the short-term picture for Bitcoin, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-correction-crypto-traders-indicators"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 analysts remain \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  for the long term}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Traders latch on to every bit of negative news when the price action turns \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \b \highlight22\uc2 Investor \b0 \highlight{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/hong-kong-bitcoin-ether-etfs-attract-200m-day1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22sentiment\b0 \highlight22  received a beating}}}\uc2  on the muted response to the Hong Kong spot Bitcoin and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) exchange-traded funds (ETFs) that debuted on April 30. Continued outflows from the United States-based spot Bitcoin ETFs {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sub-60k-after-daily-crypto-liquidations-near-300m"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 for the fifth consecutive day}}}\uc2  also did little to soothe nerves.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/c4e3e14c-9807-41a9-9a99-4458b93fb597.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Every bull phase witnesses sharp corrections, which shake out the weak hands. The lower levels give an opportunity to the long-term investors to add to their portfolios. However, it is better to wait for the price to confirm a bottom before initiating large bets.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and the altcoins start a sharp recovery, trapping the aggressive bears? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s consolidation resolved to the downside on May 1, indicating that the bears have overpowered the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/f747a732-be81-4271-8edd-81a26247767e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers will attempt to push the price back above $59,600, but the bears are likely to have other plans. If the price turns down from $59,600, it will suggest that the bears have flipped the level into resistance. That will enhance the prospects of a drop to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $54,298.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns up and breaks above the 50-day simple moving average ($66,596).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether broke below the 20-day exponential moving average ($3,170) and the $3,056 support on April 30, signaling that the bears are in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/589a538c-e87d-4709-90f0-0a7f557004e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The selling continued on May 1, and the bears tugged the price below the solid support at $2,852. If bears sustain the price below $2,852, the ETH/USDT pair could move downward to $2,700 and subsequently to $2,400.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bulls. If they want to prevent the decline, they will have to quickly push the price back above the moving averages. If they do that, it will indicate that the fall below $2,850 may have been a fake breakdown.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) April 30 candlestick shows that the bulls purchased at lower levels but they could not sustain the momentum.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/91ded5f1-93b8-4e2e-ad89-0e16a5a412c9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears continued selling and yanked the price below the moving averages on May 1. The BNB/USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $495. This is an essential support for the bulls to defend because a break below $495 could sink the pair to $460 and later to $400.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price bounces off $495 and rises above the moving averages, it will suggest that the range-bound action may continue for some more time. The bulls will have to overcome the obstacle at $635 to start the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to start a rebound off $126 in Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) shows that the bears remain in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/6e657e85-5ad9-450c-8d30-3c541e18503e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 There is a minor support at $116, but if this level cracks, the selling could accelerate, and the SOL/USDT pair could plunge to $100. The greater the fall, the longer it will take for the next leg of the uptrend to begin.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to make a comeback, they will have to quickly push the price above the 20-day EMA ($144). That may trap the aggressive bears, resulting in a short squeeze. The pair may then ascend toward the 50-day SMA ($166).\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) tried to start a relief rally from the psychological level of $0.50 on April 29, but the bulls could not maintain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/2f0e7d51-b2a6-4235-9ec0-cbef9185d164.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Sustained selling by the bears pulled the price below $0.50, opening the doors for a retest of the solid support at $0.46. The bulls are expected to fiercely defend the zone between $0.46 and $0.41 because a break below it may start a downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price bounces off $0.46 and rises above the 50-day SMA ($0.57), it will suggest that the bears are losing their grip. The XRP/USDT pair may then extend its stay inside the $0.41 to $0.74 range for several more days.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) fall picked up momentum after the price broke below the symmetrical triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/f5f17c7f-2b54-4503-a729-12de28b3d13e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears have pulled the price below the neckline of the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. If the price remains below $0.12, the selling could intensify, and the DOGE/USDT pair may slide to $0.10 and eventually to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price quickly rises back above the neckline, it will indicate solid buying at lower levels. The bulls will gain strength on a break above the 20-day EMA ($0.15), and a potential trend change will be signaled above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) broke below the 50-day SMA ($5.32) on April 30, indicating that the bears are maintaining their pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/f5826c63-10fc-4a3d-8096-71ec5e7d9105.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to defend the zone between the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $4.90 and the 61.8% retracement level of $4.25. Buyers will have to kick the price above the 20-day EMA ($5.58) to signal that the correction may be over. If that happens, the TON/USDT pair may attempt a rally to $6.24.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price continues lower and breaks below $4.25, it will signal that the uptrend has ended. That increases the risk of a drop to $3.32.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is trying to start a recovery from $0.42, but the weak rebound suggests a lack of demand from the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/33707c4d-85b1-4cde-b52c-423f0fe59948.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.48) and the RSI near the oversold zone suggest that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If the price skids below $0.42, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could retest $0.40 support. The bulls are likely to defend the level with all their might because a break below it may extend the decline to $0.35.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA remains the key overhead resistance that needs to be crossed to suggest that the bears may be losing their grip. If that happens, the pair may attempt a rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.57).\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to push Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) back above the uptrend line on April 29, but the bears did not relent. This shows that the bears are trying to flip the uptrend line into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/dd6ee173-ab09-46e8-b9a9-b331dff8b2a9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 There is a minor support at $31.92. But if this level gives way, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could plummet to $29.24. The zone between $27.24 and $29.24 may witness aggressive buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to clear the downtrend line on the way up if they want to signal a comeback. The pair could then rise to $42 and thereafter to the 50-day SMA ($45.68). This level may attract selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.000024) on April 30, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-05/c198c8b2-10e8-4687-91a4-6f30c1c006d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The SHIB/USDT pair could slide to $0.000020, which is likely to act as a strong support. Any rebound off this level is expected to face selling at the 20-day EMA. If the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, the likelihood of a drop to $0.000018 increases.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the moving averages. Such a move will signal solid buying at lower levels. The pair may then attempt a rally to $0.000033, where the bears may mount a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvNjk3MzE3YmUtOTEwNS00NmIzLTgxZDUtM2RjNzRjYjU2MTFlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240501ek51000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
