\par\par \b \uc2 2025 Price Predictions For Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) And ETFSwap (ETFS), Is $3 Possible?\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 774 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 April 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Price Forecast: Will Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Hit $3 By 2025?}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETFSwap: The TradFi-DeFi Marketplace}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETFS Price Prediction: Will The \b  \highlight22Bullish\b0 \highlight22  Presale Push Price To $3 In 2025?}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto experts and analysts predict a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  last quarter of 2024 after meticulously reading top platforms\u8217\'20\'19 price signals. As a result, crypto investors are looking to add projects that will increase profits to their portfolios. Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://etfswap.io/?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=pr&utm_campaign=0428"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETFSwap (ETFS)}}}\uc2  are two projects that have shown immense promise. However, can they ride on the bull wave and hit the $3 mark by 2025?\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Forecast: Will Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Hit $3 By 2025?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cardano.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  is a leading blockchain platform that was launched in 2015. It was created to improve scalability, sustainability, and interoperability issues often associated with older blockchains like Ethereum (ETH). Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has positioned itself as a better alternative to Proof-of-Work (PoW) blockchains like the crypto titan Bitcoin (BTC) because it is more scalable and energy-efficient.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is the digital currency for the Cardano network. The coin is named after \b \highlight22\uc2 Ada\b0 \highlight\uc2  Loverance, who is considered to be the first computer programmer. Holders of the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  token use it for transaction fees for access to the platform. Validators also receive it as a reward for running the Proof-of-Stake (PoS) system.\par \par \uc2 The platform is regarded as the \u8220\'20\'1CEthereum killer\u8221\'20\'1D amongst enthusiasts and appears highly esteemed by them. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coingecko.com/en/coins/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Data}}}\uc2  from CoinGecko shows that Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) price trend has been unencouraging. The blockchain platform needs a bull run in the coming days or risk losing key investors.\par \par \uc2 Cardano's price chart shows a 5.3% decline in the last 24 hours. The Ethereum killer hit its all-time high in September, selling for $3.09. Compared with its current value of $0.469, this reflects an 84.75% decline.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  market phase does not suggest that Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) could reach $3 by 2025. However, the crypto market is dynamic; anything can happen.\par \par \uc2 ETFSwap: The TradFi-DeFi Marketplace\par \par \uc2 ETFSwap (ETFS) is an innovative DeFi platform that allows users to seamlessly invest in a wide range of exchange-traded funds (ETFs) and cryptocurrencies. It integrates traditional finance (TradFi) theories with decentralized finance (DeFi) attributes, offering users and investors the benefits of both worlds in one marketplace. That said, users can buy and trade ETFs from different sectors on ETFSwap (ETFS).\par \par \uc2 By facilitating the trading of ETFs from various sectors, ETFSwap (ETFS) allows investors to diversify their portfolios beyond traditional forms of assets. Investors can gain insights into sectors that were previously unavailable to them, such as technology, healthcare, real estate, or energy, spreading risk and potentially boosting profits.\par \par \uc2 ETFSwap (ETFS) also provides market-making and perpetual trading services, enabling users to trade assets anytime without fear of expiration. This approach offers liquidity and flexibility to crypto traders, making trading activities more fun and worthwhile. Also, the DeFi platform allows users and investors to leverage their trade for up to 10x. The leverage tool amplifies traders' profits and is an exciting tool for seasoned traders looking to maximize their returns.\par \par \uc2 In pursuit of building a secure and dependable infrastructure, ETFSwap (ETFS) has undergone a rigorous audit by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cyberscope.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cyberscope}}}\uc2 , a leading Blockchain security firm. The audit results show that ETFSwap\u8217\'20\'19s (ETFS) smart contracts are not vulnerable to cyberattacks, and the platform is reliable.\par \par \uc2 The ETFSwap environment is powered by its utility token, ETFS. ETFS is a deflationary token that helps maintain prices in the ETFSwap (ETFS) ecosystem and compete with other tokens in the market.\par \par \uc2 ETFS Price Prediction: Will The \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Presale Push Price To $3 In 2025?\par \par \uc2 After raising $750,000 through private fundraising, ETFSwap (ETFS) is currently in its Stage 1 private presale. In this stage, an ETFS token sells for only $0.00854 and is fast selling, with over 23 million sold already. The Stage 2 presale will sell for $0.01831, indicating an over 100x surge in price value.\par \par \uc2 The fast-selling Stage 1 presale suggests a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ETFSwap (ETFS)run. With the Stage 1 presale ending soon and Stage 2 beginning, indicating its launch close by, ETFSwap is projected to experience a massive upsurge that will see value hit beyond $3 in the second half of 2025.\par \par \uc2 For more information about the ETFS Presale:\par \par \uc2 Visit ETFSwap Presale\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://linktr.ee/etfswap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Join The ETFSwap Community}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240429ek4r0000h\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/26: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,582 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 April 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Crypto bulls are are struggling to sustain the relief rally in Bitcoin and altcoins, indicating selling at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside a large range, suggesting indecision about the next trending move. Analysts trying to predict the direction are enthused by the $1.3 billion of USD Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/usdc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDC}}}\uc2  ) transferred to \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  by whale addresses. Expectations are that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-whales-transfer-exchange-coinbase-buy-signals"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 funds will be used to buy Bitcoin}}}\uc2  and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 Large investors are not only buying the top two coins by market capitalization. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  head of research James Butterfill said in a recent report based on a survey of 64 institutional investors that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-dramatic-increase-institutional-portfolios-coinshares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 15% of the respondents had invested}}}\uc2  in Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ). In comparison, none of the investors held \uc2 Solana\uc2  in the firm\u8217\'20\'19s January survey.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/e016b90f-afb8-46ca-99ff-fda125439db6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Morgan Creek Capital CEO \uc2 Mark Yusko\uc2  said in a recent interview with The Wolf Of All Streets podcast that about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/boomers-300-billion-crypto-markets-morgan-creek-capital"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $300 billion of baby boomers\u8217\'20\'19 wealth}}}\uc2  is likely to enter into digital assets within 12 months. This inflow could boost the cryptocurrency market capitalization to $6 trillion.\par \par \uc2 Can buyers thwart attempts by the bears to deepen the correction in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been trading below the moving averages for the past few days, but the bears are struggling to sink the price to the crucial support at $60,775. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/b4ab8424-96b5-4750-b5c4-3938ef85f797.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price is stuck between the 50-day simple moving average ($67,404) and the vital support at $60,775. The 20-day exponential moving average ($65,542) has started to turn down and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is just below the midpoint, indicating a minor advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below $59,600 could open the doors for a drop to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $54,298.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated in the near term if the price rises above the 50-day SMA. The BTC/USDT pair may then climb to $73,777. This remains the key overhead resistance for the bulls to overcome.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether has been oscillating between the 20-day EMA ($3,209) and the horizontal support of $3,056 for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/c104f20e-b3c3-42e7-b30f-9dafaa1df4b6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This tight range trading is unlikely to continue for long. If the price pierces the 20-day EMA, the ETH/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($3,436). This level may act as a short-term barrier, but it is likely to be crossed. The pair may then jump to $3,679.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below $3,056, it will suggest that the bears are in command. The pair may then retest the critical support at $2,852. A Break below this level may result in a decline to $2,700.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been struggling to reach the overhead resistance of $635, suggesting that the bears are defending the level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/16bc731d-94a8-4614-a05a-2df391dbf7d9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, a positive sign is that the bulls have not rushed to the exit. The price may pull back to the moving averages, where it is likely to find support. If the price rebounds off the moving averages with strength, it will enhance the possibility of a break above $635. If that happens, the BNB/USDT pair could surge to $692 and eventually to the pattern target of $775.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price slides below the moving averages, it will indicate that the range-bound action may extend for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance of $162 on April 24, indicating that the bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/6c17d97c-b876-4602-8ff4-9e5cd57c9f6c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($153) is sloping down gradually, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the negative zone, indicating that the bears have the edge. The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could descend to the solid support at $126. If the price rebounds off this level with strength, it will indicate that the pair may remain sandwiched between $126 and $162 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 50-day SMA ($168). That will open the doors for a possible rally to $205. Contrarily, a break below $126 could sink the pair to $100.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is trading below the 20-day EMA (0.54) but the bulls are trying to find support at the uptrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/0b424b20-64fd-41ca-8885-61c9c0a7fb11.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off the uptrend line and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are losing their grip. The XRP/USDT pair could then attempt a rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.59) and subsequently to $0.69.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price continues lower and breaks below the uptrend line, it will suggest that the bears are in control. The pair may plunge to $0.46, where the bulls are expected to provide strong support.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/22da3f82-16ca-4172-a9a2-612e20e23e7f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.16) and the RSI in the negative zone suggest that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If the price skids and maintains below the triangle, the DOGE/USDT pair may tumble to $0.12.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the triangle, it will signal aggressive buying on dips. That improves the prospects of a break above the downtrend line. The pair may then climb to $0.21.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) broke below the ascending channel pattern on April 22 and reached the 50-day SMA ($5.12) on April 25.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/3305c12e-d6e3-439c-a999-beb106436dec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($5.82) and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest that the bears have a slight edge. If the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA, it is likely to face stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA. If the TON/USDT pair turns lower from the 20-day EMA, it will increase the likelihood of a drop below the 50-day SMA. The pair may then drop to $4.50.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated if the bulls push the price back into the channel. Such a move will suggest that the recent breakdown may have been a bear trap.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned lower from the 20-day EMA ($0.50) on April 23 and reached the important support at $0.46.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/5bd5d6c4-6c16-40e8-bc75-4316a1324571.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the $0.46 level and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the correction may be over. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.59) and later to $0.68.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price continues lower and breaks below $0.46, it will indicate that the bears remain in charge. The pair could then slump to the crucial support at $0.40. A break below this level may resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($39) on April 24, but the bears are finding it difficult to pull the price below the uptrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/15338cc2-0d20-4f97-a720-2b0eaf9b4912.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and maintain the price above the downtrend line to signal a potential short-term trend change. The AVAX/USDT pair could then attempt a rally toward the 50-day SMA ($47).\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated in the near term if the price continues lower and breaks below the uptrend line. That could sink the pair to the $32 to $27 support zone, where buyers are likely to step in.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck between the moving averages for the past few days, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/dac07ff7-bdb9-44f6-a01b-037ac5f98298.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($0.000025) and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price breaks and maintains below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bears have seized control. The SHIB/USDT pair may then slump to $0.000020.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rises and breaks above the 50-day SMA ($0.000027), it will signal that the bulls have overpowered the bears. The pair may then attempt a rally to $0.000033.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDQvNzBhZDcwOGYtZjhhOC00M2VjLTllNjktNTEyNjJkZWU3ZjQ1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240426ek4q000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin analysts agree that BTC has \u8216\'20\'18a lot further to run\u8217\'20\'19\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 740 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 April 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin on-chain and market cycle data all suggest higher baseline prices for BTC in the months following the halving.\par \par \uc2 Analyst and founder of the Capriole Investments fund Charles Edwards said multiple on-chain metrics suggest that Bitcoin and other cryptocurrencies have \u8220\'20\'1Ca lot further to run\u8221\'20\'1D in this bull market.\par \par \uc2 In his latest newsletter, Edwards explained that transaction fees from the recent Runes launch and other long-term metrics after the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin halving}}}\uc2  suggest \u8220\'20\'1Chigher baseline Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) prices.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin now harder than gold\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/there-s-more-to-bitcoin-than-just-the-halving-why-it-pays-to-be-long-on-btc#:~:text=The%20halving%20is%20just%20another,the%20direction%20of%20Bitcoin%20price."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s fourth halving}}}\uc2  resulted in a 50% drop in the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s supply growth rate, surpassing gold in terms of inflation rate.\par \par \uc2 Edwards said long periods of continuous currency debasement and high inflation rates place Bitcoin at the forefront of \u8220\'20\'1Cglobal fungible assets\u8221\'20\'1D for long-term wealth preservation.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CGold\u8217\'20\'19s inflation rate went up +50% in 2023 to 3% p.a. That makes Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s inflation rate less than one-quarter of gold\u8217\'20\'19s. Bitcoin is now the hardest store of value.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/349e08e9-b144-4039-ae07-13d71b222424.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin vs. gold inflation rate. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Market intelligence firm Glassnode reached a similar conclusion, saying that the halving resulted in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-is-bitcoin-a-beginners-guide-to-the-worlds-first-cryptocurrency#:~:text=Bitcoin%20is%20digital%20money%2C%20also,independently%20of%20any%20central%20authority."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  decisively surpassing gold in terms of issuance scarcity.\par \par \uc2 Glassnode analysts said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe fourth halving also marks a significant milestone in the comparison of Bitcoin to Gold as for the first time in history, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s steady-state issuance rate (0.83%) becomes lower than gold (~2.3%), marking a historic handover in the title of scarcest asset.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, American entrepreneur and former CEO of cryptocurrency exchange BitMEX \uc2 Arthur Hayes{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptohayes.medium.com/left-curve-ef2e1e187027"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  governments of the world will continue printing money to offset their debts, and their currencies will lose out against Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 This makes Bitcoin the \u8220\'20\'1Chardest money ever created.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-4-24-btc-eth-bnb-sol-xrp-doge-ton-ada-avax-shib"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 4/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 History rhymes but it may not repeat itself\par \par \uc2 Many analysts have voiced their opinions on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-inflation-store-of-value"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 implications of the Bitcoin halving}}}\uc2  on BTC price. Edwards now believes three things are likely to happen to the BTC post-halving.\par \par \uc2 The first scenario assumes that the BTC price will skyrocket. The second assumes that approximately 15% of Bitcoin miners will shut off their gear and quit the business. The third assumes that transaction fees will stay at a much higher level than average.\par \par \uc2 Edwards says he expects \u8220\'20\'1Ca bit of all three\u8221\'20\'1D to happen.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s days under $100K are numbered.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/84106e1f-1763-4a3d-85da-44360bdf0693.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin production cost. Source: Capriole Investments\par \par \uc2 However, Glassnode cautioned its readers to manage their expectations against historical precedents, arguing that the performance of Bitcoin across various halving epochs is \u8220\'20\'1Cvery widespread\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1Ctoo different\u8221\'20\'1D to be used as a guide today.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe do see both diminishing returns and a shallower total drawdown effect over time, which is a natural result of the growing market size and the scale of capital flows required to move it.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/d44b966d-fee2-458b-b956-a0c47a74d231.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC price performance since halving. Source: Glassnode\par \par \uc2 Glassnode assessed BTC price performance between the cycle low and the halving and found that while there was a stark similarity between 2015, 2018 and the current cycle with between 200% and 300% price increases, the 2024 one was different as it broke the previous all-time high before the halving event.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe ATH we saw in March comes off the back of both a historically tight supply and the remarkable demand interest brought online via the new spot ETFs.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Glassnode also noted that while halving epoch 2 saw a larger price performance in the 365 days following, the current market dynamics and landscape are significantly different relative to the previous halving events.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/aedd1879-8ee4-4451-88eb-f7fd5b904b3c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC price performance 365 days after the halving. Source: Glassnode\par \par \uc2 While Glassnode did not rule out the possibility of an exponential growth in BTC price, they suggested that things might not play out exactly as they did in the past.\par \par \uc2 Hayes, on the other hand, said that BTC\u8217\'20\'19s path from the current levels to $1 million may not be as difficult as its history of rising from zero, buoyed by the bursting of the sovereign debt bubble.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDQvNDAwOTY0OGItYWM0ZC00YTg0LWJmNmMtYmQyMTQ4MGFhNjEyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240424ek4o000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,609 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 April 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins have turned down from overhead resistance, indicating that bears are active at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rally to a new all-time high, and the subsequent consolidation suggests that the bulls are not rushing to the exit as they anticipate another leg higher. According to an X post by Santiment, the rise has been supported by the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whale-fomo-btc-price-67k-liquidity"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin whales holding between 1,000 and 10,000 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  who have \u8220\'20\'1Caccumulated 266K more $BTC since the start of 2024.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 It is not only the whales who are buying. The spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds have enabled traditional finance companies to invest in Bitcoin. \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  analyst \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2  said in a X post that two {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fidelity-bitcoin-etf-draws-40-million-largest-single-investment-advisers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 United States financial advisers invested $20 million each}}}\uc2  in the \uc2 Fidelity Wise Origin Bitcoin Fund\uc2  (FBTC), overtaking the previous high investment of $17 million put by an adviser in \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 's \uc2 iShares Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (IBIT).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/06c8bb04-4228-4cf3-8e1e-7d2dcb699085.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Although analysts are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the long term, the short term looks uncertain. \uc2 Fidelity Digital Assets\uc2  believes that Bitcoin is no longer \u8220\'20\'1Ccheap\u8221\'20\'1D and is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-no-longer-cheap-fidelity-revises-medium-term-outlook"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 trading at fair value}}}\uc2 . The company downgraded its medium-term outlook for Bitcoin from \u8220\'20\'1Cpositive\u8221\'20\'1D to \u8220\'20\'1Cneutral.\u8221\'20\'1D The investment firm\u8217\'20\'19s director of research, Chris Kuiper, said in a X post that Bitcoin is at the \u8220\'20\'1Chalfway point\u8221\'20\'1D of the market cycle. He added that a large portion of the gains are historically seen \u8220\'20\'1Cin the latter half of the cycle.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 What are the important resistance levels that Bitcoin and altcoins need to cross to signal an end to the corrective phase? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rose above the 20-day exponential moving average ($65,855) on April 22, but the bears stalled the recovery at the 50-day simple moving average ($67,509).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/dd7b689c-19a9-493e-a8af-cb63975b33d8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is just below the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the BTC/USDT pair could slump to $60,775. Buyers are expected to defend this level as a break below it may clear the path for a collapse to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $54,298.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up and breaks above the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that lower levels are attracting buyers. The pair may then climb to $73,777. Buyers will have to overcome this barrier to catapult the pair to $84,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) tried to break above the 20-day EMA ($3,237) on April 24, but the long wick on the candlestick shows that the bears are not relenting.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/91ef3614-e62a-4d18-843d-0b1badd5ea74.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains below the 20-day EMA, the ETH/USDT pair risks a breakdown below $3,056. If that happens, the pair may retest the critical support at $2,852. This is a vital support to watch out for because a break below it may sink the pair to $2,700.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level or $3,056 and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the selling pressure is reducing. That could push the pair to the 50-day SMA ($3,466) and then to $3,679.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually moving toward $635 where the bulls are expected to face strong selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/61a629dc-7af5-49b3-aff4-f3e07c4e366d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from $635, it will suggest that the BNB/USDT pair may extend its stay inside the range for some more time. The pair could drop to the moving averages and thereafter to $495.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to seize control, they will have to overcome the obstacle at $635. If they do that, it will suggest the start of the next leg of the uptrend to $692 and eventually to the pattern target of $775.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has reached the overhead level of $162, where the bulls are likely to encounter strong resistance from the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/c7a72876-3143-41d6-8bde-99bc8eec5f73.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from $162, it will suggest that the bears are fiercely defending the level. That could keep the SOL/USDT pair stuck between $162 and $126 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks above $162, it will suggest that the correction may be over. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up, and the pair may attempt a rally to $205. On the downside, a break below $126 could start a new downtrend to $100.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($0.54) on April 22, but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/0f34e4be-6bd1-4314-86c0-dc8a454cd8bc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price turned down sharply and broke below the 20-day EMA on April 24, suggesting that the bears are active at higher levels. The XRP/USDT pair could drop to $0.50 and subsequently to the solid support at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to gain the upper hand, they will have to push the price back above the 20-day EMA. That will increase the likelihood of the pair remaining inside the large range between $0.46 and $0.74 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the 20-day EMA ($0.16) for the past few days, indicating a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/2d7119e5-25f5-47ac-bd20-25cbb37f924c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are finding it difficult to propel the price above the overhead resistance zone between the 20-day EMA and the downtrend line. If the price continues lower, the bears will again try to sink the DOGE/USDT pair to $0.13.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls shove the price above the overhead zone, it will signal that the correction may be over. The pair could then attempt a rally to $0.21, where the bears may pose a substantial challenge.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) broke below the ascending channel pattern on April 22, suggesting that the uptrend may be over.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/bffdaa01-9fc0-4113-a995-e158babc6229.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will make one more attempt to push the price back into the channel. If they do that, it will suggest that the breakdown may have been a bear trap. That could result in a short squeeze, pushing the price toward $7.23.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the breakdown level from the channel, it will suggest that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance. The selling could accelerate on a slide below $5.42, and the TON/USDT pair may reach the 50-day SMA ($5.01).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-stuck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price stuck?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) recovery stalled at the 20-day EMA ($0.51) on April 22, indicating that the bears continue to sell at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/97b143d5-df27-48d2-9441-88c01130d63a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price to $0.46. This is an important level to watch out for because if the support gives way, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could descend to $0.40. The bulls are likely to defend this level with vigor because a break below it will signal the start of a deeper correction toward $0.35.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. If this resistance is crossed, it will suggest a short-term trend change. The pair may then rise to $0.57.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) is likely to face resistance in the zone between the 20-day EMA ($40) and the breakdown level of $42.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/744194cd-88b9-402f-ae9f-5e08c21405bf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from the current level, it will suggest that the bears remain in command. The AVAX/USDT pair could slump toward the $32 to $27 support zone. Buyers are expected to defend this zone with all their might because if they fail in their endeavor, the pair may tumble to $20.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if bulls push the price above $42, it will suggest the start of a sustained recovery. The pair may climb to $50, where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) rose above the downtrend line on April 21, but the bulls failed to overcome the barrier at the 50-day SMA ($0.000028).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/37f41631-0d23-456f-a3c1-06da9e75b3f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price pierces the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that the corrective phase may be over. The SHIB/USDT pair could rise to $0.000033 and thereafter attempt a rally to the solid resistance at $0.000039.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down sharply and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the breakout above the downtrend line may have been a bull trap. The pair may then slide toward $0.000020.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDQvNWY0NjNjYjAtMjdkNi00M2VkLTljMmUtNTY4ZjExMzkzZjViLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240424ek4o0008d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
