\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Expert Unveils Top Altcoins for 2024 Bull Market \u8211\'20\'13 Solana, Cardano, and Rebel Satoshi Arcade\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 659 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 April 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Rebel Satoshi Arcade ($RECQ) Entices Investors With Rewards, Forecasted To See 50x Gains In 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Experts Remain \b  \highlight22Bullish\b0 \highlight22  on Solana (SOL)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ); Experts Predict $10}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Final Thoughts}}}\par \par \uc2 The year 2024 has been a significant year for the crypto sector. Up to this point, as a community, the crypto community has seen Bitcoin break the $70k mark and set a new high. Similarly, they have seen an enormous bull run of memecoins.\par \par \uc2 More than three meme coins have joined the top 100 cryptos in the market. Notably, the price gains are not over. Crypto experts have picked three altcoins \u8211\'20\'13 Solana, Cardano, and Rebel Satoshi Arcade \u8211\'20\'13 to give holders 50x gains before the end of this year.\par \par \uc2 Rebel Satoshi Arcade ($RECQ) Entices Investors With Rewards, Forecasted To See 50x Gains In 2024\par \par \uc2 Rewards have become a huge part of the gaming ecosystem, thanks to play-to-earn games. One platform that has adopted this mechanism is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://recq.rebelsatoshi.com/?utm_source=4677&utm_medium=News&utm_id=Fox"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Rebel Satoshi}}}\uc2  Arcade ($RECQ). However, Rebel Satoshi Arcade is taking another approach, unlike most P2E games. Firstly, the platform integrated other elements into its play-to-earn mechanics. Such features are NFTs, memecoin, and cryptocurrency gaming.\par \par \uc2 Furthermore, the Rebel Satoshi Arcade not only rewards gamers who participate in games. It also incentivizes people who advocate for the platform. This move is a step in its effort to ensure that active participation and oneness are achieved in the community. Therefore, players are rewarded with gaming equipment, popular NFTs, and free tokens. Nevertheless, they must have $RECQ, which is one of the native tokens of Rebel Satoshi Arcade, to enter the platform and its games.\par \par \uc2 Now, in stage 1 of its initial coin offering, $RECQ is available for sale at only $0.0037. The altcoin price is expected to ramp up in the next few months, according to market experts. They have cited its low market cap, low price, and connection to the gaming sector as \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  catalysts to propel $RECQ as high as 50x in 2024.\par \par \uc2 Experts Remain \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Solana (SOL)\par \par \uc2 While Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) is currently battling with low price gains and high FUD from investors, experts are still \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  about the Ethereum Killer. Besides, \uc2 Solana\uc2  has managed to maintain its position among the top 5 cryptocurrencies despite its poor price performance.\par \par \uc2 The price of the asset at present oscillates in the $170 - $200 range. Although the network is now faced with the failed transactions problem, \uc2 Solana\uc2  developers have chosen April 15th as the day for the issue to be rectified. This fix would add more pluses to the network influencing \uc2 Solana\uc2  price. In addition, a number of new DeFi projects could impact \uc2 Solana\uc2  and drive it up to $375.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ); Experts Predict $10\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is another altcoin that crypto experts have picked with the potential to give major gains. Their first point of reference is the upcoming upgrades on the Cardano network \u8211\'20\'13 the Chang hard fork and the Ouroboros Leios consensus mechanism.\par \par \uc2 Both upgrades are expected to improve Cardano's transaction efficiency and network governance. Consequently, Cardano's \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could benefit from the whole process. These experts see \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  rising as high as $10 in 2024.\par \par \uc2 Final Thoughts\par \par \uc2 Overall, investors asking which crypto to buy today for long-term gains can consider Solana, Cardano, and Rebel Satoshi Arcade. Those with low income can double down on Rebel SatoshiArcade, which is just worth $0.0037. Its low price and market cap make its chances for gains higher than those of Solana and Cardano.\par \par \uc2 For the latest updates and more information, be sure to visit the official {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.rebelsatoshi.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Rebel Satoshi Website}}}\uc2  or contact Rebel Red via {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/rebelsatoshi_news"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Telegram}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the viewsof Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240419ek4i00002\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,596 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 April 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Technical charts suggest that Bitcoin price is en route to new lows, but how will investors respond?\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) dipped back toward $61,000 on April 17, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels. According to data from Farside Investors, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-falls-under-62k-amid-wavering-spot-btc-etf-demand"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recent price action has resulted in net outflow}}}\uc2  s from the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) on April 12 and 15. CryptoQuant founder and CEO Ki Young Ju said in a X post that demand for Bitcoin ETFs has \u8220\'20\'1Cstagnated for 4 weeks.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 However, a comforting factor for the bulls is that the whales have not panicked and are not selling on weakness. Data from research firm Santiment shows that the largest {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-refuse-sell-btc-price-70k-euphoria"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin wallet cohorts have been on an accumulation}}}\uc2  spree since March 1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/23116c37-9231-40fc-9b61-d4683f784328.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The whales seem to be holding on to their positions due to the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook in the long term. \uc2 Bitwise Asset Management\uc2  said in a X post that after the three previous {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin halvings}}}\uc2 , Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s prices remained soft for a month but witnessed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-underestimates-long-term-bitcoin-halving-impact-bitwise"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 triple-digit gains a year after}}}\uc2  the event.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin and altcoins deepen their correction or remain range-bound for a few more days? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to sink Bitcoin below the $60,775 support on April 17 and complete a double-top pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/54d76d1d-67cf-49d9-b16b-63a3bd261ea9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the BTC/USDT pair may start a downward move to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $58,017 and then to the 61.8% retracement level of $54,298. The bulls are likely to defend this zone, but if the bears prevail, the pair may plummet to the pattern target of $47,773.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the moving averages. That may trap several aggressive bears, resulting in a short squeeze. That enhances the prospects of a rally above $73,777.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day exponential moving average ($3,301) on April 15 and broke below the $3,056 support on April 16.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/6c10ac5d-ab50-4ea8-add1-32a0e74c6fb4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains below $3,056, the ETH/USDT pair may drop to $2,852. This is a crucial level for the bulls to defend because a break and close below it may accelerate selling. The pair may tumble to $2,717 and subsequently to $2,200.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off $2,852 with strength, it will signal solid buying at lower levels. The bulls will then make another attempt to clear the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair may attempt a rally to $3,679.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 After trading between the moving averages for three days, BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 50-day simple moving average ($541) on April 17, signaling that bears have overpowered the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/405c07ad-951b-4dba-aa35-252c11c26d10.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair could tumble to the strong support at $495, an important level to watch out for. If this support gives way, the BNB/USDT pair will be vulnerable to fall to $460 and later to $400.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above the 20-day EMA ($565) will be the first sign of strength. The pair could then attempt a rally to the overhead resistance of $635, where the bears will try to stall the up move.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $156 on April 15 and reached the crucial support at $126. This suggests that every recovery attempt is being met with strong selling from the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/874f4158-055b-4f85-a194-3dffb9eb8937.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is in the negative zone, signaling that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If the $126 support cracks, the selling could intensify and the SOL/USDT pair may plummet to $100.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up sharply from the current level, it will suggest solid demand at lower levels. The pair may then rise to $162. A break and close above this resistance will signal that the bulls are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) recovery fizzled out at $0.52 on April 15, indicating that the bears are keeping up the pressure and are selling on minor relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/f4c6b6a3-69f0-48b0-bd45-d7678eb34f5a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.56) and the RSI near the oversold zone suggest that bears are in control. Sellers will have to sink the price below $0.46 to start the downward move to the vital support at $0.41. Buyers are expected to fiercely defend the $0.46 to $0.41 support zone.\par \par \uc2 Any recovery attempt is likely to face selling at $0.52 and again at the 20-day EMA. A break and close above this resistance will suggest that the XRP/USDT pair may swing between $0.41 and $0.74 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) relief rally stalled at the 50-day SMA ($0.17) on April 15, indicating that the bears continue to sell on every rise.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/a5d09fc7-4e2b-402f-99d4-3806c4a27f39.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.17) is turning lower, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the negative territory, signaling that bears have the edge. They will again try to sink the DOGE/USDT pair to the crucial support at $0.12. This level is likely to attract buying because a break below it could open the doors for a fall to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 The downtrend line is the important resistance to watch out for on the upside. If buyers overcome this barrier, the pair may rise to $0.20 and later to $0.23.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) turned down from the resistance line of the ascending channel on April 15 and fell near the support line on April 15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/bf437a9e-eb96-4fad-bc8b-fa19e0a4f27f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($5.92) and the RSI in the positive zone suggest that the bulls are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. Buyers will once again try to push the price to the resistance line. If this resistance is cleared, the TON/USDT pair could pick up momentum and surge to $8.56 and then to $10.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated if the price turns down and dives below the channel. That will clear the path for a drop to the 50-day SMA ($4.54).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/top-five-btc-miners-not-selling-despite-bitcoin-halving"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Top five BTC miners not selling despite Bitcoin halving}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to start a meaningful rebound off $0.46 increases the risk of a breakdown to $0.40 in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/8a337309-b475-4c5f-b5c8-2fb7d1a131fa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers are likely to defend the $0.40 with vigor because if this support cracks, the selling could pick up, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may collapse to $0.35. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.54) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the oversold zone indicate that bears are in control.\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off $0.40, it will suggest demand at lower levels. The bulls will gain strength above $0.50. The pair could then rally to the 20-day EMA and thereafter to $0.62, where the bears may again pose a strong challenge.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) recovery could not even reach the breakdown level of $42, signaling a lack of aggressive buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/98d6383a-7c20-4125-97b8-d41284def13a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($43) and the RSI near the oversold territory indicate that bears are in charge. The support to watch on the downside is $29 and then $27. If this zone cracks, the selling could intensify and the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could plummet to $20.\par \par \uc2 The relief rally is likely to face strong selling at the downtrend line. A break and close above this resistance will be the first indication that the bulls are on a comeback. The pair could then attempt a rally to $50.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a tight range for the past three days, indicating a lack of aggressive selling or buying at these levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/7bdb08fc-1c24-4fa4-9643-b4d215e85398.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are expected to take another shot at the $0.000017 level. If this support breaks down, the selling could accelerate and the SHIB/USDT pair may start a sharp fall toward the next major support at $0.000010. That will complete a 100% retracement of the most recent leg of the rally.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a rise above the downtrend line will be the first indication that the bears are losing their grip. The pair may rise to $0.000033, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDQvNjM1ZDVjYjktYTVkMy00MzE4LWEwZDctZDM5NGU1YTdiYzdmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240418ek4h0000n\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,614 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 April 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is trying to stay inside a range, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) faced intense selling pressure last week, but a positive sign is that lower levels near $61,000 witnessed solid buying by the bulls. This suggests that the sentiment remains positive, and traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 However, the selling may not be over yet. Markus Thielen, the head of research at 10x Research, said in a recent note that Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-miners-dump-5-billion-in-btc-after-halving-10x-research"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 miners may offload $5 billion worth of Bitcoin}}}\uc2  over the four to six months post {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin halving}}}\uc2 . That may keep Bitcoin \u8220\'20\'1Csideways for the next few months,\u8221\'20\'1D Thielen added.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/88890489-249c-47bd-a52d-a7b4321e5286.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 A sideways market usually traps both the bulls and the bears by giving false breakouts in both directions. Therefore, traders need to be careful and not jump to buy or sell at the first instance. It is better to wait for the breakout to sustain before taking large bets.\par \par \uc2 What important resistance levels must Bitcoin cross to suggest that the correction may be over? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index nose-dived to the 50-day simple moving average (5,115) on April 12, signaling that the bears are trying to take charge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/04dc47f7-8431-45c2-97a5-26ef7bd9ac94.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the 50-day SMA gives way, the index could start a corrective phase. The first support on the downside is 4,900. A bounce off this level could face selling at the 20-day exponential moving average (5,174). If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the possibility of a drop below 4,900 increases.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to prevent the decline, they will have to push the price back above the 20-day EMA. The index could then attempt a rally to 5,265.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) turned up from the 50-day SMA (104) on April 9 and rose above the 105 overhead resistance on April 10, completing an ascending triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/93f2338f-6472-4180-9e28-53a36cd4fa7e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed the price to 106, where the bears are likely to pose a strong challenge. If the price turns down from 106 but rebounds off 105, it will signal that bulls have flipped the level into support. That will enhance the prospects of a rally to 107. The pattern target of the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup is 109.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down sharply and dives below 105, it will signal that the markets have rejected the breakout. The pair could then slide to the uptrend line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s bounce off the $60,775 support has reached the moving averages where the bears are likely to mount a strong defense.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/e9166e0a-b5ff-4dc1-884d-d2c3139fb39c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the moving averages, the bears will again try to sink the BTC/USDT pair below $60,775. If this level gives way, it will signal the start of a deeper correction. The pair may drop to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $54,298.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks above the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the $60,775 to $73,777 range for a few more days. A break and close above $73,777 will indicate the resumption of the uptrend to $80,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke below the $3,056 support on April 13, but the bears could not build upon this breakdown. The bulls pushed the price back above $3,056 on April 14.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/e7deb861-99c7-4b5c-bf50-6299c6af2780.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The recovery could reach the 20-day EMA ($3,369), an important level to keep an eye on. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the ETH/USDT pair could drop to $3,056 and subsequently to $2,852.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if buyers keep the price above $3,056, it will suggest that the range-bound action remains intact. The bulls will gain strength on a break above the 20-day EMA. The pair could then attempt a rally to $3,679. Buyers will have to clear this overhead hurdle to start an up move toward $4,100.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating inside a large range between $495 and $635 for the past few days, indicating indecision about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/97a2571d-a49b-4335-bced-c26f280a5ae4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA ($574) and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price breaks and maintains above the 20-day EMA, the BNB/USDT pair may climb to $635. A break and close above this level will signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend to $692.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are selling on rallies. The pair could then drop to the support at $495.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($167) on April 12 and plunged below the 50-day SMA ($164). The bears continued selling on April 13 and pulled the price to the crucial support at $126.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/0af496c2-3363-49bf-b037-5e39a5c30f2c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the April 13 candlestick shows that the bulls are fiercely attempting to defend the $126 level. Buyers will try to push the price to the moving averages, which are likely to behave as a significant barrier.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from the moving averages, the bears will again try to sink the SOL/USDT pair below $126. If they succeed, the pair may drop to $100. This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price rises above the moving averages. The pair will then attempt a rally to $205.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a large range between $0.41 and $0.74 for several months.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/310063a6-4b72-4148-a2a6-73f2f6fb9227.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price dropped near the support of the range on April 13, but the long tail on the candlestick shows strong buying at lower levels. The bulls are trying to start a relief rally, which is likely to face resistance near the 20-day EMA ($0.57). If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, the bears will take another shot at $0.41.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bulls are likely to have other plans. They will try to maintain the price above $0.46 and push the XRP/USDT pair above the moving averages. That could keep the price inside the range for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-fresh-bid-liquidity-btc-price-fights-65k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin eats up fresh bid liquidity as BTC price fights for $65K}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) continues to trade inside the ascending channel pattern, indicating advantage to buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/b884a4d4-2890-43ab-b9ea-0d49ef0ae276.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price has reached the resistance line of the channel, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense. If the price turns down from the resistance line, the TON/USDT pair could drop to the support line. A break and close below the channel will signal a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers thrust the price above the channel, it will suggest a pick-up in momentum. The pair could then attempt a rally to $8.56 and eventually to $10.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) sliced through the 50-day SMA ($0.17) support on April 13, indicating aggressive selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/913acb1d-a482-4256-ade1-617070617db0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to start a recovery, but they may face stiff resistance at the moving averages. If the price turns down from the moving averages, it will signal that the bears view the rallies as a selling opportunity. That will increase the likelihood of a drop to the strong support at $0.12.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if buyers drive the price above the moving averages, it will suggest solid demand at lower levels. The DOGE/USDT pair may then attempt a rally to $0.20.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) plunged below the $0.57 support on April 12, completing the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. That was followed by another down day on April 13, which pulled the price below the $0.46 support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/79924522-6ba8-4f75-acf9-0c09d05834a6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A saving grace for the bulls is that the price climbed back above $0.46 on April 14, suggesting buying at lower levels. The bulls will try to start a recovery, which is likely to face strong selling at the 20-day EMA ($0.56).\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could again drop to $0.46 and then to $0.40. A break below this level could sink the pair to $0.35. The first sign of strength will be a rise above the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDQvMTNiNjIwZjktOWY3Mi00YTZjLTkwZTUtNTZiNDI5MGUyOTIxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240415ek4f000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,533 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 April 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins drop to new lows as liquidations sweep across the entire market.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) dipped to new lows at $65,000 on April 12, indicating that the bears have not yet given up. However, that has not deterred the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-accumulation-phase-btc-halving-week-away"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin whales from continuing their purchase}}}\uc2 , with the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin halving}}}\uc2  less than eight days away.\par \par \uc2 According to crypto analytics firm CryptoQuant, demand from the Bitcoin whales has surpassed the supply of new Bitcoin for the \u8220\'20\'1Cfirst time in history.\u8221\'20\'1D Increasing demand from the whales and inflows into the Bitcoin-exchange-traded funds could push Bitcoin higher.\par \par \uc2 VanEck CEO \uc2 Jan van Eck\uc2  said in an interview with Cointelegraph that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/retail-investors-bitcoin-etf-vaneck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 90% of the inflows into the Bitcoin ETFs}}}\uc2  came from retail. He anticipates institutional investments from banks and traditional firms to start trickling in from next month.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/7ae892ac-1c93-4253-82f1-659ea97e3b82.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Renowned venture capitalist \uc2 Tim Draper\uc2  said in an interview with Cointelegraph that Bitcoin remains a \u8220\'20\'1Cplace of great security\u8221\'20\'1D against inflation. Draper expects {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/250k-bitcoin-2024-tim-draper"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to surge to $250,000}}}\uc2  by the end of the year.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin challenge the all-time high or start a corrective phase in the next few days? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Bitcoin back above the downtrend line on April 10 but could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that every minor rally is being sold into.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/64f010f2-d471-4719-aa66-e07709d3e28b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($68,534) is flattening out, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is near the midpoint, suggesting that the bulls are losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 If the price slides and maintains below the 50-day simple moving average ($66,207), the BTC/USDT pair could start a deeper correction to $60,000 and eventually to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $54,298.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $73,777.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside the $3,056 to $3,679 range for the past few days, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/cfd13fb2-83ae-4147-ad26-285b064bc7b1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price could drop to the strong support at $3,056 where the bulls are likely to step in. If the ETH/USDT pair rebounds off $3,056 level with strength, it will suggest that the range-bound action may continue for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price continues lower and plummets below $3,056, it will signal the start of a deeper correction toward $2,717. The bulls will have to propel the price above $3,679 to get back into the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) closed above the symmetrical triangle on April 10, and the bulls thwarted attempts by the bears to pull the price back into the triangle on April 11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/78ea89b2-4737-45f9-86c9-d04c25306ec3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed the price higher on April 12, but the long wick on the candlestick shows that the bears are aggressively defending the overhead resistance at $645. The bears will try to pull the price back into the triangle, trapping the aggressive bulls. That could sink the price to the uptrend line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns up from the current level, it will suggest that bulls continue to buy on dips. That will increase the likelihood of a rally above $645. The BNB/USDT pair could then jump to $692.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $162 support on April 10 but could not rise above the 20-day EMA ($177), signaling selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/99bd4033-c6a5-4583-8d73-8a570141d07e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower and breaks below $162, it will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  double-top pattern. This setup could start a deeper correction toward the next major support at $126 and subsequently to the pattern target of $119.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price rebounds off $162 and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could extend its consolidation for a few more days. The next leg of the uptrend may begin after buyers clear the overhead hurdle at $205.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the moving averages, indicating uncertainty about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/b3db06b8-cb15-4c72-bcd9-7d3e2db50590.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, suggesting a consolidation in the near term. The XRP/USDT pair could swing between $0.56 and $0.69 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The longer the time spent inside the range, the greater the breakout from it. If buyers kick the price above $0.69, the pair could surge to the overhead resistance of $0.74. On the downside, a drop below $0.56 could tug the price to $0.48.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading above the breakout level of $0.19, indicating that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/1b6cc191-79ae-4572-bf9e-5099d490d751.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.19) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory indicate a slight advantage to buyers. The DOGE/USDT pair could rise to $0.21, above which a retest of $0.23 is possible.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to sink the price below the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair may slide to the 50-day SMA ($0.16), an important level to watch out for. A break and close below this support could open the doors for a possible fall to $0.12.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) broke and closed above the ascending channel pattern on April 11, but the bulls could not maintain the momentum on April 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/5f35345c-896d-4cb8-bd33-5a7d6328e8c4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pull the price back into the channel. If they do that, some aggressive bulls may get trapped. That could pull the price down to $6.29 and thereafter to the support line of the channel. Buyers are expected to fiercely defend this level.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $7.67, it will indicate that every minor dip is being purchased. That will enhance the prospects of a rally to $8.56 and thereafter to $10.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-liquidity-69k-gold-surge-markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price takes liquidity near $69K as gold surge rattles markets}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls could not build upon the rebound off $0.57 on April 10, suggesting a lack of demand at higher levels. The bears renewed their selling and pulled Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) below $0.57 on April 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/5833ffac-0a8d-4668-95e3-65164f87ef4b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price closes below $0.57, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern will complete. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.60) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the downside. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could tumble toward the next major support at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns up and breaks above the 20-day EMA. The pair may then jump to $0.68.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the moving averages, and the bears are trying to strengthen their position by pulling the price to $42.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/ed32f867-ef7f-42ef-a1da-a3dc863767b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers are expected to fiercely protect the $42 level because if they fail in their endeavor, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could start a deeper correction. The pair may slump to $35, which is again likely to behave as a solid support.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break above the downtrend line will be the first sign of strength. The pair is likely to pick up momentum after it crosses the $50 hurdle. The rally could reach $60 and then $65.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has been hovering around the 20-day EMA ($0.000028) for the past few days, indicating a state of balance between buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/9e6c1d48-261e-4106-b34b-900487cdee46.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the downtrend line suggests that the bulls are trying to start an upward move. There is a minor resistance at $0.000033, but if this level is crossed, the SHIB/USDT pair could rise to $0.000039.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and plummets below the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.000023, it will indicate that bears have seized control. The pair may then tumble to $0.000017.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDQvYmFhYmEyNTQtYmFlZC00MDkyLWIxNmUtMzE4YmZkNGU4YzU1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}